    <node id="卡芙卡">
      <data key="d0">卡芙卡</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Kafka is a prominent character and key operative of the Stellaron Hunters, a clandestine group guided by precise scripts written by their leader, Elio. She is characterized as highly cautious and analytical, faithfully following these scripts, with her actions and motives suggesting her predictions are coming true. A critical event was her arrival at Herta Space Station to implant a Stellaron into the Trailblazer, setting them on their journey. There, she deduced that Herta's collection was the actual theft target and recognized the Anti-Matter Legion's formidable strength, while noting she has never met the real Herta. She also shared with the Trailblazer secrets of an Aeon's fall.

Currently, Kafka is actively wanted on the Xianzhou Luofu, where she has been hiding. She works with Blade to persuade the Astral Express to change course to address the Luofu's Stellaron crisis. She is a fugitive tracked by authorities, including the Sky-Faring Commission and Divination Commission, and her communications are intercepted. She surrendered to the Divination Commission, a calculated move from Elio to guide a favorable future, and was interrogated after three formation bases were restarted. She is also wanted by the Interstellar Peace Company and leaves potential misleading clues. She uses her Spirit Whisper ability to manipulate Blade's Mara and control situations, such as halting a fight in Scalegorge Waterscape, and she suggested stopping battles to await important figures.

Kafka demonstrates a range of capabilities, including word spirit art to make Cloud Knights obey and communicating via an umbrella under artificial rain clouds. She escaped custody, eventually being proven innocent by the Divination Commission's calculations, providing key testimony for General Jing Yuan. Within the group, she discusses the motives of Aeons, history, and the Xianzhou Alliance, concluding that despite differing goals, all paths eventually converge. She is also known to have issued an invitation to the Trailblazer.&lt;SEP&gt;卡芙卡是星核猎手成员，与萨姆同属一个组织，被瓦尔特提及为危险分子。&lt;SEP&gt;卡芙卡是一个角色，萨姆认为她比自己更通晓人心。&lt;SEP&gt;卡芙卡is a character mentioned as someone刃and流萤will find after the tunnel.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4dbaabda37c8db9a4a137cc6aa064f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7d8a992974bc2f1f0901e4cbb9b3e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c62549d358805658f577edf0ab9b10f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e984d2cba4e5370f0ecbc1d64bbe3ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9382e1e5b2c36382f26deacac4efbc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d5f7b06f9facb3992fb0f139bd89cf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-721a2a73e1f0e6fa6610d54843b6f532&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd38dc8badc189b45d673004221d3769&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77de6de5c9d862a933254e4be35b883f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d31cd4abbf24b9ee5b9faad3ad2e6517&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e35d358e818be02513731a4ae614a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b4a197f0f2ce6b0f788bb52e789e3af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cfc8f55ca58a8b49ae984321424c78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33140787e65f36d03a2cf1fe766a0e3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c992f8ca9cbe3142dda05033f0b52e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94c423af9b3a1e7696ea7c8396c60833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-807438542660c564cc6c45c1235307a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25bbc2acab19c28d156b60535056e250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d49ee9d93d2b9c97270455c78b3b83e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-544588bbd1f1f8ebb82fb1b9ebe83ee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29856bd40ae5205b29c5ab0965af404a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59e7b46d077b5255996c168af8643d8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7823732295dacca3169a4fdc0d9b7a6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43623aa0b2e27c60a1de27a0205f0f63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecd9bc285c1eb0c1092ea17d790b9a54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6e390686a60c1282db4fe45d6c892f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c824b5ac58cbd20424e35d07f01abf7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfa499fd86ee42508c05277c43a96c61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deed5fb02763ec38f8b148679259b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b69d30c7d3a7f454ed932719bcad47b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb481f872f6ed8d0d115bc183be81f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f3368332ddd4f4c2f6a0dfe0a4ae48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd64d36e6f165af69ecd014e8024b7c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-801b6775c66f961e277ab9395c3b5a96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d1d3f2fdd68ace39bfead72d5c6de09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3e68e248a108ebdbad18c906c7b760a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5341e4ccc7283969ac76c86061d28586&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aec7e92881b8561c64f206d873044d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df8b5bd13b0c402afd43298bddf26cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db1a6716eb95924fce53acec168f822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38d7d8ba8bfe5e69f41225515582546c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e44ecf966c6560c7f086afff655868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd9f10a536cdbcda90740d8d4674e15d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7226238e34da823949aab509aaac80e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39ee06bafb842d307b13ed54ad7ab232&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-232b4fb1b400fc9168a697506bccf527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86afcf1d5b41644aabd32c7cbee164cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e83981232e76e1d9782f0427096c325c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee709ee6223dbebd15d8b80e4cdae7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-729906f69b0dc31b866284fec42bd817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b13f1d619b99829ec04b15c537d259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-591f11cf1ef3be84f3f140ad6ced600a</data>
