    <node id="艾利欧">
      <data key="d0">艾利欧</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">艾利欧是星核猎手组织的首领，也被称为“命运的奴隶”。他拥有预知未来的能力，能够窥见命运的多种可能性走向，并据此为组织编写事件发生的“剧本”，从而长期规划行动。作为掌控星核猎手全局的领导者，艾利欧本人极少公开露面，大多数具体行动由成员卡芙卡负责执行与协调。他预见到了开拓者的命运，并因此注意到了银狼的行为。艾利欧的预言被卡芙卡领受，并指导了星核猎手的行动，他还为萨姆提供剧本，其中包含指示星穹列车必须追寻“伟大遗产”等内容。此外，艾利欧声称命运是单一的，无法被规避，他还曾预言在梦想之地（即匹诺康尼）会有难忘的收获。尽管在部分描述中被提及为成员，但更多信息确认其为首领身份，展现出一个能看见命运的狂人形象。&lt;SEP&gt;艾利欧is a character who wrote the "剧本" that predicted the inevitable conflict between萨姆and the星穹列车.&lt;SEP&gt;艾利欧(Elio) is a character known for writing scripts that were previously centered around specific Stellarons.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4dbaabda37c8db9a4a137cc6aa064f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7d8a992974bc2f1f0901e4cbb9b3e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77de6de5c9d862a933254e4be35b883f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cfc8f55ca58a8b49ae984321424c78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-807438542660c564cc6c45c1235307a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25bbc2acab19c28d156b60535056e250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7823732295dacca3169a4fdc0d9b7a6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aec7e92881b8561c64f206d873044d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572b9afac6065d24e54da05a551fbbc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f273e249d48375fe4ce18df04b167906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b13f1d619b99829ec04b15c537d259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-591f11cf1ef3be84f3f140ad6ced600a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc45afcec4b5f6a1b7e1a966ff2b1588</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779015589</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="开拓者">
      <data key="d0">开拓者</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Trailblazer, also known as {NICKNAME} or the Nameless, is the confident main protagonist of *Honkai: Star Rail* and a core member of the Astral Express crew. Waking up on the Herta Space Station with amnesia, their body is uniquely implanted with and stabilized by a Stellaron, making them a subject of research. They tread the Path of Trailblaze and were briefly gazed upon by Nanook, the Aeon of Destruction. As a Nameless, they participate in expeditions with companions like March 7th, Himeko, and Welt Yang, resolving crises on Belobog and investigating a Stellaron on the Xianzhou Luofu. Due to their short lifespan, they are immune to the "Marascent" condition. In Penacony, they are a newcomer who receives help from various characters, explores with Firefly, and operates a dream pool to investigate disturbances. They can see and interact with the clock-like entity 钟表小子, using "Clockwork" abilities to resolve crises, and are sought by the 猎犬家系 for this power. Guided by Firefly and rescued by Black Swan from danger, they later team up with Black Swan and Acheron. The Trailblazer possesses a talent for "记忆" (Remembrance) and is sensitive to 忆质, acting as the central investigator in the Penacony case, witnessing murders. They are a champion of the Hot Sand Ceremony, a key participant in the Harmony Grand Ceremony, and the recipient of the Watchmaker's legacy. As a member of the Astral Express, they have completed the Penacony journey, participate in route conferences, and deliver the group's response, negotiating for Mr. Yang's release. Sunday challenges them to show the bravery and determination of 阿基维利, to which they respond with unyielding resolve, contemplating philosophical questions about life. They interact with知更鸟, offering encouragement and advice about the future, and collect clues throughout the narrative. The Trailblazer is described as being in good spirits, a minor celebrity in Penacony, and specifically requested by the IPC to attend a negotiation discussion. Gallager toasts to them with a special drink, "聚散有时," and having experienced "调律" (Tuning), they may understand Sunday's methods, while Himeko encourages them to draw from their own adventures to answer Sunday's questions. As the protagonist, they are guided by Black Swan to discover fatal flaws in their memory and are informed that they are still within a dream.&lt;SEP&gt;The Trailblazer is a passenger on the Astral Express who has concluded a journey in the "Dreamscape." They interact with黑天鹅, who takes a special interest in their memories.&lt;SEP&gt;The Trailblazer, also known as {NICKNAME}, is a member of the Astral Express crew who interacts with the other characters and makes decisions for the group's journey.&lt;SEP&gt;The Trailblazer is a member of the Astral Express, actively participates in discussions and voting about destinations, and interacts with other crew members.</data>
