    <node id="黑塔空间站">
      <data key="d0">黑塔空间站</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Herta Space Station is a research facility created and named by the Genius Society member Herta, and is located near the Azure Planet (湛蓝星). It serves as a storage site for a Stellaron and is the location where the Trailblazer awakens. The station is also a massive collection, housing a catalog of curios and numerous life forms. It was used as an operation site by the Stellar Hunters, who issued a prior warning that led to a large-scale evacuation before the station was subsequently attacked by the Anti-Matter Legion. As a reflection of Herta's personal taste, she often loses interest in the facility once her curiosity is satisfied, and she manages the station remotely through numerous puppets. Currently in a state of crisis, the station's defense systems are under severe threat from the ongoing attack.&lt;SEP&gt;黑塔空间站是黑塔建造的设施，由艾丝妲实际管理，存放星核和研究材料。&lt;SEP&gt;黑塔空间站is a space station also known as space station "黑塔".&lt;SEP&gt;黑塔空间站is a location of reference三月七uses to try to imagine the size of the建木.&lt;SEP&gt;黑塔空间站是三月七提到的一个地点，她没见过与博识尊相关的物品在那里。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4dbaabda37c8db9a4a137cc6aa064f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d5f7b06f9facb3992fb0f139bd89cf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77de6de5c9d862a933254e4be35b883f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b531442abda59ef2a92544f8f338fb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96858a626ba4813bcea021ec43244a7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e35d358e818be02513731a4ae614a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b766f048e61cc6147f844ddae676af7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e8c342929c1e0a403d0cab7884c843b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53bbd7e3dab117321de5400d6f0ab35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89adfc0a549cbe9444727c70d7f79bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8272ce558ae20153faafd6ffc5a4135d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d6c8ac9917f5a8ab265464fbd40c04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c61378b1f48a3fccbe0fff17273a16f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54c578d96b848b155835e3ba7da7e5f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cbf01ed9ad87a70a79c843ac877485f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bf663d6f3ed8f5070fc03ef10983000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f8fa3030c9f0e45dc58488cd8c0b0b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db1a6716eb95924fce53acec168f822</data>
