    <node id="星穹列车">
      <data key="d0">星穹列车</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Astral Express (星穹列车) is a magical, interstellar train and a faction dedicated to the Trailblaze path. It is an heirloom of the Aeon Akivili, historically ridden by him, and is powered by the Trailblaze path itself, traveling along Star Rails. The train serves as a mobile base and home for its crew, known as "Trailblazers" or "The Nameless," who follow in Akivili's footsteps to explore new worlds and cannot ignore the Stellaron. Its facilities include a data room, the "Wisdom Repository" archive, a partially damaged star chart, and a Parlor Car. The journey of Trailblaze is extremely difficult and not something ordinary people can endure, though the train does not reject travelers yearning for distant lands.

Notable crew members include the Trailblazer, March 7th, Dan Heng, Himeko (the primary navigator and representative), Welt Yang, and the conductor Pom-Pom. Other members like Mihaly have served the Express, with figures such as Amundsen and Granholm having served as its navigators. The faction engages in interstellar travel, providing aid to worlds troubled by Stellaron and possessing the means to seal them.

The Astral Express has been invited by The Family to investigate recent events on Penacony, including the death of Robin, and is considered a guest of honor known as "The Watchmaker." The crew decided to investigate a murder to seek justice, received a music box and messages for assistance, and were invited to the Clock Studios Theme Park by Aventurine. The faction is involved in mediating the conflict between the Family and the IPC in Penacony, with the crew participating in negotiations and being invited to a discussion by General Jing Yuan. The crew was gathered by Gallagher along with family leaders and Stellaron Hunters to meet Robin. Their future Trailblaze is being witnessed by the Memokeepers of the Garden of Recollection.&lt;SEP&gt;星穹列车是波提欧乘坐的交通工具，拥有舒适的居住环境，但缺少波提欧喜欢的强力饮料。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4dbaabda37c8db9a4a137cc6aa064f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b531442abda59ef2a92544f8f338fb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be9f92f0e7cc47777979ee06b310252c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96858a626ba4813bcea021ec43244a7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cfc8f55ca58a8b49ae984321424c78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ac1bb23d4766797788088ba5ff6aa47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b766f048e61cc6147f844ddae676af7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53bbd7e3dab117321de5400d6f0ab35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c91b253be982c706832e5755da7ad500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8272ce558ae20153faafd6ffc5a4135d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d6c8ac9917f5a8ab265464fbd40c04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cbf01ed9ad87a70a79c843ac877485f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c61378b1f48a3fccbe0fff17273a16f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54c578d96b848b155835e3ba7da7e5f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bf92db6fb06a4ce23bb9a1040ac0bf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83567c2b7f3bbf3d89505fcae70b0ba1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68ca2f09bea0bd57ce26ea252d883318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b90e0ee8e6c1bdf39a40aa9e79108543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bf663d6f3ed8f5070fc03ef10983000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e78a4d47602d8436e5950b7c64fa6734&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789285bc757b7b48d94a58fb5071cb0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95f3cdca78469e141c72057fa03532b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00732d55bdd6fa143033b2dd0669aaa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f7fcf2745a1b4cb918633cb92877ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07ddaec7bfcdba9a4cc6197378b1a8df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d55f575d28d66085799bb30b2f94c668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e575eb06637f7ecf24d773fb6f0f798b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cb8da041bb65dbc2bdac7765d979d3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fd5d5729dee96837f589844028d1e87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f0fb910ea43e4acb7d09e5d8281a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4230a2ca41a3aa5b271c968b4567de1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2decb49a546c2b4fde6ed99f9c7b7ad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9509992da819b3c05c5d00771b2ec521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21825bf2e51d148d9157e7a7efb7ae87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c308352492cacde7b8e6f6802f949905&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f371fb32e3b3a665db31402cdb619141&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33140787e65f3