    <node id="星核猎手">
      <data key="d0">星核猎手</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Stellaron Hunters (星核猎手) is a mysterious and influential faction active across the cosmos, often regarded as a shadowy organization of eccentric individuals who manipulate events from behind the scenes. Their primary known activity involves collecting multiple Stellarons for purposes that remain unclear, leading many to view their true intentions with suspicion. Core members include Kafka (who serves as the deputy to the leader), Silver Wolf, Blade, Firefly (also known as Sam), and their leader, Elio, known to the Interastral Peace Corporation as the "Slave of Fate." Kafka, Blade, and Firefly are confirmed members, and Silver Wolf is another member who has been seen by the Trailblazer in the Shackling Prison. The organization is also indirectly referenced by Acheron in evaluating the danger level of the Astral Express.

The group's actions are guided by Elio's ability to foresee the future and his long-term plans. Fu Xuan has noted that their predictions are more accurate than her own. They are responsible for implanting a Stellaron into the Trailblazer's body and have deliberately lured the Astral Express crew to Xianzhou Luofu as part of a broader plan to align them as allies against the Xianzhou Alliance's crises. On Penacony, they have laid groundwork involving Sam and Silver Wolf, establishing a hostile relationship with the Astral Express, though they are also willing to cooperate with the Express against the Family. Despite their dangerous reputation and the high bounties on some members, their overall goals remain an enigma.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4dbaabda37c8db9a4a137cc6aa064f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d5f7b06f9facb3992fb0f139bd89cf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bf663d6f3ed8f5070fc03ef10983000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e78a4d47602d8436e5950b7c64fa6734&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33140787e65f36d03a2cf1fe766a0e3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c992f8ca9cbe3142dda05033f0b52e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94c423af9b3a1e7696ea7c8396c60833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-807438542660c564cc6c45c1235307a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25bbc2acab19c28d156b60535056e250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7304e1604bff47c393b7d5c5dec23a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a28cb31f880c428c7385b0d0986befb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d49ee9d93d2b9c97270455c78b3b83e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6bc51c0b8f913f809328ba29170426&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29856bd40ae5205b29c5ab0965af404a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7823732295dacca3169a4fdc0d9b7a6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5652d718e4ea5e4dc648511456987b2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8dd3179cc07be6652a8a064b6cefde1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8be339ef38fbeb8d499020c4475c7402&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deed5fb02763ec38f8b148679259b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd64d36e6f165af69ecd014e8024b7c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5341e4ccc7283969ac76c86061d28586&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aec7e92881b8561c64f206d873044d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df8b5bd13b0c402afd43298bddf26cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d71f2f56e13337663cff785e79fbb43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db1a6716eb95924fce53acec168f822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b031b1b4ab5aae362aa1180ca1fab1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-232b4fb1b400fc9168a697506bccf527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86afcf1d5b41644aabd32c7cbee164cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95189fee74f326831efd9da16d00b815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e83981232e76e1d9782f0427096c325c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee709ee6223dbebd15d8b80e4cdae7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-729906f69b0dc31b866284fec42bd817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41a99864b87ae5c7c8eb089ea4a5b9d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2539c79e7b103e6c4fb2a5bb7901dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572b9afac6065d24e54da05a551fbbc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f273e249d4837