    <node id="？？？">
      <data key="d0">？？？</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">？？？ is a deeply enigmatic figure in Honkai: Star Rail whose identity and nature are never fully clarified, appearing through fragmented dialogues and ambiguous communications. This entity is known to communicate directly with Kafka, demonstrating knowledge of Elio's script and future events, and acts as a cryptic guide to the trailblazer, offering hints about the impending arrival of the Destruction Aeon Nanook. Within the narrative, ？？？ is a member of the Fool faction who directly confronts 砂金, displaying sharp wit and personality. They also appear as an unidentified speaker delivering protective advice, calling out for米哈伊尔 in a dream, and speaking about折纸小鸟, with their statements sometimes garbled or corrupted, adding to their overall mysterious nature.

？？？ also manifests as an internal or spiritual presence, claiming to be a "newborn of the Harmony" or akin to砂金's own inner self called "卡卡瓦夏," asserting a deep understanding of砂金 and offering companionship in his final moments. In other interactions, this figure engages in philosophical dialogue with砂金, questioning his risk-taking and self-destructive tendencies, and referencing childhood memories, the mother's departure, the卡提卡 people, and the principle of high risk, high return. They are associated with the酒馆 and possess knowledge of the欢愉 path. Additionally, ？？？ is an unknown speaker who welcomes卡卡瓦夏 to "this sad world," issues a survival challenge, and states that the Family will not open the door for Huangquan while discussing the nature of Aeons and paths. Overall, ？？？ represents a multifaceted, elusive persona woven into critical dialogues and narrative ambiguities across different contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;？？？是一个与黄泉对话的存在，认为即使事情没有意义也应该去做，并希望死后有人会在坟前献花。&lt;SEP&gt;？？？是一个神秘人物，曾参与导致绝灭大君「诛罗」陨落的战争，如今在超度由巡海游侠执念形成的“血罪灵”。&lt;SEP&gt;？？？是与黄泉对话的神秘人物，曾提到身受「沉眠无相者」(即「虚无」星神)的祝福。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c7d8a992974bc2f1f0901e4cbb9b3e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c83d3b40886e45b43e8b5c20dd177e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24e56199dd3bbd358c0139e6f8ead596&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee043452b079db75e92301d147036f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-862e02e46825a488c47a07005d7ae36a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-683cc400019b140a55e158f14e31f797&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4f1aef42316b27a74ccb75b8cd295cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3eba3eaf43b9d0278ec03a8c8e30f3ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5386db4a801d2d7223330ecc84710a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-415c7bdbfc0ac0348c2f17ccb1d95aa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8453ce4da49768db75c2cf6376b2913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7778f84cd4b1b1ad3d8124b8a0c6a5f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b218674dea3c2d8b0dd96c4c12a1e76c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b4160e98c8cbd78b3b2853638d988cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef3b6681f2925e2c81851592c3ba8372&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59017ceba7321c9197dc124a2391ce84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7525f63d21e345e0134731209482201d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba76ab4009be3694fc20bec3980fef08</data>
