    <node id="反物质军团">
      <data key="d0">反物质军团</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">The Antimatter Legion (反物质军团) is a major hostile military faction and a primary antagonistic force in the universe, serving as the army of Nanook the Aeon of Destruction. Its soldiers, known as 虚卒, are numerous and have conducted invasions across multiple locations, including a significant attack on the Herta Space Station that caused explosions and defense system failures. The Legion's attacks have been compared to locusts and have been consistently opposed by groups like the Trailblazers. The Legion is frequently associated with the appearance of Stellarons, alongside which it brings destruction. Members of the Legion were trapped and buried by a winter storm on Jarilo-VI before the Eternal Freeze, and its invasion there is linked to the Stellarons. The Legion was also active seven hundred years ago, being driven away by a Stellaron on Jarilo-VI. The faction includes powerful members such as the 绝灭大君, and has agents infiltrating the Xianzhou. It is considered a dangerous alien force known for aggressive expansion and threats to civilizations. The Antimatter Legion has also waged war on the Xianzhou Alliance and actively intervened on the Xianzhou Luofu during the Stellar Aeon Calamity, orchestrating infiltration through the schemes of a 绝灭大君. Furthermore, the 空 (Kong) fought against the Legion in a brutal war thirty years ago. Although the Legion grew weaker after its engagement with the space station, its threat, though reduced after defeats and the repair of protective shields, remains persistent.&lt;SEP&gt;The Antimatter Legion, a faction associated with the Destruction Aeon and Lord Ravagers.&lt;SEP&gt;反物质军团是入侵仙舟罗浮和毁灭“月卫之盾”的野蛮势力。&lt;SEP&gt;The Antimatter Legion is an invading force currently attacking Edo Star.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c7d8a992974bc2f1f0901e4cbb9b3e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e984d2cba4e5370f0ecbc1d64bbe3ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4dde8605746d324180cd9c5983e36ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02fceee9e0bf75fe7135a102d43473c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b531442abda59ef2a92544f8f338fb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be9f92f0e7cc47777979ee06b310252c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96858a626ba4813bcea021ec43244a7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cfc8f55ca58a8b49ae984321424c78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ac1bb23d4766797788088ba5ff6aa47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b766f048e61cc6147f844ddae676af7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53bbd7e3dab117321de5400d6f0ab35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d6c8ac9917f5a8ab265464fbd40c04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b90e0ee8e6c1bdf39a40aa9e79108543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54005507f5db05a1431064ea9db88caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e5ba5f7b6b4c9a58f7986795cc260a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2decb49a546c2b4fde6ed99f9c7b7ad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9509992da819b3c05c5d00771b2ec521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42cb7b6c602a4d11cb2e76505dd012c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fc6126d0155a7c411f4068a66d7ddca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c96d885f6a65cadc94f79df95313f0ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc2240f2b9c03c7ee20a149da420ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95189fee74f326831efd9da16d00b815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96e31031793443da0fe2823c4c28cae2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c2bf1856c9246afe262f7402bdbfdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d200c73d981b852fa64a6901ad64129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e038997304f6b48259a70927a3be53</data>
