    <node id="空间站">
      <data key="d0">空间站</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The space station is a location central to the events described, serving as a key setting for various scenes, including a conversation, a navigation point, and an area under attack. It is a facility that houses a monitoring room and is featured in surveillance footage. This location was damaged in a battle, specifically identified as the Herta Space Station. The Herta Space Station is a partially fractured-dimension (半裂界化) scientific research facility managed by黑塔 and艾丝妲. It has a business partnership with the星穹列车. The trailblazer finds themselves at this location after certain events.&lt;SEP&gt;空间站是星穹列车出发的地点。&lt;SEP&gt;空间站is the location that was in crisis and was helped by the开拓者, acknowledged by姬子.&lt;SEP&gt;The空间站is a location where a past event involving the开拓er and the末日兽occurred.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c7d8a992974bc2f1f0901e4cbb9b3e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e984d2cba4e5370f0ecbc1d64bbe3ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9382e1e5b2c36382f26deacac4efbc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5721be6d07565b08ae3211f08f869ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96858a626ba4813bcea021ec43244a7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cfc8f55ca58a8b49ae984321424c78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ac1bb23d4766797788088ba5ff6aa47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c83d3b40886e45b43e8b5c20dd177e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b90e0ee8e6c1bdf39a40aa9e79108543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00732d55bdd6fa143033b2dd0669aaa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0bd49528edf3e917eef4f2c1aa6516</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
