      <data key="d0">剧本</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The "script" written by Elio that predicts the future and dictates the actions of the Stellaron Hunters.&lt;SEP&gt;剧本is the predetermined sequence of events that流萤and刃follow, as glimpsed by艾利欧.</data>
