    <node id="天才俱乐部">
      <data key="d0">天才俱乐部</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">天才俱乐部 (Genius Society) is an organization dedicated to scientific research, operating under the protection of the Aeon of 'Erudition'. Founded by Zandar, the first member, the society is composed of the Intelligentsia's Emanators and is known for gathering eccentric geniuses. Its members have varied lifespans and have conducted diverse theoretical studies. Notable members include Herta, who is Member #83, and other individuals described as more selfish than her.&lt;SEP&gt;天才俱乐部是一个由博识尊选中的天才组成的组织，其成员黑塔、阮•梅、螺丝咕姆和斯蒂芬联合发起了模拟宇宙项目。&lt;SEP&gt;天才俱乐部is a faction also known as the genius society.&lt;SEP&gt;天才俱乐部是一个组织，成员螺丝咕姆参与合作挖掘“械皇遗冢”。&lt;SEP&gt;The Genius Society is an organization mentioned sarcastically by Truth-Doctor as a potential membership opportunity for砂金.&lt;SEP&gt;The Genius Society is an elite group of geniuses represented by Screwllum, who collaborates with the Intelligentsia Guild.&lt;SEP&gt;The Genius Society is a faction that Welt mentions is difficult to imagine getting involved in mundane research.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c62549d358805658f577edf0ab9b10f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b4a197f0f2ce6b0f788bb52e789e3af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cfc8f55ca58a8b49ae984321424c78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c61378b1f48a3fccbe0fff17273a16f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54c578d96b848b155835e3ba7da7e5f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cbf01ed9ad87a70a79c843ac877485f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b90e0ee8e6c1bdf39a40aa9e79108543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bf663d6f3ed8f5070fc03ef10983000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789285bc757b7b48d94a58fb5071cb0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3da0cb92646701693c5ed26d30314d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d200c73d981b852fa64a6901ad64129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e433ea5c6d7cc1b61f948cb569533fb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a26e6722285ef522993b41004a8fb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d235d876b6479c8e730e06da624342e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
