    </node>
    <node id="博识尊">
      <data key="d0">博识尊</data>
      <data key="d1">aeon</data>
      <data key="d2">博识尊is the Aeon of Erudition, described as a god-like figure for the Genius Society.&lt;SEP&gt;博识尊was created by赞达尔.&lt;SEP&gt;博识尊is Nous the Erudition, the Aeon from whom the principles of the Jade Abacus are said to be derived.&lt;SEP&gt;博识尊是智识星神，亲自指点了玉兆技术。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c62549d358805658f577edf0ab9b10f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cfc8f55ca58a8b49ae984321424c78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b7f59f879256f855b57fd2b90f2f093&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db1a6716eb95924fce53acec168f822</data>
