      <data key="d2">An unidentified character who speaks with卡芙卡, providing information about黑塔and the Genius Society.&lt;SEP&gt;An unidentified character who is calling for help, with parts of their speech being distorted or obscured.&lt;SEP&gt;An unidentified character who interrogates砂金about his past, work, and moral choices, referencing a figure named欧泊and the假面愚者.</data>
