    <node id="虚卒">
      <data key="d0">虚卒</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">虚卒are soldiers of the反物质军团, posing a threat in the space station core area.&lt;SEP&gt;Voidranger is a creature that Silver Wolf has disposed of by sending it to some random coordinates.&lt;SEP&gt;虚卒are Voidrangers, soldiers of the Antimatter Legion transformed by the power of Destruction.</data>
