    <node id="监控室">
      <data key="d0">监控室</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">监控室is a room within the space station equipped with surveillance systems for monitoring various areas.&lt;SEP&gt;监控室is a location where the interaction with the strange object takes place.&lt;SEP&gt;监控室is the location where the group needs to go to meet阿兰.&lt;SEP&gt;监控室is the monitoring room where Dan Heng found Alan.</data>
