    <node id="终端设备">
      <data key="d0">终端设备</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">终端设备is a computer terminal in the monitoring room that may contain data about a 'Wonder Item'.&lt;SEP&gt;终端设备is a computer terminal in the room that银狼suspects may contain the奇物they are looking for.&lt;SEP&gt;终端设备are personal devices that provide a quick access point to列车智库.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9382e1e5b2c36382f26deacac4efbc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77de6de5c9d862a933254e4be35b883f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c9a28013c36b8faa919bfb367f9fb9a</data>
