    <node id="奇物">
      <data key="d0">奇物</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Curios are mysterious and rare objects, often referred to as "奇物" in Chinese, that are primarily collected and stored within the Herta Space Station. These items are considered special artifacts or treasures curated by the space station's overseer, Herta herself. One notable example of a Curio is a gun with the unique ability to score living beings on a scale from 0 to 100. These powerful artifacts have practical applications, such as being used to conceal other significant objects like the Stardust core. The station's collection includes both unique items and, in some cases, unusual life forms. Curios are also known to be items of interest for negotiation, as characters like 姬子 have sought to request one as a gift from Herta by using leverage. Additionally, characters like 银狼 suspect that certain Curios might even be stored within a terminal.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9382e1e5b2c36382f26deacac4efbc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d5f7b06f9facb3992fb0f139bd89cf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77de6de5c9d862a933254e4be35b883f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02fceee9e0bf75fe7135a102d43473c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b766f048e61cc6147f844ddae676af7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89adfc0a549cbe9444727c70d7f79bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c91b253be982c706832e5755da7ad500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b90e0ee8e6c1bdf39a40aa9e79108543</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778736532</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
