    <node id="三月七">
      <data key="d0">三月七</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">March 7th, also known as Little March or March, is a cheerful, lively, and talkative member of the Astral Express Crew, serving as a self-proclaimed warm-hearted interstellar traveler alongside the Trailblazer and Dan Heng. She was once frozen in six-phase ice, later awakening and adopting her name from that date, suffering from amnesia after her rescue. As a key figure, she actively participates in sealing Stellarons and helping troubled worlds such as the Xianzhou Luofu and Penacony, showing excitement about new sights and often sharing photos of planets. She possesses combat abilities and a curious, courageous personality, marked by a strong determination to face challenges and a commitment to free will.

March 7th distrusts Tingyun, is shocked by Phantylia’s deception, and is a fan of singer Robin. She shows concern for friends like Dan Heng and Yukong, identifies injured individuals, and feels sentimental about farewells. In Penacony, she is excited about vacation and shopping, questions The Family’s complex entry procedures and true intentions, shows suspicion towards Sparkle, and expresses skepticism about claims regarding "Clockie." She experiences confusion and emotional turmoil during dreamscape events, comments on Gallagher’s mysterious demeanor, and samples drinks he mixed. She investigates the identity of Mikhail, the "Watchmaker," speculates about a "Dreamweaver Puzzle," and makes observations about Sunday and puppets. As an observer and commentator on stories, she participates in discussions and votes on whether to proceed on the journey, reflecting on the adventure.

March 7th is surprised by Black Swan's presence and expresses concern about her intentions, jokingly warning against using Memokeeper powers for pranks. She expresses anxiety about recent dangerous adventures and hopes for a safe journey. She often jokes with the Trailblazer, mentions her discomfort with formal negotiation settings, and is noted as playful and curious. She is also off with Himeko for hotel checkout. She plays a key role in awakening and explaining the situation to the Trailblazer.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七is a person who urges the Trailblazer to wake up and declares they will never escape from future pain.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七is a companion on the Astral Express who interacts with the Trailblazer, joking and showing concern for their well-being.&lt;SEP&gt;March 7th is a member of the Astral Express crew who expresses concern for the Trailblazer and offers opinions on the next destination.&lt;SEP&gt;March 7th is a member of the Astral Express who advocates for helping those in danger and engages in playful banter with the Trailblazer.</data>
