    <node id="主控舱段">
      <data key="d0">主控舱段</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">主控舱段is a location within a space station, accessible by a central elevator.&lt;SEP&gt;The main control deck of Herta Space Station where the elevator lock can be operated.&lt;SEP&gt;The Master Control Section is a key area on the Herta Space Station that the crew is trying to reach.&lt;SEP&gt;主控舱段is the main control section of the space station, which the group aims to reach to organize a counterattack.&lt;SEP&gt;主控舱段is the central control hub of the space station.&lt;SEP&gt;The main control section of the space station where the Trailblazer explores and reports to Asta.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5721be6d07565b08ae3211f08f869ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4dde8605746d324180cd9c5983e36ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be9f92f0e7cc47777979ee06b310252c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96858a626ba4813bcea021ec43244a7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53bbd7e3dab117321de5400d6f0ab35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c91b253be982c706832e5755da7ad500</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778736120</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="阿兰">
      <data key="d0">阿兰</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">阿兰 (Arlan) is a character from the "Honkai: Star Rail" universe, serving as the head of the Defense Department (also referred to as the security department) at the Herta Space Station. He is a security officer responsible for protecting the station and its crew. During an attack by the Anti-matter Legion, Arlan was tasked with escorting personnel evacuation but became injured, leading him to hide to avoid direct conflict. He sustained injuries that were not life-threatening, and after being bandaged, he planned to report to艾丝妲 (Asta). His self-sacrificing nature prioritizes protecting others over his own safety, and he once sought a key to unlock an elevator, concerned about his mobility slowing down his companions. At another point,他 (Dan Heng) searched for him after he lost contact. Ultimately, he was found in the monitoring room, injured but safe.&lt;SEP&gt;阿兰is a security officer at the space station who protects the researchers.&lt;SEP&gt;Head of the Security Department. He discussed with Asta about the Stellaron threat, leading to increased security measures.&lt;SEP&gt;阿兰is the security chief of Herta Space Station.&lt;SEP&gt;阿兰is a character known as the security captain.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a4dde8605746d324180cd9c5983e36ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b531442abda59ef2a92544f8f338fb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be9f92f0e7cc47777979ee06b310252c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96858a626ba4813bcea021ec43244a7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ed282c33f7910c677a95dc75e4ce131&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ac1bb23d4766797788088ba5ff6aa47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b766f048e61cc6147f844ddae676af7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e8c342929c1e0a403d0cab7884c843b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c91b253be982c706832e5755da7ad500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8272ce558ae20153faafd6ffc5a4135d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cbf01ed9ad87a70a79c843ac877485f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778815130</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="丹恒">
      <data key="d0">丹恒</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Dan Heng is a core member of the Astral Express crew, serving as a passenger, guard, archivist of the archives, and a Nameless traveler. He is characterized by a calm, analytical, and knowledgeable demeanor, often offering strategic advice, cautious analysis, and warning others of dangers. An outwardly cold and reserved personality arises from a history of loneliness and constant flight; he previously stayed on the Xianzhou and worked for the Interstellar Peace Company before joining the train. A skilled fighter with a spear, he adeptly explores harsh environments and frequently accompanies March 7th and the Trailblazer on missions. He demonstrates deep expertise on the Stellaron and Fragmentum, champions peace over force, and is proactive in standing guard, fixing robots, and analyzing complex situations. Dan Heng is anxious about the Xianzhou Luofu situation due to his past, having once left on his own after apologizing to his companions. He is also known for telling dry jokes in a serious tone and for his tendency to stay behind on the train, handling work and preferring quiet places.

Dan Heng has a mysterious past as a member of the Vidyadhara race, having been banished from the Xianzhou Luofu. He was once part of the High-Cloud Quintet as the Vidyadhara Dragon Lord, known as Dan Feng, but was banished for past crimes, leading to his reincarnation. He is pursued by Blade and other forces due to this complex history. As the former Dragon Lord who sealed the Divine Arbor, he experienced conflict with the Dragon Elders and lost his title. He feels conflicted about returning to the Luofu, wishes to meet the current Dragon Sovereign to understand his past and atone, and possesses hidden draconic powers, which Jing Yuan has thanked him for using against Phantylia. He is also known as Imbibitor Lunae and is addressed as such by some. Dan Heng also leads a ritual to unseal the Jianmu Xuan root, demonstrates caution towards the Cloud Knights, and was once a prisoner who was formally pardoned by Jing Yuan. He has fought Yanqing, and his true identity is known to few, as he plans to quickly depart the Xianzhou.

During events on Penacony, he observes the absence of Oak Family members, is cautious about the family's schemes, and suggests avoiding traps while asking to be informed of backup plans in advance. He has traveled with Acheron and is companions with Boothill, where he remains calm, analyzes the situation, and manages complex circumstances. He inquired about Sunday's whereabouts and decided to return to the train to brief the conductor. He also analyzed the Penacony situation, questioning the family's actions and proposing theories about the remnants of the "Heavenly Choir."&lt;SEP&gt;丹恒is a member of the Astral Express crew, knowledgeable and reserved.&lt;SEP&gt;丹恒is a person who tells星期日that he is a noble man not to be bound by the past.&lt;SEP&gt;Dan Heng is a member of the Astral Express who suggests visiting the planet Jianghu due to its distress signal.&lt;SEP&gt;Dan Heng is a member of the Astral Express whose judgment is trusted by others, and he comments on the meaning of reunion.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a4dde8605746d324180cd9c5983e36ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b531442abda59ef2a92544f8f338fb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be9f92f0e7cc47777979ee06b310252c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96858a626ba4813bcea021ec43244a7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ed282c33f7910c677a95dc75e4ce131&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ac1bb23d4766797788088ba5ff6aa47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b766f048e61cc6147f844ddae676af7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53bbd7e3dab117321de5400d6f0ab35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c91b253be982c706832e5755da7ad500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8272ce558ae20153faafd6ffc5a4135d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d6c8ac9917f5a8ab265464fbd40c04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c61378b1f48a3fccbe0fff17273a16f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8783ab13aafef8ed60e66b6183686c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bf92db6fb06a4ce23bb9a1040ac0bf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c83d3b40886e45b43e8b5c20dd177e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c9a28013c36b8faa919bfb367f9fb9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83567c2b7f3bbf3d89505fcae70b0ba1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68ca2f09bea0bd57ce26ea252d883318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bf663d6f3ed8f5070fc03ef10983000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e78a4d47602d8436e5950b7c64fa6734&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789285bc757b7b48d94a58fb5071cb0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95f3cdca78469e141c72057fa03532b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f7fcf2745a1b4cb918633cb92877ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01cda72aeaa485978711f9b72507b293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28c8a79168a91659cd695cab9d7e5226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07c244e0b796cd21c35920e292f8b301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07ddaec7bfcdba9a4cc6197378b1a8df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d55f575d28d66085799bb30b2f94c668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bb530c0e05d34c67f0c09a0b64e8fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff4678a309428e5e405e8aab17b34d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f946c60a8d8ff52731600d62dc86e722&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e575eb06637f7ecf24d773fb6f0f798b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7a075aaa16975be78339564df8bbf0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cb8da041bb65