    <node id="密钥">
      <data key="d0">密钥</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The key used to unlock the elevator's access in Herta Space Station.&lt;SEP&gt;密钥is the access credential required to open the闸门to the机关能源中枢.&lt;SEP&gt;A key found by Cocolia that is crucial for the next step of their plan.&lt;SEP&gt;The key is an artifact used to operate the energy central gate.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a4dde8605746d324180cd9c5983e36ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da4724fc5e3317bb631f842e18bf511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd3abc93cbfc88148dada26d6a80719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e4d2b029cb1d9c5f1ff1ba3fab0a0ca</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778808703</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="操作台">
      <data key="d0">操作台</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The console used to unlock the elevator's permissions.&lt;SEP&gt;操作台is a device used to move cargo containers at积玉坊.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a4dde8605746d324180cd9c5983e36ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a08a4c1f5ae941cbe079fc5aaa48a0b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
