    </node>
    <node id="电梯">
      <data key="d0">电梯</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The elevator in Herta Space Station that requires the key and console to unlock permissions.&lt;SEP&gt;The elevator is a means of transportation on the Herta Space Station that has been damaged.&lt;SEP&gt;电梯是连接白日梦酒店大堂与客房区域的交通设施。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a4dde8605746d324180cd9c5983e36ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be9f92f0e7cc47777979ee06b310252c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96858a626ba4813bcea021ec43244a7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1c5225a08fcc8c681d02f077d4dde16</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778835926</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="艾丝妲">
      <data key="d0">艾丝妲</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">艾丝妲 is the station master of the Herta Space Station, managing it on behalf of Herta and coordinating its defense and recovery efforts. During the incident, she directed the evacuation, organized the rescue mission, and decided who should leave and who should stay. She entrusted the access key to March 7th and was deeply concerned about Arlan's safety and self-sacrifice, while also appreciating Herta's wisdom. Although others evacuated, she chose to remain behind to oversee the situation.&lt;SEP&gt;The station master of Herta Space Station. She is concerned about the Stellaron causing “Fragmentum” corrosion if the Trailblazer stays long-term but agrees after Herta's approval.&lt;SEP&gt;艾丝妲is a character who warns about the failing shield in the support section and urges others to act quickly before the communication cuts off.&lt;SEP&gt;艾丝妲is the station master of Herta Space Station.&lt;SEP&gt;艾丝妲是黑塔空间站的站长，实际管理空间站事务。&lt;SEP&gt;艾丝妲是黑塔空间站的站长，负责管理空间站事务，并协助修复防护罩和应对裂界问题。&lt;SEP&gt;艾丝妲is a character known as the station master.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-77de6de5c9d862a933254e4be35b883f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b531442abda59ef2a92544f8f338fb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96858a626ba4813bcea021ec43244a7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ac1bb23d4766797788088ba5ff6aa47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b766f048e61cc6147f844ddae676af7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e8c342929c1e0a403d0cab7884c843b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53bbd7e3dab117321de5400d6f0ab35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c91b253be982c706832e5755da7ad500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8272ce558ae20153faafd6ffc5a4135d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d6c8ac9917f5a8ab265464fbd40c04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cbf01ed9ad87a70a79c843ac877485f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b90e0ee8e6c1bdf39a40aa9e79108543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bf663d6f3ed8f5070fc03ef10983000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
