    <node id="星际和平公司">
      <data key="d0">星际和平公司</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Interastral Peace Corporation (星际和平公司) is the largest economy and a galactic monopoly in the universe. Its primary ideology is based on worshiping the Preservation Aeon, 'Qlipoth', and it provides a form of 'Preservation' to worlds ravaged by the Antimatter Legion. A key function of the corporation is regulating Light Cone technology, for which it holds usage rights authorized by the Garden of Recollection. While ubiquitous, its involvement is not always direct; it has placed high bounties on members of the Stellaron Hunters, including Kafka and Blade, and refers to Elio as the Slave of Fate. It cannot purchase the services of Herta, and its logo marks the origin of certain devices. The corporation occasionally cooperates with the Xianzhou Alliance, such as on trade agreements, and also acts as a defrauded party in cases like the 'Aijihazha Sand Gold Incident'.

The Interastral Peace Corporation received an invitation to Penacony and is actively reclaiming it, with Aventurine (砂金) acting as its primary representative and main envoy employed to gain entry by any means. The corporation's operations at the dream hotel make it generally unpopular with the Family. As a powerful organization, it oversees market development, enforces the Interastral Peace Charter, and attempts to collaborate with the Astral Express. The corporation is also involved in the Penacony incident, demanding that Sunday be held accountable under the guise of peace, with employees monitoring the situation at the hotel. Aventurine's actions are partly motivated by his allegiance to the corporation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Interstellar Peace Company is a major galactic corporation represented by Aventurine and Topaz in the Penacony negotiations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be9f92f0e7cc47777979ee06b310252c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e8c342929c1e0a403d0cab7884c843b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cbf01ed9ad87a70a79c843ac877485f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eed04f2e24a99af4e58308c5385ef8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-807438542660c564cc6c45c1235307a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7823732295dacca3169a4fdc0d9b7a6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deed5fb02763ec38f8b148679259b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb481f872f6ed8d0d115bc183be81f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f3368332ddd4f4c2f6a0dfe0a4ae48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db1a6716eb95924fce53acec168f822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e44ecf966c6560c7f086afff655868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d200c73d981b852fa64a6901ad64129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4006787ff76d5227d6ce51fce241de65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c99e6308cd56f22b4ce44dda6f0ec62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aef888c83a56efa55bc6bdac956ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d4f76837602b150702d42db6ea60525&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c77346cce3c3448fb8ecdb4640cd7f32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b99ab1743f20fd38242e46be4fdebb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-192d4c65dacdd377abc5e38c2529132e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ebbbf7bf5819ee830ffd02c3c6f9d34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24216adb3550f4039e3373041f9f3067&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c8183406d2a4bc03402423db5c4a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f25c87c66c524f1eaa36bafc4c949cbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bef71ea9725559b5e05574558cbcec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a26e6722285ef522993b41004a8fb2</data>
