    </node>
    <node id="流光忆庭">
      <data key="d0">流光忆庭</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Garden of Recollection (流光忆庭) is a faction composed of beings known as ‘忆者’ (Memokeepers) who uniquely possess the ability to manipulate ‘忆质’ (memoria), setting them apart from ordinary individuals. This faction is credited as the original inventor of Light Cone technology, a creation subsequently authorized to the Interastral Peace Corporation. The Garden of Recollection serves the Memory Aeon and its members can traverse worlds as memes, remaining visible only to specific people. They are known for a rivalry with Herta and are speculated to hold a wanted list containing the name Dan Heng, having already made contact with the Astral Express.

Beyond technological achievements, the Garden is dedicated to recreating fallen civilizations, having successfully recovered memoria fragments related to the ‘Moon Guard’s Shield.’ They have dispatched Memokeepers, such as 黑天鹅 (Black Swan), to Penacony to record its historic moments. Members of the Garden of Recollection aim to witness the Trailblaze of the Astral Express and collect unique memories, demonstrating exceptional abilities within the Memokeeper domain of Penacony. The faction is also acknowledged as an entity that understands the principle of being a gambler’s chip and is known for its memory manipulation technology, frequently appearing in discussions about memory tampering.&lt;SEP&gt;流光忆庭是组织，曾让犯人在匹诺康尼打捞大孔洞里泄漏的忆质。&lt;SEP&gt;流光忆庭is an organization of Memokeepers that Black Swan belongs to, focused on preserving memories.&lt;SEP&gt;The Garden of Recollection is an organization that studies memoria, but their existence caused the public to overlook memoria dynamics.&lt;SEP&gt;流光忆庭是一个与记忆相关的组织，忆者是该组织的成员。&lt;SEP&gt;流光忆庭(Garden of Recollection) is an organization of忆者(Memokeepers).&lt;SEP&gt;流光忆庭是一个组织，黑天鹅是其成员。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be9f92f0e7cc47777979ee06b310252c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e8c342929c1e0a403d0cab7884c843b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c91b253be982c706832e5755da7ad500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d49ee9d93d2b9c97270455c78b3b83e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d200c73d981b852fa64a6901ad64129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e50467af689c6df6aabbc4058a5858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee043452b079db75e92301d147036f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1e23bfd4bf1c77fb266c1fdef2619ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59980cf920354512f617e41b955d0a8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24565d6d66fd343d204ca6ee232d3fb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41a99864b87ae5c7c8eb089ea4a5b9d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282520995832324abf63454ecad3f3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aef888c83a56efa55bc6bdac956ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14ef88ed231842823bf1bb0651d40e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56bf05d342e60a2ae1c0004ed755f892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-170b9f7ee9a1a78769aaf22c6aa082e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19f5f030dc583660b802b079e3f709e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7525f63d21e345e0134731209482201d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb475440db80c353fd6762c87c12548</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016379</data>
