    <node id="光锥">
      <data key="d0">光锥</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A Light Cone is a powerful enhancement artifact originally created by the Garden of Recollection, whose usage rights are now owned by the Interastral Peace Corporation.&lt;SEP&gt;光锥is an invention of the流光忆庭.&lt;SEP&gt;光锥(Light Cone) is a memory and an artifact that is being kept securely by Sunday.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be9f92f0e7cc47777979ee06b310252c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c91b253be982c706832e5755da7ad500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0a3dbfcfd8b95ff234089961fba702</data>
