    <node id="末日兽">
      <data key="d0">末日兽</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">末日兽is a creature that has been brought in to deal with星穹列车.&lt;SEP&gt;末日兽, also known as the Doomsday Beast, is a planet-destroying weapon of the Anti-Matter Legion with the power to easily tear through the space station's shield.&lt;SEP&gt;末日兽is a powerful member of the Antimatter Legion that was defeated in a recent attack.&lt;SEP&gt;末日兽is a powerful enemy creature that pursues the group but is neutralized thanks to the trailblazer.&lt;SEP&gt;The末日兽is a powerful enemy faced by the开拓者at the空间站.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a3cfc8f55ca58a8b49ae984321424c78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d6c8ac9917f5a8ab265464fbd40c04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c61378b1f48a3fccbe0fff17273a16f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c83d3b40886e45b43e8b5c20dd177e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0bd49528edf3e917eef4f2c1aa6516</data>
