      <data key="d2">赞达尔is the first genius in history, also known as赞达尔•壹•桑原.&lt;SEP&gt;赞达尔is the founder of the Genius Club who named the organization.&lt;SEP&gt;赞达尔是天才俱乐部第一位会员，提出了“宇宙之树”假说。</data>
