    <node id="螺丝咕姆">
      <data key="d0">螺丝咕姆</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">螺丝咕姆is a member of a club and a rival of银狼.&lt;SEP&gt;A genius who is highly skilled in computer technology. Herta compares the Trailblazer's potential to his, acknowledging she is not as excellent in the field.&lt;SEP&gt;螺丝咕姆是天才俱乐部会员，机械贵族，在模拟宇宙项目中负责编写程序的底层逻辑并演算银河。&lt;SEP&gt;螺丝咕姆is a character.&lt;SEP&gt;螺丝咕姆是天才俱乐部成员，参与合作挖掘“械皇遗冢”。&lt;SEP&gt;螺丝咕姆is a member of the Genius Society who agrees to provide technical support for Penacony's reconstruction.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a3cfc8f55ca58a8b49ae984321424c78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8272ce558ae20153faafd6ffc5a4135d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3da0cb92646701693c5ed26d30314d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d200c73d981b852fa64a6901ad64129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a26e6722285ef522993b41004a8fb2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779100995</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="命运">
      <data key="d0">命运</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">命运is described as making a character the "奴隶" (slave) of it.&lt;SEP&gt;命运is a concept hinted at by黄泉through the idea of缘分and a premonition of a fateful relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;命运是一种抽象力量，被描述为促使黄泉和砂金道路交汇的因素。&lt;SEP&gt;命运refers to fate or destiny, a central theme questioned by砂金regarding its predetermined nature.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a3cfc8f55ca58a8b49ae984321424c78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50324d9549c90d9f6834f20f38e5f8a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23d4778f839d2a1eac66e3c79c7e10e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405</data>
