    <node id="姬子">
      <data key="d0">姬子</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Himeko (姬子) is the Navigator and an esteemed owner-member of the Astral Express crew in the game "Honkai: Star Rail." She is characterized by a passionate, mysterious, and adventurous spirit. As the Navigator, she is responsible for communicating with ground teams, coordinating affairs, sealing Stellarons, making critical decisions, and maintaining the train, which she previously repaired to allow it to sail the galaxy again. She plays a pivotal role in welcoming new passengers like the Trailblazer, acting as a mentor who emphasizes self-discovery and personal agency, while maintaining a calm and analytical demeanor.

In various missions, Himeko represented the Express in discussions with characters such as Black Swan, Gallagher, and Aventurine. She proposed collaboration for guidance in the Memory Zone, initiated votes on the train's direction, handled commissions from the Family in Penacony, and personally investigated murder cases and dreamscape anomalies, including the case of Firefly and information about Robin. She challenged Sunday's vision for Penacony, describing the power of Harmony behind the Dreammaster and the threat of the Stellaron, and firmly opposed Sunday's concept of "Order," viewing it as a prison. Himeko is a key observer of the plot; she analyzed Sunday's beliefs, read the history of Penacony's construction, and interpreted the "Parable of the Fool Servant," recognizing an attempt to replace Harmony with Order. She also noted the likely presence of only one "Grand Theater" in the dreamscape, speculated puppets might be stage scenery, and warned the group about impending fierce battles, consistently preparing to fight while observing the situation. Furthermore, she discussed Star Gods and Penacony's future with Sunday, explained temporary travel requests of Boothill and Black Swan, praised General Jing Yuan's mediation, and accepted the invitation to join discussions, solidifying her role as a senior figure in negotiations.&lt;SEP&gt;Himeko is the navigator of the Astral Express who votes for destinations and suggests visiting the ocean planet, Lushaka.&lt;SEP&gt;Himeko is the navigator of the Astral Express who votes for destinations and expresses confidence in her safety as a Nameless.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ac1bb23d4766797788088ba5ff6aa47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b766f048e61cc6147f844ddae676af7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e8c342929c1e0a403d0cab7884c843b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c53bbd7e3dab117321de5400d6f0ab35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c91b253be982c706832e5755da7ad500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8272ce558ae20153faafd6ffc5a4135d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3aa925e2cda548b4c1ed572e6b6fb31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d6c8ac9917f5a8ab265464fbd40c04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c61378b1f48a3fccbe0fff17273a16f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54c578d96b848b155835e3ba7da7e5f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cbf01ed9ad87a70a79c843ac877485f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bf92db6fb06a4ce23bb9a1040ac0bf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c83d3b40886e45b43e8b5c20dd177e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b90e0ee8e6c1bdf39a40aa9e79108543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bf663d6f3ed8f5070fc03ef10983000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e78a4d47602d8436e5950b7c64fa6734&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789285bc757b7b48d94a58fb5071cb0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95f3cdca78469e141c72057fa03532b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f7fcf2745a1b4cb918633cb92877ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d55f575d28d66085799bb30b2f94c668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bb530c0e05d34c67f0c09a0b64e8fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e575eb06637f7ecf24d773fb6f0f798b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-876cbdcb2b6b60cef20d49340ecee30f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62781f29bdc9b0fad8b67a1741741b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54005507f5db05a1431064ea9db88caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0bd49528edf3e917eef4f2c1aa6516&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597d9b4d5a0e43e3628da07ccc535c03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f0fb910ea43e4acb7d09e5d8281a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4230a2ca41a3aa5b271c968b4567de1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f363a6ba12d7e65941adba654ef6fb4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2decb49a546c2b4fde6ed99f9c7b7ad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9509992da819b3c05c5d00771b2ec521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21825bf2e51d148d9157e7a7efb7ae87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c308352492cacde7b8e6f6802f949905&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f371fb32e3b3a665db31402cdb619141&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076f9df9869a74ed98d14ab2d4cf67a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63dc2a8cef74048f287c7e0648930116&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-807438542660c