    <node id="怪物">
      <data key="d0">怪物</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">The term "怪物" (monsters) refers to various hostile beings across multiple locations and contexts. Primarily, monsters are dangerous creatures that continuously spawn within the裂界 (Fragmentum), a dangerous and unstable space, where they pose a persistent threat. In铆钉镇 (Rivet Town), they are hazardous entities that must be carefully avoided or fought. Specific monsters include "畸形怪物" (deformed monsters) within the裂界 that characters like希儿 (Seele) must confront, causing concern for娜塔莎 (Natasha), and creatures that can flip boxes, as referenced by希儿. Additionally, monsters attack the黑塔空间站 (Herta Space Station) and are encountered by克拉拉 (Clara) while she searches for components. In the context of the禁区 (Forbidden Zone), monsters originate from the other side, with the银鬃铁卫 (Silvermane Guards) responsible for holding them back. A specific instance also describes a monster lurking near a switch that must be dealt with to proceed.&lt;SEP&gt;怪物是死于热能武器或高热反应的生物，其残骸留下了燃烧的记忆。&lt;SEP&gt;怪物是流放之地的守卫，遵循规律将美梦中的人掳走带往流梦礁。&lt;SEP&gt;怪物are hostile creatures that流萤warns to be careful of.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c53bbd7e3dab117321de5400d6f0ab35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20901f83b15280df6e331e222d79b58c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe6b86a7693b184d26c498dcba8aeaed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8010590ea9229f0d14cbda63a8ffc533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-841f969b766204a7a19f27c2b5b85d42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15180a72eb9a3f1361af9608498c499b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f0fb910ea43e4acb7d09e5d8281a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43256708d2e397fb5f52dc7939871b39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff27003d40cef9e5eea6b05a7803810c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c93d548b2a01ac78c4534185b1c50d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1edc535953132e71c8ea06d16e282c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2a617c09373b8228653ceb12250637b</data>
