    <node id="礼物">
      <data key="d0">礼物</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A gift that Wen Shiling left for Bo Shao in the analysis room.&lt;SEP&gt;The gift from燕翠representing the金人巷merchants.&lt;SEP&gt;礼物是一批由停云未能送出的物品，包括种子、菜刀和弓，由开拓者和三月七代为送达。&lt;SEP&gt;The gift is a mysterious item given by花火disguised as知更鸟, containing a button for the guest to press during the Harmony Grand Festival.</data>
