    <node id="列车组">
      <data key="d0">列车组</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Astral Express Crew (列车组), also known as the Train Crew, is the collective group of travelers who journey through the universe aboard the Astral Express. This crew is primarily led by Himeko and includes key members such as the Trailblazer, March 7th, Dan Heng, and Welt. They are often referred to as the Express Crew and are central to many significant events and negotiations, including those that take place on Penacony. The crew is known for opposing the proposals of Sunday and seeking answers during confrontations, often forming the core group that stands against him. They have also been involved in more lighthearted activities, such as playing hide-and-seek with the Moles. At times, the crew has been requested to leave by Asta, who gifted them photos as a farewell gesture. The Trailblazer has attempted to regroup with the crew, and it is generally considered wise to cooperate with them. In summary, the Astral Express Crew is a united group of travelers who work together to save worlds, collaborate with allies like Black Swan, and face various challenges, including those presented by Sunday and other adversaries.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c53bbd7e3dab117321de5400d6f0ab35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9169eec00a528b13c46d52c1ade6a7fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21825bf2e51d148d9157e7a7efb7ae87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076f9df9869a74ed98d14ab2d4cf67a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144698bffcc884ba074327b0c9548848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2b4ade52cf1ff815c99a9bf7a8f697e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-410f71ecf8e49938b81e964a9399bc3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a111bfaa2097692df9de2c4cee43b80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a07d8ef325346821827a8cabce8be9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0a3dbfcfd8b95ff234089961fba702&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ab104d64e9eb410cea34464f76c33a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b9e8302300ff54dabbffc9bcf5f0204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eafccb4855b4210dcf8ae59537a1eb77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a26e6722285ef522993b41004a8fb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea958dd07fcb944ce792ebb1149ed1b7</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779101112</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
