      <data key="d2">NICKNAME is the placeholder name for the protagonist, who interacts with various characters in the space station.&lt;SEP&gt;NICKNAME is the player character, also known as the Trailblazer and a Nameless. In this context, NICKNAME is following流萤.&lt;SEP&gt;NICKNAME是开拓者的另一称呼，在文本中被提及为调查核心人物。</data>
