    <node id="博识学会">
      <data key="d0">博识学会</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">博识学会is an organization that challenges the space station.&lt;SEP&gt;博识学会is a faction also known as the erudition society.&lt;SEP&gt;博识学会是真理医生所属的学术组织，他作为其中一员出现在本次事件中。&lt;SEP&gt;A scholarly society that was also a victim of the 'Aijihazha Sand Gold Case'.&lt;SEP&gt;博识学会是一个学术组织，正在推广相关的康复治疗技术来帮助那些需要帮助的人。&lt;SEP&gt;The Intelligentsia Guild is a scholarly organization represented by Dr. Ratio in the Penacony negotiations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c91b253be982c706832e5755da7ad500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d4f76837602b150702d42db6ea60525&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b99ab1743f20fd38242e46be4fdebb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c47098afdb2c1a8744e7c9c843360554&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a26e6722285ef522993b41004a8fb2</data>
