    <node id="星神">
      <data key="d0">星神</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">星神 (Aeon) are the supreme, god-like divinities within the universe of Honkai: Star Rail. They govern specific Paths (命途) and possess immense, cosmic power, yet they are described as beings with no free will beyond the dictates of their respective paths. Their nature is mysterious and enigmatic; some Aeons, like阿基维利 (the Trailblaze Aeon), are explicitly tied to their paths, while others like毁灭 (Destruction) and丰饶 (Abundance) act in ways difficult for mortals to comprehend. Aeons are also believed to scatter Stellarons as seeds of calamity across worlds, linking them to many of the universe’s crises. While they are considered the highest echelon of existence—with姬子 stating that no Aeon-level reaction was detected in a recent event—they are not invincible and can be killed. For the家族, a星神 serves as its central core, a figure around which members unite and devote themselves. Characters like黄泉 are speculated to be its emissaries, further emphasizing their pervasive influence. The Simulated Universe project, led by黑塔, is the primary effort to study these beings, attempting to simulate them while acknowledging their true nature remains a profound mystery.&lt;SEP&gt;星神是星期日和知更鸟讨论的理想实现者，代表一种超越同谐的存在。&lt;SEP&gt;星神(Aeons) are powerful cosmic entities that follow their own paths single-mindedly.&lt;SEP&gt;Aeons are divine or conceptual entities, and their history is part of what the pre-shows aim to illuminate.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c91b253be982c706832e5755da7ad500&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c61378b1f48a3fccbe0fff17273a16f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54c578d96b848b155835e3ba7da7e5f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00732d55bdd6fa143033b2dd0669aaa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3da0cb92646701693c5ed26d30314d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e575eb06637f7ecf24d773fb6f0f798b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f0fb910ea43e4acb7d09e5d8281a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d1d3f2fdd68ace39bfead72d5c6de09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aec7e92881b8561c64f206d873044d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d063d42a7d57ae6c56275f1aaaa1ec8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18bb9d37a8fed7eab8d5cba8f123f61d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee77b88c86c938c0967cd2eb1ef92ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28f44dbc7147eb695d2a84423677906c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb475440db80c353fd6762c87c12548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adc094529bd44146c762587e8b448ea2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779100462</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="帕姆">
      <data key="d0">帕姆</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">帕姆（Pam）是《崩坏：星穹铁道》中“星穹列车”的列车长，也是列车的核心管理员和主要播报员。他尽职尽责地负责列车的日常运行，包括进行星轨稳定性检查、组织跃迁航线会议、校准导航参数以及宣布下一站目的地。在每次跃迁前，帕姆会确保乘客安全，召集所有成员启动跳跃，并为开拓者、三月七等人送行。作为列车的权威管理者，他对旅行者友好但严守规则，强调开拓者并非唯一特殊的存在。然而，当感到不满或生气时，他的态度会变得极其严厉，甚至会使用喷壶让人冷静。

帕姆通常留在列车上不参与外出冒险，但曾与姬子一同受黑塔委托寻找“回声玻璃”，并陪同姬子前往萨托里乌斯执行任务，途中发现星舰残骸并救出乘客。他对阿基维利的故乡感到怀念，并欣喜于列车使命的复兴。帕姆不喜欢卡芙卡，认为她危险，但尊重开拓者的自主选择。他对匹诺康尼充满好奇但无法下车。帕姆的意见常被列车组成员重视，也会在噩梦后安慰主角。他还会对涉及列车安全与规则的事宜进行裁决，其声音甚至被开拓者考虑模仿。帕姆曾拜托姬子在匹诺康尼打听三位无名客的消息，并对黄泉的请求感到疑惑。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c2051d136f142b71c1c8b60288f02f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8272ce558ae20153faafd6ffc5a4135d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bf92db6fb06a4ce23bb9a1040ac0bf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f32de70791c7e5a38487eaa460b9eded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be883e02f0b9eb480b772e385046f8b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bf663d6f3ed8f5070fc03ef10983000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e78a4d47602d8436e5950b7c64fa6734&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789285bc757b7b48d94a58fb5071cb0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95f3cdca78469e141c72057fa03532b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00732d55bdd6fa143033b2dd0669aaa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f7fcf2745a1b4cb918633cb92877ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bb530c0e05d34c67f0c09a0b64e8fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e575eb06637f7ecf24d773fb6f0f798b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62249a61ab686e12d9f450bd5b82c692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4230a2ca41a3aa5b271c968b4567de1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f363a6ba12d7e65941adba654ef6fb4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f371fb32e3b3a665db31402cdb619141&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076f9df9869a74ed98d14ab2d4cf67a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63dc2a8cef74048f287c7e0648930116&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-807438542660c564cc6c45c1235307a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25bbc2acab19c28d156b60535056e250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7304e1604bff47c393b7d5c5dec23a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3b928a611b55c5851f3bf1cdc2b0d93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef607cf0570a332c394810669c8b2ed4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d49ee9d93d2b9c97270455c78b3b83e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6bc51c0b8f913f809328ba29170426&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecd9bc285c1eb0c1092ea17d790b9a54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-488e16522a18a4f6bb0a292766e58c72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbaaefa57c77ce66db9f587ea1d3d757&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55386d63b94eb9742f952f3f22848dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e021fc26775ae86ae4a8fa4b4a74a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66cf67fcb2b367fc8c70e85c70acc6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-094804e240d67bb52bc7b0d5edc9d536&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1a1c7c7cdd2117231c2128f98f9f367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-088541780cd6898348a852107a2583cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f619797d531a760023734b0000857d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff01e303ac33cbdc731672f2b8068156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00d0fbb77db3436bd966280bc71989ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10a9a57ca0c7078de0765d59816cccd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce6adaabd8f6d85314cbea559ce01a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbc0545073ffbc2eb5583d62bfd63293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8665828cdd81643c13114451e6ade3fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19f5f030dc583660b802b079e3f709e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d404ca122e5e26803146d6835398291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7525f63d21e345e0134731209482201d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb475440db80c353fd6762c87c12548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e038997304f6b48259a70927a3be53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bef71ea9725559b5e05574558cbcec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1f7faf4930e00b263ca759277579820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b169536dd073e8b85cff97e7e4637fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d235d876b6479c8e730e06da624342e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ced452746c325133a3a01ca4ffe26f9</data>
