    <node id="列车">
      <data key="d0">列车</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Astral Express, most commonly referred to as the "列车," is a unique, mobile locomotive in the form of a train that serves as the primary mode of travel and home base for the Trailblazers and their companions. Described as a travel tool carrying passengers toward an unknown destination, it is a setting where conversations, planning, and critical events occur, such as receiving invitations or initiating warp events. The train contains specific spaces like passenger cars (客房车厢), and its significance lies in its ability to traverse the stars, connecting the crew to different worlds and adventures.&lt;SEP&gt;A vehicle that has arrived at匹诺康尼.&lt;SEP&gt;The train that was split into two pieces by阿基维利.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c2051d136f142b71c1c8b60288f02f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c83d3b40886e45b43e8b5c20dd177e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b90e0ee8e6c1bdf39a40aa9e79108543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bb530c0e05d34c67f0c09a0b64e8fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f946c60a8d8ff52731600d62dc86e722&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0bd49528edf3e917eef4f2c1aa6516&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9509992da819b3c05c5d00771b2ec521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-094804e240d67bb52bc7b0d5edc9d536&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1a1c7c7cdd2117231c2128f98f9f367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f619797d531a760023734b0000857d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00d0fbb77db3436bd966280bc71989ca</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836167</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="裂界">
      <data key="d0">裂界</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">裂界（Fragmentum）是一种由星核植入世界后直接引发的危险空间扭曲与侵蚀现象，是星核存在的必然灾祸。它破坏和改造物理空间，创造高度异常的环境，使物理规律失效，并生成名为“裂界怪物”的敌对生物，这些怪物能够通过裂界连接并穿越不同世界。裂界已在多个星球构成直接威胁，包括黑塔空间站和雅利洛-Ⅵ。在雅利洛-Ⅵ上，裂界起源于星球“寒潮”降临之时，持续威胁贝洛伯格的安全，污染了城市街区与地下矿区，已蔓延至下层区，腐蚀地底物质，导致大量矿场无法开采和矿工失业，并吞噬土地，引发族群迁徙，与银鬃铁卫的损失直接相关，迫使大守护者可可利亚采取极端策略应对。

裂界是一种不断扩张的威胁，其源头被普遍认为与星核有关。它被称为“无尽的危险地带”，弥漫着死亡气息，几乎吞没了贝洛伯格以北的区域，曾侵蚀了铆钉镇，促使娜塔莎创建“地火”组织进行对抗。裂界区域是极度危险的场所，银鬃铁卫战士在此牺牲，角色如布洛妮娅感到无力，而桑博曾冒险闯入其中救援他人。裂界具有特殊能力，能制造幻象和创造事物的复制体，形成过去的残像，与可可利亚存在特殊联系。它是一种灾难性的存在，贝洛伯格与其作战是为了存护，杰帕德曾需穿越被侵蚀的裂界前往雪原。裂界是受污染的空间，污染程度各异，角色们曾在这种地带寻找出口。值得注意的是，星核引发的裂界现象在封印后不会消失，但扩张会停止。裂界怪物通常破坏人造物件，但在特定情境下，怪物也可能把守关键的能源中枢。总体而言，裂界是贝洛伯格面临的持续、扩张的威胁，可能最终侵蚀整个世界。&lt;SEP&gt;裂界是一种不断扩张的威胁，需要银鬃铁卫的攻势来抑制。&lt;SEP&gt;裂界is a concept whose influence has taken root too deeply to be reversed immediately, even if the Stellaron is sealed.&lt;SEP&gt;裂界is a phenomenon associated with the harmful crystals in the地髓矿区.&lt;SEP&gt;裂界是腐蚀贝洛伯格的现象，与星核相关。&lt;SEP&gt;裂界is a hostile space phenomenon that was stabilized by the crew.&lt;SEP&gt;裂界is a concept.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8272ce558ae20153faafd6ffc5a4135d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b90e0ee8e6c1bdf39a40aa9e79108543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28c8a79168a91659cd695cab9d7e5226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff4678a309428e5e405e8aab17b34d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e575eb06637f7ecf24d773fb6f0f798b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33a3b81a0e0d021e092a5a43b49f3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cb8da041bb65dbc2bdac7765d979d3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625aa25735f503b4e89b5390a5e1fa4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20901f83b15280df6e331e222d79b58c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-404cf71a3e6219ba8a0e5449b0ac3648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba20141801229755c9c8a7cfa181257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14ff2981a079af20ab48290ab8fef705&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d50dd0c4a864aad264fdad2c99753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb7e3676b7ef53774a045f63a562243d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbd59288b2396673d3d290554c4a1db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72d3e4bc634c012aad25dcf71e92b962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-476102d5b945c517f2ae3b121c6662a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe6b86a7693b184d26c498dcba8aeaed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-841f969b766204a7a19f27c2b5b85d42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51e338cd77e46441f1f7d69fd0e39180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c56774a55a4da64085ed73e773e673ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-460113c4ae9bdba9770d374216bde627&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb689f40a2116265b9387146e28007c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87e94271f7ba8c380df5e7881a6bfafe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16db8c2d24c790ba6ab06adc96caa029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd3abc93cbfc88148dada26d6a80719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96d655812159e371a4f4f65013fcae3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fd5d5729dee96837f589844028d1e87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a472ad06854cfbea32b100ad930934ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f358eb31ab41c53d64bb729897805779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0b70c5bab9acadcf25ebebbc43e9cc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67c3672cce0e22adc6911bd20ab34903&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-876cbdcb2b6b60cef20d49340ecee30f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc91593211be73b8761c305cc9886950&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62781f29bdc9b0fad8b67a1741741b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6477396ebbad8040692e490395c1e52b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f52a11ffcc13b31e8b906453b350f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-648ec021d414c21c95d0721c3edba947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597d9b4d5a0e43e3628da07ccc535c03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048b0dd3c3bc2cae0be82ff708452623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2c94e0a997abe0dc9a22abe65fe37fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1a8577b7946f5aa362d3182972ee9b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f0fb910ea43e4acb7d09e5d8281a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7761bbe49cdee3fe2ebc6f41bfed7bee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d93bda629c48fbb4d287f624821f6ef4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4230a2ca41a3aa5b271c968b4567de1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2decb49a546c2b4fde6ed99f9c7b7ad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3b928a611b55c5851f3bf1cdc2b0d93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
