    <node id="绝灭大君">
      <data key="d0">绝灭大君</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">绝灭大君, known as the Lord Ravager or Lord of Extinction, is a high commander and powerful Emanator of Destruction within the Antimatter Legion, serving under the Aeon of Destruction, 纳努克 (Nanook). They are among the seven great lords who compel mortals towards destruction and lead the Legion in its campaigns across the cosmos. One of their number is 幻胧 (Phantylia), who is notably present in the current events, having impersonated the character 停云 (Tingyun) to infiltrate the Xianzhou Luofu and orchestrate a destructive plot. The term "绝灭大君" designates a specific rank and role of immense authority within the Antimatter Legion's hierarchy, and these beings are considered powerful commanders and Emanators, wielding fearsome strength. However, it is noteworthy that in the described attack, 幻胧 is not believed to be present in her true form, though she plays a key role through deception.&lt;SEP&gt;绝灭大君is a Lord Ravager of the Antimatter Legion, mentioned as a threat.&lt;SEP&gt;绝灭大君是「毁灭」命途的强大存在，曾与开拓者等人交战，被三月七提及以说明敌人的强大。&lt;SEP&gt;A Lord Ravager is a powerful servant of the path of Destruction that the group has previously defeated.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-99d6c8ac9917f5a8ab265464fbd40c04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c28a8b577c86813ea10762e546e4fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42cb7b6c602a4d11cb2e76505dd012c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c96d885f6a65cadc94f79df95313f0ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc2240f2b9c03c7ee20a149da420ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3889b67baa0c9d0549e50a6f4357f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b8ec337371f5734c56c3df5468f8089</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069987</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
