    <node id="防护罩">
      <data key="d0">防护罩</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">防护罩is the shield protecting the support section of the space station, which is failing under the assault of the Doomsday Beast.&lt;SEP&gt;防护罩是空间站的防御系统，由黑塔提供代码加速修复以抵挡反物质军团。</data>
