    <node id="杨叔">
      <data key="d0">杨叔</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Uncle Yang (杨叔) is an affectionate and informal nickname used primarily by March 7th to refer to Welt Yang, a member of the Astral Express crew. The name underscores a close, familial relationship within the group, characterizing Welt as a mature, patient, reliable, and stabilizing older figure. As a crewmate, Welt Yang is a companion of Dan Heng, the Trailblazer, and March 7th, and he often provides reassurance and realistic assessments, such as helping smooth over conflicts in Belobog. March 7th has used the term in various scenarios, including when Welt worries about future events, indicating a caring yet sometimes concerned demeanor.

As a member of the Express Crew, Uncle Yang has been noted to notice subtle details, such as Robin's voice sounding tired. He has also been involved in tense situations, including being held by Sunday. Additionally, he is a member of the crew who is presumably at a hotel front desk and has been observed to try to change the subject in certain discussions. The nickname highlights the close-knit group dynamic, with Welt serving as a stabilizing and capable presence among the younger members.&lt;SEP&gt;杨叔is a member of the Astral Express crew, also known as Welt Yang, who is busy with Ji Zi.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-99d6c8ac9917f5a8ab265464fbd40c04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c83d3b40886e45b43e8b5c20dd177e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95f3cdca78469e141c72057fa03532b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-876cbdcb2b6b60cef20d49340ecee30f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21825bf2e51d148d9157e7a7efb7ae87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-759b67ce2403d327c5bbf52c85062eaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd1ac3b2477b33ac600764c2339c9761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a08a4c1f5ae941cbe079fc5aaa48a0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43623aa0b2e27c60a1de27a0205f0f63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39ee06bafb842d307b13ed54ad7ab232&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca2fde817826f962ed055501ca3dd274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95189fee74f326831efd9da16d00b815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72ad4c06466fbf815a6a26d890c9e825&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55386d63b94eb9742f952f3f22848dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e021fc26775ae86ae4a8fa4b4a74a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2b4ade52cf1ff815c99a9bf7a8f697e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c90fd6acf76e3b3f7415a285235acc48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0a70a6406ad3789553b939ba9a7d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbc0545073ffbc2eb5583d62bfd63293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d899ecf6217a2890e183d5c4a5f6bc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86e311806f377a542ee383fa4b880212&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bef71ea9725559b5e05574558cbcec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eafccb4855b4210dcf8ae59537a1eb77</data>
