    </node>
    <node id="模拟宇宙">
      <data key="d0">模拟宇宙</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">模拟宇宙is a program designed by four Genius Club members, led by黑塔, to simulate a universe and study Aeons.&lt;SEP&gt;The Simulated Universe is a virtual reality system created by Herta for testing and experimentation.&lt;SEP&gt;模拟宇宙is a simulation created based on memory, used for testing and exploration.&lt;SEP&gt;模拟宇宙是黑塔与天才俱乐部成员联合发起的项目，模拟整个宇宙以解开星神的奥秘，已升级版本。&lt;SEP&gt;模拟宇宙is a concept, the simulated universe.&lt;SEP&gt;The Simulated Universe is a project by the Genius Society that has been postponed to support Penacony’s reconstruction research.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c61378b1f48a3fccbe0fff17273a16f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a7886a58d5273ab63dee6a1b113452f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f45211ad81e0b2b4ed34aeb081be541&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3da0cb92646701693c5ed26d30314d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a26e6722285ef522993b41004a8fb2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779101006</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="军团">
      <data key="d0">军团</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">军团refers to the Antimatter Legion, which launched an attack against the Space Station.&lt;SEP&gt;军团is the hostile force that posed a threat, which has now been resolved.&lt;SEP&gt;军团是侵略者，曾在七百年前与银鬃铁卫交战。&lt;SEP&gt;军团is the organization that幻胧and药王秘传have allied with to influence the仙舟.&lt;SEP&gt;The Antimatter Legion, the army of the Destruction Aeon.&lt;SEP&gt;军团is the Legion, a group known for its aggressive actions and responsible for the danger faced by the天舶司接渡使.&lt;SEP&gt;The Antimatter Legion, a chaotic and destructive faction potentially responsible for destroying Fleur's homeworld.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0c61378b1f48a3fccbe0fff17273a16f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7c83d3b40886e45b43e8b5c20dd177e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048b0dd3c3bc2cae0be82ff708452623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c28a8b577c86813ea10762e546e4fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e573422bf2b97f952b6e576d9a40c404&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-119c7196661ead67f3283cc47c1aa976</data>
