    <node id="Astral Express">
      <data key="d0">Astral Express</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Astral Express is the train on which帕姆serves as a conductor and that is about to perform a warp.&lt;SEP&gt;The Astral Express is the train vehicle that is currently preparing for a transit jump.&lt;SEP&gt;Astral Express is the train faction to which the characters belong, with a scheduled seven-standard-day stop.&lt;SEP&gt;The Astral Express is the crew's spaceship, which has observed the玉界门reopening and is awaiting their return.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f32de70791c7e5a38487eaa460b9eded&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be883e02f0b9eb480b772e385046f8b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecd9bc285c1eb0c1092ea17d790b9a54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e021fc26775ae86ae4a8fa4b4a74a6</data>
