      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">跃迁is an event involving the train's warp or transit jump, requiring final preparations before departure.&lt;SEP&gt;A warp jump is a significant event in space travel, mentioned by Dan Heng as an imminent action.&lt;SEP&gt;跃迁is the space travel event that the Astral Express is about to perform.&lt;SEP&gt;Warp is a method of space travel used by the Astral Express to move between star systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The warp event that the Astral Express is about to undergo.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-be883e02f0b9eb480b772e385046f8b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68ca2f09bea0bd57ce26ea252d883318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f7fcf2745a1b4cb918633cb92877ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66cf67fcb2b367fc8c70e85c70acc6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-094804e240d67bb52bc7b0d5edc9d536&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c75592f96a4b5f7fcffc49d7d471d7a8</data>
