    <node id="无名客">
      <data key="d0">无名客</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Nameless (无名客) are a faction of explorers and Trailblazers intrinsically linked to the Astral Express (星穹列车). They follow the Path of Akivili, the Trailblazing Aeon, and are defined by their mission to travel the stars in constant motion, connecting different worlds. The term "Nameless" is a collective designation for all members of the Astral Express crew, who are characterized as upright, open, and idealistic individuals with a spirit of exploration and helping others. They are often driven by a pursuit of freedom and a desire to change false dreams or oppressive realities.

This faction is composed of travelers from diverse backgrounds. Prominent and current members include the Trailblazer, Welt Yang, March 7th, Himeko, and Dan Heng. Other figures, such as Boothill and past members like Firefly, are also associated with the group. The late Mikhail (沃克•夏尔•米哈伊尔) and Gallagher were former Nameless, and it is suspected that the Watchmaker (钟表匠) may have once been one. The group's identity is sometimes sought after by those hoping to gain entry into places like Penacony. The Nameless are not saviors but walk alongside mortals, and they have played a vital role in the unfolding narrative, contributing to quelling wars, entrusting legacies, and solving star-related disasters.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e78a4d47602d8436e5950b7c64fa6734&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f371fb32e3b3a665db31402cdb619141&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c28a8b577c86813ea10762e546e4fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e52e7c11d199f5688f182681811f4a43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66cf67fcb2b367fc8c70e85c70acc6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e46541e08f2deadbb702b1360ecd537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1a1c7c7cdd2117231c2128f98f9f367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-825953bbddc81f456bf53ec3b5e18e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10a9a57ca0c7078de0765d59816cccd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f417d6e4dfdd365b59a413fbb957fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c523f6ef00ca7019dac0f61aca7d59f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-119c7196661ead67f3283cc47c1aa976&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59980cf920354512f617e41b955d0a8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e36ecd5f447474c560cdbdcdd2e7783b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03be2219947057675dc5055c09116ccc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-981eb877163a6b386e5d40eb1f7edddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14ef88ed231842823bf1bb0651d40e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56bf05d342e60a2ae1c0004ed755f892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24216adb3550f4039e3373041f9f3067&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8540d7e0e81fe2169489850051f5cdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53c7f48036990ccca5a5b48e0fe82a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a53c00b399a52fdff3f15122ca9284aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8665828cdd81643c13114451e6ade3fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19f5f030dc583660b802b079e3f709e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d404ca122e5e26803146d6835398291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c47098afdb2c1a8744e7c9c843360554&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d31c548c51772ffa1288c6206b2ff0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b893a9163e9decf898e6a47789d69c6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db7acddc1a4e47a665ceece42a9f23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7525f63d21e345e0134731209482201d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb475440db80c353fd6762c87c12548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76afa09c20cb3ce18cbeba034f2526a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76f30cea7751c5e1cdb8b78f14fea91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3757b3a184b0e258bec874c72a3bf9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74d9be5bb2293