    <node id="裴迦纳">
      <data key="d0">裴迦纳</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">裴迦纳is Pegana, Akivili's hometown, which is both the first and last stop of the Astral Express's route.&lt;SEP&gt;裴迦纳是阿基维利的故乡，也是星穹列车旅程的首站和末站。&lt;SEP&gt;Pegana is the homeworld of the Aeon Akivili. It is located at the end of the Astral Express's route.&lt;SEP&gt;裴迦纳is the destination at the end of the Astral Express's route and the homeland of the Aeon阿基维利.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e78a4d47602d8436e5950b7c64fa6734&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789285bc757b7b48d94a58fb5071cb0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d49ee9d93d2b9c97270455c78b3b83e1</data>
