    <node id="命途">
      <data key="d0">命途</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">命途is a domain of power associated with an Aeon that cannot be closed and is used by Pathstriders.&lt;SEP&gt;命途是星神所掌控的道路，星神陨落后命途依然存在。&lt;SEP&gt;A Path, the philosophical and existential journey that individuals walk upon according to Fu Xuan, shaping their actions and destinies.&lt;SEP&gt;命途refers to the paths left by an Aeon for people to walk.&lt;SEP&gt;命途是由星神和凡人创造的概念，存在超出认知的外界。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d1d3f2fdd68ace39bfead72d5c6de09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38d7d8ba8bfe5e69f41225515582546c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef3b6681f2925e2c81851592c3ba8372&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19f5f030dc583660b802b079e3f709e1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
