    <node id="存护">
      <data key="d0">存护</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Path of Preservation, known in Chinese as "存护," is a cosmic principle in Honkai: Star Rail, primarily associated with the Aeon Qlipoth, also called the Amber Lord. This Path embodies the ideals of protection, creation, and defense, exemplified by the Aeon's endless forging of walls. It is followed by factions like the Builders and Architects, as well as key characters such as Svarog, who adheres to Preservation to make calculated decisions aimed at saving humanity. The Interastral Peace Corporation offers this Path's shelter to worlds in need.

In the narrative, the Path of Preservation is central to the convictions of Bronya, who believes a guardian's duty is to preserve the world built by humanity. Conversely, Cocolia is depicted as abandoning this Path in favor of the Stellaron. Similarly, Svarog previously protected the Underworld under Preservation's guidance. The Path's power is notably fading in Beloborg. In the Simulated Universe, Preservation is associated with blessings that enhance survival, while Sandgold promises its protection to the protagonist. Overall, 存护 is a fading but still significant Path of protection and blessing, with the Amber Lord as its chief Aeon.&lt;SEP&gt;Path of Preservation, a path whose power is sealed within the "Cornerstone" that砂金uses.&lt;SEP&gt;存护是信仰之一，其信徒擅长建造奇观。&lt;SEP&gt;存护is a path that represents preservation and protection, which？？？ questions砂金's true connection to.&lt;SEP&gt;存护is a concept or path, whose foundational stones can still serve a purpose even when shattered, according to砂金.&lt;SEP&gt;存护是砂金所信仰的命途，路珀王的基石是其象征。&lt;SEP&gt;存护is a power source that砂金uses, which prevented his actions from causing widespread damage.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f45211ad81e0b2b4ed34aeb081be541&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33c1e9e634113885abc239bd6e869e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd3abc93cbfc88148dada26d6a80719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54005507f5db05a1431064ea9db88caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e5ba5f7b6b4c9a58f7986795cc260a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f52a11ffcc13b31e8b906453b350f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0bd49528edf3e917eef4f2c1aa6516&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-648ec021d414c21c95d0721c3edba947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a4d80c13a1da5dc405c6fdfa48a655b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eacd315ae5f95c55d189019b4d765b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d200c73d981b852fa64a6901ad64129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057807b41b216391fb3264dc438854b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aea80432a137f815124bb7fadd3b0383&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21d69e5d473598eccb1e77a81726c583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-415c7bdbfc0ac0348c2f17ccb1d95aa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8453ce4da49768db75c2cf6376b2913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1e25533bb02e085267257087f8cfab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779015432</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="神秘">
      <data key="d0">神秘</data>
      <data key="d1">path</data>
      <data key="d2">神秘is a Path whose Aeon aims to make certain information chaotic and unclear.&lt;SEP&gt;神秘是加拉赫被指控所效忠的命途。&lt;SEP&gt;神秘是一个命途，加拉赫借助神秘的力量躲入混沌的忆域。&lt;SEP&gt;神秘is a path associated with creating梦想之地without a星核.&lt;SEP&gt;神秘is the Path followed by加拉赫, which emphasizes disbelief and mysticism.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1e25533bb02e085267257087f8cfab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53c7f48036990ccca5a5b48e0fe82a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ba3b6dae092d55950f9ddb961ea479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76f30cea7751c5e1cdb8b78f14fea91</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016615</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="克里珀">
      <data key="d0">克里珀</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">克里珀 (Qlipoth) is the Aeon of Preservation, whose power protects Belobog and is followed by the Architects and the Interstellar Peace Company. Also known as the Amber Lord, 克里珀 guides the Builders to construct walls against a universal disaster. Qlipoth Fort is named after him and is watched over by the Architects. In simulated contexts, 克里珀 appears based on collected Preservation blessings. Characters like Gepard swear by 克里珀’s name to punish deceivers.&lt;SEP&gt;克里珀is the Aeon of Preservation who gave a glance to the开拓者.&lt;SEP&gt;克里珀is the存护星神, whose holy body's light is described as golden, similar to the 「黄玉」 stone taken from托帕.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f45211ad81e0b2b4ed34aeb081be541&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01cda72aeaa485978711f9b72507b293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd3abc93cbfc88148dada26d6a80719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6477396ebbad8040692e490395c1e52b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f52a11ffcc13b31e8b906453b350f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0bd49528edf3e917eef4f2c1aa6516&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282520995832324abf63454ecad3f3a4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778900200</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="命途行者">
      <data key="d0">命途行者</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">命途行者is a person who walks on a Path due to their will overlapping with it and can draw power from it.&lt;SEP&gt;命途行者refers to followers of a specific Path, such as the Hunt.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56bf05d342e60a2ae1c0004ed755f892</data>
