    <node id="仙舟">
      <data key="d0">仙舟</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Xianzhou, also known as the Xianzhou Alliance or Xianzhou fleet alliance, is a major faction in the cosmos that governs multiple colossal Jade Starships, including the Luofu. These flagship vessels are characterized by ancient Chinese-inspired designs, advanced artificial weather systems, and interconnected realms or sub-spaces. As an independent, self-governing entity, the Xianzhou possesses its own internal governance and military structures. It is a civilization of long-lived beings, including the Vidhyadhara, to whom the Xianzhou gave refuge. The Xianzhou fleet includes the Luofu Xianzhou, where characters like Dan Heng were once banished, and where the protagonist is currently exploring. The alliance is the setting for numerous events, including a Stellaron disaster on the Luofu, various crises, and instances of betrayal. It is the civilization that the villain Huanlong plans to destroy by tainting the Jianmu, which residents view as an ancient, withered tree of unknown origin. The Xianzhou regretted accepting the Abundance and chose the path of the Hunt. Key organs include the Dan Ding Si, and the entire civilization faces ongoing perils requiring exploration and intervention. Additionally, the Xianzhou is a past location the crew has visited, and March 7th mentions wanting to say goodbye to friends there. The fleet is metaphorically described as a "fleet of immortals," with Golden Humans and formations being common sights. It is also where the teahouse operated by Meng Ming is located and is the origin of traditional famous teas, and its prosperity is symbolized by various gifts and seals.&lt;SEP&gt;仙舟refers to the Xianzhou fleet, the setting of the current journey.&lt;SEP&gt;The Xianzhou ships unified as the Xianzhou Alliance.&lt;SEP&gt;仙舟是星穹列车曾到访的地点，用于与匹诺康尼对比其复杂性。&lt;SEP&gt;仙舟is a location from which Dan Heng and some of his sayings originate.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-95f3cdca78469e141c72057fa03532b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c992f8ca9cbe3142dda05033f0b52e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e80256f6b29768c5cfabe6c8af4d081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a28cb31f880c428c7385b0d0986befb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6bc51c0b8f913f809328ba29170426&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7823732295dacca3169a4fdc0d9b7a6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43623aa0b2e27c60a1de27a0205f0f63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deed5fb02763ec38f8b148679259b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff8688e06b168deefda3fe220f725865&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b761f7975a148b7f60b9118ff40d2789&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b15f3e72ede1984381b5ab689b537e72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38d7d8ba8bfe5e69f41225515582546c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd9f10a536cdbcda90740d8d4674e15d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c28a8b577c86813ea10762e546e4fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c96d885f6a65cadc94f79df95313f0ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-232b4fb1b400fc9168a697506bccf527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc2240f2b9c03c7ee20a149da420ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b7a2ef5ad35a519d5ca57d50fdc1f32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64341e8c7e20847211eae6769982882f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72ad4c06466fbf815a6a26d890c9e825&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60ca28562fdbf0a819105efc79ad4cce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbaaefa57c77ce66db9f587ea1d3d757&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c0d83d786126b007971332b2266ae95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e021fc26775ae86ae4a8fa4b4a74a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e46541e08f2deadbb702b1360ecd537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ebbbf7bf5819ee830ffd02c3c6f9d34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eafccb4855b4210dcf8ae59537a1eb77</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779100913</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="公司">
      <data key="d0">公司</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Interastral Peace Corporation (IPC), referred to in Chinese as 星际和平公司 or simply 公司, is a mega-corporation and major faction in the Honkai: Star Rail universe. Historically, the IPC collaborated with the Builders in the old era to create an inhibitor designed to contain a Stellaron. It formerly used the planet Penacony as a border prison for exiling criminals before the location was connected by the Trailblaze. Despite being defeated and driven out by prisoners during the border wars, the company later sent agents to recover lost assets, specifically ownership of the Asdana Prison.

As a powerful major organization, the Company is described as able to provide wealth, status, and power. It employs envoys familiar with the name "钟表匠" (The Watchmaker), issues invitations for events, and places bounties on individuals such as 黄泉. The IPC maintains interest-based relationships with partners, provides intelligence and resources to operatives, and can track the identities of the "巡海游侠" (Galaxy Rangers), though this requires time. The organization is also attended the major event, influencing Penacony's situation alongside other factions.

In current affairs, the IPC is the organization that 砂金 ultimately chose to serve and will judge him for his actions, particularly the desecration of the "基石." The Company sent agents like 砂金, Aventurine, and Dr. Ratio to Penacony to recover assets. 砂金 planned a staged homicide to justify intervention and considered having its fleet surround Penacony. 花火 suggested the IPC would take over Penacony, reflecting its competitive stance against the 家族. The Company is suspected by the 家族 of creating chaos and is described as entangled with the家族, causing guests to avoid involvement. The Company is also an entity that his fleet is gathering towards Asdana.&lt;SEP&gt;The Company (Interastral Peace Corporation) expressed interest in having the Astral Express investigate the situation at Edo Star.&lt;SEP&gt;公司是砂金作为使节所代表的势力。&lt;SEP&gt;The Interastral Peace Corporation (IPC) is a major faction, represented by Aventurine, whose basic value is peace.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-95f3cdca78469e141c72057fa03532b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3230677383d6c0041b3dbc113dd8b0ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d49ee9d93d2b9c97270455c78b3b83e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66cf67fcb2b367fc8c70e85c70acc6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee709ee6223dbebd15d8b80e4cdae7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1a1c7c7cdd2117231c2128f98f9f367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057807b41b216391fb3264dc438854b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0a70a6406ad3789553b939ba9a7d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee043452b079db75e92301d147036f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-119c7196661ead67f3283cc47c1aa976&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-729906f69b0dc31b866284fec42bd817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41a99864b87ae5c7c8eb089ea4a5b9d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d063d42a7d57ae6c56275f1aaaa1ec8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03be2219947057675dc5055c09116ccc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff5381ef14c0174d6621bf098b92d840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f273e249d48375fe4ce18df04b167906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd4110dd8b2ec1a3d4e9ee703131d0f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19fa917549ed487883ffc4d2270cc5d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2d249f7bcbd0b19ddb847f1301c1021&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcc40b65a49e0c9b6e746474d3eeb7b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98bd728493101041950cb3bbec840969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14ef88ed231842823bf1bb0651d40e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-415c7bdbfc0ac0348c2f17ccb1d95aa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d49da9008828c6200d6d99602c0309a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8453ce4da49768db75c2cf6376b2913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24c8b3733d7b211b7ce78db7de0a56d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e65a39e336fdf3baa2c212c73a1cfc66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5fc4bdb0dd2b9ee973fa3d6b9e49199&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d404ca122e5e26803146d6835398291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-603ef2226ecb6b7032da6f1dbc06644f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c75592f96a4b5f7fcffc49d7d471d7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9189bbff0cdab4202d189f24260b142b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e038997304f6b48259a70927a3be53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea958dd07fcb944ce792ebb1149ed1b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d235d876b6479c8e730e06da624342e</data>
