    <node id="悲悼伶人">
      <data key="d0">悲悼伶人</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Mourning Actors are a group whose ship Dan Heng used to escape from the Company.&lt;SEP&gt;悲悼伶人is a faction.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mourning Actors are a faction that participated in the war.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mourning Actors are a theater troupe with a famous branch at Patrevinnitria.&lt;SEP&gt;A Mourning Actor is a character who has an appointment with Black Swan at the "Sapphire Belt" Patrevinizia.</data>
