    <node id="六相冰">
      <data key="d0">六相冰</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Six-Phase Ice is a special ice created by imaginary number principles that does not change form due to external interference, in which March 7th was frozen.&lt;SEP&gt;Six-Phase Ice is a rare substance that was once used to entrap March 7th.&lt;SEP&gt;Six-Phase Ice is a substance used by March 7th to perform emergency wound treatment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-95f3cdca78469e141c72057fa03532b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bb530c0e05d34c67f0c09a0b64e8fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e80256f6b29768c5cfabe6c8af4d081</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
