      <data key="d0">姬子姐姐</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">姬子姐姐是星穹列车组的成员，参与了解救三月七的行动。&lt;SEP&gt;Sister Himeko is an affectionate nickname for Himeko used by March 7th, portraying her as a caring and dependable older sister figure.</data>
