    <node id="瓦尔特先生">
      <data key="d0">瓦尔特先生</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">瓦尔特先生是星穹列车组的成员，参与了解救三月七的行动。&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特先生is a member of the Astral Express crew whose opinion about Belobog's fate being in its citizens' hands was agreed with by Bronya.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特先生is a member of the Nameless on the Astral Express, mentioned as a potential mediator.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特先生is a person waiting for流萤, mentioned as a companion who is not directly participating in this challenge.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-00732d55bdd6fa143033b2dd0669aaa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4230a2ca41a3aa5b271c968b4567de1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-488e16522a18a4f6bb0a292766e58c72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a615013e7ecef6026e27d87ed033cc3d</data>
