    <node id="星核之声">
      <data key="d0">星核之声</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The星核之声is a mysterious voice that communicates with可可利亚, presenting itself as an ally that has accompanied the guardians through generations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Stellaron's Voice is an entity that speaks to a young Cocolia, promising a new world and eternal prosperity in exchange for temporary misunderstanding.&lt;SEP&gt;星核之声是星核的具象化或声音，与可可利亚有联系，是其力量的来源。&lt;SEP&gt;星核之声is the voice or influence of the Stellaron that guides and tempts Cocolia.&lt;SEP&gt;星核之声是开拓者听到的神秘声音，内容涉及对可可利亚的威胁和描述的渐进危险性。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-031a66f450ba8a1cbde7f6bce3b9ad2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cb8da041bb65dbc2bdac7765d979d3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54005507f5db05a1431064ea9db88caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-648ec021d414c21c95d0721c3edba947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7761bbe49cdee3fe2ebc6f41bfed7bee</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778808743</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
