    <node id="守护者">
      <data key="d0">守护者</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The 守护者 (Guardian) is a title for the ruling authority and protector of the city of Belobog. This individual serves as the supreme leader of the city, bearing the immense burden of maintaining stability and order, often by keeping critical secrets to protect the populace. The 守护者 is an ally of the "星核之声" (Stellaron's voice), a relationship that has endured for generations. This figure forbids discussion of the lower-zone city, the 下层区, and is considered an enemy to the 地火 (Underground Fire) resistance group and the Trailblazers who oppose this rule. The position is hereditary; for instance, Cocolia is the current Guardian who attempts to conceal the truth about the Stellaron to preserve peace, and her daughter, Bronya, has been designated as her successor. A meeting with Dan Heng and others was scheduled with the Guardian for the following day.&lt;SEP&gt;守护者是指保护贝洛伯格的人，具有崇高的牺牲精神，布洛妮娅成为新任守护者。&lt;SEP&gt;守护者is a figure who sacrificed to expel the祸种from贝洛伯格.&lt;SEP&gt;守护者是指贝洛伯格的大守护者，当前发生了变故。&lt;SEP&gt;守护者refers to the大守护者Cocolia, who sacrificed herself.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-031a66f450ba8a1cbde7f6bce3b9ad2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f946c60a8d8ff52731600d62dc86e722&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e1f2753a3817eebbe41ea755cc6a02e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c56774a55a4da64085ed73e773e673ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1381bbbb71b642a091a6c3425722884b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87e94271f7ba8c380df5e7881a6bfafe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96d655812159e371a4f4f65013fcae3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a4d80c13a1da5dc405c6fdfa48a655b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d93bda629c48fbb4d287f624821f6ef4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df922075240eda66b779497e0b6aa03e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eacd315ae5f95c55d189019b4d765b5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778814276</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="贝洛伯格">
      <data key="d0">贝洛伯格</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Belobog is a city-state on the planet Jarilo-VI, known as the "Warm Haven," "Everlasting City," and "City of Preservation." It was constructed by the Architects under the protection of the Preservation Aeon, Qlipoth, serving as the last sanctuary for human civilization and the sole bastion against an eternal winter. The city is structurally divided into two main districts: the Overworld, which handles administration and trade, and the Underworld, focused on energy and resource extraction. Years ago, the Overworld sealed off the Underworld, leaving the lower district isolated. Belobog is ruled by the Architects and successive Supreme Guardians, with the Silvermane Guards as its primary defensive force. Specific mines, according to an analysis by Svarog, could sustain the city's energy for approximately 231 days. The city faces multiple crises, including the influence of a Stellaron, invasions by the Antimatter Legion, relentless snowstorms, and encroachment by the Fragmentum. The Stellaron is roughly located to the north in the snowy wilderness. After recovering from the Stellaron crisis, the upper and lower districts are being reconnected. The Astral Express crew visited Belobog, where they faced obstacles and diplomatic challenges that changed the Trailblazer's perspective. The city is now governed by a new Guardian, and figures like Bronya and Cocolia work to protect it. The Silvermane Guards are sworn to protect Belobog and its people. As a previous stop for the Astral Express, Belobog is mentioned in casual remarks, and a comparison notes that children in the Underworld play in mud, contrasting with other worlds.&lt;SEP&gt;贝洛伯格is the location referenced as the foundation of the false king's wall.&lt;SEP&gt;贝洛伯格是桑博提到曾帮助开拓者的地方。&lt;SEP&gt;The city that serves as the stage for the dream and is the location of the upcoming events.&lt;SEP&gt;贝洛伯格is a location recognized by三月七as the origin of the company employees conducting the evacuation operation at the hotel.&lt;SEP&gt;贝洛伯格是星穹列车曾到访的地点，用于与匹诺康尼对比其复杂性。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-09cf79b91d6ff569b6eec774a8d37694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01cda72aeaa485978711f9b72507b293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28c8a79168a91659cd695cab9d7e5226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07c244e0b796cd21c35920e292f8b301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff4678a309428e5e405e8aab17b34d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7a075aaa16975be78339564df8bbf0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33a3b81a0e0d021e092a5a43b49f3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cb8da041bb65dbc2bdac7765d979d3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576240ab20bd81b46c419628067e2caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba20141801229755c9c8a7cfa181257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d50dd0c4a864aad264fdad2c99753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb7e3676b7ef53774a045f63a562243d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72d3e4bc634c012aad25dcf71e92b962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b967d36efcc27148feab290c2d59c9cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c56774a55a4da64085ed73e773e673ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8aea3ce7e067d8f4062dc3a1d66bc67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c7275939cbc824a2d74bcf7b159fdae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e377a0f376efa576e9326882d3e9d187&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da4724fc5e3317bb631f842e18bf511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd3abc93cbfc88148dada26d6a80719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6b4af8ca344f9e2e04ac55579accce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e23752bdf2ef3627f0a83acc0150c1ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96d655812159e371a4f4f65013fcae3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fd5d5729dee96837f589844028d1e87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a472ad06854cfbea32b100ad930934ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f358eb31ab41c53d64bb729897805779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0b70c5bab9acadcf25ebebbc43e9cc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-876cbdcb2b6b60cef20d49340ecee30f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62781f29bdc9b0fad8b67a1741741b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6477396ebbad8040692e490395c1e52b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54005507f5db05a1431064ea9db88caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f52a11ffcc13b31e8b906453b350f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0bd49528edf3e917eef4f2c1aa6516&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-648ec021d414c21c95d0721c3edba947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597d9b4d5a0e43e3628da07ccc535c03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048b0dd3c3bc2cae0be82ff708452623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f0fb910ea43e4acb7d09e5d8281a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a4d80c13a1da5dc405c6fdfa48a655b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d93bda629c48fbb4d287f624821f6ef4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4230a2ca41a3aa5b271c968b4567de1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2decb49a546c2b4fde6ed99f9c7b7ad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e34f96510fd5d8b4066be7a9a58bd4ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21825bf2e51d148d9157e7a7efb7ae87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f371fb32e3b3a665db31402cdb619141&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076f9df9869a74ed98d14ab2d4cf67a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd1ac3b2477b33ac600764c2339c9761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6bc51c0b8f913f809328ba29170426&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7823732295dacca3169a4fdc0d9b7a6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-447076830112aeb99cde7bcf43070ce1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6981d8589b8138e2d6716a404ea00e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01127f89b10186b1c68cbfb9082dd96d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e43423b829e0e1a4b962a14f6ade99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aef888c83a56efa55bc6bdac956ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ebbbf7bf5819ee830ffd02c3c6f9d34</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779006474</data>
