    </node>
    <node id="寒潮">
      <data key="d0">寒潮</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The 寒潮, also known as the Cold Wave or Eternal Freeze, is a catastrophic global disaster and climatic event on the planet Jarilo-VI. This phenomenon is a cataclysmic ice age characterized by extreme cold, massive ice crystals, and a relentless blizzard, which created an inhospitable environment. The 寒潮 was created by the Stellaron based on the planet's specific conditions, appearing after the invasion of the Antimatter Legion. The disaster engulfed the entire world, burying the Antimatter Legion forces and isolating the surviving city of Belobog. As a result, it forced all human survivors to settle exclusively within Belobog and closed off the possibility of outward expansion, compelling society to develop underground. The 寒潮 is often symbolized by giant ice crystals on monuments and poses a continuous threat to the survival of all inhabitants. The disaster's source is fundamentally linked to the Stellaron, and dispelling this ongoing climatic catastrophe is a primary goal for the group, with questions raised about how much control can be achieved over it once the Stellaron is located.&lt;SEP&gt;The Eternal Freeze is a catastrophic disaster that resulted from humanity's wish to the Stellaron.&lt;SEP&gt;寒潮是雅利洛-Ⅵ面临的灾祸，与星核的影响有关。&lt;SEP&gt;Cold snap.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-09cf79b91d6ff569b6eec774a8d37694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01cda72aeaa485978711f9b72507b293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33a3b81a0e0d021e092a5a43b49f3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba20141801229755c9c8a7cfa181257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d50dd0c4a864aad264fdad2c99753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72d3e4bc634c012aad25dcf71e92b962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16db8c2d24c790ba6ab06adc96caa029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f358eb31ab41c53d64bb729897805779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62781f29bdc9b0fad8b67a1741741b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e5ba5f7b6b4c9a58f7986795cc260a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3230677383d6c0041b3dbc113dd8b0ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ae55661a99ec8ee90f3ea2484b83418</data>
