    <node id="银鬃铁卫">
      <data key="d0">银鬃铁卫</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">The Silvermane Guards (银鬃铁卫) serve as the primary military, law enforcement, and police force of the city of Belobog. Operating under the direct command of the Supreme Guardian, their main responsibilities include maintaining city safety, strict law enforcement, and defending the city from external threats—particularly monsters emerging from the Fragmentum. They actively patrol and secure areas, quarantine or block off infected zones, and rigorously pursue criminals. Notable members include Pelageya Sergeyevna (Pela), who acts as an intelligence officer; Gepard, who serves as the regiment's commanding officer (戍卫官); and Bronya, who is also a member. Historically, the Silvermane Guards were stationed in the underground regions of Belobog. However, over a decade ago, by order of the Supreme Guardian Cocolia, they withdrew entirely from the underground, abandoning those districts. This withdrawal significantly worsened conditions for the underground inhabitants and led to criticism from figures like Seele, who views this as a betrayal. Consequently, the Guards are perceived as a surface law enforcement body that does not operate or pursue individuals into the underground. Cocolia deployed the Guards to the frontlines to combat the Fragmentum, leaving the defenses of the lower city weakened. They are responsible for guarding key facilities such as energy hubs and are stationed in frontline restricted zones to resist the Fragmentum. Some former members, such as Oleg, have since left this force. The Guards have strict rules for patrolling the Fragmentum, requiring a team of four and a dedicated communications officer. Led by Gepard, they suffer casualties in battles against the Fragmentum and, during key events, have been known to pursue and place bounties on the Astral Express crew. Historically, they were led by Alisa Rand in battles at ancient battlefields. The force also acts to protect military restricted areas from unauthorized entry.&lt;SEP&gt;The Silvermane Guards are the armed forces of Belobog, fighting against the Legion.&lt;SEP&gt;银鬃铁卫是贝洛伯格的防御军队，由杰帕德指挥，负责守卫城市并协助对抗威胁。&lt;SEP&gt;银鬃铁卫是贝洛伯格的军事力量，每天为了生存而战，执行命令，并负责拖住敌人。&lt;SEP&gt;银鬃铁卫是贝洛伯格的军事力量，负责抑制裂界的扩张。&lt;SEP&gt;银鬃铁卫is a guard organization奥列格used to serve.&lt;SEP&gt;银鬃铁卫is a faction also known as the iron guards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-09cf79b91d6ff569b6eec774a8d37694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01cda72aeaa485978711f9b72507b293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28c8a79168a91659cd695cab9d7e5226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff4678a309428e5e405e8aab17b34d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7a075aaa16975be78339564df8bbf0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd0fa66de0580ceb159e7f584b0c75f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625aa25735f503b4e89b5390a5e1fa4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20901f83b15280df6e331e222d79b58c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99b307cf496fce182708882c7b313806&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42c4be0fb9d10d383856c4ec13e88c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e1dc6f9e5af6812e9d18dc7b0b4ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a90b802948644335ecefb11f9f552b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576240ab20bd81b46c419628067e2caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba20141801229755c9c8a7cfa181257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8772d247819725686282b99e50b8064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d50dd0c4a864aad264fdad2c99753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb7e3676b7ef53774a045f63a562243d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbd59288b2396673d3d290554c4a1db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-867227c60bd28fd1a9a6b67be2199b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-940a5d2c2c4bf28f6c50802d6255f3d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72d3e4bc634c012aad25dcf71e92b962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51e338cd77e46441f1f7d69fd0e39180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92b0b73d1b86ccd1a50d1c78667fc466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16db8c2d24c790ba6ab06adc96caa029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6b4af8ca344f9e2e04ac55579accce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da4724fc5e3317bb631f842e18bf511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd3abc93cbfc88148dada26d6a80719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e23752bdf2ef3627f0a83acc0150c1ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db133a2844f87e566ce2dfd3936e0a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1cedbf6b0cc229e63cd33aa3825db5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fd5d5729dee96837f589844028d1e87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14edf5531c1be80047c123e4c8f934fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a472ad06854cfbea32b100ad930934ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd6c21ae8658032a7c6a70abba655057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0b70c5bab9acadcf25ebebbc43e9cc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62781f29bdc9b0fad8b67a1741741b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6477396ebbad8040692e490395c1e52b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-648ec021d414c21c95d0721c3edba947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597d9b4d5a0e43e3628da07ccc535c03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048b0dd3c3bc2cae0be82ff708452623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3230677383d6c0041b3dbc113dd8b0ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f0fb910ea43e4acb7d09e5d8281a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f2ef2960da6e6a6c3a214f45255a64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a4d80c13a1da5dc405c6fdfa48a655b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d93bda629c48fbb4d287f624821f6ef4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
