    </node>
    <node id="杰帕德">
      <data key="d0">杰帕德</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">杰帕德，全名杰帕德·朗道，是贝洛伯格银鬃铁卫（Silvermane Guards）的戍卫官，也是一名高度受尊敬的高级军官。作为朗道家族的成员，他是希露瓦·朗道的弟弟，以理性、原则性强、性格固执和忠诚著称，深受当地市民的尊敬。他经常在前线执行任务，负责保卫贝洛伯格抵御裂界（Fragmentum）的威胁，并曾报告铁卫伤亡情况以及裂界的异常现象。作为银鬃铁卫的指挥官，他曾下令打开城门支持开拓者的行动，准备御敌并指挥铁卫列队。

在故事中，杰帕德曾负责护送星穹列车成员觐见大守护者可可利亚，并奉命解除对他们行动的限制。他观察到了开拓者与众不同的装备，并向其介绍贝洛伯格的景点，也提及裂界污染导致一些巷子无法通行。他曾试图逮捕开拓者一行，直到桑博介入才作罢。他还向三月七告知机械店偶尔有表演。由于其金发外貌，三月七推测他与布洛妮娅有遗传关系，可能是她的兄弟。同时，杰帕德在布洛妮娅眼中被视为一个潜在风险人物，因忠诚度不确定而需要作为重要联络人；他对姐姐希露瓦的检修请求也耐人寻味。此外，他支持开拓者的行动，并曾提及裂界相关信息。&lt;SEP&gt;杰帕德is a character who serves as a representative of the Architects, apologizes for past events, and delivers a message from Bronya about her inauguration speech.&lt;SEP&gt;杰帕德is a member of the Silvermane Guards who expresses gratitude for the Trailblazer's understanding and acknowledges their strength.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-09cf79b91d6ff569b6eec774a8d37694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07c244e0b796cd21c35920e292f8b301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28c8a79168a91659cd695cab9d7e5226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a90b802948644335ecefb11f9f552b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d50dd0c4a864aad264fdad2c99753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62249a61ab686e12d9f450bd5b82c692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e3269609fa84895229819f9f6377c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fa2cc7399429cd73e7c18e24bc41a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da4724fc5e3317bb631f842e18bf511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1cedbf6b0cc229e63cd33aa3825db5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fd5d5729dee96837f589844028d1e87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a472ad06854cfbea32b100ad930934ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd6c21ae8658032a7c6a70abba655057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5fcb2e9c956a15a8878b995c151b999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0b70c5bab9acadcf25ebebbc43e9cc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc91593211be73b8761c305cc9886950&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62781f29bdc9b0fad8b67a1741741b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-648ec021d414c21c95d0721c3edba947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f0fb910ea43e4acb7d09e5d8281a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f2ef2960da6e6a6c3a214f45255a64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b03521b6bf7ef269c01483b50100862&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f363a6ba12d7e65941adba654ef6fb4d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778809050</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="古代遗物">
      <data key="d0">古代遗物</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">古代遗物are artifacts illegally possessed by Sampo.&lt;SEP&gt;古代遗物是贝洛伯格历史中遗留下来的物品，桑博在寻找它们，而开拓者的装备与这些遗物不同。&lt;SEP&gt;古代遗物are old artifacts whose interfaces should be considered when piecing together parts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-09cf79b91d6ff569b6eec774a8d37694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73d390675d34e626ee4d0aa954ebdbf8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778749124</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="存护之城">
      <data key="d0">存护之城</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">存护之城is another name for Beloborg, emphasizing its role as the City of Preservation.&lt;SEP&gt;存护之城是贝洛伯格的称号，强调其作为人类庇护所的作用。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-09cf79b91d6ff569b6eec774a8d37694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778736755</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="永屹之城">
      <data key="d0">永屹之城</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">永屹之城is another name for Beloborg, meaning the Everlasting City.&lt;SEP&gt;永屹之城是贝洛伯格的称号，强调其在恶劣环境下的持久与坚固。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-09cf79b91d6ff569b6eec774a8d37694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778736755</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="人类抵御寒潮的唯一壁垒">
      <data key="d0">人类抵御寒潮的唯一壁垒</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">人类抵御寒潮的唯一壁垒is a description of Beloborg as the only barrier protecting humanity from the winter storm.&lt;SEP&gt;人类抵御寒潮的唯一壁垒是贝洛伯格的描述，突显其作为最后避难所的独特性。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-09cf79b91d6ff569b6eec774a8d37694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778736756</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="士兵">
      <data key="d0">士兵</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">士兵are Silvermane Guards who fail to track Sampo but capture the Crew.&lt;SEP&gt;士兵是银鬃铁卫的成员，在对开拓者时表现出强硬态度，要求其住口。&lt;SEP&gt;Soldiers who follow Bronya's commands, one of whom is injured during the confrontation.&lt;SEP&gt;士兵is a generic soldier who reports the danger of monsters.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-09cf79b91d6ff569b6eec774a8d37694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cb8da041bb65dbc2bdac7765d979d3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-648ec021d414c21c95d0721c3edba947</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778808497</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="铁围墙">
      <data key="d0">铁围墙</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">铁围墙refers to the defensive walls of Beloborg that enclose the only habitable area.&lt;SEP&gt;铁围墙是贝洛伯格的物理防御工事，人类只有在铁围墙内才能活命。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-09cf79b91d6ff569b6eec774a8d37694&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6</data>
