    <node id="杰帕德·朗道">
      <data key="d0">杰帕德·朗道</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">杰帕德·朗道is the Silvermane Guard captain who arrests the Crew, explains Belobog's history, and escorts them to the Guardian.&lt;SEP&gt;杰帕德·朗道is a commander of the Silvermane Guards who was about to arrest the group.&lt;SEP&gt;杰帕德是银鬃铁卫的戍卫官，曾与桑博和开拓者发生冲突。&lt;SEP&gt;杰帕德·朗道是银鬃铁卫的戍卫官，希露瓦的弟弟，负责处理与“壁垒”装置相关的公务及城区戒严事务。&lt;SEP&gt;杰帕德·朗道是银鬃铁卫的戍卫官，坚守职责并执行大守护者的命令，但在关键时刻会考虑人民的利益。&lt;SEP&gt;杰帕德·朗道是贝洛伯格的铁卫戍卫官，布洛妮娅计划通知他局势变化。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a90b802948644335ecefb11f9f552b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb7e3676b7ef53774a045f63a562243d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e23752bdf2ef3627f0a83acc0150c1ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6477396ebbad8040692e490395c1e52b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597d9b4d5a0e43e3628da07ccc535c03</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778808518</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="大守护者">
      <data key="d0">大守护者</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">The Supreme Guardian (大守护者) is the highest ruling authority and leader of the city of Belobog. This title designates the chief executive responsible for governing, protecting, and making decisions for the city. The position is typically hereditary or appointed, with the current Guardian chosen by the Architects, Belobog's founding faction, or as a designated successor. The Guardian holds significant authority, including judging outsiders, commanding the Silver Mane Guards, issuing orders for trials, captures, and arrests, and even withdrawing military forces. To the Silver Mane Guards, the Guardian's commands are absolute.

Historically, the Guardians formed a line of succession selected by the Architects. The most prominent current Supreme Guardian is Cocolia. She is described as a cold, deceptive ruler who uses lies and sweet words to separate the upper and lower levels of Belobog, disregarding the survival of the underworld's people. Figures like Oleg view her as a deceiver. She has ordered the arrest of the protagonists, accusing them of undermining the Architects' control, and has commanded the withdrawal of the Silvermane Guards. There is suspicion, from characters like希露瓦, that Cocolia's consciousness may have been transferred. While a potential successor, Bronya, feels the idea of becoming Guardian is dreadful, she recognizes that as a future Guardian, she must constantly examine her own actions and understand the immense responsibility for the city's future.&lt;SEP&gt;大守护者是贝洛伯格的领袖，布洛妮娅即将继承此职位，并决定背负秘密。&lt;SEP&gt;The Guardian is a title that Oleg believes Bronya will inherit to lead the city and help the underworld.&lt;SEP&gt;大守护者is a title for the leader of Belobog, referring to Bronya in this context, who fought in the final battle against the Stellaron.&lt;SEP&gt;The Guardian is the ruler of Belobog who was defeated in battle.&lt;SEP&gt;大守护者is the Guardian.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07ddaec7bfcdba9a4cc6197378b1a8df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33a3b81a0e0d021e092a5a43b49f3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cb8da041bb65dbc2bdac7765d979d3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8772d247819725686282b99e50b8064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d50dd0c4a864aad264fdad2c99753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbd59288b2396673d3d290554c4a1db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe6b86a7693b184d26c498dcba8aeaed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b967d36efcc27148feab290c2d59c9cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c56774a55a4da64085ed73e773e673ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4a3c5f1222a99bbb8e7f6c3737e97ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16db8c2d24c790ba6ab06adc96caa029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e3269609fa84895229819f9f6377c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e23752bdf2ef3627f0a83acc0150c1ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db133a2844f87e566ce2dfd3936e0a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fd5d5729dee96837f589844028d1e87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54005507f5db05a1431064ea9db88caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62781f29bdc9b0fad8b67a1741741b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6477396ebbad8040692e490395c1e52b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597d9b4d5a0e43e3628da07ccc535c03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e34f96510fd5d8b4066be7a9a58bd4ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f371fb32e3b3a665db31402cdb619141&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076f9df9869a74ed98d14ab2d4cf67a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778815181</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="筑城者">
      <data key="d0">筑城者</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">The Architects (筑城者) are the ruling faction and governing body of Belobog. They were established as builders, architects, and followers of the Path of Preservation, acting under the protection of the Aeon Qlipoth (克里珀). They foresaw the coming crisis, constructed the city's walls to defend against external threats like the harsh cold, and managed the city to preserve the flame of human civilization, believing in the power of Preservation. Their duties included processing material recovery applications to combat crevice erosion, constructing monuments symbolizing their spirit, maintaining steps in the furnace core, and overseeing the selection of the Supreme Guardian through a confidential and rigorous process. Historically, they initiated the sealing of the underground and the establishment of mining districts to address the cold wave and energy needs. However, they are sometimes criticized for prioritizing their own safety and sealing off the Underworld.

The Architects are also the governing body that recorded information about the Stellaron, having unearthed truths about it but deliberately concealed research findings. They maintained the government that the people trust, issuing directives stating that any contact with the Stellaron would have severe consequences. The organization expelled individuals like Serval to stop research on the Stellaron and faces threats from an "invader" subversion conspiracy. They were not fully aware of the situation in Belobog's underground regions and granted a medallion to Bronya. Along with the old-era Company, the Architects designed and built the inhibitor for the Stellaron. They are also the builders of the造物引擎, an ancient faction. The Architects decided to address the main character as "Trailblazer" as a more courteous form of address, and the mining team planned to negotiate with them.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1c0c2bc3c0f2175f61ef3687d3c8f4a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01cda72aeaa485978711f9b72507b293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28c8a79168a91659cd695cab9d7e5226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33a3b81a0e0d021e092a5a43b49f3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cb8da041bb65dbc2bdac7765d979d3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e1dc6f9e5af6812e9d18dc7b0b4ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576240ab20bd81b46c419628067e2caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba20141801229755c9c8a7cfa181257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8772d247819725686282b99e50b8064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d50dd0c4a864aad264fdad2c99753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbd59288b2396673d3d290554c4a1db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c56774a55a4da64085ed73e773e673ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67d4d3f37f7d71422b580abe9428f7e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8aea3ce7e067d8f4062dc3a1d66bc67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c7275939cbc824a2d74bcf7b159fdae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16db8c2d24c790ba6ab06adc96caa029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6b4af8ca344f9e2e04ac55579accce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd3abc93cbfc88148dada26d6a80719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e23752bdf2ef3627f0a83acc0150c1ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96d655812159e371a4f4f65013fcae3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fd5d5729dee96837f589844028d1e87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14edf5531c1be80047c123e4c8f934fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f358eb31ab41c53d64bb729897805779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62781f29bdc9b0fad8b67a1741741b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e5ba5f7b6b4c9a58f7986795cc260a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54005507f5db05a1431064ea9db88caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f52a11ffcc13b31e8b906453b350f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0bd49528edf3e917eef4f2c1aa6516&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3230677383d6c0041b3dbc113dd8b0ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f2ef2960da6e6a6c3a214f45255a64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b03521b6bf7ef269c01483b50100862&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c7646ca71928ded683b69e47ea21fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eacd315ae5f95c55d189019b4d765b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-729cfff273d4a52874da43c97c89dd2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
