    <node id="佩拉格娅•谢尔盖耶夫娜">
      <data key="d0">佩拉格娅•谢尔盖耶夫娜</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">佩拉格娅•谢尔盖耶夫娜is an intelligence officer of the Silvermane Guards and a temporary guide for the "History of Belobog" tour, introducing herself as佩拉.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-01cda72aeaa485978711f9b72507b293</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778736770</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="佩拉">
      <data key="d0">佩拉</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">佩拉（Pela），全名佩拉格娅·谢尔盖耶夫娜，是贝洛伯格的一名人物。她是银鬃铁卫的成员，协助布洛妮娅·兰德并汇报情况。佩拉也是一位知识渊博的线人，向他人解释筑城者的历史和地髓的性质。她负责为孩子们讲解历史，对其他人模仿孩子叫她“佩拉姐姐”感到无奈。佩拉是希露瓦的朋友，在布洛妮娅失踪后工作量增加。她曾成为机械热潮乐队新歌的主唱，并出现在永冬铭碑等场景。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-01cda72aeaa485978711f9b72507b293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33a3b81a0e0d021e092a5a43b49f3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fa2cc7399429cd73e7c18e24bc41a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e23752bdf2ef3627f0a83acc0150c1ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2de3edad40e74d2ad8dfed0366c5301e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778821232</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="永冬铭碑">
      <data key="d0">永冬铭碑</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">永冬铭碑is a monument erected to commemorate the great Architects, consisting of two parts: a gear symbolizing knowledge and industrial power, and a giant ice crystal symbolizing the eternal cold.&lt;SEP&gt;永冬铭碑是贝洛伯格最具象征意义的地标。&lt;SEP&gt;The Eternal Winter Monument is the location where Bronya's inauguration speech will be held.&lt;SEP&gt;永冬铭碑is a location where三月七, 佩拉, and虎克are present, serving as a spot for taking commemorative photos.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-01cda72aeaa485978711f9b72507b293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b03521b6bf7ef269c01483b50100862&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2de3edad40e74d2ad8dfed0366c5301e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
