    <node id="身着银鬃铁卫制服的女性">
      <data key="d0">身着银鬃铁卫制服的女性</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">身着银鬃铁卫制服的女性is the self-introduction of佩拉格娅•谢尔盖耶夫娜, identifying her as the intelligence officer of the Silvermane Guards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-01cda72aeaa485978711f9b72507b293</data>
