    <node id="永冬城之夜">
      <data key="d0">永冬城之夜</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">永冬城之夜是贝洛伯格城市中的一个时间段场景，描述了裂界污染和银鬃铁卫的封锁行动。&lt;SEP&gt;永冬城之夜is the specific night event during which the interaction between希露瓦and the protagonist takes place.&lt;SEP&gt;永冬城之夜represents the concept of a winter night in the Eternal Winter City (Belobog).&lt;SEP&gt;永冬城之夜is a specific time and event occurring in Belobog, involving a disturbance at an inn.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28c8a79168a91659cd695cab9d7e5226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-001f6a9fcae35b45d639be298031d7a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f946c60a8d8ff52731600d62dc86e722&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7a075aaa16975be78339564df8bbf0e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778737124</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="严厉的银鬃铁卫">
      <data key="d0">严厉的银鬃铁卫</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">严厉的银鬃铁卫是贝洛伯格银鬃铁卫的一员，负责封锁裂界侵蚀区域，态度严厉，禁止非铁卫成员进入。&lt;SEP&gt;严厉的银鬃铁卫is a specific Silvermane Guard who speaks directly to the crew, delivering a forceful summons from布洛妮娅·兰德.&lt;SEP&gt;严厉的银鬃铁卫is a more critical soldier in the银鬃铁卫who expresses frustration about the situation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28c8a79168a91659cd695cab9d7e5226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7a075aaa16975be78339564df8bbf0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778737211</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="慌张的市民">
      <data key="d0">慌张的市民</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">慌张的市民是贝洛伯格的一名居民，其财产证明存放在裂界侵蚀区域，感到绝望并试图闯入封锁区。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28c8a79168a91659cd695cab9d7e5226</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778736825</data>
