    <node id="温和的银鬃铁卫">
      <data key="d0">温和的银鬃铁卫</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">温和的银鬃铁卫是贝洛伯格银鬃铁卫的一员，试图劝告慌张的市民远离危险的封锁区域。&lt;SEP&gt;温和的银鬃铁卫is a polite and responsible soldier serving in the银鬃铁卫.&lt;SEP&gt;温和的银鬃铁卫is a Silvermane Guard who questions Cocolia's orders.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28c8a79168a91659cd695cab9d7e5226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-648ec021d414c21c95d0721c3edba947</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778808496</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="希露瓦">
      <data key="d0">希露瓦</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Serval Landau (希露瓦·朗道) is a stylish, knowledgeable, and determined character from Beloborg. She is a prominent member of the prestigious Landau family and the older sister of Gepard, a relationship that makes her more formidable. Formerly a rock band musician and a member of the Builders (筑城者), she researched the Stellaron and the Fragmentum and was a close friend of Cocolia. After being expelled by Cocolia for this research, she became a mechanic, running the mechanical workshop known as "永动" (Eternal Motion).

She is characterized by a warm, proactive, and technically brilliant personality, often enthusiastically explaining Beloborg's geothermal energy and urban structure. As a mechanic, she demonstrates technical expertise by restoring energy supply, operating terminals, and devising plans to access the energy core for repairs. She coded the underlying logic of the mechanical trestle and helped navigate restricted areas such as the Iron Guard Restricted Zone. Her wit and charm allow her to devise clever plans, such as tricking guards by claiming she was called for maintenance work. She also comments on situations and successfully opens doors.

Initiating leadership of a group of Silvermane Guards to locate and stop the Stellaron, she displays resolve by confronting blockers either by force or persuasion, and decides to face the enemy directly. She participates in analog experiments and surveys to find the Stellaron, providing information about its possible location, and has promised to stand with the team, trusting the judgment of Bronya. She comforts Seele regarding concerns about Bronya, showing her caring nature. She strongly opposes Cocolia's decision to hide the Stellaron, determined to solve the problem and prove herself, with a complex relationship with her brother Gepard, though she decides to stay and help the Iron Guard while supporting the Trailblazer in finding the Stellaron. Gepard later regrets not trusting Serval's judgment about the protagonists' intentions.&lt;SEP&gt;希露瓦is a character whom三月七mentions wanting to visit.&lt;SEP&gt;希露瓦是贝洛伯格的一位女性角色，她曾研究星核，是可可利亚的旧识，并与克拉拉、三月七、丹恒和开拓者互动。她收到了布洛妮娅关于星核和可可利亚牺牲的消息，但认为布洛妮娅有所隐瞒，决定不深究。&lt;SEP&gt;希露瓦是一个热情友好的角色，欢迎开拓者和克拉拉进入她的机械屋，并提到筑城者家的孩子叫她“阿姨”，她愿意免费签名和教克拉拉拍照。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-07c244e0b796cd21c35920e292f8b301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-001f6a9fcae35b45d639be298031d7a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33a3b81a0e0d021e092a5a43b49f3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625aa25735f503b4e89b5390a5e1fa4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62249a61ab686e12d9f450bd5b82c692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fa2cc7399429cd73e7c18e24bc41a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da4724fc5e3317bb631f842e18bf511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd3abc93cbfc88148dada26d6a80719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6b4af8ca344f9e2e04ac55579accce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db133a2844f87e566ce2dfd3936e0a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fd5d5729dee96837f589844028d1e87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14edf5531c1be80047c123e4c8f934fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a472ad06854cfbea32b100ad930934ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd6c21ae8658032a7c6a70abba655057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5fcb2e9c956a15a8878b995c151b999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f358eb31ab41c53d64bb729897805779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0b70c5bab9acadcf25ebebbc43e9cc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1df4e13a67f2223f122fe16eba1c678&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad5bb7d0c5462f28118de7e9de20b165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba7a0e579541604176a74ad243c7d799&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-876cbdcb2b6b60cef20d49340ecee30f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-438daad5b3a81628f06c73624efb8654&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62781f29bdc9b0fad8b67a1741741b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-648ec021d414c21c95d0721c3edba947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be778e6f0d14b2870b308e8da30a17eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f0fb910ea43e4acb7d09e5d8281a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f2ef2960da6e6a6c3a214f45255a64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e4d2b029cb1d9c5f1ff1ba3fab0a0ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b03521b6bf7ef269c01483b50100862&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2de3edad40e74d2ad8dfed0366c5301e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21825bf2e51d148d9157e7a7efb7ae87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-729cfff273d4a52874da43c97c89dd2f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
