    </node>
    <node id="边缘通路">
      <data key="d0">边缘通路</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">边缘通路是贝洛伯格中一个被裂界侵蚀并成为危险区域的地点。&lt;SEP&gt;边缘通路is a location in Belobog where a failed pursuit of the "外来者" by the Silvermane Guards took place.&lt;SEP&gt;Edge Passage is an area that experiences Fragmentium erosion, which is less severe than the current location.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28c8a79168a91659cd695cab9d7e5226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96d655812159e371a4f4f65013fcae3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc91593211be73b8761c305cc9886950</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
