    <node id="铁卫">
      <data key="d0">铁卫</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Iron Guards (铁卫), also known as the Silvermane Guards (银鬃铁卫), are the official military force of Belobog. They serve under the command of Bronya and the Supreme Guardian, and are responsible for maintaining security throughout the city, including posting guards near the Goethe Hotel, securing restricted areas, enforcing regulations, and forming blockades. Historically, the guards have also been stationed at the Echo Corridor. They are actively involved in frontline defense against the Fragmentum, have suffered casualties in this fight, and handle personnel changes and internal discussions. The guards have been ordered by the former Supreme Guardian Cocolia to apprehend Bronya, and are sometimes used as a threat in negotiations. The term "铁卫" is synonymous with "银鬃铁卫," emphasizing their role as the upper world's primary military force in Belobog.&lt;SEP&gt;The Iron Cavalry is a faction that Seele took Bronya to find.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-07c244e0b796cd21c35920e292f8b301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cb8da041bb65dbc2bdac7765d979d3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a90b802948644335ecefb11f9f552b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c56774a55a4da64085ed73e773e673ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67d4d3f37f7d71422b580abe9428f7e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fa2cc7399429cd73e7c18e24bc41a44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da4724fc5e3317bb631f842e18bf511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96d655812159e371a4f4f65013fcae3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fd5d5729dee96837f589844028d1e87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5fcb2e9c956a15a8878b995c151b999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad5bb7d0c5462f28118de7e9de20b165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba7a0e579541604176a74ad243c7d799&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f52a11ffcc13b31e8b906453b350f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0bd49528edf3e917eef4f2c1aa6516&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-648ec021d414c21c95d0721c3edba947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e34f96510fd5d8b4066be7a9a58bd4ca</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778809088</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="行政区">
      <data key="d0">行政区</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Administrative District is a part of Belobog where geothermal heaters are common.&lt;SEP&gt;行政区is the administrative district of贝洛伯格.&lt;SEP&gt;行政区(the administrative district) is the specific area in the upper level where奥列格and others return.&lt;SEP&gt;The Administrative District is the location where the characters find Gepard and where the inauguration speech will take place.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-07c244e0b796cd21c35920e292f8b301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aabf9b838254f2ad4a9a5099ddc6c0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b03521b6bf7ef269c01483b50100862</data>
