    <node id="「有趣」">
      <data key="d0">「有趣」</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">"Interesting" is a concept both the Trailblazer and Herta distrust, associating it with low-quality work.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-59b3336841877e8d6032aebe0661beab</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778736888</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="丰饶">
      <data key="d0">丰饶</data>
      <data key="d1">path</data>
      <data key="d2">The Abundance (丰饶) is a Path (命途) in the universe of *Honkai: Star Rail*, philosophically and cosmically focused on life, healing, and immortality. This Path is represented and granted by the Aeon Yaoshi, who bestows the gifts of life and miracles. However, these gifts are seen as a double-edged sword: while offering eternal life, they also bring catastrophe and a curse upon the living. The actions of Yaoshi and the followers of Abundance are often perceived as inscrutable and dangerous by other Aeons and observers. To the Xianzhou Alliance, the Aeon Yaoshi and the aberrations nurtured by the Path are a curse that must be eradicated, leading to conflicts such as the attempted seizure of the Ambrosial Arbor centuries ago. The miracle of the Jianmu is a direct example of this Path's influence. While the Path itself is considered taboo after the Jianmu was cut down, some factions, like the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus (药王秘传), actively follow its tenets. In everyday terms, an excessive interest in the creations of Abundance, as seen with the character Tingyun, is considered peculiar.&lt;SEP&gt;The Path of Abundance, from which Luocha draws his power.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d1d3f2fdd68ace39bfead72d5c6de09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e44ecf966c6560c7f086afff655868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7226238e34da823949aab509aaac80e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b031b1b4ab5aae362aa1180ca1fab1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e67f27ee470faa07599b85ba409e78c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47555a254b36325300969067b357d5ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42cb7b6c602a4d11cb2e76505dd012c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fc6126d0155a7c411f4068a66d7ddca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e155b8c8b6fc544d325bbcc9a2da81bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96e31031793443da0fe2823c4c28cae2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778833996</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="药师">
      <data key="d0">药师</data>
      <data key="d1">aeon</data>
      <data key="d2">药师is the Aeon of丰饶, mentioned by瓦尔特as a星神with incomprehensible actions.&lt;SEP&gt;药师是丰饶星神，被求药使寻求赐福，留下建木于罗浮仙舟。&lt;SEP&gt;药师is the Aeon of Abundance who left the Arbor on the Luofu Xianzhou.&lt;SEP&gt;药师is the Aeon of Abundance, also known as the "寿瘟祸祖," who bestows immortality but is rejected by the Xianzhou.&lt;SEP&gt;药师is an Aeon, also known as寿瘟祸祖, worshipped by the药王秘传.&lt;SEP&gt;药师is the Aeon of Abundance, considered an enemy by both Jing Yuan and Luocha.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e44ecf966c6560c7f086afff655868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7226238e34da823949aab509aaac80e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e67f27ee470faa07599b85ba409e78c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778833971</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="终末">
      <data key="d0">终末</data>
      <data key="d1">path</data>
      <data key="d2">终末is a星神mentioned by瓦尔特, highlighting the diversity of incomprehensible beings.&lt;SEP&gt;The Finality is one of the Paths that the "Emanator" identity could be related to.&lt;SEP&gt;终末is a Path of aeon, considered as one of the forces leading to a certain outcome.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-083647d174927add1aefc63655ec615b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41a99864b87ae5c7c8eb089ea4a5b9d2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778873831</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="末王">
      <data key="d0">末王</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">末王is the Aeon of终末, referenced by瓦尔特in a list of mysterious星神.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711</data>
