    <node id="星轨">
      <data key="d0">星轨</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">星轨is the path of the星穹列车, now obstructed by星核according to丹恒's preliminary survey.&lt;SEP&gt;星轨是列车航行的轨道，其稳定程度已恢复到合格标准。&lt;SEP&gt;星轨是星穹列车行驶的轨道，可能被星核阻断。&lt;SEP&gt;星轨refers to the space routes the Astral Express uses; its readings have returned to normal.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63dc2a8cef74048f287c7e0648930116&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-807438542660c564cc6c45c1235307a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3b928a611b55c5851f3bf1cdc2b0d93</data>
