      <data key="d3">chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a54e496451ca770a8da988c4194a6d2</data>
      <data key="d2">姬子defines the crew's work as an adventure encompassing exploration, understanding, building, and connecting.&lt;SEP&gt;冒险is the action of taking risks, which is discussed as a means to achieve success.</data>
