    <node id="克里珀堡">
      <data key="d0">克里珀堡</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">克里珀堡is a location where the characters previously met with the Grand Guardian.&lt;SEP&gt;The Qlipoth Fort is the heart of Belobog and the headquarters of the Architects, named after the Aeon of Preservation.&lt;SEP&gt;Qlipoth Fort is a prominent location in Belobog, previously visited by March 7th and where Bronya was encountered before.&lt;SEP&gt;克里珀堡是贝洛伯格城的行政中心，大守护者与布洛妮娅的居所。&lt;SEP&gt;克里珀堡is a location the group considers raiding but decides it is too dangerous.&lt;SEP&gt;克里珀堡is a location.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-07ddaec7bfcdba9a4cc6197378b1a8df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e23752bdf2ef3627f0a83acc0150c1ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14edf5531c1be80047c123e4c8f934fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
