    </node>
    <node id="开拓之旅">
      <data key="d0">开拓之旅</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">开拓之旅refers to the Trailblaze expeditions undertaken by the Astral Express crew, which often involve challenges on the first day.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓之旅refers to the trailblaze expedition to Jarilo-VI aimed at finding and retrieving the Stellaron.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓之旅is the Trailblazer's first expedition, which has now successfully concluded.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓之旅refers to the Trailblaze expedition, a journey undertaken by the开拓者.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓之旅(Trailblazing journey) is a concept mentioned by the Trailblazer, describing their overall adventure.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓之旅is a term for a series of adventures that have been frightening and life-threatening.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓之旅(Trailblaze Journey) refers to the protagonist's next stage of adventure after resolving the Penacony crisis.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-07ddaec7bfcdba9a4cc6197378b1a8df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e575eb06637f7ecf24d773fb6f0f798b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4230a2ca41a3aa5b271c968b4567de1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c308352492cacde7b8e6f6802f949905&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39191a57b86d0c36329b9779dc5a8995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e7e0888a83ff7c3e3d3e1321b55ccef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-950f3c9663f4eaa9cf5cef2539e2ff52</data>
