      <data key="d0">星际旅行者</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Interstellar travelers are visitors from beyond the Eternal Freeze who Coconia recognizes as not from this world.&lt;SEP&gt;星际旅行者refers to interstellar travelers who carry the will of an Aeon, mentioned in ancient legends of Belobog.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d50dd0c4a864aad264fdad2c99753</data>
