    <node id="桑博·科斯基">
      <data key="d0">桑博·科斯基</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">桑博·科斯基is a character who hides in the snow, initially mistakes the group for Silvermane Guards, and presents himself as a seasoned local and a friendly informant.&lt;SEP&gt;桑博·科斯基(桑博)是带走丹恒的“坏蛋”，其行为引发了三月七寻找丹恒的事件。&lt;SEP&gt;桑博•科斯基is an individual known for manipulating the situation, leading the group into a predicament, and is considered dangerous by丹恒.&lt;SEP&gt;桑博·科斯基is a merchant and self-proclaimed do-gooder who provides information to the group.&lt;SEP&gt;Sampo Koski is a character not directly mentioned in the text but is a known entity from the universe who might be missed. However, based on the text alone, no.  Let's check for missed entities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ff4678a309428e5e405e8aab17b34d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89497e8dfd36334070d0d4816352affd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8772d247819725686282b99e50b8064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14edf5531c1be80047c123e4c8f934fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa4f6559bb8c6fdf7a61d696bb98ea71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d235d876b6479c8e730e06da624342e</data>
