    <node id="雪原">
      <data key="d0">雪原</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Snowy Plains are a cold, snow-covered environment where the characters are traveling and looking for civilization.&lt;SEP&gt;雪原(Snowy Wilderness) is the specific terrain north of贝洛伯格where the Stellaron is located.&lt;SEP&gt;雪原位于裂界另一头，是开拓者一行人要继续向北进发的目的地。</data>
