    <node id="加热器">
      <data key="d0">加热器</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The加热器is a household appliance being repaired by希露瓦with the protagonist's assistance.&lt;SEP&gt;加热器是筑城者用来抵御寒潮的设备，三月七认为在室内设置大量加热器会浪费能源，而筑城者可能依靠它们抵御寒潮。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-001f6a9fcae35b45d639be298031d7a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33a3b81a0e0d021e092a5a43b49f3b13</data>
