    <node id="机械屋">
      <data key="d0">机械屋</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">机械屋is the mechanical workshop owned or operated by希露瓦, where the interaction occurs and which she welcomes visitors and customers to.&lt;SEP&gt;机械屋是希露瓦的据点，用于维修乐器或设备，隔音效果好，平时无人打扰。&lt;SEP&gt;机械屋is希露瓦's workplace, where she works as a mechanic.&lt;SEP&gt;机械屋is a location where希露瓦is believed to be, and the group plans to visit her there.&lt;SEP&gt;机械屋is a location where希露瓦can be found, and三月七suggests visiting.&lt;SEP&gt;机械屋是开拓者提及的场所，询问是否招助手。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-001f6a9fcae35b45d639be298031d7a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6b4af8ca344f9e2e04ac55579accce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da4724fc5e3317bb631f842e18bf511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1cedbf6b0cc229e63cd33aa3825db5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2de3edad40e74d2ad8dfed0366c5301e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c</data>
