    <node id="星轨稳定率">
      <data key="d0">星轨稳定率</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">星轨稳定率is a measure of the stability of the train's spatial trajectory, which dropped to 12% and led to an extended stop.&lt;SEP&gt;星轨稳定率是列车启动前的检测指标，由帕姆监控。</data>
