    <node id="布洛妮娅·兰德">
      <data key="d0">布洛妮娅·兰德</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Bronya Rand, also known as 布洛妮娅·兰德, is a central figure in Belobog. She serves as a member and later the acting commander of the Silvermane Guards. She is the daughter of the Supreme Guardian Cocolia Rand, making her the heir to the guardianship. Bronya received a strict upbringing in the upper layers of Belobog, designed to prepare her for leadership. She is an authoritative figure who pursues infiltrators and is noted for her role in waiting to meet the crew of the Astral Express.

Throughout her journey, Bronya undergoes significant character development. She becomes suspicious of hidden truths and agrees to cooperate with the protagonists. Deeply affected by the stark realities of the lower city, she feels shock and discomfort with the status quo, hoping to rebuild connections between the upper and lower layers. After a period of missing and suddenly returning to the Qlipoth Fort, she becomes a person of interest to the authorities. Ultimately, she rejects her mother Cocolia's nihilistic ideology, choosing instead to believe in human effort and determination. Resolving to stop Cocolia's destructive plans, Bronya eventually assumes the role of the Supreme Guardian of Belogog. Despite facing intense negative emotions and feelings of helplessness, she is grateful to Seele for helping her regain clarity and resolve.&lt;SEP&gt;布洛妮娅是前线实际上的指挥官，杰帕德在命令冲突时会参考她的指令。&lt;SEP&gt;布洛妮娅is the大守护er of贝洛伯格, daughter of可可利亚, whose purpose is to protect贝洛伯格.&lt;SEP&gt;布洛妮娅·兰德是贝洛伯格的大守护者继承者，在事件后决定肩负责任，并选择隐瞒关于母亲可可利亚的部分真相以维护希望。&lt;SEP&gt;布洛妮娅·兰德是贝洛伯格的大守护者候选人，希儿理解她的苦衷并担心她。&lt;SEP&gt;布洛妮娅·兰德是贝洛伯格第十九任守护者，在演讲中缅怀前任守护者并呼吁市民团结。&lt;SEP&gt;布洛妮娅·兰德is the Supreme Guardian of Belobog, who is mentioned as the one who decided to reconnect the upper and lower layers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f7a075aaa16975be78339564df8bbf0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d50dd0c4a864aad264fdad2c99753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbd59288b2396673d3d290554c4a1db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b967d36efcc27148feab290c2d59c9cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16db8c2d24c790ba6ab06adc96caa029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e23752bdf2ef3627f0a83acc0150c1ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54005507f5db05a1431064ea9db88caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62781f29bdc9b0fad8b67a1741741b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6477396ebbad8040692e490395c1e52b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597d9b4d5a0e43e3628da07ccc535c03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f0fb910ea43e4acb7d09e5d8281a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d93bda629c48fbb4d287f624821f6ef4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-759b67ce2403d327c5bbf52c85062eaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778814403</data>
      <data key="d6" />
