    <node id="成功">
      <data key="d0">成功</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">成功is the outcome of success, achieved by those who are willing to take risks.&lt;SEP&gt;成功代表过关的结果，但与开心相对，被视为次要。</data>
