    <node id="地髓">
      <data key="d0">地髓</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">地髓（Geomarrow）是贝洛伯格地区特有的一种关键矿石能源，其颜色会随加工时的环境温度而发生改变。这种矿物是贝洛伯格城市供暖和各类设备（包括战意造物引擎等）供能的核心资源，对维持整个城市的运转至关重要，尤其在下层区，它是生存核心、供应命脉及主要的能源交换媒介。地髓由贝洛伯格下层区的专业矿队开采，矿工们挖掘它，流浪者们也曾图谋偷取它。这种价值连城的矿物资源是矿区冲突的根本原因，例如一条巨大矿脉的发现往往引发纷争，而矿工病和地髓结晶等副产品也与它的开采密切相关。&lt;SEP&gt;地髓(Geomarrow) is the specific type of ore found in the mine's ore vein, which is used for Belobog's energy.&lt;SEP&gt;地髓是矿区产出的重要资源，用于从地上获得物资配给.&lt;SEP&gt;地髓是贝洛伯格下层的重要资源，用于与上层进行交换，是维持封闭通道中经济流通的关键物资。&lt;SEP&gt;地髓is a concept of a mineral.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33a3b81a0e0d021e092a5a43b49f3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eed04f2e24a99af4e58308c5385ef8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-404cf71a3e6219ba8a0e5449b0ac3648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576240ab20bd81b46c419628067e2caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba20141801229755c9c8a7cfa181257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14ff2981a079af20ab48290ab8fef705&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb7e3676b7ef53774a045f63a562243d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72d3e4bc634c012aad25dcf71e92b962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778821233</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="机械屋「永动」">
      <data key="d0">机械屋「永动」</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">机械屋「永动」是希露瓦经营的店铺，以其独特风格闻名，店内有一台等待修理的坏机器。&lt;SEP&gt;Mechanical Workshop named "Perpetual Motion" in Belobog, owned by Serval, where a similar mechanism was previously seen.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33a3b81a0e0d021e092a5a43b49f3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625aa25735f503b4e89b5390a5e1fa4b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778737318</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="纪念碑">
      <data key="d0">纪念碑</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">纪念碑由象征知识与工业力量的齿轮和象征寒潮的巨大冰晶构成，齿轮束缚冰霜，代表筑城者不屈于蛮荒自然的精神。&lt;SEP&gt;纪念碑位于流梦礁，上面刻有拉扎莉娜和铁尔南的名字。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33a3b81a0e0d021e092a5a43b49f3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-943144073634dd9204a02a1a6cd56046</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779015844</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="下层区">
      <data key="d0">下层区</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The 下层区 is the underground district of Belobog, primarily responsible for energy supply and resource extraction. Professional mining teams extract the mineral "地髓" there, where miners and residents live and work. This region has been permanently sealed off from the upper city for a long period, leading to severe material shortages, a stifling and hot environment, and difficult living conditions where residents often struggle to have enough food and must use supplies regardless of expiration dates. The area is a major stage for combat and investigation in the story; it is protected and operated by the local organization “地火,” which seeks ways to regain freedom and escape. The 下层区 is also threatened by the Fragmentum. It is the hometown of Seele, influences the views of Bronya (who witnessed the resilience of the people here), and is home to Clara, Svarog, and other wanderers, with the ongoing energy crisis forcing the residents to be self-sufficient. The long blockade is about to be opened, and Seele plans to bring good news to its residents. The region is the lower district where important characters like Seele, Oleg, and Bronya have significant experiences.&lt;SEP&gt;The underworld is a location whose residents felt the violent tremors from the battle.&lt;SEP&gt;下层区is the underground area of Belobog, protected by史瓦罗.&lt;SEP&gt;The Underworld is the lower district of Belobog, where the Goethe Hotel is located. It has been isolated from the upper city due to the Stellaron crisis.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lower Zone of Belobog, where reconstruction work is ongoing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33a3b81a0e0d021e092a5a43b49f3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b44b54d9085ebe3502a657a576af746d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba20141801229755c9c8a7cfa181257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8772d247819725686282b99e50b8064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb7e3676b7ef53774a045f63a562243d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-879b193e2e2cd507f925e12ca8c67405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b967d36efcc27148feab290c2d59c9cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c56774a55a4da64085ed73e773e673ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33c1e9e634113885abc239bd6e869e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92b0b73d1b86ccd1a50d1c78667fc466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59578fa5049b0de9820319ced503cdbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15180a72eb9a3f1361af9608498c499b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8aea3ce7e067d8f4062dc3a1d66bc67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e377a0f376efa576e9326882d3e9d187&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1381bbbb71b642a091a6c3425722884b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87e94271f7ba8c380df5e7881a6bfafe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62249a61ab686e12d9f450bd5b82c692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6b4af8ca344f9e2e04ac55579accce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96d655812159e371a4f4f65013fcae3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54005507f5db05a1431064ea9db88caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-648ec021d414c21c95d0721c3edba947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597d9b4d5a0e43e3628da07ccc535c03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aabf9b838254f2ad4a9a5099ddc6c0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f19b28e0e4ceee3cc3ddb8117f39016d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a4d80c13a1da5dc405c6fdfa48a655b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c7646ca71928ded683b69e47ea21fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e34f96510fd5d8b4066be7a9a58bd4ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eacd315ae5f95c55d189019b4d765b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-759b67ce2403d327c5bbf52c85062eaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f371fb32e3b3a665db31402cdb619141</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
