    </node>
    <node id="琥珀王">
      <data key="d0">琥珀王</data>
      <data key="d1">aeon</data>
      <data key="d2">The Amber Lord is a revered figure in Belobog, invoked by Bronya Rand in her official command.&lt;SEP&gt;琥珀王is another name for the Aeon克里珀.&lt;SEP&gt;琥珀王is a deity praised by眼泛泪花的女子for family reunification.&lt;SEP&gt;Qlipoth, the Preservation Aeon, whose blessing is contrasted with Aventurine's former status.&lt;SEP&gt;琥珀王是存护星神，被砂金提及作为力量之源。&lt;SEP&gt;琥珀王是一个至高存在，翡翠将一切行动都奉献给他。&lt;SEP&gt;琥珀王是存护星神，砂金将其作为信仰对象，并为其献身。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a0bd49528edf3e917eef4f2c1aa6516&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a4d80c13a1da5dc405c6fdfa48a655b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b13f1d619b99829ec04b15c537d259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1e25533bb02e085267257087f8cfab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24216adb3550f4039e3373041f9f3067</data>
