      <data key="d0">朗道家族</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">The Landau family is a noble house in Belobog, known for producing high-ranking officers like Gepard.&lt;SEP&gt;朗道家族is a family that希露瓦is a rebellious member of.&lt;SEP&gt;朗道家族is a family in贝洛伯格known for their familiarity with the front lines; 杰帕德and希露瓦are members.&lt;SEP&gt;朗道家族是贝洛伯格的家族，希露瓦和杰帕德是其成员。</data>
