    </node>
    <node id="地火">
      <data key="d0">地火</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">地火 (Wildfire), also known as "Underground Fire," is a civilian volunteer organization and self-organized militia operating in the Underworld (the lower levels) of Belobog. It was founded by local residents after the Silvermane Guards retreated to the surface, serving as the primary force for maintaining order, delivering justice, and distributing resources in the underground. The organization is co-led by Oleg and Natasha and is often described as more humane than the surface authorities. Wildfire protects local interests, provides aid, and mediates conflicts—including those involving Svarog's robots and mining disputes. It controls the adult area of the Fighting Club and helps people survive threats like Fragmentum corrosion, holding significant information such as intelligence about the Stellaron.

The group is deeply embedded in the underground community; its members have infiltrated battles against Svarog and arranged guides for teams. Wildfire is locked in conflict with Svarog's forces and seeks to lead people out of the Underworld, though Svarog does not trust them. Dan Heng and other characters suggest consulting the organization regarding unresolved mysteries and planning subsequent actions. Notable members include Seele, who believes the organization needs more people like Dunn. The organization is also known for relaying information, such as when歌蒂 learned from them that the Trailblazer had helped solve troubles. Its stability, under Natasha's leadership, is crucial to the lower zone, and its members follow布洛妮娅 due to认可 her character. Some accounts suggest that Groundfire will handle remaining notifications, possibly as its final task.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cd0fa66de0580ceb159e7f584b0c75f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99b307cf496fce182708882c7b313806&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e1dc6f9e5af6812e9d18dc7b0b4ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a90b802948644335ecefb11f9f552b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e6c641bf64196f3c447229ccda14715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-404cf71a3e6219ba8a0e5449b0ac3648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576240ab20bd81b46c419628067e2caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba20141801229755c9c8a7cfa181257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14ff2981a079af20ab48290ab8fef705&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8772d247819725686282b99e50b8064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d50dd0c4a864aad264fdad2c99753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb7e3676b7ef53774a045f63a562243d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbd59288b2396673d3d290554c4a1db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-867227c60bd28fd1a9a6b67be2199b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-940a5d2c2c4bf28f6c50802d6255f3d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33c1e9e634113885abc239bd6e869e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15180a72eb9a3f1361af9608498c499b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8aea3ce7e067d8f4062dc3a1d66bc67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9be9e73fc5517e5bedc65669d89d77cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e377a0f376efa576e9326882d3e9d187&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87e94271f7ba8c380df5e7881a6bfafe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4a3c5f1222a99bbb8e7f6c3737e97ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46382422446ab0cbb34790317e9aab79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0f0f18d770fb010f9ef46a1a80d78c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16db8c2d24c790ba6ab06adc96caa029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76d31020f2b23cdf05dbb6c335fe625&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62249a61ab686e12d9f450bd5b82c692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd3abc93cbfc88148dada26d6a80719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35d7d0c728acf9b88d61eff28dca2c9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96d655812159e371a4f4f65013fcae3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f358eb31ab41c53d64bb729897805779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f0fb910ea43e4acb7d09e5d8281a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a4d80c13a1da5dc405c6fdfa48a655b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2decb49a546c2b4fde6ed99f9c7b7ad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e34f96510fd5d8b4066be7a9a58bd4ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df922075240eda66b779497e0b6aa03e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6e390686a60