    <node id="地下">
      <data key="d0">地下</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The underground is an area long separated from the surface, where娜塔莎lives.&lt;SEP&gt;The "地下" (underground) is a sealed-off area beneath Belobog where inhabitants mine and tunnel for survival.&lt;SEP&gt;地下(the underground) is the area below the surface in Belobog, where the 'Groundfire' organization operates.</data>
