    <node id="捉迷藏">
      <data key="d0">捉迷藏</data>
      <data key="d1">game</data>
      <data key="d2">捉迷藏is a game or search activity that开拓者is engaged in.&lt;SEP&gt;捉迷藏is a hide and seek game activity mentioned in the context of an exercise.&lt;SEP&gt;捉迷藏是开拓者与虎克一起参与的游戏活动。&lt;SEP&gt;捉迷藏是尤利安和虎克等孩子们正在玩的游戏。&lt;SEP&gt;捉迷藏is a game of hide and seek, referenced in the context of a search or exploration scenario.&lt;SEP&gt;A children's game of hide-and-seek, which the young child says they are very good at.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee41a17b365ca2e2a0731ea24d911677&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bab364b8200d529f3964724811a9edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb7e3676b7ef53774a045f63a562243d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9d4a1d72c9ef0c0483fa539108970fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c2955970d316e36b2886e065d14a06c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8db95a87e9ec1f2386df8b2f27af208c</data>
