      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">外来者are outsiders, referring to开拓者, 三月七, and丹恒, who are rare visitors to the underground.&lt;SEP&gt;外来者是指知晓星核本质的星穹列车成员。&lt;SEP&gt;The "外来者" refers to the group from the Astral Express who are wanted by Belobog but aided the underground and are seeking the Stellaron.</data>
