    <node id="门">
      <data key="d0">门</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">门is a door without a switch that the group encounters.&lt;SEP&gt;A door that, when opened, reveals a magnificent dream as stated by黄泉.&lt;SEP&gt;门refers to the multiple doors present in the location, which could be used to exit.&lt;SEP&gt;The dream bubble contains many doors, and米沙has an idea of which one to take to exit.</data>
