      <data key="d0">医生</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">医生是向三月七提供丹恒被桑博带走这一关键信息的人物。&lt;SEP&gt;A general medical professional mentioned as being available to help.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-89497e8dfd36334070d0d4816352affd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e6c641bf64196f3c447229ccda14715</data>
