    <node id="鼹鼠党">
      <data key="d0">鼹鼠党</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">The 鼹鼠党 is a children's organization based in the lower areas of Belobog, particularly the Underworld districts. The group is led by a child named 虎克, who claims that the organization governs the underground region. Its members include 尤利安, 阿丽娜, and other local children. The 鼹鼠党 is known for engaging in activities such as playing hide-and-seek, and they have been involved in controlling a children's area within the "搏击俱乐部." Additionally, the organization is associated with the larger 地火 faction. Beyond playful adventures, the 鼹鼠党's members harbor ambitious dreams of becoming great heroes of the Underworld and reclaiming their home from threats like the "铁皮怪兽." Notably, the protagonists 三月七 and 开拓者 were required to join the 鼹鼠党 in order to obtain clues about 丹恒's whereabouts.&lt;SEP&gt;鼹鼠党(Mole Party) is an organization whose members, including虎克, the group is tasked with finding.&lt;SEP&gt;鼹鼠党is a faction.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-89497e8dfd36334070d0d4816352affd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-736e04456cd707bb9f0e2c7aef04b0ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576240ab20bd81b46c419628067e2caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba20141801229755c9c8a7cfa181257&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9be9e73fc5517e5bedc65669d89d77cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9169eec00a528b13c46d52c1ade6a7fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a4d80c13a1da5dc405c6fdfa48a655b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eacd315ae5f95c55d189019b4d765b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5046de594846026db79453deb7286ce2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778821254</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="于枯索的冬夜里·捉迷藏·看看三月七在做什么">
      <data key="d0">于枯索的冬夜里·捉迷藏·看看三月七在做什么</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">这是发生在三月七与虎克、尤利安之间的捉迷藏游戏，目的是让三月七证明实力以加入鼹鼠党。</data>
