    <node id="史瓦罗">
      <data key="d0">史瓦罗</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">Svarog (史瓦罗) is an ancient and immensely powerful intelligent robot from the era of the Old World wars, having personally participated in defensive battles. He serves as the absolute leader and master of all autonomous machines in Belobog's undercity, operating from his base known as the Svarog base. His domain includes the core furnace hub, which he once sealed off, but he also provides shelter for local vagrant camps. The size of this giant robot is compared to the "Engine of Creation" by March 7th. He is a central figure that the organization Wildfire perceives as a threat, leading to conflicts due to his control over vital machinery and many secrets from before the cataclysm.

Svarog's actions are governed strictly by logic and calculation, and he distrusts human emotions, viewing them as unreliable. He stores, organizes, and provides data and audio recordings about the Stellaron, considering memories valuable and treating them like family. His stored data reveals that the Builders had already uncovered the truth about the Stellaron long ago. He also oversees trials for certification through robotic eyes. Svarog is a mechanical lifeform in Belobog's underworld from whom characters like Seele and Bronya gained crucial information. He is a powerful enemy that Bronya and her allies defeated in the underground to uncover truths about the Stellaron, his defeat later referenced by Seele to boost morale.

Svarog is an intelligent robot who serves as the guardian of the Underworld and calculates tasks related to protection. He is the leader of the intelligent robots in the mechanical settlement and shows concern for Clara, having raised her and granting her access to his base. Initially hostile to the Trailblazer, he ultimately agreed to share Stellaron information after assessing the threat they posed. The team originally intended to have a peaceful conversation with him, but he was the one who initiated the conflict despite being approached first.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-86c4d66f96134bb2c626dd84696834c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b44b54d9085ebe3502a657a576af746d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e1dc6f9e5af6812e9d18dc7b0b4ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee35aad5398fe0bbfcb6bc6c13d64bfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbd59288b2396673d3d290554c4a1db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-867227c60bd28fd1a9a6b67be2199b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e28fada03ee0258d0ac9090608ef7ef0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625578b596e2b744e9564c211f124572&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33c1e9e634113885abc239bd6e869e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c8165dc1c4464351a5fdc5fe0b4bff2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb689f40a2116265b9387146e28007c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59578fa5049b0de9820319ced503cdbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15180a72eb9a3f1361af9608498c499b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8aea3ce7e067d8f4062dc3a1d66bc67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3451267c02e481535c919fa43f9afc00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73d390675d34e626ee4d0aa954ebdbf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d17d81ab35ada8d5b554583411830bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a15bd9bbe1fb85611f5a68beeb93c36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfa1130e03deed9ba9c6b872e5bbc731&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c7275939cbc824a2d74bcf7b159fdae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9be9e73fc5517e5bedc65669d89d77cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e377a0f376efa576e9326882d3e9d187&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d074295b463d948dc288523dc7361759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1381bbbb71b642a091a6c3425722884b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87e94271f7ba8c380df5e7881a6bfafe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4a3c5f1222a99bbb8e7f6c3737e97ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46382422446ab0cbb34790317e9aab79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7676be6593d15f8d8e0abed8f5b1db59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0f0f18d770fb010f9ef46a1a80d78c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16db8c2d24c790ba6ab06adc96caa029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76d31020f2b23cdf05dbb6c335fe625&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62249a61ab686e12d9f450bd5b82c692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96d655812159e371a4f4f65013fcae3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f358eb31ab41c53d64bb729897805779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba7a0e579541604176a74ad243c7d799&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54005507f5db05a1431064ea9db88caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6abbca669401b90a21ed06750a5d8c43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a4d80c13a1da5dc405c6fdfa48a655b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2decb49a546c2b4fde6ed99f9c7b7ad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df922075240eda66b779497e0b6aa03e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eacd315ae5f95c55d189019b4d765b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
