    </node>
    <node id="安东尼娜">
      <data key="d0">安东尼娜</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Antonina (安东尼娜) is a miner and a member of the mining team in the Belobog矿区. She is known for being outspoken and confrontational, particularly towards both homeless wanderers and Svarog's robots. Antonina expresses frustration with the current situation and holds a negative view of wanderers, believing that giving them jobs by letting them join the mining team is the correct way to help them, rather than through other forms of assistance. Despite her critical stance, she also provides information about Oleg's whereabouts and clarifies the miners' relationship with the wanderers, acknowledging that the wanderers helped the miners during a collapse. She is recognized by Seele and, when approached by the Trailblazer, offers details about Svarog. She is curious when she hears about good news potentially related to her.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b44b54d9085ebe3502a657a576af746d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e1dc6f9e5af6812e9d18dc7b0b4ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-867227c60bd28fd1a9a6b67be2199b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c7646ca71928ded683b69e47ea21fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eacd315ae5f95c55d189019b4d765b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ae55661a99ec8ee90f3ea2484b83418</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778900464</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="希儿">
      <data key="d0">希儿</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">希儿（Seele）是《崩坏：星穹铁道》中一位出身于贝洛伯格下层区的角色。她在铆钉镇最混乱的街区长大，后被“地火”组织的领导人奥列格送至娜塔莎负责的孤儿院，并跟随娜塔莎学习生活技能。从十岁起，她便随奥列格巡查矿区，逐渐成长为“地火”组织的核心成员，担任侦查与行动骨干。希儿的性格直爽、好强且行动力极强，平时习惯独自执行任务，对陌生人略显难以接近，但本质上嘴硬心软，具有强烈的保护欲。

希儿精通下层区的矿车构造等实用知识，善于利用身边工具（例如家用寻物仪“查宝”）解决实际问题。她常在矿区巡逻，干预流浪者冲突与机器人攻击，因出身下层而对来自上层的银鬃铁卫持警惕和不信任态度，坚信其规则不适用于自己。她深得奥列格的信任，常被委以重任，并与娜塔莎关系亲密，视其为姐姐；她认为娜塔莎有很多责任并相信她在用自己的方式解决问题。

希儿是布洛妮娅的朋友，担心她的安危，承诺过保护她，并决心从可可利亚手中救回布洛妮娅。她是一位果断、行动导向的地火成员，主张直接行动，曾提议向史瓦罗进行暴力摊牌，并支持前往地面的决定。希儿也感到命运的重担压在双区之间，同时能注意到裂界污染的严重性。在战斗中，她勇于面对新怪物，并曾评论过杰帕德的顽强。她为开拓者作担保并证明其没有说谎，是一位从底层成长起来、务实可靠的角色。此外，希儿与布洛妮娅共同保守秘密，并负责将消息带给下层区；她支持希露瓦的话，并准备与开拓者一起行动；她也曾考虑独自潜入以取回钥匙。&lt;SEP&gt;希儿是地火成员，正与开拓者、丹恒和三月七一起行动，目标是救下布洛妮娅并对抗可可利亚。&lt;SEP&gt;希儿is a person who attended the inauguration ceremony of Bronya and noted that the people of the Underworld showed their support for the new leader.&lt;SEP&gt;希儿is a character who was present at a speech but stayed hidden; she is associated with the "地火" organization.&lt;SEP&gt;Seele is a person who is safe after the battle and helped Bronya, who was unwell, find the Iron Cavalry.&lt;SEP&gt;希儿is a character from Belobog who argues with Bronya about resource allocation for the reconstruction of the Underworld.&lt;SEP&gt;希儿is a character known as Seele.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b44b54d9085ebe3502a657a576af746d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e1dc6f9e5af6812e9d18dc7b0b4ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eed04f2e24a99af4e58308c5385ef8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e6c641bf64196f3c447229ccda14715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee35aad5398fe0bbfcb6bc6c13d64bfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-404cf71a3e6219ba8a0e5449b0ac3648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14ff2981a079af20ab48290ab8fef705&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d50dd0c4a864aad264fdad2c99753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb7e3676b7ef53774a045f63a562243d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbd59288b2396673d3d290554c4a1db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-867227c60bd28fd1a9a6b67be2199b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e28fada03ee0258d0ac9090608ef7ef0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec0afbfcefea689190c2427cc020c0d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-879b193e2e2cd507f925e12ca8c67405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-476102d5b945c517f2ae3b121c6662a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2f36e14631056ca2cd44db4ce2f6881&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe6b86a7693b184d26c498dcba8aeaed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8010590ea9229f0d14cbda63a8ffc533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-841f969b766204a7a19f27c2b5b85d42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51e338cd77e46441f1f7d69fd0e39180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625578b596e2b744e9564c211f124572&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b967d36efcc27148feab290c2d59c9cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c56774a55a4da64085ed73e773e673ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67d4d3f37f7d71422b580abe9428f7e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-460113c4ae9bdba9770d374216bde627&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33c1e9e634113885abc239bd6e869e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c8165dc1c4464351a5fdc5fe0b4bff2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92b0b73d1b86ccd1a50d1c78667fc466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb689f40a2116265b9387146e28007c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15180a72eb9a3f1361af9608498c499b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8aea3ce7e067d8f4062dc3a1d66bc67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-152d535f64a42b693378f5507f2f15ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3451267c02e481535c919fa43f9afc00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7e6dfd88c57cb9da6e78365aeec90fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e54baa7e28178c35678f9b162976f8ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73d390675d34e626ee4d0aa954ebdbf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d17d81ab35ada8d5b554583411830bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a15bd9bbe1fb