    <node id="查宝">
      <data key="d0">查宝</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">查宝is a small robot or device that offers to help find objects, although its brainwave scanning module is damaged it can still run manual input search functions.&lt;SEP&gt;查宝, full name "家用寻物仪『理查德』•版本0.63•专家型•年度豪华版", is a damaged device from the星际和平公司with a brainwave scanning module malfunction, capable of speaking and performing identity searches.&lt;SEP&gt;查宝是一个辅助寻找物品的设备，具有简单的交互功能.&lt;SEP&gt;查宝is a household item finder device capable of searching for objects, but not organic life, and is produced by星际和平家电.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b44b54d9085ebe3502a657a576af746d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eed04f2e24a99af4e58308c5385ef8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec0afbfcefea689190c2427cc020c0d8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778748409</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="流浪者">
      <data key="d0">流浪者</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">流浪者（Vagrants/Wanderers）是贝洛伯格（Belobog）地下矿区中一个主要由无家可归或流离失所者组成的群体。他们的家园大多被裂界（the Fragmentum）摧毁，因此被迫迁移到矿区中安家，其中一些人在保存的矿区内建立了新的营地。部分流浪者寻求史瓦罗（Svarog）的保护，例如在炉心（Furnace Core）附近扎营。然而，这个群体在矿区中与当地矿工存在冲突，有时表现出对抗性，甚至试图抢劫矿工。一些流浪者因矿区的机器占领而无法靠近内部矿区，而另一些则因采矿作业受伤，这促使克拉拉（Clara）向史瓦罗呼吁帮助。此外，流浪者中也有部分行为不端者，在“地火”（Wildfire）的领地内制造冲突，但面对对峙时会迅速逃离。总体而言，流浪者是一群有尊严的流离失所者，如安东尼娜（Antonina）所认为，应通过提供适当工作而非纯粹慈善来帮助他们克服困境。

流浪者与裂界中的怪物有明确的区别，他们是生活在底层区域、居住条件恶劣且缺乏医疗设施的人群。流浪者营地中有人受伤需要止痛剂，克拉拉因此为他们寻找药品。一些流浪者暂住在史瓦罗基地附近。此外，这群人中还会讨论机器维修并分享信息。在地区内，流浪者被认为可能能够观察到某些群体的行动。&lt;SEP&gt;流浪者are a group of wanderers who assisted the miners during the collapse.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b44b54d9085ebe3502a657a576af746d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e1dc6f9e5af6812e9d18dc7b0b4ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e6c641bf64196f3c447229ccda14715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-404cf71a3e6219ba8a0e5449b0ac3648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee35aad5398fe0bbfcb6bc6c13d64bfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14ff2981a079af20ab48290ab8fef705&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbd59288b2396673d3d290554c4a1db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-867227c60bd28fd1a9a6b67be2199b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-476102d5b945c517f2ae3b121c6662a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-841f969b766204a7a19f27c2b5b85d42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625578b596e2b744e9564c211f124572&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33c1e9e634113885abc239bd6e869e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb689f40a2116265b9387146e28007c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73d390675d34e626ee4d0aa954ebdbf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46382422446ab0cbb34790317e9aab79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c7646ca71928ded683b69e47ea21fc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778808995</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="矿队">
      <data key="d0">矿队</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">矿队is a mining team that安东尼娜allowed the homeless wanderers to join.&lt;SEP&gt;矿队is the mining team working in the area, which is in conflict with both wanderers and robots.&lt;SEP&gt;The mining team that got into a brawl with a group of thugs.&lt;SEP&gt;矿队refers to the mining teams in the area, who, along with the wanderers, are unable to approach the inner mine due to the robots.&lt;SEP&gt;矿队is a group of miners who have been subject to theft and attacks in the矿区.&lt;SEP&gt;矿队is a group of miners that likely has wounded individuals.&lt;SEP&gt;矿队is the mining team that is experiencing financial hardship and will prepare to restart work if the cable car station reopens.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b44b54d9085ebe3502a657a576af746d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e1dc6f9e5af6812e9d18dc7b0b4ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e6c641bf64196f3c447229ccda14715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee35aad5398fe0bbfcb6bc6c13d64bfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-476102d5b945c517f2ae3b121c6662a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625578b596e2b744e9564c211f124572&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c7646ca71928ded683b69e47ea21fc</data>
