    <node id="搏击俱乐部">
      <data key="d0">搏击俱乐部</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">搏击俱乐部is a fighting club that has reportedly attracted a new member known as a black-haired young man.&lt;SEP&gt;搏击俱乐部is a location where Sampo claims winning a championship provides the fame needed to meet the '地火'.&lt;SEP&gt;搏击俱乐部是贝洛伯格下层区的一个显眼建筑，黑色头发的大哥哥被蓝色头发的叔叔带去那里。&lt;SEP&gt;The "搏击俱乐部" is a venue in the underground where people play a game of rock-paper-scissors disguised as fighting, with separate areas for children and adults.&lt;SEP&gt;搏击俱乐部is a location in the underground where丹恒overheard information about the withdrawal of the Silvermane Guards.&lt;SEP&gt;搏击俱乐部是下层区的场所，丹恒曾在此听到一些信息。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-42c4be0fb9d10d383856c4ec13e88c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a90b802948644335ecefb11f9f552b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-736e04456cd707bb9f0e2c7aef04b0ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576240ab20bd81b46c419628067e2caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8772d247819725686282b99e50b8064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb7e3676b7ef53774a045f63a562243d</data>
