    <node id="于枯索的冬夜里">
      <data key="d0">于枯索的冬夜里</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The event or experience "于枯索的冬夜里" serves as the overarching context for the described rules and events.&lt;SEP&gt;《于枯索的冬夜里》 is a story or mission where characters use a household item finder to search for mining cart parts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-42c4be0fb9d10d383856c4ec13e88c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec0afbfcefea689190c2427cc020c0d8</data>
