    <node id="地痞">
      <data key="d0">地痞</data>
      <data key="d1">group</data>
      <data key="d2">地痞are a group of thugs who harass the miners and confront Seele and Bronya.&lt;SEP&gt;地痞是指在矿区挑衅的群体，引发冲突并对矿民进行盗窃.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d8e1dc6f9e5af6812e9d18dc7b0b4ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778748325</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="奥列格">
      <data key="d0">奥列格</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">奥列格（Oleg）是地下组织“地火”（Wildfire/Groundfire）的核心领袖和明面首领，负责处理该团体对外的事务。他性格豪爽，对真诚的朋友表示欢迎，也是一名经验丰富的退伍老兵。他曾带领一群人深入大矿区解决机器人引发的冲突，并忙于处理当地的各种问题。奥列格对上层区（贝洛伯格上层区）和史瓦罗有着深刻的了解，并主张对史瓦罗采取和平解决与军事准备相结合的策略。他是“地火”组织的创始成员之一，由娜塔莎召集创建。奥列格曾捡到希儿并将其送到娜塔莎的孤儿院，之后带领她巡查矿区，成为希儿的同伴和重要盟友。他指派桑博担任队伍的向导，支持开拓者团队对抗史瓦罗，展现出作为领导者的决断力和责任感。奥列格还为旅行者安排住宿，保证布洛妮娅的安全，并派员协助危险任务。他代表娜塔莎与开拓者等人商讨后续计划，并负责送他们回上层区。此外，奥列格被描述为善于处理脏活，曾作为救援领袖在关键时刻被桑博带来帮助团队。他曾想与布洛妮娅见面，并担心过早出卖娜塔莎，同时认为开拓者是地下的大英雄。奥列格也被提及为可能与歌德大饭店或地火组织相关的人物。&lt;SEP&gt;奥列格is a leader figure, known as "奥列格头儿", associated with the "地火" organization in the lower levels. He acknowledges the contributions of the travelers and believes their paths will cross again.&lt;SEP&gt;奥列格is a former银鬃铁卫officer who lives in the lower levels and runs an organization.&lt;SEP&gt;奥列格is a character who survived the underworld and returns to the administrative district, expressing nostalgia and describing the fresh air as freedom.&lt;SEP&gt;奥列格is another adult from the lower zone, mentioned alongside娜塔莎as someone who will experience the return to normalcy.&lt;SEP&gt;奥列格is a former兵长known for heroic deeds in the银鬃铁卫.&lt;SEP&gt;Oleg is a person who is surprised by the group's quick return and inquires about the outcome, noting that the violent tremors in the underworld were caused by their battle. He believes Bronya will become the new Guardian of the city and help the underworld.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d8e1dc6f9e5af6812e9d18dc7b0b4ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e6c641bf64196f3c447229ccda14715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-404cf71a3e6219ba8a0e5449b0ac3648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14ff2981a079af20ab48290ab8fef705&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d50dd0c4a864aad264fdad2c99753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbd59288b2396673d3d290554c4a1db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-867227c60bd28fd1a9a6b67be2199b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e28fada03ee0258d0ac9090608ef7ef0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-940a5d2c2c4bf28f6c50802d6255f3d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-476102d5b945c517f2ae3b121c6662a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8010590ea9229f0d14cbda63a8ffc533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c8165dc1c4464351a5fdc5fe0b4bff2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9be9e73fc5517e5bedc65669d89d77cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e377a0f376efa576e9326882d3e9d187&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d074295b463d948dc288523dc7361759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1381bbbb71b642a091a6c3425722884b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87e94271f7ba8c380df5e7881a6bfafe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4a3c5f1222a99bbb8e7f6c3737e97ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46382422446ab0cbb34790317e9aab79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16db8c2d24c790ba6ab06adc96caa029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76d31020f2b23cdf05dbb6c335fe625&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62249a61ab686e12d9f450bd5b82c692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e3269609fa84895229819f9f6377c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96d655812159e371a4f4f65013fcae3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14edf5531c1be80047c123e4c8f934fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aabf9b838254f2ad4a9a5099ddc6c0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f19b28e0e4ceee3cc3ddb8117f39016d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a4d80c13a1da5dc405c6fdfa48a655b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e34f96510fd5d8b4066be7a9a58bd4ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa4f6559bb8c6fdf7a61d696bb98ea71</data>
