    <node id="炉心枢纽">
      <data key="d0">炉心枢纽</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">炉心枢纽is the central hub occupied by Svarog's robots, which no one is allowed to approach.&lt;SEP&gt;炉心枢纽(Furnace Core) is a location Svarog mentions he needs to guard as he recalculates his plans due to the new variable.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d8e1dc6f9e5af6812e9d18dc7b0b4ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40</data>
