    </node>
    <node id="矿区">
      <data key="d0">矿区</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">矿区is the mining area where the conflict between miners, wanderers, and robots takes place.&lt;SEP&gt;矿区is the underground mining area where the events take place, a location the wanderers consider dangerous due to robots but also a source of valuables like地髓.&lt;SEP&gt;The mining district is the location where the conflict between the mining team, wanderers, and thugs takes place. It has been heavily contaminated by the Fragmentum.&lt;SEP&gt;矿区是贝洛伯格下层区的重要组成部分，是地底的生命线.&lt;SEP&gt;矿区是地下区域，矿工和流浪者曾因矿脉发生冲突。&lt;SEP&gt;The mine is a location in the lower zone where conflicts and struggles occurred in the past.&lt;SEP&gt;The mining area where克拉拉and others help wounded individuals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d8e1dc6f9e5af6812e9d18dc7b0b4ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eed04f2e24a99af4e58308c5385ef8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14ff2981a079af20ab48290ab8fef705&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-867227c60bd28fd1a9a6b67be2199b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59578fa5049b0de9820319ced503cdbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1381bbbb71b642a091a6c3425722884b</data>
