    <node id="地痞流氓">
      <data key="d0">地痞流氓</data>
      <data key="d1">group</data>
      <data key="d2">A group of thugs who attacked the miners in the mine.&lt;SEP&gt;地痞流氓是占据矿脉且全副武装的敌对群体.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7e6c641bf64196f3c447229ccda14715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2</data>
