    <node id="第一矿队">
      <data key="d0">第一矿队</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">第一矿队is the mining team that伊蕾恩is a member of, and its members are among those affected by the robot occupation.&lt;SEP&gt;The First Mining Team is a mining group that discovered a massive Geomarrow vein in the mining district, leading to the conflict.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee35aad5398fe0bbfcb6bc6c13d64bfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14ff2981a079af20ab48290ab8fef705</data>
