      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="大矿区">
      <data key="d0">大矿区</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Great Mining Zone (大矿区) is a major mining area located in the underworld of Belobog, specifically in the Beloborg Lower Zone. It serves as a vital lifeline for the underground region by providing essential mineral supplies. The zone is a primary location where various incidents and conflicts unfold, including troubles faced by the "Groundfire" organization (also known as Wildfire), with Oleg being actively involved there. The area has been threatened by local thugs due to conflicts, and it has been the site of incidents involving流浪者 (wanderers) and矿队 (mining teams), leading to injuries and chaos. Additionally, the Big Mining Area was mentioned by Clara as the location of a previous incident that contributed to Svarog's distrust. Characters such as March 7th, Seele, and Clara have been encountered here.&lt;SEP&gt;大矿区is a location associated with mining activities and is potentially affected by conflicts and tremors.&lt;SEP&gt;大矿区is a location.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-404cf71a3e6219ba8a0e5449b0ac3648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee35aad5398fe0bbfcb6bc6c13d64bfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d50dd0c4a864aad264fdad2c99753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-476102d5b945c517f2ae3b121c6662a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33c1e9e634113885abc239bd6e869e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3451267c02e481535c919fa43f9afc00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c7646ca71928ded683b69e47ea21fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778821237</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="矿工">
      <data key="d0">矿工</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">矿工are workers in the mine area who have conflicts with the流浪者over resources.&lt;SEP&gt;矿工是在矿区工作的人，与流浪者之间存在频繁的冲突。&lt;SEP&gt;矿工(Miners) are workers in the underground mine who have been injured, prompting Clara's appeal to Svarog for help.&lt;SEP&gt;矿工是在矿区工作的群体，与流浪者存在冲突.&lt;SEP&gt;矿工are individuals involved in the mining conflict that史瓦罗intervenes in.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-404cf71a3e6219ba8a0e5449b0ac3648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbd59288b2396673d3d290554c4a1db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-867227c60bd28fd1a9a6b67be2199b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625578b596e2b744e9564c211f124572</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778748694</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="机器人">
      <data key="d0">机器人</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">机器人(Robots) are a third-party force that has occupied the inner circle of the large mining area, preventing people from entering.&lt;SEP&gt;机器人(Robots) are mechanical entities, including those commanded by Svarog, that are in conflict with Wildfire and have occupied the mine.&lt;SEP&gt;机器人是受史瓦罗控制的机械，没有自主意志，行动反映史瓦罗的目的.&lt;SEP&gt;机器人refers to the robotic nature of史瓦罗, which希儿believes limits his understanding.&lt;SEP&gt;机器人是史瓦罗控制的战斗单位，不怕牺牲，构成武力威胁。&lt;SEP&gt;机器人are machines in the area, mentioned alongside流浪者as potential observers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee35aad5398fe0bbfcb6bc6c13d64bfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d41e31ec86767fc2e205456db4be7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-867227c60bd28fd1a9a6b67be2199b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e377a0f376efa576e9326882d3e9d187&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d074295b463d948dc288523dc7361759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46382422446ab0cbb34790317e9aab79</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778757328</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
