      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="炉心">
      <data key="d0">炉心</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">炉心 is a large structure located in Beloborg that serves as a critical connection between the upper and lower layers of the city. Historically used for travel, it has since been restricted and is now a heavily guarded key facility. Functioning as the energy center of the Underworld, the炉心 also acts as a pillar for transportation between the upper and lower levels. The area is described as an underground region, with the robot Svarog guarding its vital hub and protecting the surrounding vagrant camps. Svarog's control once led to the封锁 of炉心, but when the blockade was lifted, it allowed the lower zone to replenish its resources. The character Natasha mentions assigning management of炉心 to the organization "地火" (the Fire), while Sampo refers to it as a relatively more convenient route and takes responsibility for guiding the player through炉心 to return to the upper area.&lt;SEP&gt;炉心is a passage connecting the upper and lower levels with spiral stone steps.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb7e3676b7ef53774a045f63a562243d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-867227c60bd28fd1a9a6b67be2199b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87e94271f7ba8c380df5e7881a6bfafe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4a3c5f1222a99bbb8e7f6c3737e97ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46382422446ab0cbb34790317e9aab79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62249a61ab686e12d9f450bd5b82c692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e3269609fa84895229819f9f6377c51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14edf5531c1be80047c123e4c8f934fa</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778757798</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="约书亚">
      <data key="d0">约书亚</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">约书亚is a person Sampo expected to see in the area but who is absent.&lt;SEP&gt;约书亚is a skeptical resident of the lower zone who expresses suspicion about the Silvermane Guards' actions.&lt;SEP&gt;约书亚is a concerned onlooker at the hotel accident. He is initially worried that Pike is dead and later suggests taking Pike to see Doctor Natasha.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f19b28e0e4ceee3cc3ddb8117f39016d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-759b67ce2403d327c5bbf52c85062eaa</data>
