    <node id="克拉拉">
      <data key="d0">克拉拉</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">克拉拉 (Clara) is a young, compassionate, and selfless girl from the lower zones of Belobog, distinguished by her red clothing. She shares a profound, familial bond with the artificial intelligence entity Svarog, whom she regards as family and frequently accompanies. Clara is deeply empathetic towards the plight of miners and vagrants, actively caring for the wounded and seeking painkillers and medical supplies for wanderers. She is skilled at repairs and plays a key role in her interactions with Svarog, often persuading him to do more to help those in need, though she hesitates to mediate conflicts directly. Clara previously lived in the large mine area, where she had authority over access to Svarog's base and is seen as a "family member" of the robots. She once faced danger while searching for machine components in a workshop. Clara has assisted the Nameless team by helping them acquire painkillers and cooperates with them, but refuses to directly mediate with Svarog. Other characters, such as Natasha, have stated they will not harm Clara or Svarog. Clara has noted the difference in smell between Belobog's upper and lower levels. She is friends with Perkins, expresses doubt over Hook's interpretations, and is considered a child who would likely not refuse to sit with the Trailblazer. Clara cares for Svarog, refers to Serval as "sister," and recalls fond memories of Svarog "taking pictures" of her as a child. She is grateful for the care of the Trailblazer, March 7th, and Dan Heng, and aspires to become an adult like Serval to protect everyone and Svarog. She also dreams of becoming a traveler like the Trailblazers.&lt;SEP&gt;克拉拉is a character known as Clara.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-867227c60bd28fd1a9a6b67be2199b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625578b596e2b744e9564c211f124572&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33c1e9e634113885abc239bd6e869e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c8165dc1c4464351a5fdc5fe0b4bff2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb689f40a2116265b9387146e28007c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59578fa5049b0de9820319ced503cdbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7c6805290c04de3a583d44fbdb6e8e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15180a72eb9a3f1361af9608498c499b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8aea3ce7e067d8f4062dc3a1d66bc67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3451267c02e481535c919fa43f9afc00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7e6dfd88c57cb9da6e78365aeec90fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6f6ad1bb208de7f8bcba6b596b9c76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a15bd9bbe1fb85611f5a68beeb93c36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e377a0f376efa576e9326882d3e9d187&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1381bbbb71b642a091a6c3425722884b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87e94271f7ba8c380df5e7881a6bfafe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4a3c5f1222a99bbb8e7f6c3737e97ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46382422446ab0cbb34790317e9aab79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7676be6593d15f8d8e0abed8f5b1db59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0f0f18d770fb010f9ef46a1a80d78c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aabf9b838254f2ad4a9a5099ddc6c0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6abbca669401b90a21ed06750a5d8c43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a4d80c13a1da5dc405c6fdfa48a655b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f363a6ba12d7e65941adba654ef6fb4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df922075240eda66b779497e0b6aa03e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eacd315ae5f95c55d189019b4d765b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21825bf2e51d148d9157e7a7efb7ae87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-729cfff273d4a52874da43c97c89dd2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
