    <node id="歌德大饭店">
      <data key="d0">歌德大饭店</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">歌德大饭店是贝洛伯格的一家旅馆，是文本中梦境发生的背景地点。&lt;SEP&gt;歌德大饭店(Goethe Grand Hotel) is a hotel in the underground area where the travelers are staying.&lt;SEP&gt;歌德大饭店是一家饭店，提供住宿和餐饮服务。&lt;SEP&gt;歌德大饭店is a hotel in the underworld run by Gotti. It sustains damage from shaking but is being renovated.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4e1f2753a3817eebbe41ea755cc6a02e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-940a5d2c2c4bf28f6c50802d6255f3d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76d31020f2b23cdf05dbb6c335fe625&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-759b67ce2403d327c5bbf52c85062eaa</data>
