    <node id="歌蒂">
      <data key="d0">歌蒂</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">歌蒂is a character who welcomes guests at the Goethe Grand Hotel and is instructed by Oleg to provide hospitality.&lt;SEP&gt;歌蒂是歌德宾馆的员工，介绍了宾馆的历史和歌德家族前辈的奋斗故事。&lt;SEP&gt;歌蒂是歌德大饭店的工作人员，负责接待客人并提供服务。&lt;SEP&gt;歌蒂是下层区的居民，称赞奥列格平时照顾大家。&lt;SEP&gt;歌蒂is a person who reunites with老歌德at a hotel and discusses business.&lt;SEP&gt;歌蒂is the owner of the Goethe Hotel in the underworld. She is a hardworking woman who is renovating the hotel and is deeply moved by the news that the upper and lower layers will be reopened.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-940a5d2c2c4bf28f6c50802d6255f3d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe6b86a7693b184d26c498dcba8aeaed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76d31020f2b23cdf05dbb6c335fe625&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62249a61ab686e12d9f450bd5b82c692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a4d80c13a1da5dc405c6fdfa48a655b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-759b67ce2403d327c5bbf52c85062eaa</data>
