    <node id="敌人">
      <data key="d0">敌人</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">敌人是布洛妮娅在黑暗中遇到的人物(即开拓者)，她设想过将他们逮捕是更合理的选择，但目前感到困惑。&lt;SEP&gt;敌人在孤儿院内部出现，从背后偷袭希儿和布洛妮娅，布洛妮娅曾在禁区前线见过同种怪物。&lt;SEP&gt;敌人refers to adversaries the protagonist may have, as mentioned by黄泉.&lt;SEP&gt;Enemies are figures Acheron suggests the group should identify and fight against.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-72d3e4bc634c012aad25dcf71e92b962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92b0b73d1b86ccd1a50d1c78667fc466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-088541780cd6898348a852107a2583cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a111bfaa2097692df9de2c4cee43b80</data>
