    <node id="磐岩镇">
      <data key="d0">磐岩镇</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">磐岩镇is the location where娜塔莎moved her clinic and orphanage after the erosion of her hometown.&lt;SEP&gt;磐岩镇is a location where the group intends to return to report to娜塔莎.&lt;SEP&gt;磐岩镇是娜塔莎从铆钉镇逃到并创建「地火」的落脚点，也是下层区的核心区域。&lt;SEP&gt;磐岩镇is a location.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-476102d5b945c517f2ae3b121c6662a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-625578b596e2b744e9564c211f124572&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87e94271f7ba8c380df5e7881a6bfafe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
