    <node id="止痛剂">
      <data key="d0">止痛剂</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">止痛剂is a medicinal analgesic stored in an old laboratory for treating pain.&lt;SEP&gt;止痛剂是一种医疗物品，被提及在对话中作为需要记住的物资。&lt;SEP&gt;止痛剂are medical supplies sought by both克拉拉and the group.&lt;SEP&gt;止痛剂are painkillers collected by希儿and克拉拉.&lt;SEP&gt;Painkillers are the medical supplies the Trailblazer was searching for, which Seele and Clara later share.&lt;SEP&gt;止痛剂是希儿交付的医疗物资之一，但分量稍少。&lt;SEP&gt;止痛剂是开拓者和克拉拉在储藏室中寻得并分享的物资。</data>
