      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">裂界生物are creatures from the裂界that do not need human supplies and would not take items in an organized manner.&lt;SEP&gt;裂界生物are enemies from the裂界, with低级裂界生物being mindless destroyers, while this specific one is more intelligent and tactical.</data>
