      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">帕金斯is a companion of克拉拉who keeps her safe.&lt;SEP&gt;Perkins is a guard robot that protects Clara and follows her commands, initially perceiving the Trailblazer as a threat.&lt;SEP&gt;A robot belonging to克拉拉, called帕金斯, that attempts to initialize its self-repair module and sends a warning about a threat to克拉拉.&lt;SEP&gt;Perkins is a person who communicates haltingly and identifies the outsiders as Clara's friends.&lt;SEP&gt;帕金斯is a robot that was repaired by克拉拉.</data>
