      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">禁区前线是布洛妮娅曾见过类型相近怪物的危险地带。&lt;SEP&gt;禁区前线is the restricted military area guarded by邓恩.&lt;SEP&gt;The Forbidden Zone front line is where the bridge leads, facing the endless Fragmentum and the weary Silvermane Guards.&lt;SEP&gt;禁区前线是贝洛伯格的一部分，人们在那里努力生存和奋战。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-92b0b73d1b86ccd1a50d1c78667fc466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da4724fc5e3317bb631f842e18bf511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd3abc93cbfc88148dada26d6a80719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54005507f5db05a1431064ea9db88caf</data>
