      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">机械聚落is where Clara likely returned to after leaving the group.&lt;SEP&gt;机械聚落是史瓦罗的根据地所在，桑博声称对这里很熟悉。&lt;SEP&gt;A mechanical settlement that is the destination of the journey.&lt;SEP&gt;机械聚落是史瓦罗和智能机器人们所在的地点。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-15180a72eb9a3f1361af9608498c499b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9be9e73fc5517e5bedc65669d89d77cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6abbca669401b90a21ed06750a5d8c43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df922075240eda66b779497e0b6aa03e</data>
