    <node id="真相">
      <data key="d0">真相</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">真相refers to the underlying reality or secret that布洛妮娅and开拓者are preparing to uncover, serving as a key motivation for their actions.&lt;SEP&gt;The truth about the location and the situation that Firefly and the Trailblazer seek to uncover.&lt;SEP&gt;真相is the hidden reality that砂金is trying to uncover, believing he has proven its existence.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-152d535f64a42b693378f5507f2f15ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b85937e6bc111bb0516718814af5cb90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2d249f7bcbd0b19ddb847f1301c1021&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53c7f48036990ccca5a5b48e0fe82a3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778900853</data>
