      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">家人是一个概念，用于描述克拉拉与机器人的亲密关系。&lt;SEP&gt;家人refers to family members the protagonist may have, as mentioned by黄泉.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3451267c02e481535c919fa43f9afc00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-088541780cd6898348a852107a2583cd</data>
