    <node id="暴躁机器人">
      <data key="d0">暴躁机器人</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">暴躁机器人(Grouchy Robot) is a robot with a bad temper, tasked with issuing certifications and poses tests to individuals. It gets easily annoyed, complains frequently, but eventually issues certifications after a test.&lt;SEP&gt;暴躁机器人is a hostile robot that challenges the group after a failed authentication.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e54baa7e28178c35678f9b162976f8ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46382422446ab0cbb34790317e9aab79</data>
