    <node id="微晶单元">
      <data key="d0">微晶单元</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">微晶单元(Microcrystalline Unit) is a component that the robot asks about in its test question, asking which part it should be connected to.&lt;SEP&gt;微晶单元is a component that should be connected to the braking module to make a machine function.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e54baa7e28178c35678f9b162976f8ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73d390675d34e626ee4d0aa954ebdbf8</data>
