      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">巴列维is a figure known as "矿灯" who gave advice on piecing together parts from ancient artifacts, but is considered unreliable.&lt;SEP&gt;巴列维is a character known as Miner Lamp.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-73d390675d34e626ee4d0aa954ebdbf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb</data>
