      <data key="d0">认证机器人</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">The认证机器人is a protocol-driven machine that administers a certification test and activates combat mode when threatened.&lt;SEP&gt;认证机器人is a robot that performs authentication but attacks the group after evaluation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-73d390675d34e626ee4d0aa954ebdbf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46382422446ab0cbb34790317e9aab79</data>
