      <data key="d2">栈桥is a structure with multiple platforms, each equipped with similar control terminals.&lt;SEP&gt;A bridge leading to the frontline of the Forbidden Zone.&lt;SEP&gt;栈桥is a structure that can be rotated to cut off front and rear areas to prevent monster infiltration.&lt;SEP&gt;栈桥是可旋转的桥梁部件，用于连接两岸，破解机关时需要旋转栈桥来绕路。</data>
