    <node id="邓恩">
      <data key="d0">邓恩</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">邓恩is the captain of the银鬃铁卫, a former keyboardist in希露瓦's band, and guards the禁区.&lt;SEP&gt;邓恩is a silvermane guard who was once a bandmate of Cocolia and values his dignity as a soldier. He initially confronted the group but was knocked unconscious by Cocolia.&lt;SEP&gt;邓恩是银鬃铁卫的警卫队长，拥有授权他人进入能源中枢的密钥。&lt;SEP&gt;邓恩is a character who helped open the energy central gate and was thanked by三月七.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4da4724fc5e3317bb631f842e18bf511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fd3abc93cbfc88148dada26d6a80719&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db133a2844f87e566ce2dfd3936e0a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e4d2b029cb1d9c5f1ff1ba3fab0a0ca</data>
