    <node id="弗朗兹">
      <data key="d0">弗朗兹</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">弗朗兹is a guard at the禁区entrance who confirmed the检修claim.&lt;SEP&gt;弗朗兹is a银鬃铁卫guard stationed at the gate, who knows希露瓦and is eventually persuaded to let them in.</data>
