      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">机关能源中枢is a component needing inspection, requiring a密钥to access.&lt;SEP&gt;The机关能源中枢(Mechanical Energy Core) is a central power supply unit connected to many pipelines, powering the entire Iron Cavalry restricted area.&lt;SEP&gt;Mechanism energy center.</data>
