    <node id="铁卫禁区">
      <data key="d0">铁卫禁区</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">铁卫禁区是贝洛伯格的一处军事区域，希露瓦和杰帕德在此处活动，杰帕德提及前线紧张，暗示该区域临近前线。&lt;SEP&gt;铁卫禁区is a location where the group plans to go to find the星核.&lt;SEP&gt;铁卫禁区是银鬃铁卫的主力驻扎地，位于贝洛伯格以北，是前往北部雪原的必经之路。&lt;SEP&gt;铁卫禁区是希露瓦和希儿前往的地点。&lt;SEP&gt;The铁卫禁区(Iron Cavalry Restricted Area) is a guarded zone that contains the energy core and other critical equipment.&lt;SEP&gt;铁卫禁区is the military zone that希露瓦's group invaded, guarded by杰帕德.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e23752bdf2ef3627f0a83acc0150c1ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14edf5531c1be80047c123e4c8f934fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a472ad06854cfbea32b100ad930934ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1df4e13a67f2223f122fe16eba1c678&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad5bb7d0c5462f28118de7e9de20b165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62781f29bdc9b0fad8b67a1741741b4</data>
