    <node id="禁区">
      <data key="d0">禁区</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The禁区is a military restricted area that the group aims to infiltrate.&lt;SEP&gt;禁区是贝洛伯格外围的军事管制区域，设有机械栈桥，允许铁卫出入但通常无外人进入。&lt;SEP&gt;禁区is a restricted military area protected by the银鬃铁卫, which希露瓦's group has entered.&lt;SEP&gt;禁区是铁卫守卫的地方，大门后隐藏着怪物。&lt;SEP&gt;The Restricted Zone is the location of a previous incident for which Gepard apologizes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fd6c21ae8658032a7c6a70abba655057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5fcb2e9c956a15a8878b995c151b999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62781f29bdc9b0fad8b67a1741741b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f0fb910ea43e4acb7d09e5d8281a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b03521b6bf7ef269c01483b50100862</data>
