    </node>
    <node id="铁卫队长">
      <data key="d0">铁卫队长</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">铁卫队长是贝洛伯格银鬃铁卫的队长，负责管理后备队并进行日常训练。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a5fcb2e9c956a15a8878b995c151b999</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778757843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="裂界怪物">
      <data key="d0">裂界怪物</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">裂界怪物是出没于禁区的敌对威胁，对铁卫虎视眈眈。&lt;SEP&gt;裂界怪物are dangerous beings that can attack at any time from the裂界, threatening the禁区.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a5fcb2e9c956a15a8878b995c151b999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62781f29bdc9b0fad8b67a1741741b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7761bbe49cdee3fe2ebc6f41bfed7bee</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778808354</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="机械栈桥">
      <data key="d0">机械栈桥</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">机械栈桥是禁区内的关键通道，由终端机联合控制，穿过桥对岸是充满危险的人间地狱。&lt;SEP&gt;The mechanical bridge is a concept mentioned as something that will expose the group's presence when activated.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a5fcb2e9c956a15a8878b995c151b999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e4d2b029cb1d9c5f1ff1ba3fab0a0ca</data>
