      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The机关门is a locked door that the characters need to open by finding a switch and activating multiple mechanisms.&lt;SEP&gt;机关门是场景中的障碍，需要旋转栈桥和绕路来破解。</data>
