    <node id="造物引擎">
      <data key="d0">造物引擎</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">造物引擎是筑城者制造的古代巨型机器，被可可利亚召唤并用来攻击开拓者一行人。&lt;SEP&gt;「造物引擎」是可可利亚引发的巨大动静，被城中居民察觉。&lt;SEP&gt;造物引擎is a giant machine built by the Builders, not a weapon, used in the past.&lt;SEP&gt;An alternate name for the "Creation Furnace," a machine entangled by roots.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-54005507f5db05a1431064ea9db88caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597d9b4d5a0e43e3628da07ccc535c03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eacd315ae5f95c55d189019b4d765b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7</data>
