    <node id="大门">
      <data key="d0">大门</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">大门是希儿和三月七试图通过的障碍，可能与能源中枢有关。&lt;SEP&gt;The main gate of the Divination Commission is locked, which is unusual.&lt;SEP&gt;大门(Front door) is a locked door encountered during the journey, later used as an exit point.&lt;SEP&gt;大门is the door that is tightly closed, blocking access.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-048b0dd3c3bc2cae0be82ff708452623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d79ed550ca1869c633e5ee3153e644d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e324df5f5fbf95c7405c125ff8a660d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbf1e080f7d2432c571b42ae8fc7291c</data>
