      <data key="d2">缆车道操作员is a cable car operator in the upper level who was previously stuck in the mines and now resumes duty, referring to the protagonists as saviors of the underworld.&lt;SEP&gt;The cable car operator is a worker who resumes passenger cable car service after a decade-long lockdown of the Underworld.</data>
