      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">自由is the newfound state of being that residents of the lower zone will experience after the blockade ends.&lt;SEP&gt;砂金希望通过与星期日的谈判赢回自由，这是他的核心目标之一。&lt;SEP&gt;自由is a concept representing people's awakening from the dream in Penacony, as observed by瓦尔特.</data>
