    <node id="托帕">
      <data key="d0">托帕</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Topaz (托帕) is a character and an employee of the Interastral Peace Corporation (星际和平公司), who leads a work group in Penacony and interacts with the Star Rail crew. She is a member of the organization known as the "Stoneheart Ten" (石心十人), and her personal "Cornerstone" (基石) is named "Topaz" (黄玉), which was once mistakenly confiscated in place of Aventurine's. Topaz is involved in business dealings with Aventurine (砂金), offering commentary on his style and luck. She is observed bringing bad news to a group and discusses the nature of transactions and the significance of which side of the table one sits on. While staying at the White Day Dream Hotel in Penacony, Topaz is being monitored by the hunting dog family. She notes the fading of the Aventurine's light, linking it to a certain outcome, and acknowledges that she lacks information on two specific cases, prompting her to ask everyone to continue investigating. Topaz maintains a friendly attitude towards her partners and is under surveillance by others.&lt;SEP&gt;托帕is a member of the Strategic Investment Department of the Interstellar Peace Company who announces the company's decision regarding Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;托帕(Topaz)是石心十人成员)，与翡翠一起负责余下事务的安排。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4eacd315ae5f95c55d189019b4d765b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282520995832324abf63454ecad3f3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aef888c83a56efa55bc6bdac956ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd4110dd8b2ec1a3d4e9ee703131d0f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b5b57107ecdd0adb6ee1dfe96f3f1bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2867a0c8f2055442e0179842efc7f30e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6b4da45b5db96356b86865d457909d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b13f1d619b99829ec04b15c537d259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a26e6722285ef522993b41004a8fb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a5c4612ea2ec33740c626cf9067e70</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
