    <node id="停云">
      <data key="d0">停云</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Tingyun (停云) is a Foxian (狐人) woman who serves as a 接渡使 (Ferryman) and reception envoy for the Sky-Faring Commission (天舶司) on the Xianzhou Luofu. In her official capacity, she guides merchants and travelers, most notably the Astral Express crew, acting as a bridge between the Nameless and the Xianzhou Alliance. She is characterized by a polite, slightly teasing, and businesslike manner with fast-paced formal speech. As a Foxian, she possesses distinctive fox-like features, including a tail. Her duties include presenting reports to the Tianshi Caucus, explaining local phenomena such as artificial weather and chaos caused by the Stellaron, and offering to lead visitors to see the Master of Skies, Yukong. She is also a merchant who travels extensively along trade routes and is noted as a significant client of several shops. Tingyun is knowledgeable about the faction "药王秘传" (Yaowang Secret Arts) and its history, and she comments on the nature of immortality and the power of the Arbor. She participates in specific missions, such as helping to arrest Kafka by borrowing the tracking device "谛听" (Diting) from the Artisanship Commission.

However, a critical deception is part of her story. The "Tingyun" who appeared beside the Trailblazer was later revealed to be an assumed identity used by 幻胧 (Huanlong), a Lord Ravager from the Antimatter Legion. This 幻胧 was described as vicious and cruel, intended to disturb the mind. While the true 接渡使 girl may have been replaced or killed, this impersonation led to the Trailblazer and March 7th’s team actively searching for the real Tingyun. After 幻胧's true form was revealed, Tingyun disappeared and is widely presumed to have been killed. Her fate is discussed by her Foxian peers and other characters, and her belongings, including a gift left for a rival named 岩明, are being sorted. Despite her presumed death, she is also remembered as a traveling merchant who promised to find new tea varieties for 梦茗 and offered suggestions for improving tea drinks.&lt;SEP&gt;停云was a member of the Sky-Faring Commission and a colleague of驭空. She is believed to have been impersonated by a Lord Ravager from the Antimatter Legion.&lt;SEP&gt;停云is a character from the Sky-Faring Commission whom驭空vows to remember and avenge if harmed.&lt;SEP&gt;停云is a deceased Foxian merchant who was a subordinate and trusted ally of驭空. She prepared gifts for colleagues before her death.&lt;SEP&gt;停云is a character who gave a cleaver to Yan Cui and is associated with the "Minghuo" merchant group.&lt;SEP&gt;停云(狐人少女)是天舶司的成员，因罗浮灾变平息后接使命要远行，未能在场接受礼物。&lt;SEP&gt;停云是仙舟角色，驭空计划调查她进入仙舟前的遭遇。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33140787e65f36d03a2cf1fe766a0e3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c992f8ca9cbe3142dda05033f0b52e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc36253f91faca1d058d7b1f373af715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e80256f6b29768c5cfabe6c8af4d081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd1ac3b2477b33ac600764c2339c9761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08335684ed867f94f55ddc89bffdc37f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a08a4c1f5ae941cbe079fc5aaa48a0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-544588bbd1f1f8ebb82fb1b9ebe83ee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59e7b46d077b5255996c168af8643d8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7823732295dacca3169a4fdc0d9b7a6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43623aa0b2e27c60a1de27a0205f0f63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5652d718e4ea5e4dc648511456987b2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbab5d9a926ed72d8916642b162a156f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8dd3179cc07be6652a8a064b6cefde1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8be339ef38fbeb8d499020c4475c7402&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6e390686a60c1282db4fe45d6c892f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d36361cb146b22a7c168a9c43edca56d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c824b5ac58cbd20424e35d07f01abf7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deed5fb02763ec38f8b148679259b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b69d30c7d3a7f454ed932719bcad47b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb481f872f6ed8d0d115bc183be81f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f8fa3030c9f0e45dc58488cd8c0b0b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f3368332ddd4f4c2f6a0dfe0a4ae48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd64d36e6f165af69ecd014e8024b7c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-801b6775c66f961e277ab9395c3b5a96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b761f7975a148b7f60b9118ff40d2789&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df8b5bd13b0c402afd43298bddf26cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89401ac7b3d1c2b401bcf8e7944f69bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa7e8c23cf3710b65c0a4d1a58f9cc03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e44ecf966c6560c7f086afff655868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9742ce4eb1971ba77904fc0e1868746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e9b4a06f02fe7c6cb62ff7b9a3d56cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0f25ff767eb93fbf9b6c961acfd724&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e67f27ee470faa07599b85ba409e78c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1945f8514165034735bd89e91cd1b9e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47555a254b36325300969067b357d5ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1172e16aec5fcaed74cebbab925fca42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42cb7b6c602a4d11cb2e76505dd012c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fc6126d0155a7c411f4068a66d7ddca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c28a8b577c86813ea10762e546e4fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f278bd20ddab6f42665b46012b517f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc2240f2b9c03c7ee20a149da420ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be9865cd0a314577e84980b2a240b82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cc6ee9954920e7d6473573d551d2e86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b7a2ef5ad35a519d5ca57d50fdc1f32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e573422bf2b97f952b6e576d9a40c404&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c0d83d786126b007971332b2266ae95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c2bf1856c9246afe262f7402bdbfdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-073fe1b65d2e4f5e017ed008c73c5311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e47a0efebc7ceac09127ceb2083c2301</data>
