    <node id="驭空">
      <data key="d0">驭空</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Yu Kong (also known as Yukong) is a high-ranking official on the Xianzhou Luofu, serving as the Master of the Skies (Celestial Master) and leader of the Sky-Faring Commission (天舶司). She is a figure of authority within the Commission, with the power to authorize missions and delegate tasks, such as assigning Tingyun to receive guests. Initially, she is perceived as repressive or difficult, having refused the Astral Express crew’s offer to help with the Stellaron and questioned their involvement, stating that Xianzhou’s internal affairs are not for outsiders. Despite this, she later provides full assistance to the crew, sharing intelligence and resources, and offers accommodations billed to the Commission. She also represents the Xianzhou Luofu in signing mutual trade agreements with the Interastral Peace Corporation.

Yu Kong is also a former elite Cloud Knight pilot, now responsible for the security of the Luofu. She struggles with past war trauma, but realizes she is still needed. She is grieving the apparent loss of her colleague, Tingyun, and is organizing a funeral ritual for her, using some of Tingyun’s items in the memorial ceremony. She coordinates ceremonies and asks participants to return after completing tasks. Her character is complex, with a noted “delinquent girl” past, suggesting a rebellious background. Fu Xuan also entrusts the Astral Express crew to deliver items to Yu Kong.&lt;SEP&gt;驭空(天舶司司舵)代表天舶司向开拓者一行送上祝福，希望他们旅途顺利，并期待未来能再返罗浮仙舟。&lt;SEP&gt;驭空是天舶司角色，参与奠仪并计划调查停云的遭遇。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33140787e65f36d03a2cf1fe766a0e3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c992f8ca9cbe3142dda05033f0b52e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e80256f6b29768c5cfabe6c8af4d081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd1ac3b2477b33ac600764c2339c9761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7823732295dacca3169a4fdc0d9b7a6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43623aa0b2e27c60a1de27a0205f0f63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8dd3179cc07be6652a8a064b6cefde1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6e390686a60c1282db4fe45d6c892f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd64d36e6f165af69ecd014e8024b7c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-801b6775c66f961e277ab9395c3b5a96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1172e16aec5fcaed74cebbab925fca42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc2240f2b9c03c7ee20a149da420ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08266cb02a66740e7f80f5e88aa54b8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cc6ee9954920e7d6473573d551d2e86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e83981232e76e1d9782f0427096c325c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c0d83d786126b007971332b2266ae95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c2bf1856c9246afe262f7402bdbfdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d200c73d981b852fa64a6901ad64129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6812b272464cfa07676db3909d99535&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e47a0efebc7ceac09127ceb2083c2301</data>
