      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">星穹列车是开拓者所在的列车组，完成开拓任务并感谢开拓者和三月七的贡献。&lt;SEP&gt;星穹列车is the faction to which三月七, 姬子, and开拓者belong, and they are exploring Penacony and investigating the Watchmaker.</data>
