    <node id="航线会议">
      <data key="d0">航线会议</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">航线会议是星穹列车团队决定下一站目的地的会议。&lt;SEP&gt;航线会议is a meeting on the train regarding the route, which the crew is called to attend.&lt;SEP&gt;The route meeting is a discussion held in the Observation Car to plan the next journey.&lt;SEP&gt;The Route Conference is a meeting held on the Astral Express to decide the next destination through voting.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63dc2a8cef74048f287c7e0648930116&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3b928a611b55c5851f3bf1cdc2b0d93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66cf67fcb2b367fc8c70e85c70acc6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e038997304f6b48259a70927a3be53</data>
