    </node>
    <node id="酒馆">
      <data key="d0">酒馆</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">酒馆is a location where桑博's siblings gather, and he sends greetings to them.&lt;SEP&gt;The Tavern, a faction whose members Aventurine references.&lt;SEP&gt;酒馆is a place that has invited砂金and is the origin of the Fool faction.&lt;SEP&gt;A faction mentioned, home to the "Fools", a group active in Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;酒馆是加拉赫工作的地方，也是调饮发生的场景。&lt;SEP&gt;The酒馆is an organization that invited砂金, implying an affiliation with the欢愉path.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0bdbb076d9f126977e13238c0f114dd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee043452b079db75e92301d147036f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-119c7196661ead67f3283cc47c1aa976&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3428cb608b39b27cf65390b499a0173e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-415c7bdbfc0ac0348c2f17ccb1d95aa7</data>
