      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="恩公">
      <data key="d0">恩公</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">恩公 is a term of respect and address used primarily by the characters Yukong and Tingyun (停云) within the context of the Xianzhou Luofu. Yukong uses it to refer to the Trailblazer and their companions, signifying them as honored guests. More frequently, Tingyun uses "恩公" to address the Trailblazer, the main protagonist and captain of the Astral Express, as well as their companions whom she is guiding. The term indicates a relationship that is both respectful and familiar, used by Tingyun for the unnamed guests she assists on their mission. Overall, "恩公" serves as a respectful title for the Trailblazer and their group, acknowledging their status and the assistance they provide.&lt;SEP&gt;"恩公" is a respectful term used by停云to address the Trailblazer, likening them to a heroic imperial censor.&lt;SEP&gt;恩公is a term used by幻胧to address the player character, indicating familiarity or mockery.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cd1ac3b2477b33ac600764c2339c9761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08335684ed867f94f55ddc89bffdc37f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59e7b46d077b5255996c168af8643d8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8be339ef38fbeb8d499020c4475c7402&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f3368332ddd4f4c2f6a0dfe0a4ae48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-801b6775c66f961e277ab9395c3b5a96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9742ce4eb1971ba77904fc0e1868746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-263cab5cd67fef338242acaf5a013942</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778833372</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="仙舟罗浮">
      <data key="d0">仙舟罗浮</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">仙舟罗浮是仙舟联盟的一艘，是当前事件发生的主要地点。&lt;SEP&gt;仙舟罗浮是仙舟联盟的舰船之一，目前正经历封锁和战乱，建木重生引发危机。&lt;SEP&gt;仙舟罗浮is the specific Xianzhou where长乐天, 星槎海, and金人巷are located.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-94c423af9b3a1e7696ea7c8396c60833&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86afcf1d5b41644aabd32c7cbee164cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64341e8c7e20847211eae6769982882f</data>
