      <data key="d0">岚</data>
      <data key="d1">aeon</data>
      <data key="d2">岚是巡猎星神，仙舟联盟被其所追逐。&lt;SEP&gt;岚is the aeon of the Hunt, also known as帝弓司命.&lt;SEP&gt;岚(Lan) is the Aeon of the Hunt, who is said to always walk the path of "巡猎" (The Hunt).</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-807438542660c564cc6c45c1235307a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb475440db80c353fd6762c87c12548</data>
