    <node id="列车长">
      <data key="d0">列车长</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">列车长is the train conductor who would complain if the group delays the departure.&lt;SEP&gt;列车长is a title for the train conductor, who requested the crew's presence at the line meeting.&lt;SEP&gt;A title for Pam, the Conductor of the Astral Express, whose authority is noted by the crew in their conversation.&lt;SEP&gt;列车长is the conductor of the Astral Express, also referred to as帕姆, whom三月七wants to bring gifts for.&lt;SEP&gt;The Conductor of the Astral Express, who is preparing for the next journey.&lt;SEP&gt;The Conductor (likely Pom-Pom) is a character who asked the crew to gather information about certain Nameless explorers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-af804fb1bf95b8cfffcbb33654822b1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3b928a611b55c5851f3bf1cdc2b0d93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55386d63b94eb9742f952f3f22848dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e021fc26775ae86ae4a8fa4b4a74a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8540d7e0e81fe2169489850051f5cdd</data>
