    <node id="彦卿">
      <data key="d0">彦卿</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">彦卿（Yanqing）是《崩坏：星穹铁道》中仙舟罗浮的一位年轻、天赋异禀的云骑剑士和剑术大师。他性格好战，渴望获得“剑首”称号，对战斗充满热情，尤其急于与星核猎手（如刃）交战。彦卿对景元将军忠心耿耿，服从其命令，并曾提醒将军在奠仪后休息。他曾尝试在云骑士卒面前逮捕刃和丹恒，并与丹恒有过正面交手，事后仍想再次较量，但担心丹恒会生气。彦卿对开拓者（主角）的剑术表示敬佩，并寻求指导，以进一步提升自己的剑技。作为仙舟罗浮的年轻剑客，彦卿在战斗中展现出顽强斗志，是一位颇具潜力的剑术新星。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c3b928a611b55c5851f3bf1cdc2b0d93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8dd3179cc07be6652a8a064b6cefde1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-232b4fb1b400fc9168a697506bccf527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86afcf1d5b41644aabd32c7cbee164cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ecf17482a3d194b8f2226acc4dfad00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e47a0efebc7ceac09127ceb2083c2301</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778835403</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="将军">
      <data key="d0">将军</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The "将军" (General) is a high-ranking military and administrative leadership position within the Xianzhou Alliance. The most prominent figure associated with this title is Jing Yuan, the General of the Xianzhou Luofu. As the highest military authority on the Luofu, the General is a powerful leader comparable to Emanators of Destruction, responsible for resolving major threats, maintaining order, and giving orders to subordinates such as Yanqing and the Cloud Knights. He has entrusted officials like Fu Xuan with critical tasks and has directly involved the Artisanship Commission in investigating mysterious sounds. The General also made the strategic decision to seek outside help against the Den of Thieves and provided information that there were traitors within the丹鼎司 (Alchemy Commission). He is a figure who believes there are traitors in that department and, while far away and unable to help directly, requested aid and commanded figures such as Tingyun to accompany the group. More broadly, "将军" refers to the six generals of the Xianzhou Alliance, all of whom hold similar high-ranking status and formidable power. Jing Yuan is specifically referenced as expecting Huanlong and is a character whose attack caused destruction, showcasing his power as an Emanator. Additionally, the General is a role that invited outsiders as guests and is also depicted as a fictional character who raises questions about royal protection and confrontation.&lt;SEP&gt;将军是一位军事指挥官，应丹恒的结盟玉兆之邀前来解围。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c3b928a611b55c5851f3bf1cdc2b0d93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6e390686a60c1282db4fe45d6c892f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deed5fb02763ec38f8b148679259b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5c30624adbe5e5d9ad4c03419838c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd64d36e6f165af69ecd014e8024b7c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-184e0755b006a40e8337e9d9c49cc56a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aec7e92881b8561c64f206d873044d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd9f10a536cdbcda90740d8d4674e15d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca2fde817826f962ed055501ca3dd274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0f25ff767eb93fbf9b6c961acfd724&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47555a254b36325300969067b357d5ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1172e16aec5fcaed74cebbab925fca42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f9194e1080efdf8689a47d84993d492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144698bffcc884ba074327b0c9548848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2c085436fa6bf983aab02ecf8df5b37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3070df1abcaa1544f3ddc70bfbcafb06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fecb71ee2401bfdf2be56be0fc3835d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b9e8302300ff54dabbffc9bcf5f0204</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
