    <node id="匹诺康尼">
      <data key="d0">匹诺康尼</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Penacony (匹诺康尼), also known as the "Land of the Dreams," "Festival Star," "Eternal Joyful Penacony," "City of Dreams," "Planet of Festivities," and "盛会之星," is a major cosmic location and the primary setting for the game's Penacony storyline. Originally an interstellar prison planet used by the Interstellar Peace Corporation to exile criminals during a desolate era of chaotic dreams, it was later transformed into a golden metropolis and a celebrated vacation destination. This planet-wide, genuine dreamscape is built within the Memoria Domain, blending reality and fantasy, and divides into at least twelve independent dreamscapes, including the commercial hub "Golden Hour," Dream Town, Aiden Park, and the Dreamscape Hotel. Some visions depict it as a desolate, sandy wasteland—an unreal paradise.

Governed by the powerful Family faction, including five great families like the Oak, Hound, and Iris families, Penacony offers an escape from reality to enjoy happiness and comfortable sleep. It hosts events like the Harmonious Choir Grand Ceremony and is the epicenter of the Asdana Stellaron Crisis, currently in danger due to a Stellaron with its dream built on sacrifice. Anomalies like the nightmare entity "Death," disappearance cases, and internal family disputes have occurred. It is the setting for key events, including the mystery of the Clockmaker's legacy, where Sunday planned to create a "paradise" of Order, believing Penacony's plight could not be saved by Harmony. The protagonist, a minor celebrity here, along with characters like the Trailblazer and March 7th, face its complex situation, ultimately revealing it as a dream world that cannot eliminate real-life troubles and pains, merely providing an escape. Penacony is ultimately saved by the faction represented by the Trailblazer, who intends to awaken it from its dream state, resolving the conflict between Order and freedom. Its history, evolving from a border prison to a free paradise and then a Family territory, is explored through pre-shows and the past of the Aeons. Figures like Ragwark Charles Mikhail considered it a land with no path forward; within its dreams, Mikhail's vision of Penacony belongs to the path of 「Trailblaze」 rather than 「Order」, and the Family's Harmonious path is believed to be mixed with impurities. The planet is also the location of negotiations between the Family and the IPC during reconstruction, with characters like Jade arriving, noting that its inner ring can only see the "Anying Eagle Constellation" during the intersection of spring and summer.&lt;SEP&gt;Penacony is a previous destination of the Astral Express, where the events of the "Penacony trip" took place.&lt;SEP&gt;匹诺康尼(Penacony) is the location where the "Order"'s dream took place and the setting of the events.</data>
