    <node id="十王司">
      <data key="d0">十王司</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">十王司 (Ten-Lords Commission) is a Xianzhou judicial, enforcement, and management body. It is primarily responsible for dealing with Mara-struck individuals (those afflicted by the Mara), typically intervening when the situation becomes dire. As a long-life management organization, it oversees the passage of the Xianzhou's long-lived inhabitants, managing life, death, and the fate of the Mara-struck. The commission employs various agents, including mechanical judges like雪衣, and is involved in significant tasks such as conducting inspections at鳞渊境regarding the建木's seal and managing names and jade tokens of fallen Xianzhou warriors. It also has the authority to make decisions regarding public record, such as the removal of丹恒's name from public visibility. In essence, 十王司 is a key faction on the Xianzhou that governs the unique challenges posed by its long-lived populace.&lt;SEP&gt;十王司is an authority on the Xianzhou that sought to destroy丹恒after丹枫's crimes, ultimately overseeing the forced scale-shedding.&lt;SEP&gt;Ten Lords' Commission is a faction responsible for managing the passage of the Xianzhou's long-lived inhabitants.&lt;SEP&gt;十王司is the Ten-Lords Commission of the Xianzhou, which reviews officials.&lt;SEP&gt;十王司是仙舟联盟的司法与审判机构，景元及六御需应对其审查。&lt;SEP&gt;The Ten Lords Commission is an authoritative body that issued the decree to pardon Dan Heng's exile.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e950cd2284a42010147f1d1b6048c439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff8688e06b168deefda3fe220f725865&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b031b1b4ab5aae362aa1180ca1fab1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc2240f2b9c03c7ee20a149da420ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be9865cd0a314577e84980b2a240b82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144698bffcc884ba074327b0c9548848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95189fee74f326831efd9da16d00b815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e46541e08f2deadbb702b1360ecd537</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778834164</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="丹鼎司">
      <data key="d0">丹鼎司</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">丹鼎司 (Alchemy Commission) is a critical department and specific location or realm on the Xianzhou Luofu, and one of the six commissions of the entire Xianzhou Alliance. As the primary medical and alchemical branch of the Luofu, it is responsible for deploying physicians and overseeing treatment during crises, and it serves as the workplace and place of origin for the Dragon Lady, Bailu. This commission is located near the seal of the "Ambrosial Arbor" (建木), making it a key destination for investigations. In this context, the Divine Foresight General, Jing Yuan, has planned operations in this realm. Historically, the Alchemy Commission played a pivotal role in transforming the Xianzhou natives into long-lived species (长生种) by researching technology derived from the Ambrosial Arbor, but excessive research eventually led to turmoil. In more recent events, the Commission has been suspected of and, in some cases, confirmed to be involved in internal betrayals. The "药王秘传" (Disciples of Sanctus Medicus) has carried out a rebellion from within this location, leading to its sealing. Consequently, the area is considered dangerous, with Cloud Knights actively gathering there to address the crisis.&lt;SEP&gt;The Alchemy Commission is a department on the Xianzhou Luofu, which is a destination for the crew as per the General's request.&lt;SEP&gt;The Alchemy Commission, the intended destination the group is trying to reach via a shortcut.&lt;SEP&gt;丹鼎司is the alchemy department of the Xianzhou Luofu, the crew's intended destination.&lt;SEP&gt;The Alchemy Commission of the Xianzhou Luofu, where the Yaoqing Medicine Sect is hiding.&lt;SEP&gt;丹鼎司原本掌握“仙道”，在建木被斫断后衰落，成为药王秘传的温床。&lt;SEP&gt;丹鼎司is the Alchemy Commission of the Xianzhou Luofu, implicated in the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus conspiracy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-447076830112aeb99cde7bcf43070ce1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5c30624adbe5e5d9ad4c03419838c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e950cd2284a42010147f1d1b6048c439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b761f7975a148b7f60b9118ff40d2789&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df8b5bd13b0c402afd43298bddf26cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89401ac7b3d1c2b401bcf8e7944f69bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e44ecf966c6560c7f086afff655868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd9f10a536cdbcda90740d8d4674e15d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39ee06bafb842d307b13ed54ad7ab232&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca2fde817826f962ed055501ca3dd274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56f9050ddaba5533f393398440a8cfd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a32218a257d7f9a168428513c60be25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47555a254b36325300969067b357d5ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f99f516c83f852e030149192dc355f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
