    <node id="家族">
      <data key="d0">家族</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Family (家族) is the primary governing and ruling faction of Penacony, acting as the planet's actual administrator under the principles of Harmony. Composed of five distinct bloodlines or houses—including the Oak, Cypress, and Iris houses—it is responsible for creating, maintaining, and overseeing the entire Dreamscape, including regions like Golden Hour. The Family took over the former prison colony of Penacony, created the Dreamscape with the Watchmaker before breaking away, and invited other factions to the first Charmony Festival, which it continues to host. Its duties encompass developing the dream world, ensuring safety, taming sentient objects, managing guest accommodations, enforcing strict immigration procedures, and recruiting artists and architects.

The Family is led by the "Dreammaster" and notable members include Sunday, who represents the Family in interrogations, and Gopherwood, a former member who later became the Dreammaster of Penacony. While the Family uses the power of Harmony to build barriers and isolate concepts like death, multiple indications suggest it hides secrets, including concealing that the Dreamscape is sinking or experiencing anomalies. It is suspected by Sam and Firefly of hiding "death," burying the truth, and attempting to cover up murder within the Dreamscape. The Family is accused of preparing a stand-in for Sunday, with its corruption described as deeply rooted, and is targeted by the Interastral Peace Corporation and investigated by the Nameless and the Company. It manages forbidden areas, controls access to the Grand Theater, and denies invitations to the Galaxy Rangers, while its members are accused of having impure intentions toward Harmony.&lt;SEP&gt;家族是匹诺康尼的统治势力，逐步将流放之地变为自己的属地。&lt;SEP&gt;The Family is a faction in Penacony, now disavowing Sunday and the Order remnants as rebels, labeling the event an internal rebellion.&lt;SEP&gt;The Family is the faction that governs Penacony, which the company agrees to support unconditionally in reconstruction.&lt;SEP&gt;家族(Family)是匹诺康尼的统治派系，翡翠石被送入家族驻地。&lt;SEP&gt;The "家族" (Family) is an organization hosting a grand and extravagant dream that the Trailblazer has fully experienced.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbaaefa57c77ce66db9f587ea1d3d757&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66cf67fcb2b367fc8c70e85c70acc6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d200c73d981b852fa64a6901ad64129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20dddf19eb9d23402675b17b25d6b7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1a1c7c7cdd2117231c2128f98f9f367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c90fd6acf76e3b3f7415a285235acc48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057807b41b216391fb3264dc438854b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0a70a6406ad3789553b939ba9a7d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e50467af689c6df6aabbc4058a5858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39191a57b86d0c36329b9779dc5a8995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f417d6e4dfdd365b59a413fbb957fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a98a1c1a689b396bfb11efe6ce17aa85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-617dce04e03da6f4182367ac28a4339a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5179dc00e5d44a2c504e7041b8bb948e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c523f6ef00ca7019dac0f61aca7d59f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa5aa8e08ea7c3effd4b7bef1b6f636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b247ac5f089f87433ccf835725c1e41e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee043452b079db75e92301d147036f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd54298969c8e9076bcb5f00cec55b5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-119c7196661ead67f3283cc47c1aa976&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce6adaabd8f6d85314cbea559ce01a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b85937e6bc111bb0516718814af5cb90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94b36a60fd2207123b5e9971b8727478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-410f71ecf8e49938b81e964a9399bc3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-397cb05512c9c527d5b3c213e7dbc9b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59980cf920354512f617e41b955d0a8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-704fd94705176c5d8b7902f98a6e3b69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24565d6d66fd343d204ca6ee232d3fb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a111bfaa2097692df9de2c4cee43b80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a07d8ef325346821827a8cabce8be9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-729906f69b0dc31b866284fec42bd817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-083647d174927add1aefc63655ec615b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d063d42a7d57ae6c56275f1aaaa1ec8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4006787ff76d5227d6ce51fce241de65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03be2219947057675dc5055c09116ccc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7a59509484c