    <node id="花火">
      <data key="d0">花火</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">花火（Sparkle）是一位擅长欺诈与幻术的假面愚者，她潜入匹诺康尼，以玩弄他人和留下礼物为乐。花火曾袭击开拓者，并在故事中假扮成桑博，导致开拓者和流萤坠入稚子的梦。她还假扮星期日（Sunday）的妹妹，用嘲讽的方式提出帮助他。花火与砂金（被称为“小孔雀”）进行互动，提供隐晦的建议和一个“同归于尽”装置，并声称“沉默的”身份已不再适用于知更鸟（Robin），因为后者已死亡。花火同意按下按钮为说话者放烟花的承诺。作为一位善于欺诈的角色，花火也提醒其他人在现实与想象之间做出区分。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59980cf920354512f617e41b955d0a8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-083647d174927add1aefc63655ec615b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2d249f7bcbd0b19ddb847f1301c1021&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39d2c739f8e0853297665a283cb117d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9530d64790c372ec3c8746d7998106a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea958dd07fcb944ce792ebb1149ed1b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5952867e688ef54311e49d8a4f3f4ad2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779101201</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="药王秘传">
      <data key="d0">药王秘传</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Disciples of Sanctus Medicus, known as 药王秘传, is a secret and long-standing organization within the仙舟联盟 that serves as a dangerous internal threat to仙舟罗浮. They are a faction of叛教者, originating from the丹鼎司, who worship the Aeon of Abundance, 药师 (also called寿瘟祸祖). Their primary goal is to subvert the Alliance's rules on immortality and restore the power of the Abundance and the divine tree,建木. The organization has been a hidden threat for millennia, collaborating with external forces like the军团 to incite rebellion. After abandoning a century of潜伏, they launched a large-scale rebellion in conjuction with the建木's rebirth. Their plotting tactics included mixing elixirs that induce魔阴身 into the mist of洞天, thereby disrupting the云骑军's morale and transforming soldiers into monsters, as well as planting星核 into洞天 to cause further chaos. Although they succeeded in封锁丹鼎司, the Disciples were ultimately defeated by the云骑军, who view them as dangerous madmen.&lt;SEP&gt;药王秘传is a faction on the Xianzhou Luofu manipulated by幻胧to execute the Stellaron plot.&lt;SEP&gt;药王秘传试图让建木重生，并与反物质军团合作获取星核，引发叛乱。&lt;SEP&gt;药王秘传is a faction that has confidence in the power of the Ambrosial Arbor.&lt;SEP&gt;药王秘传is a faction on the Xianzhou Luofu that venerates the Abundance.&lt;SEP&gt;药王秘传is a faction on the Xianzhou Luofu associated with the Alchemy Commission's cults.&lt;SEP&gt;药王秘传是仙舟罗浮上的一个组织，其老大是丹枢，被小孩们视为可怕的存在。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df8b5bd13b0c402afd43298bddf26cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd9f10a536cdbcda90740d8d4674e15d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9742ce4eb1971ba77904fc0e1868746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e4a3e89257a68f05fa5998ec94e48c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca2fde817826f962ed055501ca3dd274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56f9050ddaba5533f393398440a8cfd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e67f27ee470faa07599b85ba409e78c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1172e16aec5fcaed74cebbab925fca42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c28a8b577c86813ea10762e546e4fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44856396e630f7b48e968e5becd820f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86afcf1d5b41644aabd32c7cbee164cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f9194e1080efdf8689a47d84993d492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95189fee74f326831efd9da16d00b815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96e31031793443da0fe2823c4c28cae2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ecf17482a3d194b8f2226acc4dfad00</data>
