    <node id="工造司">
      <data key="d0">工造司</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">工造司 (Artisanship Commission) is a highly significant and complex entity on the Xianzhou Luofu, functioning as both a major faction and a critical organization. As a faction, it serves as the primary administrative and governance body for specific regions, including authority over facilities like Huixing Port. It possesses the Creation Furnace and is renowned as the central workshop, forge, and mechanical arts district of the Luofu, responsible for creating sophisticated mechanical devices, inventions, and advanced technologies like Yùzhào engineering and the tracking device "谛听" (Dìtīng). It is a location of strategic importance, historically accessed by shortcut routes or skiff. Due to the catastrophic Stellaron erosion and the rampage of the Jianmu (建木), the entire district has been shut down and sealed, ceasing its vital industrial operations. In addition to its shutdown, the area suffered a major incident when a dangerous plant disaster broke out, trapping people inside, which confused their progress. The Commission is also notably affiliated with characters like 公输师傅, who claims it as his own group and suggests it can provide help.&lt;SEP&gt;工造司是仙舟「罗浮」中的一个机构，专精于机关术和武器研制，曾受云骑军委托研制武器。&lt;SEP&gt;工造司is an organization whose territory has been mostly cleared of the Jianmu's roots.&lt;SEP&gt;工造司是仙舟罗浮的机构，公输师傅在此工作。&lt;SEP&gt;工造司是罗浮仙舟的工匠机构，在经历事件后由公输师傅负责重建。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59e7b46d077b5255996c168af8643d8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8be339ef38fbeb8d499020c4475c7402&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6e390686a60c1282db4fe45d6c892f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e950cd2284a42010147f1d1b6048c439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89401ac7b3d1c2b401bcf8e7944f69bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db1a6716eb95924fce53acec168f822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa7e8c23cf3710b65c0a4d1a58f9cc03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7226238e34da823949aab509aaac80e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e9b4a06f02fe7c6cb62ff7b9a3d56cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca2fde817826f962ed055501ca3dd274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1945f8514165034735bd89e91cd1b9e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47555a254b36325300969067b357d5ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a32218a257d7f9a168428513c60be25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f99f516c83f852e030149192dc355f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f278bd20ddab6f42665b46012b517f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8496abee5a579ddcf1430e6d8a381dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee709ee6223dbebd15d8b80e4cdae7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6812b272464cfa07676db3909d99535</data>
