    <node id="欢愉">
      <data key="d0">欢愉</data>
      <data key="d1">path</data>
      <data key="d2">欢愉is a path known as elation.&lt;SEP&gt;欢愉(Elation) is a path or concept referenced by the Trailblazer, describing the journey as joyous.&lt;SEP&gt;欢愉is a path or power that represents joy and happiness, which砂金had an opportunity to embrace.&lt;SEP&gt;欢愉是其中一条命途，波提欧曾遇到一位欢愉令使。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39191a57b86d0c36329b9779dc5a8995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-415c7bdbfc0ac0348c2f17ccb1d95aa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19f5f030dc583660b802b079e3f709e1</data>
