    <node id="阿格莱雅">
      <data key="d0">阿格莱雅</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">阿格莱雅is a character known as the tailor and knight commander.&lt;SEP&gt;Aglaea is titled the "Idolatress of Glory" and seeks to summon the "Undying Mydeimos."</data>
