    <node id="苏乐达">
      <data key="d0">苏乐达</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">苏乐达（SoulGlad）是一个知名的汽水品牌，起源于匹诺康尼。该品牌最初源于监狱时期的苏萨水，后经艾迪恩改进并推广，成为广受欢迎的饮品。苏乐达在匹诺康尼的梦境中由苜蓿草家系允许生产和销售，并且常被描绘为甜梦般的味道。它曾被姬子推荐给瓦尔特，也被筑梦师提及作为灵感缺乏的可能原因。此外，角色砂金曾回忆自己过量饮用苏乐达。尽管苏乐达是流行品牌，但在某些特定酒吧并不出售。&lt;SEP&gt;苏乐达is a type of drink not served at舒翁's惊梦酒吧.&lt;SEP&gt;Soda is a drink in the dream, considered the essence of the dream by波奇, linked to the "Soda Demon".&lt;SEP&gt;苏乐达是匹诺康尼的一种象征性饮料，别名「瓶中美梦」，比苏萨水更甜，比美梦糖浆更苦。&lt;SEP&gt;苏乐达是一种饮料，加拉赫认为喝醉的人才会发神经。&lt;SEP&gt;苏乐达是苏乐达™有限公司的产品，在动作派考验中作为竞争对手出现，带有植入广告性质。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1a1c7c7cdd2117231c2128f98f9f367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39191a57b86d0c36329b9779dc5a8995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9b2a1a2685fcbb48ffa0db4ab228ace&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a38591012debae0e68f3582f3cacd5a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff27003d40cef9e5eea6b05a7803810c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-622a56b244419f3133bcd4b11feb44f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-319ffb461ba5f8c9e0f44cd7237080b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3428cb608b39b27cf65390b499a0173e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b13f1d619b99829ec04b15c537d259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80b3d00e921a34b33dce9e546b244084</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016832</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="折纸小鸟">
      <data key="d0">折纸小鸟</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">折纸小鸟are characters known as origami birds.&lt;SEP&gt;折纸小鸟(Origami Bird) is one of Pocketwatch's friends who helps protect Dreamtown Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;折纸小鸟is a folded paper bird given to米哈伊尔for protection.&lt;SEP&gt;折纸小鸟is a character who comments on the end of the beautiful dream.&lt;SEP&gt;折纸小鸟is a crease bird that got stuck in a tail and sought help; it acquired a part of the puzzle clock's inner workings.&lt;SEP&gt;折纸小鸟are paper bird creatures that form a large family of siblings, serving as crew members on the "Compass" and are friends with Misha and Clockie.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fa14e2cd405ae0ca7c60547e2d8750c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4f1aef42316b27a74ccb75b8cd295cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-192d4c65dacdd377abc5e38c2529132e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fd6207caebf601e2aad532ccfd66dd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edd454eefe538364064b11caeeed6aad</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069696</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="白日梦酒店">
      <data key="d0">白日梦酒店</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">白日梦酒店（The Grand Hotel for Daydreams），又称“白日梦酒店”Dreamscape hotel，是位于匹诺康尼（Penacony）的一家知名酒店。该酒店连接着匹诺康尼的现实与梦境，为来自银河系各地的宾客提供房间以及梦境沉浸服务。它不仅是一个提供度假体验和服务的场所，也是剧情中角色们办理入住并因房间分配而产生困惑邂逅的地点。在故事中，酒店正在经历翻新，这给客人带来了不便，但酒店本身仍被视为一个享有盛誉的场所，主角的房间就位于此处。此外，米沙在该酒店工作，共同为宾客营造梦幻的住宿环境。&lt;SEP&gt;白日梦酒店是匹诺康尼的著名酒店，正在修缮中。&lt;SEP&gt;白日梦酒店(Daydream Hotel) is a location described as a familiar and safe place for the protagonist, serving as the "real world" they have returned to.&lt;SEP&gt;白日梦酒店是匹诺康尼的一家堂皇酒店，案件发生的地点，怪物死于此处，不速之客从大堂一侧进入并向深处前进。&lt;SEP&gt;The hotel where Topaz is being monitored by the hunting dog family during their stay in Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;白日梦酒店是匹诺康尼的堂皇酒店，也是梦境酒店。&lt;SEP&gt;白日梦酒店是匹诺康尼的一个地点，开拓者在这里遇到了米沙并与砂金发生冲突。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc9103f99ee3d74873921f4d8a2534f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15b6e6e158da99c33381e80ff7783a9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-088541780cd6898348a852107a2583cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-057807b41b216391fb3264dc438854b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0a70a6406ad3789553b939ba9a7d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1c5225a08fcc8c681d02f077d4dde16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a16fedfe3f508b11cdff3673766a2c3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aace89d765824c111aa44dc26aee7e88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43256708d2e397fb5f52dc7939871b39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b5b57107ecdd0adb6ee1dfe96f3f1bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76afa09c20cb3ce18cbeba034f2526a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea958dd07fcb944ce792ebb1149ed1b7</data>
