    <node id="石头老板">
      <data key="d0">石头老板</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">石头老板 is a character portrayed as a large crocodile and a primary antagonist within the narrative of "小小哈努行动" and the setting of美梦小镇. He is a villainous figure who leads a group of other villains, and his schemes include using a strange device to shrink哈努兄弟, capturing and taunting them before being eventually defeated. In美梦小镇, he is considered the biggest villain, described as greedy and wanting to drive away the townspeople to monopolize valuable stone materials, thereby harming the town's harmony. He is also a moody, fearsome troublemaker who seeks treasure and intends to return to美梦小镇. Additionally, it is noted by石头老板 that哈努兄弟 will only end up in one place across all times.&lt;SEP&gt;石头老板是《小小哈努行动》中的反派角色，集结战舰准备进攻美梦小镇。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5611e840a75b01108d00f49d206e97a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9103d4503305e761c1839744485d9bf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-984f2b2c81711f4d1b45fc906d20a6b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfa9fb5844d8ca25fdcdcdb908866300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21dfe803f1b69867a83cc9b8e912e4d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-192d4c65dacdd377abc5e38c2529132e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03ebfa7ecf0c4900fef7960e9a636783&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-519002bb5791c29026085e92f1f99620</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016799</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="钟表匠">
      <data key="d0">钟表匠</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Watchmaker, also known as the Clockmaker, is a legendary figure central to the history and secrets of Penacony. He is referred to as the "Father of Penacony" for his role in constructing its dream world and is the original inspiration for the character "Clockwork Boy," having been a clock shop apprentice in his youth who dreamed of broken clocks growing limbs. The Watchmaker was a guest of the Astral Express and the first and last Nameless of Penacony, leading the pioneers in liberating the prison, building the dream, and participating in Penacony's war of independence. Initially, he cooperated with the Family to develop Penacony but later fell out with them, becoming their traitor and ultimately dying in obscurity. This made him a target of vengeance for figures like Sunday. He was also the true master of Gallagher and an old friend of Aventurine, and his legacy constitutes the true secret of Penacony's dream, connected to its mysterious dripping clock and ticking sounds. He summoned the Dreamchasers to Penacony but did not grant them direct success; he was also a film tycoon who wrote screenplays about Penacony's pioneering era. The Watchmaker created the legendary dream bubble "Mikhail's Sleep." The name "Watchmaker" represents a legacy that can only be passed to one person, suggesting the title can be inherited. He is also known as Mikhail, with the full name Lagwork Charles Mikhail, who claimed "the Watchmaker is the Nameless." The Watchmaker sent invitations to various parties, included knights, and was used by the Family as a figurehead to invite Pathstriders to remain in Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;钟表匠是加拉赫所提到的一个相关情报人物。&lt;SEP&gt;钟表匠is an identity associated with米沙, as revealed by黑天鹅.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1a1c7c7cdd2117231c2128f98f9f367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0a70a6406ad3789553b939ba9a7d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-825953bbddc81f456bf53ec3b5e18e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b85937e6bc111bb0516718814af5cb90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-704fd94705176c5d8b7902f98a6e3b69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-083647d174927add1aefc63655ec615b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2539c79e7b103e6c4fb2a5bb7901dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f230a74b3af82c685045831898f3ea6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcc40b65a49e0c9b6e746474d3eeb7b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-981eb877163a6b386e5d40eb1f7edddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21d69e5d473598eccb1e77a81726c583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dceb88ab2e44d48a689d3dca587728e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18bb9d37a8fed7eab8d5cba8f123f61d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23d4778f839d2a1eac66e3c79c7e10e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b13f1d619b99829ec04b15c537d259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ebbbf7bf5819ee830ffd02c3c6f9d34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24216adb3550f4039e3373041f9f3067&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c93d548b2a01ac78c4534185b1c50d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2eae7f1df6bd3eadca41c1db5167225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53c7f48036990ccca5a5b48e0fe82a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ba3b6dae092d55950f9ddb961ea479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a53c00b399a52fdff3f15122ca9284aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-943144073634dd9204a02a1a6cd56046&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c72500fd19b3d31361401b01307328e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79dd695a476e6e11c893e09fcf2268ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-225b9ab801f101967ba46c6705f68054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56989daaebf06ae7dc0a54da8f088146&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76f30cea7751c5e1cdb8b78f14fea91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3757b3a184b0e258bec874c72a3bf9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80b3d00e921a34b33dce9e546b244084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3dac2b0b58dede9fc2d9238e6c559d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b926f3dee50d8c90e7dd10c60b966773&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0120d6441f2644ee546f500398f26838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e64c4e33d4c17b896fbd12e80f65658f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3b2df6c7c464d907afd4da6f5f01960&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92b7f5f4dc623665b5e5c7330c0b5c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edd454eefe538364064b11caeeed6aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c86e4e8873e665dc85fecd7c393c16c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba76ab4009be3694fc20bec3980fef08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea958dd07fcb944ce792ebb1149ed1b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-620e245cd9df09d58b2231e7fff3bf19</data>
