    <node id="黑天鹅">
      <data key="d0">黑天鹅</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">黑天鹅，也被称为黑天鹅小姐，是来自流光忆庭(Garden of Recollection)的忆者(Memokeeper)和收藏家。她精通在忆域(Memory Zone)中行动，能够利用特殊方法穿越梦境空间、捕捉他人思想并窥见梦境的中心，甚至穿过墙壁。她拥有读取和重建记忆的能力，能够从记忆碎片中重现场景，并让死者“开口说话”，这使她成为一位观察者、分析师和向导。她对记忆流动中的异常非常敏感，能够感知忆质的流向，精通梦泡操作。她也是一位占卜师，并在脑海中筹划涉及流浪者、猎人等的计谋。

在匹诺康尼的剧情中，黑天鹅是关键角色。她受邀参与家族盛会，并向星穹列车的无名客解释梦境真相，赞赏开拓者(NICKNAME)在记忆方面的天赋。她曾协助调查“死亡”事件，提醒开拓者与黄泉保持距离。她测试了砂金所展示记忆的真伪，暗示更深层的阴谋。她与黄泉及开拓者在忆域中相遇，并策划将开拓者带至某人面前。在开拓者从梦中醒来时给予关照，并向流萤自我介绍为忆者并提供帮助。她曾从星穹列车组员处得知流萤情况。后来，她引导某人离开酒店并赠予告别礼物，提及有私人事务要处理一位巡海游侠。她联系波提欧并安排在星穹列车会面。她陪同黄泉会见其他人，并向丹恒讲述斯卡曼德洛斯星故事提及“寰宇蝗灾”等历史事件。她从“齐响诗班”中拯救团队，并致力于收集独特记忆，尽管其言语有时带有诱导性。此外，黑天鹅请求与星穹列车组同行，并与姬子有事商谈。她揭示米沙的真实身份为“钟表匠”，并解释其作为忆域迷因的本质。她曾描述人生如一座蜿蜒的迷宫，唯有记忆留存。&lt;SEP&gt;黑天鹅is a mysterious figure who uses a "空光锥" to observe and record memories. She is particularly interested in the memories of the Trailblazer, believing them to be unique and capable of reflecting the future of the universe.&lt;SEP&gt;Black Swan is a Remembrancer who is present on the Astral Express, stating that this is normal for a Remembrancer.&lt;SEP&gt;黑天鹅is a character who holds memories related to the interlocutor and uses them for divination.&lt;SEP&gt;Black Swan is a character who has an appointment with a Mourning Actor at the "Sapphire Belt" Patrevinizia, is interested in the Trailblazer's memories, and can sense emotions.&lt;SEP&gt;黑天鹅is an experienced memory teller (忆者) who was affected by the "Order" and fell into illusions. She provided information about the "Order"'s plan to the protagonist.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-397cb05512c9c527d5b3c213e7dbc9b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e324df5f5fbf95c7405c125ff8a660d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59980cf920354512f617e41b955d0a8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e36ecd5f447474c560cdbdcdd2e7783b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aace89d765824c111aa44dc26aee7e88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba8ea9656978b4e19fcc42dec8ec2cc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-704fd94705176c5d8b7902f98a6e3b69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24565d6d66fd343d204ca6ee232d3fb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a111bfaa2097692df9de2c4cee43b80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e054224ab31732b118e4e211ff9c592b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-decf73ec6ca6190de19732c8d1e452cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f224a52938afe06f7dc4abae08d7f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a85593df517a24f90624d6d6d8ce60fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44b1268c29f322dda94efbb954a2bab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59833388a41f82904090db562befcc88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43256708d2e397fb5f52dc7939871b39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b3042cb485fcff761368d2fa08b2f5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a07d8ef325346821827a8cabce8be9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62881e327fa555c1113cdf9c14505837&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-729906f69b0dc31b866284fec42bd817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c011e090ca9129d5dd9e7a0c357dfcff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-083647d174927add1aefc63655ec615b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41a99864b87ae5c7c8eb089ea4a5b9d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2539c79e7b103e6c4fb2a5bb7901dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d063d42a7d57ae6c56275f1aaaa1ec8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ccc378859a917598c9851df3b46abc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a930d2ce58da41c1260cc2977c4d9da1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5954e37f4e86a5288abe3c27ceaf4ef9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f230a74b3af82c685045831898f3ea6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff5381ef14c0174d6621bf098b92d840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a014c948b270f74369d5227c7fc80c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c99e6308cd56f22b4ce44dda6f0ec62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f273e249d48375fe4ce18df04b167906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35e08651f12dc11859015c2a39d1939f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-473a36d80be8d1101b3f94e63e6f01c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aef888c83a56efa55bc6bdac956ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56bf05d342e60a2ae1c0004ed755f892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7525f63d21e345e0134731209482201d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb475440db80c353fd6762c87c12548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba76ab4009be3694fc20bec3980fef08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fecb71ee2401bfdf2be56be0fc3835d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e038997304f6b48259a70927a3be53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eafccb4855b4210dcf8ae59537a1eb77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a26e6722285ef522993b41004a8fb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea958dd07fcb944ce792ebb1149ed1b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1f7faf4930e00b263ca759277579820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5952867e688ef54311e49d8a4f3f4ad2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-620e245cd9df09d58b2231e7fff3bf19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b169536dd073e8b85cff97e7e4637fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f8169ffa75dde27fa9703c4f216c7b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d235d876b6479c8e730e06da624342e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ced452746c325133a3a01ca4ffe26f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-950f3c9663f4eaa9cf5cef2539e2ff52</data>
