    <node id="建木">
      <data key="d0">建木</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">建木 (Jianmu/Ambrosial Arbor) is a legendary divine tree located on the Xianzhou "罗浮" (Luofu). It is an ancient remnant left by the Aeon of Abundance (药师), possessing the power to shape life, conquer death, and grant immortality. The tree’s material is tough and metallic, and it has its own will, enabling movement and destruction. After being cut down in a great war by the Aeon of the Hunt (帝弓司命), its roots remained tangled and never truly died. For millennia, the tree was sealed within the reality fragment of 鳞渊境 (Scalegorge Waterscape) by the Dragon Lord and the Vidyadhara (持明族), who imprisoned it in their homeland to strictly limit its growth.

建木 was once the core of the 丹鼎司 (Alchemy Commission)'s research into longevity and technology. This research ultimately led to the "魔阴身" (Mara-struck) condition and the rebellion of the "药王秘传" (Disciples of Sanctus Medicus). The tree was reborn due to a "星核" (Stellar Core) being planted at its roots, making it a significant focal point of conflicts on the Luofu. Its encroachment has worsened erosion phenomena, caused ecological imbalance, and damaged areas such as the 工造司 (Artisanship Commission), threatening the Creation Furnace (造化洪炉). The Lord Ravager 幻胧 (Phantylia) plans to taint the reborn tree with the power of Abundance to destroy the Xianzhou. Accessing the sealed pathway to the tree requires the power of 丹恒 (Dan Heng). Despite being resealed and currently kept in a static, safe state due to controlled growth, the tree remains deeply connected to ongoing rebellions and the conflict with Phantylia, symbolizing the persistent threat of Abundance on the Luofu.&lt;SEP&gt;建木is a tree on the Xianzhou Luofu that has revived, posing a major threat.&lt;SEP&gt;建木(永寿神木/不死树)是仙舟上的神木，与重大事件相关，其事务需要六御合议才能决定。&lt;SEP&gt;建木是永寿神木，是姬子提到的壮丽景观之一。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f8fa3030c9f0e45dc58488cd8c0b0b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b761f7975a148b7f60b9118ff40d2789&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df8b5bd13b0c402afd43298bddf26cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89401ac7b3d1c2b401bcf8e7944f69bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e44ecf966c6560c7f086afff655868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd9f10a536cdbcda90740d8d4674e15d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7226238e34da823949aab509aaac80e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e9b4a06f02fe7c6cb62ff7b9a3d56cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca2fde817826f962ed055501ca3dd274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c496b9a280b1526dbcd2f69583d665af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1945f8514165034735bd89e91cd1b9e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47555a254b36325300969067b357d5ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a32218a257d7f9a168428513c60be25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f99f516c83f852e030149192dc355f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1172e16aec5fcaed74cebbab925fca42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42cb7b6c602a4d11cb2e76505dd012c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fc6126d0155a7c411f4068a66d7ddca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c28a8b577c86813ea10762e546e4fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8496abee5a579ddcf1430e6d8a381dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c96d885f6a65cadc94f79df95313f0ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86afcf1d5b41644aabd32c7cbee164cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f9194e1080efdf8689a47d84993d492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be9865cd0a314577e84980b2a240b82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144698bffcc884ba074327b0c9548848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95189fee74f326831efd9da16d00b815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e52e7c11d199f5688f182681811f4a43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-329c1b97983307d60a3541156156882f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fecec594c1525b37f11626500aba76a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72ad4c06466fbf815a6a26d890c9e825&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e155b8c8b6fc544d325bbcc9a2da81bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60ca28562fdbf0a819105efc79ad4cce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96e31031793443da0fe2823c4c28cae2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee709ee6223dbebd15d8b80e4cdae7e</data>
