    <node id="同谐">
      <data key="d0">同谐</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Harmony (同谐) is a fundamental Path in the universe of Honkai: Star Rail, primarily followed and represented by the Aeon Xipe (希佩). It serves as the core ideology and power system for the Family (家族), the major faction in the Penacony region, with the sharing of harmonious joy as their supreme goal. The Harmony is used to maintain order and protect the dream world, invoked during events like the Harmonious Chant Ceremony (谐乐大典) in the form of the "Choir of Harmony." Practically, it tunes the dreamscape substance known as 忆质 (Memory Matter) and provides a security matrix constructed by the Dreamweavers, backing the Family's claim of safety. The Harmony can be channeled for adaptation, communication, and even interrogation; for example, Robin (知更鸟) produced sound through its resonance after losing her voice, and Sunday (星期日) used it to force Aventurine (砂金) to tell the truth. It was also used for religious baptisms and imprisonment, and being branded a traitor to the Harmony carries severe consequences.

The Harmony is a philosophy emphasizing harmony and equality, but it is also described as manipulating human weaknesses and having been betrayed by Penacony, which turned the region into an illusory "Festival Star." The path is inclusive but will expel guests for Penacony's peace, and it does not accommodate the way of Huangquan. According to suggestions from Welt (瓦尔特), its essence may have been altered by external factors. Notably, the Harmony has already consumed and integrated the "Order" (秩序) Path. However, Sunday believes the Harmony is insufficient to save Penacony's plight or rescue the weak. Aventurine suspects the Harmony may be a deliberate plot behind events in Penacony, and a distinct voice in his head, which dismisses being a "newborn of the Harmony," suggests something related to but separate from the path. The Harmony is also a path or journey that Robin is considering or embarking on, as questioned by Sunday, and is the path that Sunday and Robin both follow, emphasizing aiding the weak with strength, though this concept was challenged during the story. Ultimately, the Harmony is the path underlying the existing order of Penacony, and Sunday planned to usurp its authority. In the context of the Harmonious Chant Ceremony, it became an object of usurpation and fusion.&lt;SEP&gt;同谐是改变匹诺康尼的力量，但被姬子视为与过去的压迫者无异的做法。&lt;SEP&gt;同谐是一位星神，其到来使匹诺康尼从流放之地转变为盛会之星，带来正面与负面变化。&lt;SEP&gt;同谐是希佩所代表的命途，其瞥视与开拓的传承产生共鸣。&lt;SEP&gt;同谐is a concept or path mentioned as a blessing and source of light.&lt;SEP&gt;同谐(Harmony) is a Path whose authority was being usurped by Sunday to revive the "Order".&lt;SEP&gt;同谐(God of Harmony) is the deity whose authority was being challenged.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66cf67fcb2b367fc8c70e85c70acc6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d200c73d981b852fa64a6901ad64129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e50467af689c6df6aabbc4058a5858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a98a1c1a689b396bfb11efe6ce17aa85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03be2219947057675dc5055c09116ccc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff5381ef14c0174d6621bf098b92d840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aea80432a137f815124bb7fadd3b0383&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-009c79711483e2ca1c076c720ae3e662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19fa917549ed487883ffc4d2270cc5d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0a3dbfcfd8b95ff234089961fba702&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-981eb877163a6b386e5d40eb1f7edddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-319ffb461ba5f8c9e0f44cd7237080b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18bb9d37a8fed7eab8d5cba8f123f61d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee77b88c86c938c0967cd2eb1ef92ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5386db4a801d2d7223330ecc84710a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23d4778f839d2a1eac66e3c79c7e10e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef3b6681f2925e2c81851592c3ba8372&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24216adb3550f4039e3373041f9f3067&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-745ef3f5cddfa7a86e439825e5de4a96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53c7f48036990ccca5a5b48e0fe82a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ba3b6dae092d55950f9ddb961ea479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11db0eebf350de4c9c9bbf8188cadf5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19f5f030dc583660b802b079e3f709e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d404ca122e5e26803146d6835398291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9530d64790c372ec3c8746d7998106a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28f44dbc7147eb695d2a84423677906c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-603ef2226ecb6b7032da6f1dbc06644f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-225b9ab801f101967ba46c6705f68054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54eac7c3e839691c079d25a3b921a4d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d81d7afd4e410e297a5351eee7eb9d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6762f27a4d20dfd610a1155d60e87b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa4f6559bb8c6fdf7a61d696bb98ea71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcadf281cd20b82436458f643f5099be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d8d43bcd5da9f1a53fc3bdb43750929&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba76ab4009be3694fc20bec3980fef08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c75592f96a4b5f7fcffc49d7d471d7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3889b67baa0c9d0549e50a6f4357f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f25c87c66c524f1eaa36bafc4c949cbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-900f45b839e44f78ea4e418b6d10c897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-634037196a7f2b333524f9f78739583e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-620e245cd9df09d58b2231e7fff3bf19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-950f3c9663f4eaa9cf5cef2539e2ff52</data>
