    <node id="不夜侯">
      <data key="d0">不夜侯</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">不夜侯is a location.&lt;SEP&gt;不夜侯is a location whose owner is being asked about.&lt;SEP&gt;A teahouse where A-Wang and A-Lai usually perform, currently closed due to Cloud Knight patrols.&lt;SEP&gt;不夜侯是仙舟罗浮上的一座港口茶馆，由梦茗经营。&lt;SEP&gt;不夜侯是仙舟罗浮的一个地点，作为店铺名称被印在一个盒子底部。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5652d718e4ea5e4dc648511456987b2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d36361cb146b22a7c168a9c43edca56d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b7a2ef5ad35a519d5ca57d50fdc1f32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5</data>
