    <node id="金人巷">
      <data key="d0">金人巷</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">金人巷is a location.&lt;SEP&gt;金人巷is a commercial street in Longle Sky known for its many restaurants and entertainment venues, attracting food enthusiasts.&lt;SEP&gt;金人巷is a location where the merchants, represented by燕翠, sent a gift.&lt;SEP&gt;金人巷is a location in the Xianzhou Luofu where "尚滋味" restaurant is situated.&lt;SEP&gt;金人巷是仙舟罗浮的一个地点，是「尚滋味」店铺的所在地。&lt;SEP&gt;金人巷是罗浮仙舟的一条著名街道，以丰富的小吃闻名，白露曾计划与开拓者一同前往。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64341e8c7e20847211eae6769982882f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c0d83d786126b007971332b2266ae95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-073fe1b65d2e4f5e017ed008c73c5311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6812b272464cfa07676db3909d99535</data>
