    <node id="苜蓿草家系">
      <data key="d0">苜蓿草家系</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">苜蓿草家系is a faction.&lt;SEP&gt;苜蓿草家系(Alfalfa Family) is a faction within Penacony that restricts beverage brands in pre-made dreams.&lt;SEP&gt;One of the five houses of Penacony, responsible for financial operations.&lt;SEP&gt;苜蓿草家系是匹诺康尼的五大家系之一，天环族仆从侍奉于此。&lt;SEP&gt;苜蓿草家系是匹诺康尼的七大家系之一，策划了“白色沙漠”事件，其家主意图投靠公司，后被长子弑杀。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39191a57b86d0c36329b9779dc5a8995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6b4da45b5db96356b86865d457909d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-225b9ab801f101967ba46c6705f68054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f25c87c66c524f1eaa36bafc4c949cbc</data>
