    <node id="忆域">
      <data key="d0">忆域</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">忆域 (Memory Zone) is the vast, perilous, and chaotic domain of memories, often described as a sea of memoria (忆质). This fluid realm underpins the constructed dreamscape of Penacony, which is but a single island within this ocean. The Memory Zone is deeply distorted and surreal, featuring environments like upside-down rooms and behaving like a children's playground for the Memokeepers. Within this space, real architectural structures lose meaning, and it is home to flowery wanderings, mimetic creatures, and specific memory imprints, such as those of Firefly.

This domain serves as the stage for all memories, including specific locations like Dreamflux Reef and Golden Hour that are built from dreams. Historically, the Asdana system experienced notable leaks from this zone, marking significant "Great Holes." The Memory Zone grants great advantages to Memokeepers, such as Black Swan, who is adept at traversing its dangers, sensing others through their accessories, and recovering forgotten information from within it. She has served as a guide for the Astral Express crew within this dream-like region. Characters like Gallagher have also used mysterious powers to hide within the Memory Zone. The domain is considered the home turf of memokeepers like Black Swan, and the Intelligentsia Guild and Genius Society intend to study it to aid Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;The "忆域" (Memory Zone) is a realm of memories, and from it, 黑天鹅gains insights about the Trailblazer's value and future.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66cf67fcb2b367fc8c70e85c70acc6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-397cb05512c9c527d5b3c213e7dbc9b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e324df5f5fbf95c7405c125ff8a660d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59980cf920354512f617e41b955d0a8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba8ea9656978b4e19fcc42dec8ec2cc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-704fd94705176c5d8b7902f98a6e3b69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24565d6d66fd343d204ca6ee232d3fb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-decf73ec6ca6190de19732c8d1e452cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43256708d2e397fb5f52dc7939871b39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b3042cb485fcff761368d2fa08b2f5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a07d8ef325346821827a8cabce8be9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62881e327fa555c1113cdf9c14505837&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2539c79e7b103e6c4fb2a5bb7901dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aef888c83a56efa55bc6bdac956ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23d4778f839d2a1eac66e3c79c7e10e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-170b9f7ee9a1a78769aaf22c6aa082e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ba3b6dae092d55950f9ddb961ea479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e64c4e33d4c17b896fbd12e80f65658f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fecb71ee2401bfdf2be56be0fc3835d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eafccb4855b4210dcf8ae59537a1eb77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a26e6722285ef522993b41004a8fb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b169536dd073e8b85cff97e7e4637fa</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
