    <node id="记忆">
      <data key="d0">记忆</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Remembrance (记忆) is a fundamental concept within the universe of "Honkai: Star Rail," functioning both as a Path and a domain of power. As a Path, Remembrance is followed by the Garden of Recollection, which seeks to resurrect dead worlds within a pure land of memory. It is also a Path for which the Trailblazer shows aptitude. Remembrance is personified as an Aeon worshipped by the Garden of Recollection. This power or domain is considered a suitable cradle, with Black Swan believing that the intersection of nightmares and beautiful dreams is a cradle of Remembrance.

In specific contexts, 记忆 is central to Fu Xuan's explanation of the causes of Mara-Struck, noting that the memory capacity of long-lived species is limited, leaving only the residue of pain and regret as their emotional thresholds wear away. Furthermore, 记忆 is a concept linked to Acheron's past experiences, which sometimes cause her to forget important matters. It is also a central theme that is investigated, manipulated, and sometimes erased.&lt;SEP&gt;记忆is a concept that黑天鹅states does not lie and is associated with the真实发生的现实.&lt;SEP&gt;记忆is a path associated with creating梦想之地without a星核.&lt;SEP&gt;记忆is a concept defined by黄泉as something created by the past that can bloom into meaning in the distant future.&lt;SEP&gt;记忆(Memory) is a core concept in黑天鹅's philosophy, described as a powerful force and a way to shape and remember the world.&lt;SEP&gt;记忆refers to the memories that黑天鹅holds related to the interlocutor, used for divination.&lt;SEP&gt;记忆(Memory) is the concept that holds the key to a chance of survival. The protagonist's "memory" allows them to see a path to escape the Order's dream.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d200c73d981b852fa64a6901ad64129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50324d9549c90d9f6834f20f38e5f8a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1e23bfd4bf1c77fb266c1fdef2619ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e324df5f5fbf95c7405c125ff8a660d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e36ecd5f447474c560cdbdcdd2e7783b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff5381ef14c0174d6621bf098b92d840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-473a36d80be8d1101b3f94e63e6f01c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53c7f48036990ccca5a5b48e0fe82a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5554caf63113cf1aae9ee5c4485624e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5952867e688ef54311e49d8a4f3f4ad2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b169536dd073e8b85cff97e7e4637fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f8169ffa75dde27fa9703c4f216c7b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-950f3c9663f4eaa9cf5cef2539e2ff52</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779101375</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="符玄">
      <data key="d0">符玄</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Fu Xuan (also known as "Divination Commissioner" or "Master Diviner") is a high-ranking official and the head of the Divination Commission (太卜司) on the Xianzhou Luofu, holding one of the key "Six Charioteers" positions. As a highly skilled professional diviner, she operates and maintains the "Poor Observation Array" (穷观阵) using complex algorithms, relying on divination as a core tool for intelligence, strategy, and leadership. Pragmatic, cautious, and logical, Fu Xuan is tasked by General Jing Yuan to command the Cloud Knights during crises such as the Stellaron disaster, and she reports events to other ships. She assigned tasks to subordinates like Qingque, directed the Nameless to the star skiff dock, and communicated with characters such as March 7th and Welt about procedures. Fu Xuan deduced that the target of the antagonist Huanlong was the Jianmu, aiming to destroy the Xianzhou, and she took custody of prisoners like Kafka for interrogation, though Kafka anticipated her arrival. She has investigated the secrets of the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus and discussed battle strategies. Fu Xuan also handles matters related to Tingyun, coordinates with the Sky-Faring Commission, and manages disaster aftermath, writing reports to the Xianzhou Alliance high command. Ambitious and strategic, she seeks to become the next general of the Luofu and has proposed a plan to use the Stellaron Hunters as bait. She admits intuition is also accurate and is frustrated by those deceiving the Xianzhou. Additionally, she knows old secrets of the Luofu and is curious about Dan Heng's reincarnation.&lt;SEP&gt;符玄是罗浮的太卜大人，并暂代将军之职，负责统计伤亡、追剿药王残党、向六御说明战况，以及感谢星穹列车的帮助。&lt;SEP&gt;符玄is a character who sent a battle report to驭空about the events of the war.&lt;SEP&gt;符玄is the Master Diviner who becomes the acting General of the Luofu.&lt;SEP&gt;符玄(太卜大人)是仙舟罗浮的太卜，正在履行将军职责，处理罗浮事务。&lt;SEP&gt;符玄(太卜大人)是罗浮仙舟的太卜，通过卜算得知开拓者会多次返回罗浮，因此简化道别，祝福对方旅途平安。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8dd3179cc07be6652a8a064b6cefde1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfa499fd86ee42508c05277c43a96c61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deed5fb02763ec38f8b148679259b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d79ed550ca1869c633e5ee3153e644d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd64d36e6f165af69ecd014e8024b7c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-184e0755b006a40e8337e9d9c49cc56a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b761f7975a148b7f60b9118ff40d2789&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b7f59f879256f855b57fd2b90f2f093&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3e68e248a108ebdbad18c906c7b760a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5341e4ccc7283969ac76c86061d28586&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df8b5bd13b0c402afd43298bddf26cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89401ac7b3d1c2b401bcf8e7944f69bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d71f2f56e13337663cff785e79fbb43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db1a6716eb95924fce53acec168f822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38d7d8ba8bfe5e69f41225515582546c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e44ecf966c6560c7f086afff655868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd9f10a536cdbcda90740d8d4674e15d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7226238e34da823949aab509aaac80e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9742ce4eb1971ba77904fc0e1868746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0f25ff767eb93fbf9b6c961acfd724&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e67f27ee470faa07599b85ba409e78c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f99f516c83f852e030149192dc355f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1172e16aec5fcaed74cebbab925fca42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42cb7b6c602a4d11cb2e76505dd012c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fc6126d0155a7c411f4068a66d7ddca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c28a8b577c86813ea10762e546e4fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44856396e630f7b48e968e5becd820f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c96d885f6a65cadc94f79df95313f0ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc2240f2b9c03c7ee20a149da420ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144698bffcc884ba074327b0c9548848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95189fee74f326831efd9da16d00b815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e573422bf2b97f952b6e576d9a40c404&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-329c1b97983307d60a3541156156882f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6812b272464c