    </node>
    <node id="米沙">
      <data key="d0">米沙</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Misha is a multifaceted character from *Honkai: Star Rail*, primarily associated with the dreamscape of Penacony. In one of his central roles, he works as a hotel bellhop and attendant at the "Daydream" Hotel, where he provides luggage service, welcomes guests, and guides visitors from the "Thoughts Gallery" towards the "Golden Hour." He performs these duties with a polite and apologetic demeanor, offering information about the nature of the Dreamscape. He is also depicted calling out to the Trailblazer from within a painting frame, hinting at a deeper connection. Misha is a friend of Pocketwatch (钟表小子), who is in danger and needs rescue, and he expresses gratitude to the Trailblazer for resolving crises. 

Additionally, Misha is a resident of Dreamflux Reef, where he acts as a guide, familiar with the area and its inhabitants, and plans to lead Walt and March 7th to meet Robin. He is also a member of the Astral Express crew, noted as a "little one" who wants to help during serious discussions. Misha struggles with memories of a place like a hotel with a fireplace and toy room, though he was raised in Dreamflux Reef, and is involved in helping recover memories, possibly related to the past of Mihail. He knows Mikhail as his grandfather and believes Mikhail is a navigator aboard the "Compass" who reached a new continent.

In another role, Misha is a boy who serves as the captain of the "Compass," partnering with Pocketwatch and the Mirror Lady (镜子小姐) in their search for a new continent within dreams. He was born from a dream bubble, making him essentially a "dream dweller" similar to a "Memetic Entity" from the Memory Zone. He also appears as a hotel doorman who has forgotten his mission as a guide. 

Furthermore, Misha is known as a nickname for Lagwork Charles Mikhail, referred to as "Little Misha," and is an individual encouraged by the "Navigator" Mikhail. In various excerpts, it is speculated that a mysterious fragment might be related to him.&lt;SEP&gt;米沙是拉格沃克•夏尔•米哈伊尔的别名，在对话中发表关于钟表指针和前进的言论。&lt;SEP&gt;米沙是白日梦酒店的门童，在故事中与开拓者相遇，并且其真相后来被揭露。&lt;SEP&gt;米沙is a character initially met at a hotel, later revealed by黑天鹅to be a memory zone meme and the "Watchmaker".&lt;SEP&gt;米沙is the "Watchmaker" and a memory zone meme.&lt;SEP&gt;Misha is a character mentioned as having a connection to the ocean planet Lushaka, being the hometown of both Misha and Mikhail.&lt;SEP&gt;米沙is a character who unexpectedly appears in the protagonist's dream, serving as a sign of the dream's imperfection (瑕疵).</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bac9ba1b5a1e229036d7433b40241a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc9103f99ee3d74873921f4d8a2534f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15b6e6e158da99c33381e80ff7783a9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c90fd6acf76e3b3f7415a285235acc48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0a70a6406ad3789553b939ba9a7d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-153395e9add5cada9e8eecae20e4cc5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fa14e2cd405ae0ca7c60547e2d8750c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-984f2b2c81711f4d1b45fc906d20a6b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfa9fb5844d8ca25fdcdcdb908866300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1e23bfd4bf1c77fb266c1fdef2619ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21dfe803f1b69867a83cc9b8e912e4d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-583e0d3ed8742499e962b6515d8043c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-170b9f7ee9a1a78769aaf22c6aa082e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53c7f48036990ccca5a5b48e0fe82a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ba3b6dae092d55950f9ddb961ea479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2f9568f3044cc0b8024fbb468793c90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b73a0cbe3c5a2f94efb6838682649be5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d899ecf6217a2890e183d5c4a5f6bc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fade5ce5717b1083491143af20df52aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e64c4e33d4c17b896fbd12e80f65658f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74d9be5bb22932287cf5a631b7386195&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3b2df6c7c464d907afd4da6f5f01960&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92b7f5f4dc623665b5e5c7330c0b5c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffa19e6c8f41788df56ba4b3dcb02a41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52733535a8d92067f786b9174c7caa23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edd454eefe538364064b11caeeed6aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa4f6559bb8c6fdf7a61d696bb98ea71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a4bb44dd906f564ea60408699af064c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2771ea026584f582e5aa13185baf31d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea958dd07fcb944ce792ebb1149ed1b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-620e245cd9df09d58b2231e7fff3bf19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d235d876b6479c8e730e06da624342e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-950f3c9663f4eaa9cf5cef2539e2ff52</data>
