    <node id="伊德莉拉">
      <data key="d0">伊德莉拉</data>
      <data key="d1">aeon</data>
      <data key="d2">伊德莉拉is the aeon of pure beauty.&lt;SEP&gt;伊德莉拉是纯美星神，已陨落。&lt;SEP&gt;伊德莉拉是纯美星神，被称为「纯美女神」，是银枝所信奉的神明。&lt;SEP&gt;Idrila the Beauty is the Aeon of Beauty, who ascended at the location of Melusteyn.</data>
