      <data key="d2">幽囚狱is a location.&lt;SEP&gt;幽囚狱是仙舟罗浮的机要之地，未被星核侵蚀。&lt;SEP&gt;The Shackling Prison is a detention facility on the Xianzhou Luofu where Yanqing threatens to take Dan Heng and Blade.</data>
