    <node id="波月古海">
      <data key="d0">波月古海</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">波月古海is a location.&lt;SEP&gt;波月古海是鳞渊境内的海域，与持明族蜕生轮回相关，曾洗尽丹枫的罪愆。&lt;SEP&gt;波月古海is the ancient sea where the Vidhyadhara's eggs molt and reincarnate.</data>
