    <node id="尚滋味">
      <data key="d0">尚滋味</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">尚滋味is a location, a restaurant.&lt;SEP&gt;尚滋味is a restaurant in the Golden Alley (金人巷), run by Yan Cui, known for dishes like "Spicy Braised Beef Offal".&lt;SEP&gt;尚滋味是位于仙舟罗浮金人巷的一家店铺，其广告出现在一把菜刀的刀匣里。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-073fe1b65d2e4f5e017ed008c73c5311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778834015</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="燕翠">
      <data key="d0">燕翠</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">燕翠is a character, the head chef of尚滋味.&lt;SEP&gt;燕翠is a character representing the Golden Theater merchants who gifted something to the Trailblazer.&lt;SEP&gt;燕翠is the chef and owner of "尚滋味" restaurant in the Golden Alley, known for her cooking philosophy and receiving a cleaver from Tingyun.&lt;SEP&gt;燕翠(老板娘)是「尚滋味」的主厨，为了感谢众人送礼物，提议当场做一道菜作为回礼。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c0d83d786126b007971332b2266ae95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-073fe1b65d2e4f5e017ed008c73c5311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778834021</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="谐乐大典">
      <data key="d0">谐乐大典</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Harmony Grand Ceremony (谐乐大典), also known as the Harmonious Ceremony or the Harmonious Choir Festival, is a major event held once per Amber Era on the planet Penacony, the "Star of Festivities." This grand celebration gathers followers of the Harmony path to pray for the universe's future and convey the Harmony of the Aeon, aiming to enhance galactic happiness and harmony. Organized by the Family (家族), the ceremony is hosted within a grand theater and anticipates the arrival of the "Choir of Harmony." Due to its great significance and the large crowds it attracts, it prompts heightened security concerns and causes local hotels to become overcrowded. The Family's internal focus on the ceremony surpasses attention given to incidents involving "death," and its preparation requires a significant amount of manpower. Because of the ceremony's imminence, the Family feels compelled to conceal the truth about the dreamscape. The mimetic dream technology was originally planned to debut there. Key figures involved include Sunday, who served as the host, and Robin, who was invited as the lead female singer, though she ultimately chose to abandon the event. The ceremony follows a pre-scripted play and is an upcoming event where champions of the Hot Sand Ceremony are expected to appear. It is suspected that the ceremony could be used to broadcast the power of a Stellaron through song, and some believe its true purpose is to usurp and fuse the powers of "Harmony" and "Order." According to Sparkle, the Harmony Grand Ceremony can no longer be held as planned, as it could be used to destroy Harmony, and the group seeks to stop the upcoming event. Some groups have noted the anticipated incoming Harmony Grand Ceremony, remarking on the empty theater as poor box office.&lt;SEP&gt;谐乐大典是即将在匹诺康尼大剧院开幕的典礼，事关星核、匹诺康尼和银河的未来。&lt;SEP&gt;The Harmony Grand Ceremony is a key event in Penacony that Sunday and Robin are implicated in.&lt;SEP&gt;谐乐大典是故事中发生的重大事件，主角一行人在这里与星期日一决生死。&lt;SEP&gt;谐乐大典(Harmony Grand Ceremony) was the event during which Sunday usurped the authority of the "Choir of Chords".</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d200c73d981b852fa64a6901ad64129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20dddf19eb9d23402675b17b25d6b7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-088541780cd6898348a852107a2583cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10a9a57ca0c7078de0765d59816cccd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a98a1c1a689b396bfb11efe6ce17aa85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-119c7196661ead67f3283cc47c1aa976&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59980cf920354512f617e41b955d0a8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-083647d174927add1aefc63655ec615b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f273e249d48375fe4ce18df04b167906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aef888c83a56efa55bc6bdac956ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c77346cce3c3448fb8ecdb4640cd7f32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcc40b65a49e0c9b6e746474d3eeb7b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b13f1d619b99829ec04b15c537d259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae9b4cc1fecad7f9f71968041c2edbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5fc4bdb0dd2b9ee973fa3d6b9e49199&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cfbc268760ea4bc489027077a7b65a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8665828cdd81643c13114451e6ade3fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-399e9f5b95e2162b7f5074dcec92103a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9530d64790c372ec3c8746d7998106a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b893a9163e9decf898e6a47789d69c6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-603ef2226ecb6b7032da6f1dbc06644f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d11ce896bd7f1b7e87c79e1a7cf7dabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c8183406d2a4bc03402423db5c4a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3757b3a184b0e258bec874c72a3bf9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ab104d64e9eb410cea34464f76c33a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54eac7c3e839691c079d25a3b921a4d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d8d43bcd5da9f1a53fc3bdb43750929&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba76ab4009be3694fc20bec3980fef08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cca95c43061171ec0f9a64327c928c33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c75592f96a4b5f7fcffc49d7d471d7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3889b67baa0c9d0549e50a6f4357f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b8ec337371f5734c56c3df5468f8089&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-634037196a7f2b333524f9f78739583e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bef71ea9725559b5e05574558cbcec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea958dd07fcb944ce792ebb1149ed1b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-950f3c9663f4e