    <node id="猎犬家系">
      <data key="d0">猎犬家系</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Bloodhound Family (猎犬家系) is a constituent sub-faction and one of the five great families (五大家系) within the larger Family organization governing the planet Penacony. Its primary responsibility is to maintain security and order, particularly within the Dreamscape and the hotel environment. This includes overseeing hotel security data, managing records of the入梦池 (Dreamscape pools), handling cases, detaining stowaways and fugitives, as well as pursuing and monitoring specific individuals. The faction notably attempted to capture a figure known as the "钟表匠" (Watchmaker) but was unsuccessful. The Bloodhound Family is led by a治安官 (Security Chief), a position represented by Gallagher, who has provided assistance to external parties like Acheron in tracking wanted criminals and has been consulted for information by figures such as Welt. The family is also responsible for sealing off locations like the克劳克影视乐园 (Clock Studios Theme Park) and for heavily punishing any disrespectful behavior towards guests.&lt;SEP&gt;猎犬家系是匹诺康尼的五大家系之一，负责维护治安和秩序。&lt;SEP&gt;猎犬家系是匹诺康尼的家族之一，负责管理治安，追捕偷渡犯。&lt;SEP&gt;猎犬家系是匹诺康尼的一个家系，负责治安和驱逐罪犯，他们负责处理偷渡客并执行驱逐。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10a9a57ca0c7078de0765d59816cccd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f417d6e4dfdd365b59a413fbb957fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa5aa8e08ea7c3effd4b7bef1b6f636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21dfe803f1b69867a83cc9b8e912e4d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce6adaabd8f6d85314cbea559ce01a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-704fd94705176c5d8b7902f98a6e3b69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-729906f69b0dc31b866284fec42bd817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2539c79e7b103e6c4fb2a5bb7901dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff5381ef14c0174d6621bf098b92d840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3be5af5a5f63df24c11126cb1e24505d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aef888c83a56efa55bc6bdac956ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b5b57107ecdd0adb6ee1dfe96f3f1bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-981eb877163a6b386e5d40eb1f7edddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14ef88ed231842823bf1bb0651d40e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6b4da45b5db96356b86865d457909d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18bb9d37a8fed7eab8d5cba8f123f61d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1e25533bb02e085267257087f8cfab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5fc4bdb0dd2b9ee973fa3d6b9e49199&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-225b9ab801f101967ba46c6705f68054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32d2a4d85dd65814c67bee4806ee1d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c8183406d2a4bc03402423db5c4a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ded3035b9d576152c6b6ec854c5ffeed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1853bbf4383b790ff8a8b2d27d966ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa4f6559bb8c6fdf7a61d696bb98ea71</data>
