    </node>
    <node id="筑梦师">
      <data key="d0">筑梦师</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">筑梦师is a character, a dreamweaver.&lt;SEP&gt;筑梦师is a character experiencing frustration and a creative block, working on a project involving emotions.&lt;SEP&gt;筑梦师is a team formed by家族, composed of artists, architects, and scholars, tasked with weaving the dreams of匹诺康尼.&lt;SEP&gt;筑梦师是一位正在调试表盘的工匠，突然想到一个绝妙的点子并决定立即复现。&lt;SEP&gt;筑梦师是匹诺康尼的造梦者之一，情绪烦躁。&lt;SEP&gt;筑梦师(Dreamweavers) are professionals who link their thoughts to build an unbreakable defensive line that safeguards the dreamscape.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a38591012debae0e68f3582f3cacd5a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd54298969c8e9076bcb5f00cec55b5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1a9f4aad7204cea18125f77f6e84118&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce6adaabd8f6d85314cbea559ce01a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff5381ef14c0174d6621bf098b92d840</data>
