    <node id="白露">
      <data key="d0">白露</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">白露，又称龙女大人或衔药龙女，是《崩坏：星穹铁道》世界观中的一名角色。她是丹鼎司的正牌医士，也是仙舟罗浮上当代持明龙尊的继任者，尽管外表是一个小女孩，却肩负着重要的头衔。白露诞生并蜕生于水，自那以后便开始研习医道，为患者提供专家门诊服务，并擅长以非常规的方法安抚病人，性格活泼好客。她向往离开罗浮，曾与开拓者约定一起溜出去游玩，她了解许多好吃的小店，并承诺为开拓者免费诊治，还曾邀请对方一同前往金人巷品尝小吃。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-447076830112aeb99cde7bcf43070ce1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5c30624adbe5e5d9ad4c03419838c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e52e7c11d199f5688f182681811f4a43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee709ee6223dbebd15d8b80e4cdae7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ecf17482a3d194b8f2226acc4dfad00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6812b272464cfa07676db3909d99535</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778835329</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="镜流">
      <data key="d0">镜流</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">镜流is a character known as Jingliu.&lt;SEP&gt;Jingliu was a legendary sword master of the Xianzhou Luofu and a member of the High-Cloud Quintet who went mad with Mara, and she taught Yanqing his signature sword technique.&lt;SEP&gt;镜流is a former swordsmaster of the Xianzhou who opposes Jing Yuan to destroy Abundance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-232b4fb1b400fc9168a697506bccf527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2</data>
