    <node id="雪衣">
      <data key="d0">雪衣</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">雪衣is a character known as a judge.&lt;SEP&gt;雪衣is a character who observes and comments on unusual phenomena.&lt;SEP&gt;雪衣is a mechanical judge (偃偶判官) of the Ten Lords' Commission (十王司) who is on a mission to capture the Stellaron Hunter (星核猎手).&lt;SEP&gt;雪衣is a judge acting as a messenger for the Ten Lords' Commission, who delivers news of the war's aftermath.&lt;SEP&gt;雪衣is a judge acting as a messenger for the Ten Lords' Commission, who delivers news of the war's aftermath.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cee72ad52e1d632ea45449aff61bfd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b031b1b4ab5aae362aa1180ca1fab1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc2240f2b9c03c7ee20a149da420ca0</data>
