    <node id="银枝">
      <data key="d0">银枝</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">银枝is a character, a knight of purity.&lt;SEP&gt;银枝是纯美骑士团的骑士，信奉纯美女神伊德莉拉，在巨星巅峰战中挑战开拓者和流萤。&lt;SEP&gt;Argenti is a character from the Knights of Beauty who appears as a contestant and discusses aesthetics with the Trailblazer.&lt;SEP&gt;Argenti is a character from the Knights of Beauty who appears as a contestant and discusses aesthetics with the Trailblazer.&lt;SEP&gt;银枝(Argenti)是纯美骑士)，帮助砂金全身而退，挖掘流梦礁的真相。</data>
