    <node id="大毫">
      <data key="d0">大毫</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">大毫is a character, the immortal Daha.&lt;SEP&gt;大毫是地衡司的人，从天舶司的朋友那里听说将军请来了几位客人，试图邀请开拓者前往地衡司公廨一叙。&lt;SEP&gt;大毫is an official from地衡司(Ground Transport Department) who coordinates personnel and invites the protagonists to a meeting.&lt;SEP&gt;Da Hao is a character who reminds the Trailblazer about how they once dealt with a Marastruck individual and mentions the Dragon Lady, Bailu.</data>
