    <node id="帝弓司命">
      <data key="d0">帝弓司命</data>
      <data key="d1">aeon</data>
      <data key="d2">帝弓司命is the aeons of the Hunt.&lt;SEP&gt;帝弓司命是巡猎星神，护佑仙舟。&lt;SEP&gt;帝弓司命是巡猎星神。&lt;SEP&gt;帝弓司命是岚的神名，曾在数千年前斫断建木。&lt;SEP&gt;帝弓司命is the Aeon of the Hunt, also known as Lan, the Xianzhou's patron deity.</data>
