    <node id="幻胧">
      <data key="d0">幻胧</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">幻胧 is a character from the game Honkai: Star Rail, identified as a "绝灭大君" (Lord of Extinction or Lord Ravager) who serves the Aeon 纳努克 (Nanook) of Destruction. 

As an Emanator of Destruction from the Antimatter Legion, 幻胧 enjoys causing destruction, the downfall of souls, and internal collapse. She uses her own illusions to lead others astray and often appears with a playful, mocking demeanor. 幻胧 is a major antagonist deeply infiltrated and conspired against the Luofu region of the Xianzhou Alliance. She impersonated the character Tingyun to infiltrate the Xianzhou, and orchestrated the Stellaron crisis while manipulating the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus, sparking turmoil on the Luofu. The general 景元 planned to confront her, recognizing her as a Lord of Extinction responsible for the rebellion and crisis on his ship.&lt;SEP&gt;幻胧is a character mentioned by Jing Yuan as a reason to hurry, likely an antagonist or threat.&lt;SEP&gt;幻胧is a character who covets the giant tree symbol and is about to pollute it.&lt;SEP&gt;幻胧is a绝灭大君, a high-ranking member of the Antimatter Legion (反物质军团) serving Nanook the Destruction. It manipulates the power of the Ambrosial Arbor and seeks to bring destruction to the Xianzhou Luofu.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c28a8b577c86813ea10762e546e4fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c96d885f6a65cadc94f79df95313f0ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be9865cd0a314577e84980b2a240b82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95189fee74f326831efd9da16d00b815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-263cab5cd67fef338242acaf5a013942&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e155b8c8b6fc544d325bbcc9a2da81bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60ca28562fdbf0a819105efc79ad4cce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96e31031793443da0fe2823c4c28cae2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778833560</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
