    <node id="西衍先生">
      <data key="d0">西衍先生</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">西衍先生is a character.&lt;SEP&gt;西衍先生is a person who knows the owner of "不夜侯".&lt;SEP&gt;A person near the 'Bunight' teahouse who provides information on Tingyun's recent activities.&lt;SEP&gt;西衍先生是说书人，擅长讲述云上五骁的传奇故事，素裳推荐开拓者去听。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5652d718e4ea5e4dc648511456987b2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d36361cb146b22a7c168a9c43edca56d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6812b272464cfa07676db3909d99535</data>
