    <node id="翡翠">
      <data key="d0">翡翠</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">翡翠is a character known as Jade.&lt;SEP&gt;翡翠is a member of the "石心十人" who gave砂金his stone, described as a more precious gem that砂金石can imitate.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent of 'Diamond' who negotiates with the suspect, offering him a new life and role.&lt;SEP&gt;翡翠is a character who remarks that砂金fulfilled his promise and got what he wanted.&lt;SEP&gt;翡翠是一个角色，提到砂金兑现了承诺并得偿所愿，计划将基石送入家族领地开始收获，并引用了一段关于觐见、添酒、占有的文雅话术，一切献给琥珀王。&lt;SEP&gt;翡翠(Jade)是托帕和砂金的同事)，与砂金就任务结果进行通话，并计划前往匹诺康尼处理后续事宜。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d49da9008828c6200d6d99602c0309a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b99ab1743f20fd38242e46be4fdebb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b13f1d619b99829ec04b15c537d259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a5c4612ea2ec33740c626cf9067e70</data>
