    <node id="塔伊兹育罗斯">
      <data key="d0">塔伊兹育罗斯</data>
      <data key="d1">aeon</data>
      <data key="d2">塔伊兹育罗斯is the aeon of Propagation.&lt;SEP&gt;塔伊兹育罗斯是繁育星神，因神战而陨落。&lt;SEP&gt;塔伊兹育罗斯是繁育星神，在不朽命途分裂后诞生，后被多位星神杀死。&lt;SEP&gt;A being whose remains were hinted at being potentially found in the艾吉哈佐desert.&lt;SEP&gt;塔伊兹育罗斯是「繁育」星神，其在寰宇蝗灾中给宇宙带来无尽浩劫。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d1d3f2fdd68ace39bfead72d5c6de09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7226238e34da823949aab509aaac80e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b99ab1743f20fd38242e46be4fdebb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba76ab4009be3694fc20bec3980fef08</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069927</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="烬灭祸祖">
      <data key="d0">烬灭祸祖</data>
      <data key="d1">aeon</data>
      <data key="d2">烬灭祸祖is another name for the Destruction Aeon, Nanook.&lt;SEP&gt;烬灭祸祖is Nanook, the Destruction Aeon.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2</data>
