    <node id="万界之癌">
      <data key="d0">万界之癌</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">万界之癌is an event where the Stellaron crisis spread across the galaxy.&lt;SEP&gt;万界之癌(The Stellaron) is a phenomenon that caused the Asdana Prison to become a bad debt for the Interastral Peace Corporation.&lt;SEP&gt;The "Cancer of All Worlds" is a catastrophic event that orphaned Sunday and Robin, making them victims.</data>
