    <node id="列车团">
      <data key="d0">列车团</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The 列车团, also known as the Astral Express Crew or the Nameless, is the group of travelers belonging to the Astral Express. In Chinese, 列车团 is an alternative name for the team affiliated with the Astral Express. This crew makes decisions through democratic voting. They have been involved in significant events, such as helping the Xianzhou Luofu capture the character 卡芙卡 and saving the Xianzhou Luofu during a disaster. Members of this group include 瓦尔特 and 三月七, who are among those pursuing 卡芙卡. Due to their proven capabilities, the 列车团 has been asked for further assistance in various operations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6a6bc51c0b8f913f809328ba29170426&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deed5fb02763ec38f8b148679259b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5341e4ccc7283969ac76c86061d28586&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89401ac7b3d1c2b401bcf8e7944f69bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc2240f2b9c03c7ee20a149da420ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e52e7c11d199f5688f182681811f4a43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e46541e08f2deadbb702b1360ecd537</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778834155</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="谛听">
      <data key="d0">谛听</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">谛听 is a bionic tracking device developed by the Artisanship Commission that mimics the five senses of the Foxian race, used to follow trails and locate individuals by tracking scents or footprints. It can also locate clues and is employed to track specific individuals' whereabouts, such as Cardica or卡芙卡. In addition to its mechanical nature, 谛听 is also described as a creature or a机巧犬 (mechanical dog) that interacts with the Trailblazer through vocalizations like "汪汪" and "呜" to express emotions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-544588bbd1f1f8ebb82fb1b9ebe83ee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59e7b46d077b5255996c168af8643d8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbab5d9a926ed72d8916642b162a156f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b69d30c7d3a7f454ed932719bcad47b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb481f872f6ed8d0d115bc183be81f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91f3368332ddd4f4c2f6a0dfe0a4ae48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-801b6775c66f961e277ab9395c3b5a96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6812b272464cfa07676db3909d99535</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778835331</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="迴星港">
      <data key="d0">迴星港</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">迴星港 (Huixing Port) is a specific location situated within the仙舟罗浮 (Xianzhou Luofu). It is an area under the jurisdiction of the Artisanship Commission, characterized by its status as a major shipbuilding facility. At the time of certain events, the district is partially inactive, with its dome instruments having stopped and its checkpoints being abandoned. The port is notably the location where a Stellaron Hunter, identified as Kafka, surrendered to the Divination Commission. The group’s search for both Kafka and a Foxian girl leads them to this area, based on a tip from a snack stall owner who indicated the girl may have gone in that direction. Furthermore, the shipbuilding facility within 迴星港 is identified as the source of background noise in a transmission from Kafka, making it a key point of investigation for the characters.&lt;SEP&gt;迴星港is a star-dockyard on the Xianzhou Luofu where ships were built, now it has stopped operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Cirrus Star Harbor is the location where驭空goes to oversee the construction of Star Skiffs for the funeral.&lt;SEP&gt;Cirrus Star Harbor is the location where驭空goes to oversee the construction of Star Skiffs for the funeral.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-544588bbd1f1f8ebb82fb1b9ebe83ee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5652d718e4ea5e4dc648511456987b2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8be339ef38fbeb8d499020c4475c7402&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d6e390686a60c1282db4fe45d6c892f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d36361cb146b22a7c168a9c43edca56d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2732799e47c96bf58918c62a5c081c6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb481f872f6ed8d0d115bc183be81f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-801b6775c66f961e277ab9395c3b5a96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc2240f2b9c03c7ee20a149da420ca0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778833625</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="乘槎驭风仙窟游">
      <data key="d0">乘槎驭风仙窟游</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">乘槎驭风仙窟游is an event or quest involving tracking and following trails.&lt;SEP&gt;乘槎驭风仙窟游is the overarching quest event involving travel via star skiff within the Xianzhou Luofu.&lt;SEP&gt;乘槎驭风仙窟游is an event or mission title referring to the investigation of the "建木" and related areas on the Xianzhou "罗浮".&lt;SEP&gt;乘槎驭风仙窟游is a journey or exploration event described in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;乘槎驭风仙窟游is a specific event or mission involving travel and exploration within a mystical cave, directly related to actions on the建木.&lt;SEP&gt;乘槎驭风仙窟游is an event during which the group travels to the location of the Creation Furnace. (Redundant - already extracted)</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-544588bbd1f1f8ebb82fb1b9ebe83ee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-184e0755b006a40e8337e9d9c49cc56a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b761f7975a148b7f60b9118ff40d2789&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cee72ad52e1d632ea45449aff61bfd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c496b9a280b1526dbcd2f69583d665af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1945f8514165034735bd89e91cd1b9e2</data>
