    <node id="六御">
      <data key="d0">六御</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The "Six Chariots" (Liu Yu) is the governing council of the Xianzhou Luofu. Fu Xuan expects Jing Yuan to nominate her as his successor during the next council meeting.&lt;SEP&gt;六御refers to the six high officials or charioteers of the Xianzhou, of which符玄is one.&lt;SEP&gt;六御refers to a high-ranking position within the Xianzhou government, indicating a person of significant power and ability.&lt;SEP&gt;六御是罗浮的官方行政机构，共同商议并决定授予星穹列车盟友地位及最高规格优待。&lt;SEP&gt;六御are the six high commissions of the Xianzhou that need to deliberate on matters involving the Arbor.&lt;SEP&gt;六御是仙舟罗浮的最高行政决策机构，负责合议如涉及「建木」等大事。</data>
