      <data key="d0">洞天</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">洞天 refers to the pocket dimensions, realms, or spatial pocket worlds within the Xianzhou Alliance starships, most notably the Xianzhou "Luofu". These are special, self-contained spatial areas that house various key locations such as the "丹鼎司" (Alchemy Commission), "鳞渊境" (Scalegorge Waterscape), and the Divination Commission. The term is used broadly to describe the various realms on the仙舟 from which personnel like丹士医师 (alchemist-doctors) are stationed.

These pocket worlds are not static; they can be altered or endangered by significant events. For instance, the Stellaron incident on the Luofu caused alterations within the洞天, and during historical invasions, half of the Luofu's pocket worlds were nearly destroyed. Furthermore, the洞天 have faced threats such as the intrusion of wood essence, which could lead to signs of collapse. In terms of function, they are used for sealing the "建木" (the Ambrosial Arbor). A notable act of sabotage involved the "药王秘传" (the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus) scattering alchemical pills that induce "魔阴身" (Mara-struck) into the mists within various洞天. Beyond its literal meaning, the term is also used metaphorically; for example, Fu Xuan uses the concept of subspace to express her unwavering commitment to keeping a promise.&lt;SEP&gt;洞天refers to the pocket worlds within the Xianzhou ships that can be locked down.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cfa499fd86ee42508c05277c43a96c61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deed5fb02763ec38f8b148679259b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b761f7975a148b7f60b9118ff40d2789&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd9f10a536cdbcda90740d8d4674e15d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47555a254b36325300969067b357d5ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f278bd20ddab6f42665b46012b517f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c96d885f6a65cadc94f79df95313f0ce</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778832619</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="命运的奴隶">
      <data key="d0">命运的奴隶</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">命运的奴隶is how卡芙卡describes the Stellaron Hunters, indicating they act based on foreseeing and shaping the best future.&lt;SEP&gt;命运的奴隶is a title given to Elio, the leader of the Stellaron Hunters.&lt;SEP&gt;命运的奴隶是艾利欧的称号，其能够预见未来。&lt;SEP&gt;Another title for Elio, referring to Sam's handler.&lt;SEP&gt;The Slave of Fate is a character who gave Firefly a script predicting her three 'deaths' in the land of dreams.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-80deed5fb02763ec38f8b148679259b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572b9afac6065d24e54da05a551fbbc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cca95c43061171ec0f9a64327c928c33</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069948</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="本座">
      <data key="d0">本座</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">本座is the self-referential term used by符玄, meaning 'I, the Diviner', and is not a separate entity.&lt;SEP&gt;符玄的自称，在对话中用作第一人称代词，表达其太卜的身份和权威。&lt;SEP&gt;本座是符玄的自称，用于表达其对撰写报告的决定。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-80deed5fb02763ec38f8b148679259b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778833312</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
