    <node id="太卜大人">
      <data key="d0">太卜大人</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">太卜大人是太卜司的领导者，虽然身高不高但能力出众，在青雀心中受到尊敬。&lt;SEP&gt;The Grand Diviner who has already led the vanguard into battle against the Abundance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dc7a23ca2f49ce8c9eb126529ef028cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47555a254b36325300969067b357d5ba</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
