    </node>
    <node id="云骑">
      <data key="d0">云骑</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">The Cloud Knights (云骑) are the primary military force of the Xianzhou Alliance, including the Xianzhou Luofu. Their core duty is to protect the people, and they have historically been engaged in combat against the forces of Abundance. The Cloud Knights are actively involved in major crises; for example, they have been assembled at the Alchemy Commission to address the Stellaron crisis on the Luofu. Individual members, such as the "警惕的云骑" (vigilant Cloud Knight), serve as guards for captured prisoners, exhibiting caution against deceptive rhetoric. The organization is a point of concern for figures like Dan Heng, who fears that returning to the Xianzhou might lead to delays caused by them. Additionally, Tingyun once inquired why the Cloud Knights do not typically suffer from the condition known as "魔阴身," and the knights are among the patients treated by the healer Bai Lu.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cloud Knights are the military force of the Xianzhou Alliance, many of whom perished in the Stellar Aeon Calamity.&lt;SEP&gt;云骑(Cloud Knight)是仙舟「罗浮」的军队组织成员，负责守卫和与将军沟通。&lt;SEP&gt;The Cloud Knights are the military force of the Xianzhou Alliance, many of whom perished in the Stellar Aeon Calamity.&lt;SEP&gt;云骑(云骑军)是仙舟罗浮的军队，景元养病后无人能照拂丹恒。&lt;SEP&gt;云骑是仙舟罗浮的军事力量，驭空计划参与其调查。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7b69d30c7d3a7f454ed932719bcad47b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d71f2f56e13337663cff785e79fbb43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e4a3e89257a68f05fa5998ec94e48c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39ee06bafb842d307b13ed54ad7ab232&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47555a254b36325300969067b357d5ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fce4149acf09d1a10fc8b794f73a22e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fc6126d0155a7c411f4068a66d7ddca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc2240f2b9c03c7ee20a149da420ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144698bffcc884ba074327b0c9548848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d6383237af538cadaa98ed29bd46255&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e47a0efebc7ceac09127ceb2083c2301</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778835399</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="太卜">
      <data key="d0">太卜</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Grand Diviner (太卜) is the official title for the head of the Divination Commission (太卜司) on the Xianzhou Luofu, most notably held by Fu Xuan. As the leader of the Commission, the Grand Diviner is a formidable diviner with significant skills, capable of controlling situations and disliking disorder and excessive questioning. Their duties include overseeing the Commission's operations, expecting punctuality from staff, and guiding the Alliance away from disaster through divination and strategic calculations. The Grand Diviner holds the authority to order security overhauls, activate formations, and direct the staffing of the Matrix of Prescience. This position is known to be busy, as Fu Xuan is currently dealing with staff shortages. The Grand Diviner is also the superior to characters like Qingque, who humorously suggests that their superior might share her lazy tendencies. Additionally, the title "太卜" can refer to a person or group from the Divination Commission who are positioned near survivors, and it is also used to specifically refer to Fu Xuan's official title, indicating she acts according to her divination and strategic calculations.&lt;SEP&gt;太卜is a divination official who led the expedition against the药王秘传.&lt;SEP&gt;太卜是仙舟「罗浮」的卜算机构，符玄是其长官，知晓陈年公案。&lt;SEP&gt;太卜is a friend on the仙舟that三月七considers saying goodbye to.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7b69d30c7d3a7f454ed932719bcad47b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d79ed550ca1869c633e5ee3153e644d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2940364ce77c89b6b787e5861475970&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d1d3f2fdd68ace39bfead72d5c6de09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b7f59f879256f855b57fd2b90f2f093&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3e68e248a108ebdbad18c906c7b760a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b15f3e72ede1984381b5ab689b537e72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e5724440b453f77f33b2b72b886fc77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e44ecf966c6560c7f086afff655868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e4a3e89257a68f05fa5998ec94e48c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1172e16aec5fcaed74cebbab925fca42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fc6126d0155a7c411f4068a66d7ddca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c96d885f6a65cadc94f79df95313f0ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f9194e1080efdf8689a47d84993d492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144698bffcc884ba074327b0c9548848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e021fc26775ae86ae4a8fa4b4a74a6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778833790</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
