      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">星核危机is an incident involving a Stellaron, which Kafka is allegedly associated with.&lt;SEP&gt;星核危机是匹诺康尼面临的核心问题，姬子和加拉赫讨论的焦点。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ba3b6dae092d55950f9ddb961ea479</data>
