    </node>
    <node id="罗浮仙舟">
      <data key="d0">罗浮仙舟</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Xianzhou Luofu is one of the six flagship vessels of the Xianzhou Alliance, a fleet of colossal starships that traverse the stars. It is a primary location for the game's narrative, serving as the stage for multiple significant events. Historically, the Luofu was renowned for housing the Ambrosial Tree (Jianmu), a fact that has led to complex ties with the Vidyadhara, who are owed a great debt for their role in imprisoning the tree. The ship is currently confronting several interconnected crises, including the threat of the Stellaron, a rebellion from the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus, and the onset of Mara-struck madness. As a major setting, the Luofu is home to numerous characters and factions, such as the Alchemy Commission, where Dr. Bailu practices medicine. The ship also serves as the location for significant cultural events, such as Solace Funeral Rites. In the present day, the Xianzhou Luofu is recovering from a war that occurred thirty years prior and is working to revitalize itself through trade and other means.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-447076830112aeb99cde7bcf43070ce1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f8fa3030c9f0e45dc58488cd8c0b0b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e44ecf966c6560c7f086afff655868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7226238e34da823949aab509aaac80e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca2fde817826f962ed055501ca3dd274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fc6126d0155a7c411f4068a66d7ddca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c96d885f6a65cadc94f79df95313f0ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e52e7c11d199f5688f182681811f4a43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c2bf1856c9246afe262f7402bdbfdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e46541e08f2deadbb702b1360ecd537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6812b272464cfa07676db3909d99535&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea21a9fcfb577e8e763f6c2dd49464d7</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778835429</data>
      <data key="d6" />
