    <node id="广大">
      <data key="d0">广大</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">广大is a ground transport department (地衡司) worker who informs the protagonist about the closure of shipping routes and offers a paid service to leave on a friend's starskiif.&lt;SEP&gt;Guangda is a civil servant who informs the Trailblazer about a special situation on the Xianzhou Luofu and advises them to stay in their hotel.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5c30624adbe5e5d9ad4c03419838c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e950cd2284a42010147f1d1b6048c439</data>
