    <node id="龙女大人">
      <data key="d0">龙女大人</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">龙女大人是仙舟罗浮上的持明族人物，在之前的事件中为长乐天的百姓解围。&lt;SEP&gt;The Dragon Lady is a title for Bailu, the Dragon Lady of the Alchemy Commission.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5c30624adbe5e5d9ad4c03419838c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd64d36e6f165af69ecd014e8024b7c9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778821968</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="玉兆">
      <data key="d0">玉兆</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">玉兆是仙舟特有的卜算技术，用于推演占算、趋吉避凶。&lt;SEP&gt;玉兆(Jade Abacus) is a personal communication device used by Xianzhou citizens, on which official news (邸报) will be published.&lt;SEP&gt;A Jade Abacus is a device used for registration and identification on the Xianzhou Luofu.&lt;SEP&gt;玉兆(Jade Abacus) are objects crafted by the Artisanship Commission using engraved jade crystal lattices containing countless talismans, used in various mechanisms to run according to designed intentions.&lt;SEP&gt;Jade Omen (Yuzhao) is a computational device or data input for the Divination Commission's systems, into which the algorithm's results are read.&lt;SEP&gt;玉兆是仙舟的技术，类似于计算机和芯片，由博识尊指点。&lt;SEP&gt;A ceremonial token inscribed with an oath, symbolizing the alliance between the Luofu Cloud Knights and the train crew; it also functions as a beacon.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d5c30624adbe5e5d9ad4c03419838c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e950cd2284a42010147f1d1b6048c439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd64d36e6f165af69ecd014e8024b7c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b7f59f879256f855b57fd2b90f2f093&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d71f2f56e13337663cff785e79fbb43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db1a6716eb95924fce53acec168f822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e46541e08f2deadbb702b1360ecd537</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778834151</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
