    <node id="未来">
      <data key="d0">未来</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">未来被瓦尔特描述为一团等待人们通过选择来决定的迷雾，由变量组成。&lt;SEP&gt;「未来」 (the future) is mentioned as a destination or entity waiting ahead, symbolizing what lies beyond the present moment.&lt;SEP&gt;未来(Future) is a concept that Elio sees into, and where the subject (the player character) came to be seen as an "impossible thing".</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fd64d36e6f165af69ecd014e8024b7c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d721b9818dfeb98f14b8d1a877f7a139&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc45afcec4b5f6a1b7e1a966ff2b1588</data>
