    <node id="不朽">
      <data key="d0">不朽</data>
      <data key="d1">path</data>
      <data key="d2">不朽是已陨落的星神，代表“不朽”命途，被称为“龙”。&lt;SEP&gt;不朽是一个命途或星神，其消失后命途被塔伊兹育罗斯分裂，诞生了繁育星神。&lt;SEP&gt;不朽is Long, The Permanence, a path associated with dragons and the Vidyadhara lineage.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4d1d3f2fdd68ace39bfead72d5c6de09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7226238e34da823949aab509aaac80e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96e31031793443da0fe2823c4c28cae2</data>
