    </node>
    <node id="太一">
      <data key="d0">太一</data>
      <data key="d1">aeon</data>
      <data key="d2">太一是秩序星神，被同谐星神希佩同化而陨落。&lt;SEP&gt;太一是已陨落的秩序星神，其所行道路与「同谐」碰撞后被吞纳同化，留下无主的「秩序」命途。&lt;SEP&gt;太一是「秩序」星神，在列神之战后被「同谐」的希佩吞纳。&lt;SEP&gt;太一is the Order Aeon who gave meaning to the world but was overthrown by the people.&lt;SEP&gt;太一是秩序星神，已死，与阿基维利一同被提及作为已死星神。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4d1d3f2fdd68ace39bfead72d5c6de09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d81d7afd4e410e297a5351eee7eb9d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba76ab4009be3694fc20bec3980fef08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8a929a77ffa0523358ea526d90b536b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5855a83e99050d0498aa175b3322d047&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-634037196a7f2b333524f9f78739583e</data>
