    <node id="仙舟人">
      <data key="d0">仙舟人</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">仙舟人are the long-lived inhabitants of the Xianzhou, who practice unique funeral rites.&lt;SEP&gt;仙舟人are the immortal people of the Xianzhou Alliance, who are described as fearing "non-death" more than death.&lt;SEP&gt;The "Xianzhou people" are a civilization that followed Abundance initially, but later turned to the Hunt to counter its disasters.&lt;SEP&gt;仙舟人refers to the people of the仙舟, whose appearance幻胧disguised herself as.&lt;SEP&gt;仙舟人是仙舟联盟的居民，龙师认为龙尊试图用封印建木来换取仙舟人的信任是徒劳的。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ff8688e06b168deefda3fe220f725865&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9742ce4eb1971ba77904fc0e1868746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c28a8b577c86813ea10762e546e4fa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fecec594c1525b37f11626500aba76a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778833423</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="因果殿">
      <data key="d0">因果殿</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">因果殿is a location in the十王司where the names of fallen Xianzhou soldiers are honored.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hall of Karma is a location where the Ten Lords' Commission records the life stories of Xianzhou inhabitants.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hall of Karma is a location where the Ten Lords' Commission records the life stories of Xianzhou inhabitants.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ff8688e06b168deefda3fe220f725865&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cc2240f2b9c03c7ee20a149da420ca0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778833622</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="持明">
      <data key="d0">持明</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">持明are a race known as the Dragon's Descendants; they can undergo a rebirth process by transforming into a pearl-like egg.&lt;SEP&gt;持明(Vidyadhara) are a dragon-like race within the Xianzhou Alliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Vidyadhara, a long-life race within the Xianzhou who can escape Marasylum through the process of rebirth via 'shedding scales'.&lt;SEP&gt;持明是丹恒所属的种族，其转生被视为蜕变新生的过程。&lt;SEP&gt;持明is a race on the Xianzhou, among whom opinions were divided on punishing丹枫; they are linked to a primordial sea called Tanghai.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ff8688e06b168deefda3fe220f725865&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9742ce4eb1971ba77904fc0e1868746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1172e16aec5fcaed74cebbab925fca42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-144698bffcc884ba074327b0c9548848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95189fee74f326831efd9da16d00b815</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778833152</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
