    <node id="杨先生">
      <data key="d0">杨先生</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">杨先生is a character praised by青雀for easily unlocking the door, and is humorously granted the title of "逍遥门掌门" of the太卜司.&lt;SEP&gt;杨先生is another name for瓦尔特; he made an observation about the Linglu's healing relying on energy from a source.&lt;SEP&gt;杨先生is another name for瓦尔特, who is thanked by符玄for handling the matter.&lt;SEP&gt;杨先生是瓦尔特·杨，与三月七和开拓者一起被提及作为凑牌桌的成员。&lt;SEP&gt;杨先生是开拓者的同伴(通常指瓦尔特·杨)，青雀关心他是否学会了打帝垣琼玉牌。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-67aa978acb883a7010e681ac9415be70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a32218a257d7f9a168428513c60be25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e573422bf2b97f952b6e576d9a40c404&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee709ee6223dbebd15d8b80e4cdae7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6812b272464cfa07676db3909d99535</data>
