      <data key="d2">神木重萌is an event referenced in the quest title, involving the revival of the sacred tree Jianmu on the Xianzhou Luofu.&lt;SEP&gt;神木重萌refers to the event of the "建木" (divine tree) sprouting anew or being reborn, which is the core event discussed.</data>
