      <data key="d2">掣转天衡is an event referenced in the quest title, involving a pivotal change or operation on the ship mechanism of a Xianzhou vessel.&lt;SEP&gt;掣转天衡is an event or phase related to the mission, likely involving turning or shifting a celestial mechanism.</data>
