    <node id="鳞渊境">
      <data key="d0">鳞渊境</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Scalegorge Waterscape (鳞渊境) is a distinct reality fragment (洞天) located aboard the Xianzhou Luofu (仙舟罗浮). It is an underwater realm, accessible by starskiff, that was transplanted from the Vidyadhara (持明) homeworld and is managed by the Vidyadhara clan. It was formerly the site of the Vidyadhara Dragon Palace and is now used to seal the Ambrosial Arbor (建木). The Scalegorge Waterscape features Vidyadhara seals and is the location of the Wave-Moon Ancient Sea (波月古海). It serves as a key destination for investigations into the Arbor, and notably, it was the site of a confrontation involving Dan Heng, Blade, and Yanqing, as well as a conversation between Jingyuan and Dan Heng.&lt;SEP&gt;鳞渊境是罗浮的地点，星核被送入此处以引发建木重生。&lt;SEP&gt;鳞渊境是仙舟「罗浮」的持明族圣地，用于封印建木，由历代龙尊通过古海之潮维护封印。&lt;SEP&gt;A location on the Xianzhou Luofu that Dan Heng has revisited, where he feels a sense of unreality.&lt;SEP&gt;鳞渊境is a location that the young female character questions whether they should leave behind.&lt;SEP&gt;鳞渊境是仙舟罗浮的地点，是姬子羡慕开拓者曾到过的壮丽景观。&lt;SEP&gt;Scalegorge Waterscape is a location on the Luofu Xianzhou, used to describe the persistent nature of certain opinions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b761f7975a148b7f60b9118ff40d2789&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42cb7b6c602a4d11cb2e76505dd012c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fc6126d0155a7c411f4068a66d7ddca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c96d885f6a65cadc94f79df95313f0ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-232b4fb1b400fc9168a697506bccf527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86afcf1d5b41644aabd32c7cbee164cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be9865cd0a314577e84980b2a240b82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e52e7c11d199f5688f182681811f4a43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fecec594c1525b37f11626500aba76a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e83981232e76e1d9782f0427096c325c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60ca28562fdbf0a819105efc79ad4cce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee709ee6223dbebd15d8b80e4cdae7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e46541e08f2deadbb702b1360ecd537</data>
