    </node>
    <node id="穷观阵">
      <data key="d0">穷观阵</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The穷观阵 (Matrix of Prescience), also known as the Poor Observation Array or Poverty Observation Formation, is a significant divination device and large Jade Abacus terminal located within the太卜司 (Divination Commission). It is a central formation guarded by符玄 and is used for complex calculations of variables, allowing users to understand both the past and the future. The穷观阵 is critically employed in interrogation procedures, capable of discerning truth from falsehood and revealing hidden truths; it was instrumental in confirming the good intentions of the Stellaron Hunters. This divination device operates by calculating information from a target's journey along a specific Path. At one point, it was noted to have stopped functioning, but it remains a key tool for divination and information calculation.&lt;SEP&gt;穷观阵is a divination array used by the Divination Commission to reveal truth.&lt;SEP&gt;穷观阵is a divination array that revealed卡芙卡's innocence to符玄.&lt;SEP&gt;穷观阵是太卜司的设施，符玄在此看到卡芙卡从艾利欧那里领受的预言。&lt;SEP&gt;A powerful divination array operated by the Divination Commission that can examine a person's past. March 7th hopes to use it to learn about her own history.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2b7f59f879256f855b57fd2b90f2f093&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3e68e248a108ebdbad18c906c7b760a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5341e4ccc7283969ac76c86061d28586&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aec7e92881b8561c64f206d873044d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df8b5bd13b0c402afd43298bddf26cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d71f2f56e13337663cff785e79fbb43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db1a6716eb95924fce53acec168f822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38d7d8ba8bfe5e69f41225515582546c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54e44ecf966c6560c7f086afff655868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd9f10a536cdbcda90740d8d4674e15d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e83981232e76e1d9782f0427096c325c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778833475</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
