      <data key="d0">寿瘟祸祖</data>
      <data key="d1">aeon</data>
      <data key="d2">寿瘟祸祖is another name for the Abundance Aeon, Yaoshi, who is worshipped by the药王秘传.&lt;SEP&gt;"寿瘟祸祖" is a derogatory title for the Aeon of Abundance, known as Yaoshi, who offered the gift of immortality.&lt;SEP&gt;寿瘟祸祖(also known as Aeon "药师") is the deity worshipped by the药王秘传, associated with the Abundance path.&lt;SEP&gt;寿瘟祸祖是丰饶星神。&lt;SEP&gt;寿瘟祸祖is another name for the Aeon of Abundance, whose power幻胧plans to spread via the建木.&lt;SEP&gt;寿瘟祸祖is Yaoshi, the Abundance Aeon, called by a derogatory name.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d9742ce4eb1971ba77904fc0e1868746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e67f27ee470faa07599b85ba409e78c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95189fee74f326831efd9da16d00b815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e52e7c11d199f5688f182681811f4a43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778833973</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="帝弓">
      <data key="d0">帝弓</data>
      <data key="d1">aeon</data>
      <data key="d2">帝弓(The Bow) is a name for the Hunt Aeon, Lan, whose teachings are revered by the Xianzhou.&lt;SEP&gt;帝弓is a deity (Aeon of the Hunt or a revered figure) mentioned in a soldier's exclamation, representing protection.&lt;SEP&gt;The Aeon of the Hunt, who the Xianzhou people follow and with whom they fought against the Abundance.&lt;SEP&gt;帝弓是巡猎星神，仙舟人以其光矢表达行动。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d9742ce4eb1971ba77904fc0e1868746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e67f27ee470faa07599b85ba409e78c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-603ef2226ecb6b7032da6f1dbc06644f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
