    </node>
    <node id="玄鹿">
      <data key="d0">玄鹿</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">玄鹿is a mythical beast mentioned by a crazed cultist, symbolizing a desired transformation.&lt;SEP&gt;玄鹿is a Xuan Lu, a spiritual beast born from the Jianmu to guard it, possessing regenerative abilities.&lt;SEP&gt;玄鹿是建木相关的一种生物，是姬子提到的景观。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d9742ce4eb1971ba77904fc0e1868746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1945f8514165034735bd89e91cd1b9e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee709ee6223dbebd15d8b80e4cdae7e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
