      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="丰饶之主">
      <data key="d0">丰饶之主</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">丰饶之主is another title for the Abundance Aeon, Yaoshi, whom停云describes as playing a cruel joke by granting immortality that leads to a worse fate.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d9742ce4eb1971ba77904fc0e1868746</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778831727</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="丹炉">
      <data key="d0">丹炉</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">丹炉是丹鼎司用于提炼「建木」之力的装置，持续喷涌烟雾，形成「云霞紫府」区域，阻挡了云骑军的推进。&lt;SEP&gt;丹炉is a furnace or cauldron mentioned by a crazed cultist, whose smoke allows them to "smell the future."&lt;SEP&gt;丹炉is a general term for alchemical furnaces, which三月七notes are close by and the group is tasked with closing.&lt;SEP&gt;A cauldron or alchemy furnace referenced by Fu Xuan, used to discuss the dangers of toxicity and dosage.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9742ce4eb1971ba77904fc0e1868746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb0f25ff767eb93fbf9b6c961acfd724&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1172e16aec5fcaed74cebbab925fca42</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778832329</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="云霞紫府">
      <data key="d0">云霞紫府</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">云霞紫府是丹鼎司古时阐演仙道的地点，因丹炉烟霭不息而得名，是兵法上的死地，寸步难近。&lt;SEP&gt;A location, likely within the Alchemy Commission, where the "药王秘传" agents were annihilated.&lt;SEP&gt;云霞紫府is a location that was filled with poisonous gas, necessitating the云骑军's advance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56f9050ddaba5533f393398440a8cfd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f9194e1080efdf8689a47d84993d492</data>
