    <node id="云骑守卫">
      <data key="d0">云骑守卫</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">云骑守卫refers to the soldiers of the云骑军who are standing guard and restricting passage.&lt;SEP&gt;云骑守卫is a soldier guarding the encampment who identifies the group and relays orders from符玄. (Added description nuance)&lt;SEP&gt;A Cloud Knight Guard who announces the return of Fu Xuan.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d9742ce4eb1971ba77904fc0e1868746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e67f27ee470faa07599b85ba409e78c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44856396e630f7b48e968e5becd820f6</data>
