    <node id="被俘的信徒">
      <data key="d0">被俘的信徒</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">被俘的信徒is a captured follower of药王秘传who finds the silent escort boring.&lt;SEP&gt;A captured follower of "药王秘传", attributing failure to lack of faith and threatening others with the Abundance's gift.&lt;SEP&gt;被俘的信徒(Captured Believer) is a member of the anti-matter legion cult who fervently praises the power of the Abundance (Yaoshi) and the rebirth of the Ambrosial Arbor.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d9742ce4eb1971ba77904fc0e1868746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56f9050ddaba5533f393398440a8cfd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fc6126d0155a7c411f4068a66d7ddca</data>
