    <node id="丹士">
      <data key="d0">丹士</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">丹士是丹鼎司的研究人员，曾因操纵生命为乐，从「建木」研究出种种技术，最终分化出「药王秘传」。&lt;SEP&gt;"丹士" were alchemists in the "丹鼎司" who manipulated the power of the Ambrosial Arbor to perform miraculous arts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7</data>
