    <node id="云骑队长">
      <data key="d0">云骑队长</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d9742ce4eb1971ba77904fc0e1868746&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56f9050ddaba5533f393398440a8cfd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86afcf1d5b41644aabd32c7cbee164cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f9194e1080efdf8689a47d84993d492</data>
      <data key="d2">The云骑队长references 《云骑武经》 for knowledge about how contact with寿瘟祸祖can cause instantaneous魔阴身.&lt;SEP&gt;A Cloud Knight captain informing people about the rebellion and urging them to stay for safety, also finds Dan Heng familiar.&lt;SEP&gt;云骑队长是罗浮云骑军的小队长，向开拓者解释建木重生和药王秘传的作乱。&lt;SEP&gt;云骑队长is a captain of the云骑军who informs开拓者about the guests invited by the将军and the progress of the battle.</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778832649</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
