    <node id="医士着装的女子">
      <data key="d0">医士着装的女子</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">医士着装的女子is a woman dressed as a physician who is revealed to be a member of the Medicine Master's Secret. She mocks the Xianzhou Alliance for relying on short-lived species like the Astral Express.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28e4a3e89257a68f05fa5998ec94e48c</data>
