      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">垂死的云骑is a fatally wounded Cloud Knight. He warns the group about the woman being from the Medicine Master's Secret and reveals he has been transformed by her, begging them to leave.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28e4a3e89257a68f05fa5998ec94e48c</data>
