    <node id="药王秘传信徒">
      <data key="d0">药王秘传信徒</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">药王秘传信徒is a devotee of the Medicine Master's Secret. They taunt the Astral Express members about their short lifespans and offer them the long life that the Medicine Master's Secret can provide.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28e4a3e89257a68f05fa5998ec94e48c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778831815</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="丹枢">
      <data key="d0">丹枢</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">丹枢is the Dan Shi Zhang (丹士长) of the Alchemy Commission and the leader of the Medicine Master's Secret faction on the Xianzhou Luofu, though not explicitly named here, the "医士着装的女子" is implied to be a member of this faction.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dan Shi Zhang, also known as the leader of the Yaoqing Medicine Sect, who is confronted by Fu Xuan.&lt;SEP&gt;丹枢is a furnace or alchemical structure built with the cooperation of the Vidyadhara, which contains Yun Yin Shu (云吟术).&lt;SEP&gt;丹枢(丹士长)是仙舟罗浮丹鼎司的丹士，正在闭关研究丹药。&lt;SEP&gt;丹枢大人是一位了不得的丹士，为天缺者们炼药救治。&lt;SEP&gt;丹枢是药王秘传的老大，曾为小鱼等孩子送药，但此后失去音信。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28e4a3e89257a68f05fa5998ec94e48c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d6383237af538cadaa98ed29bd46255&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee709ee6223dbebd15d8b80e4cdae7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ecf17482a3d194b8f2226acc4dfad00</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778835315</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
