      <data key="d0">子铭</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">子铭is a male apprentice at the Artisanship Commission who is curious about the Jianmu’s material and considers scraping off a piece for experimentation. He later claims to have caught a cold to avoid a dangerous operation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e9b4a06f02fe7c6cb62ff7b9a3d56cc</data>
