    <node id="铖杰">
      <data key="d0">铖杰</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">铖杰is a person at the Artisanship Commission who used a "Realm-Scroll Painting Screen" to escape a dangerous situation. He is concerned about the limited teleportation distance of the device.&lt;SEP&gt;A person named Chengjie.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e9b4a06f02fe7c6cb62ff7b9a3d56cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ae55661a99ec8ee90f3ea2484b83418</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778900451</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="阿伟">
      <data key="d0">阿伟</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">阿伟is an apprentice at the Artisanship Commission, desperate to rescue his master, Gongshu. He initially doubts the help from the Astral Express crew but later asks them to save his teacher.&lt;SEP&gt;阿伟is a person who works in research and is involved in a situation with公输师傅, describing a frantic moment where they struggled to do multiple tasks at once.&lt;SEP&gt;阿伟is a worker from the Artisanship Commission who warns others about the dangerous tree disaster inside.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e9b4a06f02fe7c6cb62ff7b9a3d56cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca2fde817826f962ed055501ca3dd274</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778831931</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="公输师傅">
      <data key="d0">公输师傅</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">公输师傅(Master Gongshu), also known as 公输梁 and hailed as "镕金铄铁第一巧手," is the oldest and most esteemed master craftsman in the "Rongjin Workshop" (熔金坊) of the Artisanship Commission (工造司) on the Xianzhou Luofu. He is a highly skilled craftsman, engineer, and leader of disciples, possessing extensive knowledge of mechanical arts (机关术). He is responsible for the research, development, and debugging of sophisticated mechanical devices, including the "幻境画屏" (Illusory Landscape Screen) and the "匣里流光" (Casket of Flowing Light).

During a crisis involving the Ambrosial Tree (Jianmu), Master Gongshu warned that the Jianmu's roots were piercing the Creation Furnace. He provided crucial insights into the Linglu's connection to the Ambrosial Tree and proposed a plan to cut its roots. In the midst of the danger, he courageously ran back into the danger zone, shouting about the furnace. He is the teacher of a disciple named 阿伟. Although he initially mistook the Trailblazer's crew for enemies, he eventually collaborated with them, offering rewards for their assistance in repairing the Creation Furnace. Master Gongshu expressed great excitement and validation upon discovering the correct method for a critical task, demonstrating his deep passion and expertise in his craft.&lt;SEP&gt;公输师傅is a master craftsman who sets up a device and speculates on the root system of the Jianmu.&lt;SEP&gt;公输师傅是工造司的师傅，感叹人生多别离，欢迎开拓者回来。&lt;SEP&gt;公输师傅是工造司的师傅，经历工造司战后进行重建，感叹短生种徒弟离开后难再相见，为开拓者的离去感到惆怅。&lt;SEP&gt;Master Gong Shu.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e9b4a06f02fe7c6cb62ff7b9a3d56cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca2fde817826f962ed055501ca3dd274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c496b9a280b1526dbcd2f69583d665af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1945f8514165034735bd89e91cd1b9e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a32218a257d7f9a168428513c60be25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f99f516c83f852e030149192dc355f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f278bd20ddab6f42665b46012b517f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8496abee5a579ddcf1430e6d8a381dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee709ee6223dbebd15d8b80e4cdae7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6812b272464cfa07676db3909d99535&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ae55661a99ec8ee90f3ea2484b83418</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778900717</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
