      <data key="d0">云澈</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">云澈is a senior female apprentice in the materials group at the Artisanship Commission. She is sarcastic and risk-averse, mocking her junior's reckless plan to approach the Jianmu.</data>
