      <data key="d2">铖杰used the "Realm-Scroll Painting Screen" to teleport himself and others out of the crisis at the Artisanship Commission.&lt;SEP&gt;The Illusory Canvas is a device whose roots were previously burned off with a mechanism, providing a clue to how the Linglu's regeneration can be disrupted.</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
