    <node id="智者">
      <data key="d0">智者</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Wise individuals who rejected the temptation of immortality from Abundance, contrasting with those who accepted it.&lt;SEP&gt;智者is the recipient of the opening dialogue, who is told to press the button and release a firework.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39d2c739f8e0853297665a283cb117d2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
