    </node>
    <node id="愚者">
      <data key="d0">愚者</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">"愚者" (The Fool) is a term that refers to multiple distinct entities within the game's lore. One primary meaning describes foolish individuals who accepted immortality from the Abundance, a decision that led to the Xianzhou's historical regrets. In the context of the Penacony storyline, "愚者" is also a specific faction or character among the invited participants of the grand event, actively involved in the complex dreamscape politics and viewed by some, like砂金, as a "company dog." This entity is suspected of having the capability to interfere with dream powers and techniques, and was initially considered a possible candidate for bringing米沙and流萤 into the dream. However, new clues and statements from黑天鹅 have definitively ruled out the愚者 as the source of the "fatal flaw" or crucial vulnerability in the dream, dismissing earlier conjectures by the Trailblazer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2e36f6ac57f6bfa898a604348d0a71f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee043452b079db75e92301d147036f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-729906f69b0dc31b866284fec42bd817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-083647d174927add1aefc63655ec615b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-603ef2226ecb6b7032da6f1dbc06644f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74d9be5bb22932287cf5a631b7386195&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea958dd07fcb944ce792ebb1149ed1b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1f7faf4930e00b263ca759277579820</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779101115</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
