      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Abundance is a concept or deity believed in by the "药王秘传" followers.&lt;SEP&gt;药王(Medicinal King) refers to the Aeon of Abundance, Yaoshi, who bestowed the Ambrosial Arbor on the Xianzhou in the age of divine descent.</data>
