      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">持明龙尊是持明族的领袖，世代守望建木封印，借助持明龙裔的力量遏制建木。&lt;SEP&gt;The term "Vidyadhara Dragon Lord" is used by Blade as an alias for Dan Heng's past incarnation, Dan Feng, referring to the same entity as the Imbibitor Lunae.&lt;SEP&gt;The current Dragon Sovereign of the Vidyadhara on the Xianzhou Luofu, whom Dan Heng wishes to meet.</data>
