      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">星核灾变(Stellaron Calamity) is the critical disaster currently affecting the Xianzhou Luofu, which needs to be contained urgently.&lt;SEP&gt;The Stellar Aeon Calamity is a disaster that occurred on the Xianzhou Luofu, causing widespread loss of life.&lt;SEP&gt;The Stellar Aeon Calamity is a disaster that occurred on the Xianzhou Luofu, causing widespread loss of life.</data>
