    <node id="往昔的回声">
      <data key="d0">往昔的回声</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Echoes of the Past are voices from the Vidyadhara that speak to Dan Heng during his journey into Scalegorge Waterscape, urging him forward and reflecting on their history.&lt;SEP&gt;往昔的回声are echoes or voices from the past that recount historical events and teachings related to the Vidyadhara.</data>
