    </node>
    <node id="持明一族">
      <data key="d0">持明一族</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">The Vidyadhara are a long-lived, water-dwelling race who undergo cyclic rebirth, forgetting their past lives, and are native to the Xianzhou.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-232b4fb1b400fc9168a697506bccf527</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778832631</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="龙尊">
      <data key="d0">龙尊</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Dragon Lord is the leader and most powerful figure among the Vidyadhara, a title once held by Dan Feng and now a part of Dan Heng's rejected past.&lt;SEP&gt;龙尊是持明族的领袖称号，丹枫和丹恒都具有龙尊气质。&lt;SEP&gt;龙尊是持明族的首领，掌握强大力量。&lt;SEP&gt;龙尊是持明族的领袖之一，负责在显龙大雩殿引导古海之潮，封印建木，因决意镇压建木而被称为"背叛"。&lt;SEP&gt;龙尊is a person or being, specifically referring to Danheng's power, used to open the path to the Jianmu.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-232b4fb1b400fc9168a697506bccf527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86afcf1d5b41644aabd32c7cbee164cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e52e7c11d199f5688f182681811f4a43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fecec594c1525b37f11626500aba76a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72ad4c06466fbf815a6a26d890c9e825</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778833441</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="丹枫">
      <data key="d0">丹枫</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">丹枫是丹恒的前世，曾犯下罪行，化龙之力传承不完整，被景元提及。&lt;SEP&gt;Dan Feng is the former High Elder of the Vidyadhara whose voice is heard by Dan Heng.&lt;SEP&gt;丹枫是上一代龙尊，已故。&lt;SEP&gt;丹枫is the previous incarnation of丹恒who committed a grave crime on the Luofu, leading to the forced shedding of his scales.&lt;SEP&gt;Dan Feng is the previous incarnation of Dan Heng, the former High Elder of the Xianzhou Luofu, whose past actions are something Dan Heng wishes to understand and atone for.&lt;SEP&gt;Dan Feng is an individual whose past sins are deeply rooted and serve as a source of lasting conflict for Dan Heng.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-86afcf1d5b41644aabd32c7cbee164cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be9865cd0a314577e84980b2a240b82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95189fee74f326831efd9da16d00b815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e52e7c11d199f5688f182681811f4a43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e83981232e76e1d9782f0427096c325c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e46541e08f2deadbb702b1360ecd537</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778834165</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="罗浮将军">
      <data key="d0">罗浮将军</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">罗浮将军是仙舟罗浮的最高军事统领，景元担任此职。&lt;SEP&gt;The Luofu General is mentioned by March 7th in relation to the Trailblazer's manner of speaking.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-86afcf1d5b41644aabd32c7cbee164cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ab104d64e9eb410cea34464f76c33a5</data>
