    <node id="慰灵奠仪">
      <data key="d0">慰灵奠仪</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A funeral ritual organized by驭空to honor the deceased from the Stellar Aeon Calamity, using Foxian customs to send their belongings into a star.&lt;SEP&gt;慰灵奠仪is a memorial ceremony organized by驭空, for which some of Tingyun's items are intended.&lt;SEP&gt;A funeral ritual organized by驭空to honor the deceased from the Stellar Aeon Calamity, using Foxian customs to send their belongings into a star.&lt;SEP&gt;慰灵奠仪is a memorial ceremony to honor the fallen, led by驭空.&lt;SEP&gt;A funeral ceremony called the "Solace Funeral Rite" taking place on the Xianzhou Luofu.&lt;SEP&gt;慰灵奠仪是葬礼的一部分，关切的长辈提醒疲惫的女人要坚强出席。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7cc2240f2b9c03c7ee20a149da420ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cc6ee9954920e7d6473573d551d2e86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c0d83d786126b007971332b2266ae95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e47a0efebc7ceac09127ceb2083c2301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea21a9fcfb577e8e763f6c2dd49464d7</data>
