    <node id="岩明">
      <data key="d0">岩明</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">岩明is a character tasked by驭空with organizing停云's belongings.&lt;SEP&gt;岩明is a member of the Minghuo commercial group and a competitor of Tingyun. He is tasked with organizing Tingyun's belongings and is considering a return gift for her.&lt;SEP&gt;岩明is a character tasked by驭空with organizing停云's belongings.&lt;SEP&gt;岩明is a character who bids farewell to the Trailblazer, implying a past rivalry.&lt;SEP&gt;岩明is a reception envoy who brings a kite as a memorial gift for停云, following Foxian traditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7cc2240f2b9c03c7ee20a149da420ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cc6ee9954920e7d6473573d551d2e86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c0d83d786126b007971332b2266ae95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8c2bf1856c9246afe262f7402bdbfdc</data>
