      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The voice of the Dragon Lord (Dan Feng), heard in a memory, speaking to Yingxing.&lt;SEP&gt;龙尊的声音是那位接受镇压建木使命的龙尊，在对话中坚持自己的决定，不容更改。&lt;SEP&gt;龙尊的声音is the Voice of the Vidhyadhara High Elder, who asks the young female character if she will resent his decision to leave.</data>
