    <node id="苍老的声音">
      <data key="d0">苍老的声音</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An old voice that challenges the female intruder, asking who she is and why she wants to see the Dragon Lord.&lt;SEP&gt;苍老的声音is an unidentified elderly person's voice quoting ancient records about the Tanghai waters brought by the Vidyadhara from their homeland.&lt;SEP&gt;苍老的声音是持明族的龙师之一，在鳞渊境中反对龙尊封印建木的决定，指责其为背叛。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5be9865cd0a314577e84980b2a240b82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95189fee74f326831efd9da16d00b815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fecec594c1525b37f11626500aba76a</data>
