    <node id="云上五骁">
      <data key="d0">云上五骁</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">云上五骁是丹恒作为英雄大放异彩的历史事件或团体。&lt;SEP&gt;云上五骁refers to the historical event and team of five heroes, including Jing Yuan and Dan Heng's past self, who previously fought threats to the Luofu.&lt;SEP&gt;云上五骁是仙舟历史上的传奇事件，包含多位英雄人物，素裳对此故事极为喜爱。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-144698bffcc884ba074327b0c9548848&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96e31031793443da0fe2823c4c28cae2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6812b272464cfa07676db3909d99535</data>
