      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">显龙大雩殿is a location on the Xianzhou Luofu where the Astral Express Crew's friends are waiting.&lt;SEP&gt;显龙大雩殿是持明族举行传统仪式的场所，历代龙尊在此引导古海之潮，加固建木封印。</data>
