    <node id="青镞">
      <data key="d0">青镞</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">青镞是神策府的成员，负责向星穹列车传达信息，并提及太卜暂代将军职责等事务。&lt;SEP&gt;青镞is a secretary who explains the difficulty of handling the revived Arbor and the political situation on the Luofu.&lt;SEP&gt;青镞是太卜符玄的助手，负责收集情报和起草文书，认为太卜工作繁重。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-329c1b97983307d60a3541156156882f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024d2e72f6f7b12c92caa76b22df8be2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5</data>
