      <data key="d2">小三月is a nickname used by Himeko to refer to March 7th, highlighting her childlike excitement about the trip.&lt;SEP&gt;小三月is a crew member of the Astral Express who was informed about the invitation's secret before the journey.&lt;SEP&gt;小三月, also known as March 7th, is a passenger on the Astral Express who leaves with Himeko to check out from the hotel.&lt;SEP&gt;小三月, also known as March 7th, is a passenger of the Astral Express who leaves with Himeko to check out of the hotel.</data>
