    <node id="盛会之星">
      <data key="d0">盛会之星</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">"盛会之星" (Festival Star) is an alternative title for Penacony (匹诺康尼), a celestial location renowned as the "Planet of Festivities" or "Land of Exuberance." It is depicted as a starry sky hotel in the universe, a dazzling metropolis that attracts dream-chasers inspired by the legacy of the Clockmaker. This bustling hub of celebration, known for its luxurious nightlife and beautiful dreams, serves as the central stage for dialogues about dreams and collapse, yet it harbors darker elements, with incidents of stowaways, deceivers, and criminals being not uncommon. Notably, the "永火官邸" (Eternal Fire Mansion) once planned to destroy it, and it is identified as the site of the "星核之灾" (Stellar Core Disaster). The "盛会之星" also represents a point of contention, as Sunday insists it must not revert to chaos and lawlessness, underscoring its dual nature as a symbol of both hope and intrigue.&lt;SEP&gt;The Planet of Festivities is the name for the world of Penacony, which has bred the Order's consciousness for centuries.&lt;SEP&gt;盛会之星is a series of collectible cards, with a limited edition version being a specific item in the conversation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c55386d63b94eb9742f952f3f22848dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66cf67fcb2b367fc8c70e85c70acc6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-825953bbddc81f456bf53ec3b5e18e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39191a57b86d0c36329b9779dc5a8995&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d063d42a7d57ae6c56275f1aaaa1ec8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572b9afac6065d24e54da05a551fbbc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3428cb608b39b27cf65390b499a0173e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee77b88c86c938c0967cd2eb1ef92ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53c7f48036990ccca5a5b48e0fe82a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11db0eebf350de4c9c9bbf8188cadf5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19f5f030dc583660b802b079e3f709e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-603ef2226ecb6b7032da6f1dbc06644f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ab104d64e9eb410cea34464f76c33a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cca95c43061171ec0f9a64327c928c33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2e9955ec7cd96066b2da5a65826e6bd</data>
