    <node id="梦境">
      <data key="d0">梦境</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">梦境 is a core and complex concept in the world of Honkai: Star Rail, primarily referring to the extensive, constructed dream realm or dreamscape associated with the planet Penacony. This conceptual space serves as an overarching dreaming state, a safe realm provided and reshaped by the Family, where characters can communicate, converse, and engage in a wide range of activities that drive the story's primary events. The dream world is a virtual reality space unique to Penacony, caused by high concentrations of 忆质 (Memory Matter), and is divided into twelve independent dreamscapes. Access to this realm is typically gained through hotels located in the real world, and sounds within are often described as shadows of dreams, highlighting its ethereal and constructed nature.

The dreamscape is a magical, structured, and often surreal domain experienced by visitors, but it is revealed to be more complex and dangerous than officially claimed, possessing layers of true and false realities. It is a reality that can be influenced by memories, navigated through areas like the Memory Zone, and is subject to unique dangers and rules. Characters such as 加拉赫 and 猎犬 track 流萤's traces within it, and it is a state from which 砂金 wakes up. The dream is also the specific realm where 加拉赫 was created as a fictional being. Furthermore, it is a beautiful but fragile dreamscape that is starting to collapse, ultimately serving as a core experience and a surreal domain closely tied to the activities of the Family.&lt;SEP&gt;The dream world of Penacony, where an incident is rumored to have occurred that could affect the Harmony Grand Festival.&lt;SEP&gt;梦境是匹诺康尼的基础，家族承诺不会在梦境中伤害人。&lt;SEP&gt;The dreamscape is the overarching setting where the events take place, including the Grand Theater and the pre-shows.&lt;SEP&gt;梦境is a domain that黑天鹅considers a home, where she helped the group escape.&lt;SEP&gt;梦境是一个抽象概念，众人之前所处并刚刚返回的现实世界之外的空间。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4044b89b470454271f8b524e00475f7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-334e7e79d5c51585ceb73017dc7d115a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2b4ade52cf1ff815c99a9bf7a8f697e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-088541780cd6898348a852107a2583cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0a70a6406ad3789553b939ba9a7d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a16fedfe3f508b11cdff3673766a2c3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10a9a57ca0c7078de0765d59816cccd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5179dc00e5d44a2c504e7041b8bb948e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7dcaf80719866a0b9c2ddcb6cf0c498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94b36a60fd2207123b5e9971b8727478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-410f71ecf8e49938b81e964a9399bc3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-397cb05512c9c527d5b3c213e7dbc9b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b3042cb485fcff761368d2fa08b2f5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbf1e080f7d2432c571b42ae8fc7291c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd4110dd8b2ec1a3d4e9ee703131d0f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-622a56b244419f3133bcd4b11feb44f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98bd728493101041950cb3bbec840969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14ef88ed231842823bf1bb0651d40e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3428cb608b39b27cf65390b499a0173e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1e25533bb02e085267257087f8cfab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-745ef3f5cddfa7a86e439825e5de4a96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76afa09c20cb3ce18cbeba034f2526a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c8183406d2a4bc03402423db5c4a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d81d7afd4e410e297a5351eee7eb9d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adc094529bd44146c762587e8b448ea2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fecb71ee2401bfdf2be56be0fc3835d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b9e8302300ff54dabbffc9bcf5f0204</data>
