    <node id="喧哗与骚动">
      <data key="d0">喧哗与骚动</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">喧哗与骚动is a narrative event or chapter in a story, characterized by sound and fury, occurring at a specific time of night.&lt;SEP&gt;喧哗与骚动是一个标题或章节名称，涵盖了后面的副标题“丑时三刻的敲门声·在陌生的大厅中寻找出路”，描述了一个具体的场景和事件序列。&lt;SEP&gt;喧哗与骚动is a concept or title that frames the narrative context for the story about the golden age.&lt;SEP&gt;喧哗与骚动is a concept or event referenced in the context of visiting a salon.&lt;SEP&gt;喧哗与骚动is an overarching event or series of events, likely a larger narrative context within which the midnight waking and dream pool entry occurs.&lt;SEP&gt;An event or chapter title referencing the chaotic and noisy situation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d8b3036a7054e36e407ee2c643ac7421&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3d6e59a84cdff2359344a0988afec38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f538a89763c2867e55afcfe01521fffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cbbecf39bafc8dba9cd07bec4cf605e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a85593df517a24f90624d6d6d8ce60fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62881e327fa555c1113cdf9c14505837</data>
