    <node id="丑时三刻的敲门声">
      <data key="d0">丑时三刻的敲门声</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">丑时三刻的敲门声is a specific event within the narrative, describing a knock on a door occurring at the third watch of the night (丑时三刻).</data>
