    <node id="铁尔南">
      <data key="d0">铁尔南</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Tienan is a former Nameless who was a guard on the Astral Express and chose to settle in Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;铁尔南was a无名客who sacrificed himself before the turning point of匹诺康尼's history.&lt;SEP&gt;铁尔南是善用枪械的牛仔，带领人们挺过战争，后探索星系时被虫群包围而全军覆没。&lt;SEP&gt;铁尔南与拉格沃克、拉扎莉娜一起留在阿斯德纳，拉格沃克对其未能同行感到遗憾。&lt;SEP&gt;铁尔南is a character who comments on the absurdity of guarding people from within the 「Nihility」 and asks for黄泉's name.&lt;SEP&gt;铁尔南is a person whose existence is fading, but he believes the user's name should be remembered by the universe.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-66cf67fcb2b367fc8c70e85c70acc6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53c7f48036990ccca5a5b48e0fe82a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-943144073634dd9204a02a1a6cd56046&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a4bb44dd906f564ea60408699af064c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5554caf63113cf1aae9ee5c4485624e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5952867e688ef54311e49d8a4f3f4ad2</data>
