      <data key="d0">拉格沃克</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Lagwork is a former Nameless who was a mechanic on the Astral Express and chose to settle in Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;拉格沃克是最后一位无名客，他在弥留之际嘱咐加拉赫寄出邀请函，并准备了属于「开拓」后人的遗产。</data>
