      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Lazalina is a former Nameless who was a surveyor on the Astral Express and chose to settle in Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;拉扎莉娜是一位英雄，牺牲于独立战争，名字刻在流梦礁纪念碑上。&lt;SEP&gt;拉扎莉娜与拉格沃克、铁尔南一起留在阿斯德纳。</data>
