      <data key="d0">银轨</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Silver Rail is a network of train tracks connecting worlds, which once reached Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;银轨是星穹列车留下的轨道，由灯蛾家系尝试开垦。</data>
