    <node id="边陲监狱">
      <data key="d0">边陲监狱</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Penacony was originally used as a border prison by the Interastral Peace Corporation.&lt;SEP&gt;A former border prison which has been transformed into the luxurious hotel匹诺康尼.&lt;SEP&gt;边陲监狱(The Asdana Prison) is a location whose ownership the Interastral Peace Corporation is trying to recover from The Family of Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;边陲监狱是匹诺康尼的前身，曾为公司监狱，囚犯在哈努努领导下起义。&lt;SEP&gt;边陲监狱是匹诺康尼的前身，一个曾关押囚犯的地方，后被改造为自由之地。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-66cf67fcb2b367fc8c70e85c70acc6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f619797d531a760023734b0000857d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff5381ef14c0174d6621bf098b92d840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14ef88ed231842823bf1bb0651d40e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9189bbff0cdab4202d189f24260b142b</data>
