    <node id="星际和平播报">
      <data key="d0">星际和平播报</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">星际和平播报是一档星际广播节目，定期播报星际和平相关消息，是连接各星域的媒体内容。&lt;SEP&gt;星际和平播报是一档新闻报道节目，由男女声主持人播报，报道宇宙中的重大事件。&lt;SEP&gt;星际和平播报is a media broadcast service of the Interastral Peace Corporation that disseminates official news and announcements.&lt;SEP&gt;A news segment from the Interastral Peace Broadcasting, reporting on major incidents like the 'Aijihazha Sand Gold Case'.&lt;SEP&gt;星际和平播报is a news outlet that reports on the conflict between the卡提卡人and埃维金人in茨冈尼亚.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0d200c73d981b852fa64a6901ad64129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f46eb8f1702ab10d93418f19e93e9bb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b99ab1743f20fd38242e46be4fdebb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24c8b3733d7b211b7ce78db7de0a56d3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779006620</data>
