    <node id="橡木家系">
      <data key="d0">橡木家系</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Oak Family (橡木家系) is one of the five great families that constitute the governing body of the planet Penacony, known collectively as the Family. Within this ruling structure, the Oak Family is responsible for authorizing and coordinating the behavior of the Hunt Family (猎犬家系) and holds significant authority. The head of the Oak Family is Sunday (星期日), who has also been referred to as its "second patriarch" and "铎音" (spokesperson). The family's most prominent figure is described as the "wing-headed boy." The Oak Family is known to have been among the five families that betrayed the Clockmaker and his children. It authorized the Nameless (无名客) to assist with an investigation but is suspected of withholding information and has been unwilling to agree with their demands. The family is under stress due to a murder, and it is suspected that a true betrayer may be lurking within its ranks. A suspicious visitor associated with Gallagher (加拉赫) was linked to the Oak Family, and the family has an agreement with a character named Sand Gold (砂金). Notably, its members were absent from the hotel. The Oak Family, under Sunday's leadership, declared its own enmity with the Astral Express, a position he noted did not necessarily represent the other families. The family also extended an invitation representing its 107,336 souls, implying that all of them were involved in a particular plan.&lt;SEP&gt;The Oak Family is a faction within Penacony's Family, formerly headed by Sunday, who was dismissed by the Family after the incident.&lt;SEP&gt;橡木家系is one of the Five Families of Penacony. Sunday planned to use its faction members' will (over 100,000 people) to carry out his scheme.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-20dddf19eb9d23402675b17b25d6b7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce6adaabd8f6d85314cbea559ce01a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-981eb877163a6b386e5d40eb1f7edddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21d69e5d473598eccb1e77a81726c583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14ef88ed231842823bf1bb0651d40e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8540d7e0e81fe2169489850051f5cdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-745ef3f5cddfa7a86e439825e5de4a96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ba3b6dae092d55950f9ddb961ea479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2f9568f3044cc0b8024fbb468793c90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae9b4cc1fecad7f9f71968041c2edbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19f5f030dc583660b802b079e3f709e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-225b9ab801f101967ba46c6705f68054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76afa09c20cb3ce18cbeba034f2526a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c8183406d2a4bc03402423db5c4a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ab104d64e9eb410cea34464f76c33a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54eac7c3e839691c079d25a3b921a4d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d81d7afd4e410e297a5351eee7eb9d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1853bbf4383b790ff8a8b2d27d966ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa4f6559bb8c6fdf7a61d696bb98ea71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c75592f96a4b5f7fcffc49d7d471d7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-634037196a7f2b333524f9f78739583e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bef71ea9725559b5e05574558cbcec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-950f3c9663f4eaa9cf5cef2539e2ff52</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
