    </node>
    <node id="入梦池">
      <data key="d0">入梦池</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Dreamscape Pool (入梦池) is a device or facility used to enter the dreamscape of Penacony, typically located within hotel guest rooms. It allows guests to immerse themselves in dreams, providing a comfortable dreaming experience. The pool also serves as a method for accessing the true Penacony. While the Family uses the Dreamscape Pool to monitor a dreamer's physiological indicators—such as heart rate, blood oxygen, and body temperature—during sleep (with records managed by them), it also functions as a safety mechanism that can forcibly awaken a dreamer when they are in danger, thus preventing death. Notably, Memokeepers do not require this device to enter dreams. The Dreamscape Pool has been used by Silver Wolf to provide hidden map coordinates and is associated with the event of waking up at midnight.&lt;SEP&gt;The dream pools are devices used to keep guests’ bodies in a comatose state while they exist in the dreamscape.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c2b4ade52cf1ff815c99a9bf7a8f697e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a111bfaa2097692df9de2c4cee43b80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a85593df517a24f90624d6d6d8ce60fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-729906f69b0dc31b866284fec42bd817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aef888c83a56efa55bc6bdac956ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-157465497ea64ffb70d63727d9cd7189</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016499</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="邀请函">
      <data key="d0">邀请函</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">邀请函is a mysterious invitation received by the Astral Express, which is a music box containing a hidden message decrypted by姬子.&lt;SEP&gt;An invitation that is connected to the Watchmaker and the Nameless, central to the main plot.&lt;SEP&gt;邀请函is the invitation to the event in Penacony, the authenticity of whose connection to the Clockmaker is questioned by Himeko.&lt;SEP&gt;An invitation that posed the question "Why does life sleep?" which Firefly refers to.&lt;SEP&gt;An invitation that was delivered to the泯灭帮, initiating the events under investigation.&lt;SEP&gt;邀请函是永火官邸将在未来收到的一个物品，涉及刃提到的后续事件。&lt;SEP&gt;邀请函是拉格沃克•夏尔•米哈伊尔计划必须寄到星穹列车手中的信件。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c1a1c7c7cdd2117231c2128f98f9f367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0a70a6406ad3789553b939ba9a7d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-119c7196661ead67f3283cc47c1aa976&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c93d548b2a01ac78c4534185b1c50d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c86e4e8873e665dc85fecd7c393c16c6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069826</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
