    </node>
    <node id="八音盒">
      <data key="d0">八音盒</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">八音盒is the physical form of the invitation, which can play music, but the one received by the Astral Express had dissonant sounds.&lt;SEP&gt;八音盒是巡海游侠用于入住酒店的物品。&lt;SEP&gt;An object that served as the "邀请函" for the泯灭帮and contains memories from its custody, notably by黄泉.&lt;SEP&gt;A music box that Huang Quan asks the Annihilation Gang leader to leave behind as a chance to live.&lt;SEP&gt;八音盒是星穹列车收到的物品，内藏「钟表匠」的留言。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c1a1c7c7cdd2117231c2128f98f9f367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d063d42a7d57ae6c56275f1aaaa1ec8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572b9afac6065d24e54da05a551fbbc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14ef88ed231842823bf1bb0651d40e4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779005809</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="谐乐">
      <data key="d0">谐乐</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">谐乐is the musical note that the invitation music box plays when its spring is wound, featuring dissonant tones according to姬子's description.&lt;SEP&gt;谐乐is the music of harmony used by Robin to adjust the Trailblazer's mental state.&lt;SEP&gt;谐乐是「同谐」命途的颂歌，在希佩吞纳太一后，原本的合唱变为谐乐的颂歌。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c1a1c7c7cdd2117231c2128f98f9f367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10a9a57ca0c7078de0765d59816cccd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d81d7afd4e410e297a5351eee7eb9d8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069449</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="引力波频率">
      <data key="d0">引力波频率</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">引力波频率is a gravitational wave frequency that the music box's audio background matched, used by姬子to decode the message.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c1a1c7c7cdd2117231c2128f98f9f367</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778835530</data>
