      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">筹码are items used in gambling, with three being claimed as sufficient for a gamble.&lt;SEP&gt;gaming tokens found scattered on the floor of the bar.&lt;SEP&gt;筹码is a concept used by the冷漠的男性to describe砂金's role and expendability.&lt;SEP&gt;筹码are the "three chips" (the托帕石, 砂金石, and another "基石") that砂金bets on his plan for匹诺康尼.&lt;SEP&gt;筹码are game tokens that fell from the sky at克劳克影视乐园, later disappearing, and were part of the拟梦技术效果.&lt;SEP&gt;筹码是砂金给开拓者的信物，实际上是小型发信器。</data>
