    <node id="大堂">
      <data key="d0">大堂</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">大堂 is a location that appears to serve as a key destination across multiple contexts. In the context of the Memory Zone or a hotel setting, the Lobby is the main lobby and a significant goal that various characters, including Black Swan, the protagonist, and黄泉 (the character being guided by the Navigator lady), are trying to reach. It is described as a destination that requires effort to locate within the Memory Zone and is the place where the characters plan to go after passing through their current area. Additionally, the Lobby is mentioned as the starting point where an identical elevator was observed, suggesting it may be a recurring or pivotal area within a hotel. In a separate context, the Lobby (大堂) is also noted as an area aboard the Star Rail (星穹列车), where Himeko (姬子) and a general (将军) are conversing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-50324d9549c90d9f6834f20f38e5f8a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-397cb05512c9c527d5b3c213e7dbc9b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-decf73ec6ca6190de19732c8d1e452cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f224a52938afe06f7dc4abae08d7f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b3042cb485fcff761368d2fa08b2f5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62881e327fa555c1113cdf9c14505837&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b9e8302300ff54dabbffc9bcf5f0204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eafccb4855b4210dcf8ae59537a1eb77</data>
