    <node id="艾丽">
      <data key="d0">艾丽</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">艾丽is a hotel front desk staff member who is checking reservation information.&lt;SEP&gt;艾丽是白日梦酒店的前台工作人员，为星穹列车的客人办理入住手续。&lt;SEP&gt;艾丽is a hotel front desk staff member who handles inquiries about hotel records and hotel system data.&lt;SEP&gt;艾丽is a character who reassures guests about life-sign monitoring for safety.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the Bloodhound Family who assures the crew that monitoring vital signs is for guest safety.&lt;SEP&gt;艾丽是「白日梦」酒店的前台工作人员，负责接待宾客并处理入住事宜。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1c5225a08fcc8c681d02f077d4dde16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aef888c83a56efa55bc6bdac956ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6b4da45b5db96356b86865d457909d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56bf05d342e60a2ae1c0004ed755f892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76afa09c20cb3ce18cbeba034f2526a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016500</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="三月七女士">
      <data key="d0">三月七女士</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">三月七女士is a passenger of the Astral Express with a platinum room reservation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778835798</data>
