    </node>
    <node id="钻石">
      <data key="d0">钻石</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">钻石is the head of the Strategic Investment Department, Aventurine's superior.&lt;SEP&gt;钻石is a member of the "石心十人" who focuses on results, and whose actions砂金seeks to justify by creating enough value.&lt;SEP&gt;The head of the Strategic Investment Department, referred to as 'Diamond'.&lt;SEP&gt;钻石is the person who chose砂金for the mission, as he only cares about obtaining匹诺康尼.&lt;SEP&gt;钻石(Diamond)是石心十人的领导者)，发起了关于砂金的会议，并对砂金的未来做出决议。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d49da9008828c6200d6d99602c0309a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b99ab1743f20fd38242e46be4fdebb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-192d4c65dacdd377abc5e38c2529132e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a5c4612ea2ec33740c626cf9067e70</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779101171</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="战略投资部">
      <data key="d0">战略投资部</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">战略投资部is the department within the Interstellar Peace Company that Aventurine works for.&lt;SEP&gt;The Strategic Investment Department is a division of the Interstellar Peace Company that砂金belongs to.&lt;SEP&gt;战略投资部是星际和平公司的一个部门，负责砂金的任务并期待其死讯。&lt;SEP&gt;The Strategic Investment Department of the IPC, which directed the relocation of the suspect.&lt;SEP&gt;战略投资部是公司的一个重要部门，砂金是其干部。&lt;SEP&gt;The Strategic Investment Department is a division of the Interstellar Peace Company that votes to permanently abandon claims on Penacony.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aea80432a137f815124bb7fadd3b0383&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19fa917549ed487883ffc4d2270cc5d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b99ab1743f20fd38242e46be4fdebb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d404ca122e5e26803146d6835398291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a26e6722285ef522993b41004a8fb2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779101004</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="星期日先生">
      <data key="d0">星期日先生</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">星期日先生is another name for Sunday, a member of the Family in Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;星期日先生is a character who does not seem to create an image of being aloof based on the mansion's decor.&lt;SEP&gt;星期日先生is a person who requested真理医生to bring a suspect to the meeting area.&lt;SEP&gt;星期日先生is a member of the Family, possibly the head of the Oak family, who is tracking the whereabouts of the company's envoy.&lt;SEP&gt;星期日先生是瓦尔特在谈判前怀疑的对象，瓦尔特觉得他的态度有些不对劲。&lt;SEP&gt;星期日先生is a contact person the hotel needs to get in touch with for the check-in process.&lt;SEP&gt;星期日先生is a formal way to refer to Sunday, described as a decent man who imprisoned people using his "Tuning" ability but did not harm them severely.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9de4b10f842bc7af36c30316a0a72a84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c32fef6b2ca99ee137b9f48fa9ca28a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cfbc268760ea4bc489027077a7b65a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d404ca122e5e26803146d6835398291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d31c548c51772ffa1288c6206b2ff0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bef71ea9725559b5e05574558cbcec4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779100891</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="公司战略投资部">
      <data key="d0">公司战略投资部</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">公司战略投资部is the Strategic Investment Department of the Interstellar Peace Company, to which Aventurine belongs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515</data>
