    <node id="梦境护照">
      <data key="d0">梦境护照</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Dream Pass is a guide that instructs users on how to operate the dream pool.&lt;SEP&gt;梦境护照是酒店客房房卡，集成入住功能，也是匹诺康尼的纪念品，支持打卡功能并生成梦境手账。&lt;SEP&gt;梦境护照is a guidebook for dreamers in Penacony that provides information about the various dreamscapes.&lt;SEP&gt;梦境护照is a document that records a customer's journey in匹诺康尼.&lt;SEP&gt;梦境护照(Dream Passport) is a personalized document required for exchanging Aiden Tokens, verified by the administrator.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1c5225a08fcc8c681d02f077d4dde16&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0a70a6406ad3789553b939ba9a7d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00d0fbb77db3436bd966280bc71989ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a1a975c1b544b3b996dc81b6a9744e6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836624</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="钟表匠的遗产">
      <data key="d0">钟表匠的遗产</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Clockmaker's Legacy, also known as the Watchmaker's Legacy, is a significant, mysterious, and coveted prize sought after by various factions within the story of Penacony. This inheritance or asset is connected to the history of the Trailblaze and is linked to everyone within the dream of Penacony. The legacy is a central goal that characters such as Aventurine and Sam (who mentions a "grand legacy" in relation to it) intend to use for their own purposes, while others, like Firefly, are hesitant to abandon it. The legacy is also a prominent target of the character Acheron during her search in Penacony. It is described as being connected to a recent death, specifically a mysterious event or object tied to the demise of a young woman. The pursuit of the Clockmaker's Legacy has ignited a series of events that drive the conflict and investigation within the narrative of Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;钟表匠的遗产是拉格沃克•夏尔•米哈伊尔计划用来举办盛会的理由。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-119c7196661ead67f3283cc47c1aa976&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b85937e6bc111bb0516718814af5cb90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32d6689318964b4f25cc58e1492544f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-729906f69b0dc31b866284fec42bd817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f273e249d48375fe4ce18df04b167906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d68ceba3f304fb715c34b69def89e801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-981eb877163a6b386e5d40eb1f7edddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dceb88ab2e44d48a689d3dca587728e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c86e4e8873e665dc85fecd7c393c16c6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069816</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="茨冈尼亚奴隶">
      <data key="d0">茨冈尼亚奴隶</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Aventurine is a former slave from the planet Sigonia, which is part of his background.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778835833</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="泯灭帮">
      <data key="d0">泯灭帮</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">The Doomsday Sect, a faction Aventurine considers but deems unlikely as an ally.&lt;SEP&gt;泯灭帮is a faction that砂金mentions, and黑天鹅confirms its existence and involvement.&lt;SEP&gt;泯灭帮是一个组织，永火官邸曾将其他泯灭帮作为攻击目标。&lt;SEP&gt;A group of outlaws who disappeared after encountering黄泉. They received an "邀请函" and their memories are being investigated by黑天鹅.&lt;SEP&gt;泯灭帮是一个恶势力团体，其成员阿弗利特在匹诺康尼惨死。&lt;SEP&gt;泯灭帮是一个角色或组织，在对话中被提及失去音讯，瓦尔特向丹恒求证此事并非砂金编造。&lt;SEP&gt;泯灭帮是银河中一个恶劣的派系，但被认为不如得罪巡海游侠严重。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41a99864b87ae5c7c8eb089ea4a5b9d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d063d42a7d57ae6c56275f1aaaa1ec8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d68ceba3f304fb715c34b69def89e801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89c9a7f59707875421c63842c0c2864&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-603ef2226ecb6b7032da6f1dbc06644f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016358</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="纯美骑士团">
      <data key="d0">纯美骑士团</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">The Knights of Beauty, a faction whose attendance at events is still uncertain.&lt;SEP&gt;A knight order that Asimid's speech reminds the protagonist of.&lt;SEP&gt;纯美骑士团是信奉纯美女神伊德莉拉的骑士组织，银枝是其成员。&lt;SEP&gt;The Knights of Beauty is an organization that received an invitation from the "Watchmaker."&lt;SEP&gt;纯美骑士团(Knights of Beauty)是派系)，银枝是其成员，帮助砂金全身而退。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e43423b829e0e1a4b962a14f6ade99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b2c339896aa1485cee46de5caa5513b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0120d6441f2644ee546f500398f26838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a5c4612ea2ec33740c626cf9067e70</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779101181</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="砂金石">
      <data key="d0">砂金石</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The aventurine stone, a key component of Aventurine's power that was confiscated by the Family.&lt;SEP&gt;砂金石is the third "基石" (Cornerstone) that砂金successfully smuggles past星期日by using托帕石as a decoy.&lt;SEP&gt;砂金石(Avgitine) is a gem or artifact in砂金's possession that is too broken to protect him fully.&lt;SEP&gt;砂金石是一个宝物或基石，其光芒消失代表了某种结果。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d49da9008828c6200d6d99602c0309a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b13f1d619b99829ec04b15c537d259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779006461</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="基石">
      <data key="d0">基石</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Cornerstones, also known as "基石," are precious artifacts and holy stones that seal the power of an Emanator of Preservation. They are cast from the light of the Aeon Qlipoth's physical body and serve as badges of office and power for the members of the "Stonehearts" (石心十人). These stones are considered more valuable than life itself, acting as a symbol of identity and authority. Aventurine, a member of the Stonehearts, once had his cornerstone stones confiscated. He later used his cornerstone in a high-stakes gamble, disguising it among jewels as a gift to successfully infiltrate the Family's territory. Although Aventurine ultimately won the gamble, he lost his cornerstone as the price, demonstrating that these stones can be broken yet still retain function.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282520995832324abf63454ecad3f3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aea80432a137f815124bb7fadd3b0383&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-009c79711483e2ca1c076c720ae3e662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19fa917549ed487883ffc4d2270cc5d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d49da9008828c6200d6d99602c0309a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b13f1d619b99829ec04b15c537d259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a5c4612ea2ec33740c626cf9067e70</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779101195</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="茨冈尼亚">
      <data key="d0">茨冈尼亚</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Sigonia, a planet whose slaves are referenced in Aventurine's background.&lt;SEP&gt;茨冈尼亚is the home region of the Eridian people, associated with stereotypes of being liars, thieves, and socialites.&lt;SEP&gt;Tsugania is a planet often called the "thirsty eye of the storm" and a "God-forsaken land," characterized by drought, thunder, and bloodshed.&lt;SEP&gt;茨冈尼亚is a location, with砂金being derogatorily referred to as a茨冈尼亚的鬣狗.&lt;SEP&gt;茨冈尼亚is an unowned star region where the卡提卡人and埃维金人conflict takes place.&lt;SEP&gt;茨冈尼亚是砂金的故乡，他从那里的荒漠走来，经历苦难。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee043452b079db75e92301d147036f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39d2c739f8e0853297665a283cb117d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24c8b3733d7b211b7ce78db7de0a56d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24216adb3550f4039e3373041f9f3067</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779015268</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="埃维金人">
      <data key="d0">埃维金人</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Avgin people, to whom Aventurine belongs, who teach that "friends are weapons."&lt;SEP&gt;埃维金人is the people of茨冈尼亚的埃维金氏族, who are characterized by their inability to read, tamper with, or manipulate others' thoughts.&lt;SEP&gt;埃维金人是卡卡瓦夏所属的氏族，其财富被认为是卡卡瓦夏的好运。&lt;SEP&gt;The埃维金人are a people group, of which砂金is a member, and are believed by砂金to be extinct in the universe.&lt;SEP&gt;The Evijin people are an ethnicity or group, mentioned in the fragmented title, often associated with sand or gambling in the story context.&lt;SEP&gt;The Avgin people, a group whose good fortune is considered the most valuable wealth.&lt;SEP&gt;埃维金人are a group with a vendetta, celebrating the卡卡瓦祭典, who are attacked by the卡提卡人.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282520995832324abf63454ecad3f3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce9985de7455578605cf22e38811639d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-415c7bdbfc0ac0348c2f17ccb1d95aa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f43b730084add2664fd6ace2b5c04bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18e073010df1d8dcb67d8164010d59bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24c8b3733d7b211b7ce78db7de0a56d3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779006618</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="阿蒂尼孔雀">
      <data key="d0">阿蒂尼孔雀</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An Adini peacock, a bird with one of the ugliest calls in the universe, used by Ratio as a metaphor for Aventurine.&lt;SEP&gt;阿蒂尼孔雀is a comparison used by拉帝奥to describe砂金, implying a certain deceptive or showy nature.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-415c7bdbfc0ac0348c2f17ccb1d95aa7</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779006068</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="米哈伊尔">
      <data key="d0">米哈伊尔</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">米哈伊尔（Mikhail）是一位关联着匹诺康尼（Penacony）梦境、且身份复杂并带有悲剧色彩的关键人物。他最为人所知的身份是“钟表匠”（Watchmaker），一位脱离了创建匹诺康尼的家族并最终被家族视为背叛者的神秘人物。作为前无名客（Nameless），米哈伊尔曾犯下一次错误，并为此遗留下了一条艰难的道路给后来的无名客。他曾为了宣传而创造了“盛会海选”（Grand Prix），并为未来的无名客留下了一个“梦泡”（Dream Bubble）。米哈伊尔也被指是米沙（Misha）的祖父，一位记录航海日志并结交无名客的领航员或探险家，也曾被米沙唤作“爷爷”。

在梦境的回忆中，米哈伊尔是一个消失或缺席的人，常被未知声音呼唤其归来，也曾有人要求他带走一只折纸小鸟以作保护。他与加拉赫（Gallagher）关系密切，两人曾一同在梦境荒野中驰骋；但加拉赫所熟悉的米哈伊尔是原始的“钟表匠”，这个名号可能在他之后被继承。米哈伊尔最终因年老体弱离开了匹诺康尼，并在梦境中与秘密和情感告别紧密相连，是一位身份极其复杂且带有浓厚悲剧色彩的昔日筑梦者。&lt;SEP&gt;米哈伊尔is Misha's grandfather, a navigator and great traveler who sailed aboard the "Compass" and is associated with the "Watchmaker" identity.&lt;SEP&gt;米哈伊尔是已故的无名客，曾参与计划，加拉赫将去地狱与他重逢。&lt;SEP&gt;米哈伊尔is one of the earlier Nameless who had the long-cherished wish to pioneer Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;Mikhail is a former Nameless whose hometown is Lushaka.&lt;SEP&gt;Mikhail is a character mentioned as having a connection to the ocean planet Lushaka, being the hometown of both Misha and Mikhail.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-683cc400019b140a55e158f14e31f797&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4f1aef42316b27a74ccb75b8cd295cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94b36a60fd2207123b5e9971b8727478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46b2b97289f01ed627152dd064d7b8f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-981eb877163a6b386e5d40eb1f7edddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14ef88ed231842823bf1bb0651d40e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3428cb608b39b27cf65390b499a0173e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53c7f48036990ccca5a5b48e0fe82a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d404ca122e5e26803146d6835398291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b893a9163e9decf898e6a47789d69c6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76f30cea7751c5e1cdb8b78f14fea91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e64c4e33d4c17b896fbd12e80f65658f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92b7f5f4dc623665b5e5c7330c0b5c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffa19e6c8f41788df56ba4b3dcb02a41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edd454eefe538364064b11caeeed6aad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cca95c43061171ec0f9a64327c928c33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a52baa9f6e0386aac3ddefb6f99df9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e038997304f6b48259a70927a3be53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d235d876b6479c8e730e06da624342e</data>
