    <node id="公司代表">
      <data key="d0">公司代表</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A representative of the Interastral Peace Corporation, described by Himeko as a ulterior-motived envoy and a smooth-talking merchant.&lt;SEP&gt;公司代表is a representative of the Interastral Peace Corporation, described as a cunning businessman and flamboyant young master.&lt;SEP&gt;公司代表is a corporate representative to be met at the hotel lobby negotiation.&lt;SEP&gt;The IPC representatives are the specific delegates who insisted the Trailblazer must attend the negotiation discussion.</data>
