    <node id="热砂的时刻">
      <data key="d0">热砂的时刻</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">热砂的时刻is a dreamscape in Penacony that Himeko looks forward to, featuring wilderness winds and taverns.&lt;SEP&gt;热砂的时刻is a location within匹诺康尼where the苏乐达™盛会海选's热砂分会场is located.</data>
