    <node id="匹诺康尼大剧院">
      <data key="d0">匹诺康尼大剧院</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Penacony Grand Theater is a prominent landmark and cultural venue located in Penacony. It is described as a grand, dazzlingly bright building that is even more luminous than the moon, symbolizing the prosperity and beauty of this land of dreams. The theater is most famously the designated venue for the Harmonic Grand Ceremony, a major event where champions are to enter and where the singer Robin is scheduled to perform a concert. However, the theater's significance extends beyond being a performance space; it is fundamentally tied to Penacony's very nature. The building itself is identified as the Stellaron, the core of the dreamscape, and is the cause of Penacony's transformation. As the center of the dream and the location of the Stellaron, the Penacony Grand Theater is also the stage for the Harmonic Grand Ceremony and is regarded as a decisive battleground for determining the future of Penacony, currently devoid of audiences and staff.&lt;SEP&gt;匹诺康尼大剧院是谐乐大典的举办地点，星期日邀请主角一行前往舞台中央。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b0a70a6406ad3789553b939ba9a7d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a98a1c1a689b396bfb11efe6ce17aa85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd240111452116215a8d61a962441a8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae9b4cc1fecad7f9f71968041c2edbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32d2a4d85dd65814c67bee4806ee1d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ab104d64e9eb410cea34464f76c33a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c75592f96a4b5f7fcffc49d7d471d7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3889b67baa0c9d0549e50a6f4357f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-634037196a7f2b333524f9f78739583e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779100750</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="盛会">
      <data key="d0">盛会</data>
