      <data key="d2">盛会is the grand event in Penacony involving a legacy, intrigue, and various factions, described as resembling a detective novel.&lt;SEP&gt;盛会是由拉格沃克•夏尔•米哈伊尔计划以“钟表匠的遗产”为名义，向全银河发出邀请，把人们聚集到匹诺康尼的活动。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b0a70a6406ad3789553b939ba9a7d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c86e4e8873e665dc85fecd7c393c16c6</data>
