      <data key="d2">钟表匠将梦想化作现实。&lt;SEP&gt;The concept of dreaming is central to the experiences of people in Penacony, as they are lulled into a dream state by the broadcast.&lt;SEP&gt;梦想是加拉赫在回忆与米哈伊尔在梦境荒野策马飞驰时提及的概念。</data>
