    <node id="梦境贩售店">
      <data key="d0">梦境贩售店</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">梦境贩售店is a super famous store located within the Oti Shopping Center, specializing in dream-related goods.&lt;SEP&gt;The Dreamscape Boutique is a shop in Penacony where visitors like the Astral Express crew can buy dream bubbles containing the memories of others, curated by Dr. Edward.&lt;SEP&gt;梦境贩售店是一家为客人提供梦境体验服务的店铺，位于匹诺康尼。&lt;SEP&gt;梦境贩售店is a location within the匹诺康尼dream world where one can spend time.&lt;SEP&gt;梦境贩售店is a location in Penacony where姬子plans to investigate.&lt;SEP&gt;梦境贩售店is a shop where姬子consulted Edward the Doctor about dream bubbles.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-26bfe6e3e19a6097b5f4aad4304e4d11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff01e303ac33cbdc731672f2b8068156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24bad56f5285fbbd948b8af133255ccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa5aa8e08ea7c3effd4b7bef1b6f636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76f30cea7751c5e1cdb8b78f14fea91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74d9be5bb22932287cf5a631b7386195</data>
