    <node id="鸢尾花家系">
      <data key="d0">鸢尾花家系</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">鸢尾花家系(Iris Family) is one of the five major families (五大家系) in Penacony. This family is involved in performance and entertainment, maintaining performer archives and managing hotel system records. Notably, Firefly (流萤) is a member of this family, serving as an artist (艺者). The head of the 鸢尾花家系 has privately sought help from Sparkle (花火). The family is credited with developing the dream-building technology (拟梦技术) for the Harmony Festival (谐乐大典). Additionally, they have been accused by Emily of forcing Shu Weng (舒翁) into hiding, described as "bastards" and "villains," indicating their involvement in a dispute related to Shu Weng's predicament. A member of this family was also involved in a conflict at a bar.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-10a9a57ca0c7078de0765d59816cccd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01127f89b10186b1c68cbfb9082dd96d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aef888c83a56efa55bc6bdac956ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff27003d40cef9e5eea6b05a7803810c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb2a372ee2f9460e30f608f49c4ae874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5fc4bdb0dd2b9ee973fa3d6b9e49199&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9530d64790c372ec3c8746d7998106a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ded3035b9d576152c6b6ec854c5ffeed</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
