    </node>
    <node id="开拓客">
      <data key="d0">开拓客</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">开拓客是星穹列车的乘客，可以体验梦境贩售店的服务。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-24bad56f5285fbbd948b8af133255ccd</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="个性化梦泡">
      <data key="d0">个性化梦泡</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">个性化梦泡是可以重复体验的定制化梦境产品，由近期梦境和情绪原型制成。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-24bad56f5285fbbd948b8af133255ccd</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836252</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="情绪原型">
      <data key="d0">情绪原型</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">情绪原型是制作个性化梦泡所需的辅助材料。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-24bad56f5285fbbd948b8af133255ccd</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836255</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="电视">
      <data key="d0">电视</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">电视是道具，流萤认为它可能有猫腻，但先锋可以尝试。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a1f417d6e4dfdd365b59a413fbb957fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836260</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="情感">
      <data key="d0">情感</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">桑博提到了强烈情感，但他没有说明具体用途。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a1f417d6e4dfdd365b59a413fbb957fe</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836262</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="秘密据点">
      <data key="d0">秘密据点</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a1f417d6e4dfdd365b59a413fbb957fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b247ac5f089f87433ccf835725c1e41e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fa14e2cd405ae0ca7c60547e2d8750c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee043452b079db75e92301d147036f9f</data>
      <data key="d2">流萤计划带先锋去她的秘密据点，在那里揭露一切。&lt;SEP&gt;秘密据点(Secret Base) is a hidden location belonging to流萤, situated within the undeveloped dreamscape.&lt;SEP&gt;秘密据点(Secret Base) is a location the Trailblazer and Firefly were heading to before encountering Pocketwatch.&lt;SEP&gt;秘密据点is a secret base located inside a location accessible via a pinball machine.</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836974</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="小小哈努行动">
      <data key="d0">小小哈努行动</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">《小小哈努行动》是一部剧情介绍类的内容，描述了渗透乐被石头老板变小并冒险拯救美梦小镇的故事。&lt;SEP&gt;《小小哈努行动》 is a game world or level that the character流萤has just left or completed.&lt;SEP&gt;《小小哈努行动》是一个游戏或互动作品，讲述了哈努兄弟保卫美梦小镇的故事。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b5611e840a75b01108d00f49d206e97a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea54d0393768a455e6b3a9e281d49198&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-519002bb5791c29026085e92f1f99620</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016808</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="电视机">
      <data key="d0">电视机</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The "电视机" (television) is a multifunctional artifact and device. It serves as a portal or transition point to another realm, as it can absorb individuals, such as a character named Penetrating Music, and swap their consciousness with that of the Hanu Brothers, allowing for body-swapping to break barriers. Participants at a doorway can use it to leap into the world of the Hanu Brothers and experience a story. The television is also noted by the character Firefly as a potential source of danger or abnormal signal due to its glaring flash. For the Hanu Brothers themselves, touching the television is necessary for them to transform back into their original forms, and it acts as a device to transition to the next level. Additionally, it is identified as a TV set, an electronic device for receiving and displaying signals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b5611e840a75b01108d00f49d206e97a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9103d4503305e761c1839744485d9bf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44b1268c29f322dda94efbb954a2bab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ae55661a99ec8ee90f3ea2484b83418&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3dac2b0b58dede9fc2d9238e6c559d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05884a17d8c8c5a8133a0c2b263b2ba7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1edc535953132e71c8ea06d16e282c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2a617c09373b8228653ceb12250637b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779017088</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="门洞">
      <data key="d0">门洞</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">门洞是开始冒险的入口，渗透乐需要从那里钻进去。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b5611e840a75b01108d00f49d206e97a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836302</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="苏乐达主题休闲区">
      <data key="d0">苏乐达主题休闲区</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">苏乐达主题休闲区是匹诺康尼的一个游乐区域，名为「艾迪恩公园」。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c9b2a1a2685fcbb48ffa0db4ab228ace</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836303</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="苏乐达企业总部大楼">
      <data key="d0">苏乐达企业总部大楼</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">苏乐达企业总部大楼是一座巨大的汽水瓶形状的建筑，是匹诺康尼汽水文化的标志。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c9b2a1a2685fcbb48ffa0db4ab228ace</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836307</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="苏萨水">
      <data key="d0">苏萨水</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">苏萨水是苏乐达汽水的前身，最初由苏萨先生在监狱时期发明的甜味药水。&lt;SEP&gt;苏萨水是匹诺康尼的一种饮料，用于对比描述苏乐达的甜度特征。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c9b2a1a2685fcbb48ffa0db4ab228ace&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3428cb608b39b27cf65390b499a0173e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779005822</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="苏萨先生">
      <data key="d0">苏萨先生</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">苏萨先生是苏萨水的发明者，其配方后来被艾迪恩买下。&lt;SEP&gt;苏萨先生是饮料商，他的饮料救活了艾迪恩并启发他创造苏乐达™。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c9b2a1a2685fcbb48ffa0db4ab228ace&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3757b3a184b0e258bec874c72a3bf9d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016710</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="艾迪恩">
      <data key="d0">艾迪恩</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">艾迪恩是一位星际行商，买下苏萨水配方后创造了苏乐达品牌和「糖浆主义」。&lt;SEP&gt;艾迪恩·列达是苏乐达™商业帝国的缔造者、匹诺康尼十大富豪之一，也是苏乐达工厂的厂长。&lt;SEP&gt;艾迪恩是苏乐达™的创始人和热砂盛典的组织者，怀念匹诺康尼的逐梦年代。&lt;SEP&gt;Eden is an announcer who interacts with the Trailblazer and March 7th during the Hot Sand Ceremony.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c9b2a1a2685fcbb48ffa0db4ab228ace&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db7acddc1a4e47a665ceece42a9f23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3757b3a184b0e258bec874c72a3bf9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ab104d64e9eb410cea34464f76c33a5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069204</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="糖浆主义">
      <data key="d0">糖浆主义</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">糖浆主义是一种由艾迪恩提出的理念，声称饮用苏乐达是一种全新的生活方式。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c9b2a1a2685fcbb48ffa0db4ab228ace</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836313</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="梦见草">
      <data key="d0">梦见草</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">梦见草是苏萨水原始配方中的一种原料，现已彻底灭绝。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c9b2a1a2685fcbb48ffa0db4ab228ace</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836313</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="元年苏乐达">
      <data key="d0">元年苏乐达</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">元年苏乐达是只能在匹诺康尼的梦里才能品尝到的原始配方苏乐达。&lt;SEP&gt;元年苏乐达is a type of drink within the匹诺康尼dream world, mentioned as a source of intense feeling.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c9b2a1a2685fcbb48ffa0db4ab228ace&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa5aa8e08ea7c3effd4b7bef1b6f636</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836712</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="苏乐达汽水文化">
      <data key="d0">苏乐达汽水文化</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">苏乐达汽水文化是匹诺康尼的一种标志性文化，以艾迪恩公园和苏乐达企业总部大楼为代表。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c9b2a1a2685fcbb48ffa0db4ab228ace</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836314</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
