    </node>
    <node id="使命(Mission)">
      <data key="d0">使命(Mission)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">使命is the calling that莎塔娜mentions to开拓者, urging them to fulfill the contract.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ef6981d8589b8138e2d6716a404ea00e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836368</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="垃圾桶">
      <data key="d0">垃圾桶</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">垃圾桶are the entities that need to be helped and freed from troubles as part of the contract.&lt;SEP&gt;Sentient trash cans in the dream that form groups like a knight order and need to be united by the protagonist to fight the evil.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ef6981d8589b8138e2d6716a404ea00e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e43423b829e0e1a4b962a14f6ade99</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836730</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="阿斯德纳的中央监狱">
      <data key="d0">阿斯德纳的中央监狱</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Asdana Central Prison is the real-world counterpart that was repurposed into Penacony's Grand Theater within the dream.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a98a1c1a689b396bfb11efe6ce17aa85</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1778836374</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="谐乐颂">
      <data key="d0">谐乐颂</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">"Harmony Ode" is a musical piece or anthem continuously performed at the Grand Theater for the dream world.&lt;SEP&gt;The "Harmony Eulogy" (谐乐颂) is a text that Sunday quotes from to criticize Sparkle.&lt;SEP&gt;谐乐颂是一套教导人们关爱和帮助弱者的思想理念。&lt;SEP&gt;《谐乐颂》 is a scripture that知更鸟compares to the mysterious passages in her brother's journal, finding no similar records.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a98a1c1a689b396bfb11efe6ce17aa85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-083647d174927add1aefc63655ec615b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c47098afdb2c1a8744e7c9c843360554&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-620e245cd9df09d58b2231e7fff3bf19</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
