      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">"Choir of Harmony" is an incarnation of "Harmony," a path, and brings blessings to Penacony during the ceremony.&lt;SEP&gt;「齐响诗班」 is a choir entity associated with神主日, representing the forces of秩序.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a98a1c1a689b396bfb11efe6ce17aa85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5554caf63113cf1aae9ee5c4485624e7</data>
