      <data key="d2">开拓者must obtain three proofs of trust in order to fulfill the contract.&lt;SEP&gt;信任的证明is a symbolic item representing earned trust, given as a gift.&lt;SEP&gt;信任的证明is an item needed for a quest, lost by阿圾米德in a garbage pile.&lt;SEP&gt;Proofs of Trust are items that the Trailblazer has collected, symbolizing completed contracts or missions.</data>
