    <node id="猎犬家系成员">
      <data key="d0">猎犬家系成员</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">猎犬家系成员is a member of the猎犬家系, responsible for maintaining order in the dream world of匹诺康尼. They express intense emotions, have a duty-bound principle, reference characters like米娅, and engage in combat.&lt;SEP&gt;猎犬家系成员is a member of the Hunt family who guards the construction site and enforces the rule that non-construction team members are prohibited from entering.&lt;SEP&gt;猎犬家系成员是守卫，遵循家族规矩，表现出喜怒无常的情绪。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2aa5aa8e08ea7c3effd4b7bef1b6f636&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee31cbded467b8d75638ca57df54a73f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce6adaabd8f6d85314cbea559ce01a36</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
