      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">A character who was punished by Tatalov for angering him and is forced to count all the trash in the city.&lt;SEP&gt;阿圾米德is an elderly being with wisdom and intelligence, capable of giving and transferring trust.&lt;SEP&gt;阿圾米德is a trash can that possesses the "Trust Certificate" but has lost it in a mountain of garbage.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28e43423b829e0e1a4b962a14f6ade99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0038e05462ef55ab269a8168eaea158&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f84c99c0ea0228c39f808a8930a6d6a</data>
