      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">A character who claims many buckets praise his beauty and mentions the "Golden Buckle Knight Order".&lt;SEP&gt;垃圾桶王子is a prince turned into a trash can by dark magic, offering loyalty and service to the player.</data>
