      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A character who offers the protagonist a choice of death for saving him but later acknowledges the protagonist's bravery.&lt;SEP&gt;垃垃撕圾is a highly evil bucket that was imprisoned for countless years, growing bitter and vengeful towards any deliverer.&lt;SEP&gt;垃垃撕圾是观桶对话的对象，据说战胜了一个被封印的恶魔，获得了观桶及其它桶的信任。</data>
