      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">筑梦边缘is a location deep within a dreamscape that the characters are exploring.&lt;SEP&gt;筑梦边缘(Dream's Edge) is a location in the dreamscape, a deep area presumably bordering the constructed dream reality.&lt;SEP&gt;筑梦边缘is a location described as a remote, pioneering area not typically visited by tourists, where construction or dreaming activities take place.&lt;SEP&gt;筑梦边缘(Edge of Dreamscape) is a location that leads deeper into an area and is being patrolled by guards.&lt;SEP&gt;A remote area in the dreamscape of Penacony, described as the closest place to the sky in dreams.&lt;SEP&gt;筑梦边缘(Dream's Edge) is a location with complex construction that流萤frequently passes through, requiring activation and deactivation of the筑梦遥眼.</data>
