    <node id="帮派老大">
      <data key="d0">帮派老大</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">帮派老大是美梦小镇中的黑帮领袖，性格暴躁好斗，会因小事(如被指责不懂规矩)而以武力威胁他人。&lt;SEP&gt;帮派老大is a gang leader who initially behaves aggressively but later becomes confused and apologetic after experiencing a change in attitude.&lt;SEP&gt;帮派老大is a gang leader whose emotional state is altered by the clock trick, showing sudden politeness or sadness.&lt;SEP&gt;帮派老大是某个帮派的头目，曾因想起母星母亲而情绪激动。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-984f2b2c81711f4d1b45fc906d20a6b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfa9fb5844d8ca25fdcdcdb908866300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21dfe803f1b69867a83cc9b8e912e4d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce6adaabd8f6d85314cbea559ce01a36</data>
