      <data key="d2">筑梦边境is the location where the characters attempt to enter.&lt;SEP&gt;筑梦边境是匹诺康尼的一个区域，是三月七、开拓者和姬子寻找加拉赫的地点。&lt;SEP&gt;The location where the sheriff Galagher is currently present.</data>
