    <node id="埃维金">
      <data key="d0">埃维金</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">埃维金is a term for a honey-like people, used by砂金to describe himself.&lt;SEP&gt;The Avgin are a tribal group on Tsugania, associated with the meaning "honey," and considered blessed by the Mother Goddess.&lt;SEP&gt;埃维金is an organization or group mentioned in the context of the story.&lt;SEP&gt;埃维金is a term or name mentioned in the game, but its exact nature is unclear from the provided text fragment.&lt;SEP&gt;埃维金is a faction or group referred to in the text, associated with a boy.&lt;SEP&gt;埃维金is the ethnic group or clan to which the young boy and the other child (卡卡瓦夏) belong.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee043452b079db75e92301d147036f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e9683bae2c22cd52f4dabb5dac67998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7778f84cd4b1b1ad3d8124b8a0c6a5f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8fb3b2e78cf087e71949144122c8829&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-192d4c65dacdd377abc5e38c2529132e</data>
