    <node id="假面愚者">
      <data key="d0">假面愚者</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">The Masked Fools (假面愚者) are a sub-faction of the Fool, invited by the Fool faction to join their cause. They are a group of troublemakers known for causing street disturbances, which have led to misunderstandings involving黄泉, such as a potential prank that caused her to mistakenly enter a dream. The faction is characterized by its devotion to joy (欢愉) and illusionary arts (幻术), and notable members include花火, who represents these traits. The Masked Fools also aided Hanunu in an independence war. In another incident, one of their members, a young woman, once drugged the Trailblazer. Additionally, the faction gave砂金 a clue to "find a mute friend," with the mute person being知更鸟.&lt;SEP&gt;一个角色，提供了某种提示给砂金。&lt;SEP&gt;The假面愚者is a character who provided砂金with an answer capable of overturning everything.&lt;SEP&gt;假面愚者是擅长欺诈和玩弄他人的组织，花火是其成员。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee043452b079db75e92301d147036f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfa9fb5844d8ca25fdcdcdb908866300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59980cf920354512f617e41b955d0a8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-704fd94705176c5d8b7902f98a6e3b69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03be2219947057675dc5055c09116ccc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2d249f7bcbd0b19ddb847f1301c1021&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-981eb877163a6b386e5d40eb1f7edddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3428cb608b39b27cf65390b499a0173e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3ef576bac7adaec894b503280717b1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fc27eb1f7547ffdcf4c47fa1e6ca44c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9530d64790c372ec3c8746d7998106a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
