    <node id="忆庭">
      <data key="d0">忆庭</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A faction mentioned, home to the "Memokeepers", individuals who study and manipulate memories.&lt;SEP&gt;The Garden of Recollection is a faction that sent Memokeepers to Penacony to commemorate the historic moment.&lt;SEP&gt;忆庭(The Garden of Recollection) is a faction that licensed the Light Cone presentation technology used by Aventurine to show a memory.&lt;SEP&gt;The Garden of Recollection is an organization that agrees to assist with research on Penacony’s dreamscape and Memoria.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-119c7196661ead67f3283cc47c1aa976&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a111bfaa2097692df9de2c4cee43b80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff5381ef14c0174d6621bf098b92d840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a26e6722285ef522993b41004a8fb2</data>
