    <node id="梦主">
      <data key="d0">梦主</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Dreammaster, also known as "梦主," is a high-ranking, enigmatic entity and the current leader of the Family within the dreamscape of Penacony. Identified as Mr. Gopherwood and representing the Oak Family, the Dreammaster acts as the幕后 manager of the dreamscape, holding significant authority and a notable malice towards outsiders, having exiled 137 foreigners. This figure is a key power player in the region, to the extent that even members of the Hound Family believe they would not be allowed entry even if the Dreammaster themselves arrived. The Dreammaster is the main negotiating counterpart for figures like Welt Yang, particularly regarding talks involving the Stellaron, and operates behind the "Harmony" faction. The Dreammaster has shown dissatisfaction with Sunday's recent performance and is the intended recipient of a letter from Aimiki seeking to expose the crimes of the Iris Family; despite his power, Sunday is known to dare to act in opposition to the Dreammaster. As a mysterious figure, the Dreammaster is spoken of as a potential antagonist who might be manipulating the Stellaron and is awaited by Sunday and Robin regarding the Harmonious Grand Festival. The Dreammaster is a rarely seen ruler, with even the heads of the five houses knowing little about them, and has personally gone to the front lines to oversee the Harmony Grand Festival.&lt;SEP&gt;梦主是一名角色，身为家族的领导者，对谐乐大典和星核事件态度严肃，接受询问并试图证明清白。&lt;SEP&gt;「梦主」是匹诺康尼的神秘人物，提醒星期日让瓦尔特等人歇息。&lt;SEP&gt;梦主是一位名为歌斐木的神秘角色，是家族计划的核心策划者，意在让秩序降临于匹诺康尼。&lt;SEP&gt;梦主是匹诺康尼的领导者，星期日代表梦主发出邀请。&lt;SEP&gt;梦主与星期日另有图谋，共同策划了谐乐大典上的冲突。&lt;SEP&gt;梦主(Dreammaster) is a figure who tried to expel黄泉from the dream at all costs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce6adaabd8f6d85314cbea559ce01a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcc40b65a49e0c9b6e746474d3eeb7b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb2a372ee2f9460e30f608f49c4ae874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae9b4cc1fecad7f9f71968041c2edbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-943144073634dd9204a02a1a6cd56046&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11db0eebf350de4c9c9bbf8188cadf5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19f5f030dc583660b802b079e3f709e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d404ca122e5e26803146d6835398291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-399e9f5b95e2162b7f5074dcec92103a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c47098afdb2c1a8744e7c9c843360554&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d11ce896bd7f1b7e87c79e1a7cf7dabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-157465497ea64ffb70d63727d9cd7189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76f30cea7751c5e1cdb8b78f14fea91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c8183406d2a4bc03402423db5c4a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ab104d64e9eb410cea34464f76c33a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0120d6441f2644ee546f500398f26838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54eac7c3e839691c079d25a3b921a4d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d81d7afd4e410e297a5351eee7eb9d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c75592f96a4b5f7fcffc49d7d471d7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-634037196a7f2b333524f9f78739583e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea958dd07fcb944ce792ebb1149ed1b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-950f3c9663f4eaa9cf5cef2539e2ff52</data>
