    <node id="酒店">
      <data key="d0">酒店</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">酒店is the physical or dream hotel in Penacony that the Trailblazer considers returning to for waking up.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific hotel in匹诺康尼, possibly the "白日梦" hotel, which is a setting for the events and part of the investigation.&lt;SEP&gt;酒店is the location from which the characters are leaving.&lt;SEP&gt;The hotel is the location where corporate dogs (公司狗) are watching the characters.&lt;SEP&gt;The hotel in Penacony where the characters are located, which is a key location for the investigation.&lt;SEP&gt;酒店is a location that the current place is not, but米沙feels he has lived there for a while.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-410f71ecf8e49938b81e964a9399bc3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-473a36d80be8d1101b3f94e63e6f01c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c8183406d2a4bc03402423db5c4a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7be6554ad2d31235c95eb13deac8112e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fade5ce5717b1083491143af20df52aa</data>
