      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The protagonist, referred to as "小瞌睡虫" (sleepyhead) and "你" (you), has just woken up from a dream in the 【喧哗与骚动·倘若在午夜醒来·】 (Sound and Fury: If You Wake at Midnight) scenario.</data>
