    <node id="原始梦境">
      <data key="d0">原始梦境</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">原始梦境(Primordial Dream) is a concept described as an area that could negatively affect a person's mental state. The protagonist was fortunate not to be impacted by it.&lt;SEP&gt;The 'Primordial Dream' is a concept mentioned by the Trailblazer, indicating a deeper layer of the dreamscape.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-aace89d765824c111aa44dc26aee7e88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24565d6d66fd343d204ca6ee232d3fb3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
