    <node id="梦境酒店">
      <data key="d0">梦境酒店</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">梦境酒店是匹诺康尼美梦中的第一站，目前正在进行修缮。&lt;SEP&gt;The Dream Hotel is the designated meeting point in the dream world where the crew plans to gather after successfully entering the dream.&lt;SEP&gt;梦境酒店是匹诺康尼中的一个隐藏地点，被银狼称为隐藏地图，可能涉及家族秘密。&lt;SEP&gt;The "梦境酒店" (Dream Hotel) is where the Trailblazer and their companions first entered the dreamscape.</data>
