    <node id="筑梦拼图">
      <data key="d0">筑梦拼图</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">筑梦拼图is a mysterious object that appears unexpectedly and requires investigation.&lt;SEP&gt;筑梦拼图is a puzzle or artifact that is the subject of an investigation.&lt;SEP&gt;筑梦拼图is a puzzle challenge that must be completed to proceed, with fragments sought by enemies.&lt;SEP&gt;"Dreamweaver Puzzle" is a concept or item that needs to be completed to create an exit in the current location.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ba8ea9656978b4e19fcc42dec8ec2cc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c45c76fdbb8ac037f6f25d9c5599f73d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03ebfa7ecf0c4900fef7960e9a636783&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52733535a8d92067f786b9174c7caa23</data>
