    <node id="领航员小姐">
      <data key="d0">领航员小姐</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A navigator whose location, the 'lobby', is being sought.&lt;SEP&gt;领航员小姐是砂金提到的一个人物，被描述为聪明人。&lt;SEP&gt;领航员小姐(The Navigator) is a member of the Astral Express whom Aventurine believes will understand the value of his proposed cooperation.</data>
