    <node id="萨姆">
      <data key="d0">萨姆</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">"萨姆" is a multifaceted entity primarily known as a member of the "星核猎手" (Stellaron Hunters) organization. They are referred to as the "熔火骑士" (Molten Knight) and are the true, alternate identity of the character "流萤." As a remnant of the "格拉默铁骑" (Glammoth Iron Cavalry), Sam is skilled in genetic modification and possesses a simple personality but is capable of decisive and dangerous actions. Sam interacts with key figures like the protagonist and "黄泉" (Acheron), following a "script" provided by "艾利欧" (Elio) but retaining the right to make personal choices. They wear cold armor and do not possess the ability to dream. Sam has been known to threaten others with death and the act of "igniting the sea," and they waited for a long time in the cracks between dreams for the protagonist to awaken. They struggled to resolve matters simply, feel constrained by their script, and consider themselves less capable than fellow members Elio, "卡芙卡" (Kafka), "银狼" (Silver Wolf), and "刃" (Blade), though they are effective against villains. Ultimately, Sam revealed the full extent of "流萤" to others.&lt;SEP&gt;萨姆is a persona or transformed state of Firefly, who speaks a final line about meeting again in reality.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-729906f69b0dc31b866284fec42bd817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2539c79e7b103e6c4fb2a5bb7901dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572b9afac6065d24e54da05a551fbbc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f273e249d48375fe4ce18df04b167906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b13f1d619b99829ec04b15c537d259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1e25533bb02e085267257087f8cfab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-591f11cf1ef3be84f3f140ad6ced600a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cca95c43061171ec0f9a64327c928c33</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069935</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
