      <data key="d0">游戏</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">游戏is a concept referenced by砂金when he says '这下更有意思了' (this makes it more interesting), indicating a playful or game-like turn of events.&lt;SEP&gt;游戏is a survival challenge set by冷漠的男性for his 34 slaves, requiring them to survive for two days.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41a99864b87ae5c7c8eb089ea4a5b9d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39d2c739f8e0853297665a283cb117d2</data>
