    <node id="永火官邸">
      <data key="d0">永火官邸</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The "Eternal Fire Mansion" is a group led by Afrit from Tuofei, burning and looting to fulfill the will of destruction.&lt;SEP&gt;永火官邸是由阿弗利特领导的组织，践行「毁灭」意志，在赴约途中覆灭。&lt;SEP&gt;A location from which the泯灭帮departed, signifying a journey or event.&lt;SEP&gt;永火官邸是阿弗利特在匹诺康尼的住处或行动据点，与泯灭帮相关。&lt;SEP&gt;永火官邸将取代耶佩拉，并在不远的未来收到邀请函，是一个地点或组织。&lt;SEP&gt;The location that will replace耶佩拉in the future, receiving a message from an unknown sender.&lt;SEP&gt;The Eternal Flame Mansion is a location that will replace Yepela and become Firefly's next destination.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a2539c79e7b103e6c4fb2a5bb7901dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d063d42a7d57ae6c56275f1aaaa1ec8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d68ceba3f304fb715c34b69def89e801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-591f11cf1ef3be84f3f140ad6ced600a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c93d548b2a01ac78c4534185b1c50d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cca95c43061171ec0f9a64327c928c33</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069949</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="陀斐特">
      <data key="d0">陀斐特</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Tuofei is the location associated with the "Eternal Fire Duke" Afrit.&lt;SEP&gt;陀斐特是火魔阿弗利特的来源地，一个特定地点。&lt;SEP&gt;The location associated with the Fire Demons.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a2539c79e7b103e6c4fb2a5bb7901dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d063d42a7d57ae6c56275f1aaaa1ec8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572b9afac6065d24e54da05a551fbbc3</data>
