    <node id="冥火大公">
      <data key="d0">冥火大公</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">冥火大公is a fire demon from Tuofei, leader of the "Eternal Fire Mansion," who views Nanuk as his patron and engages in destruction.&lt;SEP&gt;The leader of the Annihilation Gang, a fire demon from Tophet, who seeks a final, blazing confrontation with Huang Quan.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a2539c79e7b103e6c4fb2a5bb7901dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-572b9afac6065d24e54da05a551fbbc3</data>
