    </node>
    <node id="阿弗利特">
      <data key="d0">阿弗利特</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">阿弗利特是来自陀斐特的火魔，一种元素生命，曾是永火官邸的领导者，被巡海游侠杀害。&lt;SEP&gt;阿弗利特is the fire demon known as the "Eternal Fire Duke," an elemental lifeform from Tuofei.&lt;SEP&gt;阿弗利特(Aflit) is a person whose death is confirmed by Aventurine, setting a precedent for the threat in Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;A voice heard in the memory of the invitation, possibly belonging to a member of the泯灭帮.&lt;SEP&gt;阿弗利特是泯灭帮成员，在匹诺康尼以将死之躯化为烈火殉道。&lt;SEP&gt;A person named Afleet.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a2539c79e7b103e6c4fb2a5bb7901dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d063d42a7d57ae6c56275f1aaaa1ec8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff5381ef14c0174d6621bf098b92d840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d68ceba3f304fb715c34b69def89e801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ae55661a99ec8ee90f3ea2484b83418</data>
