    <node id="迷因">
      <data key="d0">迷因</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">迷因are dream-based creatures that exist within the structure of the dream hotel, posing a threat to visitors.&lt;SEP&gt;迷因是黄泉在朝露公馆巡逻时发现的守卫实体。&lt;SEP&gt;迷因is a creature that attacked流萤in the dream, showing a reflection of "另一片梦境" in its pupil.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a930d2ce58da41c1260cc2977c4d9da1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c77346cce3c3448fb8ecdb4640cd7f32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-591f11cf1ef3be84f3f140ad6ced600a</data>
