    <node id="猎犬">
      <data key="d0">猎犬</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">猎犬是家族下属的家系，负责监视砂金在匹诺康尼的行动。&lt;SEP&gt;猎犬是一个团体或组织，与案件调查有关，被姬子认为是打听案情的目标。&lt;SEP&gt;The Hunters are the security faction in Penacony, represented by Woolsy who offers assistance to Aventurine.&lt;SEP&gt;Watchdogs are a faction in the dream, referred to by伍尔西as being ready to serve if danger arises.&lt;SEP&gt;猎犬是负责在梦境和现实中追踪偷渡犯的势力，在发现流萤人间蒸发后非常头疼。&lt;SEP&gt;猎犬是匹诺康尼五大家系之一。&lt;SEP&gt;The猎犬are a group that知更鸟mentions might have noticed her absence.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-03be2219947057675dc5055c09116ccc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd4110dd8b2ec1a3d4e9ee703131d0f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-319ffb461ba5f8c9e0f44cd7237080b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98bd728493101041950cb3bbec840969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3428cb608b39b27cf65390b499a0173e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95d96d4d7563dffb24dc61858d6be022&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-620e245cd9df09d58b2231e7fff3bf19</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779101204</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="朝露公馆">
      <data key="d0">朝露公馆</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">朝露公馆是橡木家系的要塞，也是星期日和砂金会面的地点，戒备森严。&lt;SEP&gt;朝露公馆是家族的一处宏伟宅邸，被认为是禁地，无人接待客人。&lt;SEP&gt;朝露公馆is a deep location within the tightly guarded family estate that黄泉and瓦尔特are entering.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-03be2219947057675dc5055c09116ccc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c77346cce3c3448fb8ecdb4640cd7f32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6189fd71f5b5b0638759e8acd76bcc</data>
