      <data key="d0">茨冈尼亚-Ⅳ</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Tsugania-IV is a barren planet located in the borderless zone between three major galaxies, known for its harsh climate and constant threat of small celestial body impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;The origin planet of the suspect in the fraud case, a place known for refugees.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b99ab1743f20fd38242e46be4fdebb8</data>
