      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Katika are a tribal group on Tsugania, associated with the meaning "blade," and represent a threat to the Avgin.&lt;SEP&gt;卡提卡是卡提卡人的别名，意为剥皮刀。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-009c79711483e2ca1c076c720ae3e662</data>
