    </node>
    <node id="卡卡瓦夏">
      <data key="d0">卡卡瓦夏</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">卡卡瓦夏（Kakavasha）是埃维金人（Avgin tribe）的一名儿童，被称为“母神的礼物”，出生时伴随雨水，并且被认为运气极好，受母神赐福。他是姐姐最后剩下的家人，曾与卡提卡人发生冲突并打赌获胜，将一条项链视为战利品，而姐姐则担心他的安危。在更深的语境中，卡卡瓦夏被揭示为砂金（Aventurine）的未来版本或真实身份，代表一种特定的命运或人生结果，其名字字面意思为人们所追求的“终点”。他也是诈骗案中的嫌疑人，是一名来自茨冈尼亚-Ⅳ（茨冈尼亚-IV）的幸存者，具备说服技巧。卡卡瓦夏曾请求砂金拍照作为纪念，表达对持久记忆的渴望，并在梦中与砂金对话，作为砂金过去的自我或内在小孩的化身。最后，故事中提到在卡卡瓦的极光下与他重逢和道别。&lt;SEP&gt;卡卡瓦夏is a name referenced in the conversation, likely another identity of砂金or a past self.&lt;SEP&gt;卡卡瓦夏is an埃维金人child, referred to as the one blessed by the Mother Goddess, who encounters and performs a ritual with砂金before being separated from his sister.&lt;SEP&gt;卡卡瓦夏is a character who is photographed and converses with砂金.&lt;SEP&gt;卡卡瓦夏is a character to whom the farewell 「再见，卡卡瓦夏。」 is addressed, likely a person named KAKAVASHA.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce9985de7455578605cf22e38811639d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-009c79711483e2ca1c076c720ae3e662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5386db4a801d2d7223330ecc84710a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b99ab1743f20fd38242e46be4fdebb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d721b9818dfeb98f14b8d1a877f7a139&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b218674dea3c2d8b0dd96c4c12a1e76c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b13f1d619b99829ec04b15c537d259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24c8b3733d7b211b7ce78db7de0a56d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289e083da669f9b6ec33a02ad3f5dbdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7462973bc25b8f97eb8d381115cfd21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e65a39e336fdf3baa2c212c73a1cfc66</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779015219</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="母神">
      <data key="d0">母神</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Mother Goddess is the supreme deity in the Avgin faith, also referred to as Fingo-Bijos.&lt;SEP&gt;砂金家族信仰的神祇，被认为是赐福的来源。&lt;SEP&gt;A deity or goddess that砂金references, believing in their protection and guidance during his endeavors.&lt;SEP&gt;母神is a deity figure referenced by 「砂金」 in the context of rain, forgiveness, and blessings.&lt;SEP&gt;母神(Mother Goddess) is a divine figure of the Avgin people, who guides and blesses砂金. Her call signals the moment of death.&lt;SEP&gt;母神is the divine entity of the埃维金人, associated with blessings, rain, and the卡卡瓦祭典.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce9985de7455578605cf22e38811639d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3ef576bac7adaec894b503280717b1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b99ab1743f20fd38242e46be4fdebb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-192d4c65dacdd377abc5e38c2529132e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24c8b3733d7b211b7ce78db7de0a56d3</data>
