      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The five houses are a group of organizations that have the Eastern Nightingale as their emblem, not the Extinction Eagle.&lt;SEP&gt;五大家系是匹诺康尼的五个主要家族体系，其家主是瓦尔特有所耳闻的对象。&lt;SEP&gt;The Five Great Families are the governing bodies of Penacony, including the Oak Family, Hound Family, and others.&lt;SEP&gt;五大家系是在歌斐木引領下先後皈依的家族，共同建立了匹诺康尼的新秩序。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e0736442493f26f4baa24a23cd4552ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d11ce896bd7f1b7e87c79e1a7cf7dabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-574c8183406d2a4bc03402423db5c4a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f25c87c66c524f1eaa36bafc4c949cbc</data>
