    <node id="美梦乐园">
      <data key="d0">美梦乐园</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">美梦乐园is a dream location where三月七believes no one should die, only happiness should occur.&lt;SEP&gt;美梦乐园是匹诺康尼的别称，加拉赫认为其真正的滋味就是他所调制的饮料所蕴含的东西。&lt;SEP&gt;美梦乐园是星期日理想中的世界，由秩序建立，提供永恒安宁的七休日。&lt;SEP&gt;The Dreamscape, or the "Land of Dreams," is a location in Penacony that was nearly seized by remnants of Order.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ded800b8093baab52c47d17c86d04375&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3428cb608b39b27cf65390b499a0173e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6762f27a4d20dfd610a1155d60e87b32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bef71ea9725559b5e05574558cbcec4</data>
