    <node id="大剧院">
      <data key="d0">大剧院</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">大剧院is a location in the dreamscape that triggers三月七's anxious thoughts.&lt;SEP&gt;大剧院is the location inside匹诺康尼where the谐乐大典is held and is heavily guarded by the家族.&lt;SEP&gt;The Grand Theater is a location within the dreamscape where the events are set to take place.&lt;SEP&gt;大剧院is a large theater with a sinister atmosphere, empty of staff and audience, but with many puppets at the ticket booth.&lt;SEP&gt;大剧院is a grand theater that has been transformed by the power of秩序.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ded800b8093baab52c47d17c86d04375&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b893a9163e9decf898e6a47789d69c6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adc094529bd44146c762587e8b448ea2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbb8a3bfa4ae13183c3d097c522f56f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8a929a77ffa0523358ea526d90b536b</data>
