      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">有原则的猎犬家系成员是猎犬家系的治安官手下，负责在筑梦边境进行封锁，以案件调查为由拒绝闲人进入。&lt;SEP&gt;有原则的猎犬家系成员是猎犬家系的一员，负责守卫特定区域，性格固执，但最终因下班时间而放弃阻拦。&lt;SEP&gt;A principled member of the Bloodhound Family who had a past fight with the Trailblazer and a silver-haired girl, whom they call "钟表小子(Clockwork Boy)."</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3be5af5a5f63df24c11126cb1e24505d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6b4da45b5db96356b86865d457909d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18bb9d37a8fed7eab8d5cba8f123f61d</data>
