    <node id="石心十人">
      <data key="d0">石心十人</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ten Stonehearts are elite members of the Strategic Investment Department, each holding a "Cornerstone."&lt;SEP&gt;石心十人is an elite group within the strategic investment department, known for their unity and the use of 「基石」.&lt;SEP&gt;石心十人is a group of elites that include砂金, 托帕, 翡翠and钻石, who use their "基石" (Cornerstones) to serve the company's interests.&lt;SEP&gt;石心十人(Stonehearts)是星际和平公司的精英组织)，星期日可能对其进行降级或踢出。</data>
