    <node id="卡提卡人">
      <data key="d0">卡提卡人</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">卡提卡人是被描述为笨拙的群体，与卡卡瓦夏进行危险的赌博游戏。&lt;SEP&gt;卡提卡人是嗜血、残忍、贪得无厌的群体，卡卡瓦夏曾与他们发生冲突。&lt;SEP&gt;卡提卡人is a group of people who pursued砂金and his sister during their childhood.&lt;SEP&gt;卡提卡人are a氏族described as嗜血and残忍, who attack the埃维金人.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce9985de7455578605cf22e38811639d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-009c79711483e2ca1c076c720ae3e662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7778f84cd4b1b1ad3d8124b8a0c6a5f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24c8b3733d7b211b7ce78db7de0a56d3</data>
