      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">沙漠是卡卡瓦夏进行赌博的地点，环境艰苦。&lt;SEP&gt;沙漠is a location referenced by the child, providing a point of comparison for height.&lt;SEP&gt;沙漠是故事发生的初始地点，人物在此处经历困境后被大雨拯救。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce9985de7455578605cf22e38811639d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e9683bae2c22cd52f4dabb5dac67998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee455e266c9bbd01db8a74a4c28bcc9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
