      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">妈妈是卡卡瓦夏和姐姐已故的母亲，她留给姐姐一条项链，并在去世前请求地母神的原谅。&lt;SEP&gt;妈妈is the mother of砂金and his sister, referenced in the context of the day she said goodbye.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce9985de7455578605cf22e38811639d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7778f84cd4b1b1ad3d8124b8a0c6a5f2</data>
