      <data key="d0">塔安巴</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">塔安巴, also called赤铜币, is a currency used to purchase slaves, with砂金being bought for 60 of these coins.&lt;SEP&gt;塔安巴is a unit of currency, specifically a type of copper coin called赤铜币, used to measure value.&lt;SEP&gt;A form of currency (copper coin) mentioned by卡卡瓦夏to price his life.</data>
