    <node id="伍尔西">
      <data key="d0">伍尔西</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">伍尔西is a member of the Hunters in Penacony, who offers to help Aventurine and discusses potential dangers in the dream.&lt;SEP&gt;伍尔西is a watchman in the dream who offers to help砂金by contacting the hotel for a forced awakening.&lt;SEP&gt;伍尔西是猎犬护卫长。&lt;SEP&gt;伍尔西是猎犬护卫长，星期日提到加拉赫的伤疤是他的勋章。</data>
