    <node id="艾米绮">
      <data key="d0">艾米绮</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">艾米绮是舒翁的朋友，她非常关心舒翁，希望舒翁能离开冷清的酒吧，回到舞台上。她认为舒翁因鸢尾花家系的阴谋而被迫躲藏，并计划写信控诉鸢尾花家系。艾米绮自认胆小怯懦，依赖舒翁的指引，并梦想与舒翁一同登上舞台。&lt;SEP&gt;艾米绮is a persistent character who wants to recruit舒翁for a performance stage called鸢尾花, describing舒翁as having talent and urging her to become a star in匹诺康尼.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bb2a372ee2f9460e30f608f49c4ae874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bafb0a0e0f90ec9d367776c00f11b4a7</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779005940</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="怪物酒吧">
      <data key="d0">怪物酒吧</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">怪物酒吧是舒翁经营的一间冷清、破烂的酒吧，也是舒翁躲避鸢尾花家系的地方。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bb2a372ee2f9460e30f608f49c4ae874</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779005767</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="舒翁的过去">
      <data key="d0">舒翁的过去</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">舒翁的过去被艾米绮描述为一段闪耀的历史，表明舒翁曾经是鸢尾花家系中才华横溢的巨星。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bb2a372ee2f9460e30f608f49c4ae874</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779005768</data>
