    <node id="精神的亚当">
      <data key="d0">精神的亚当</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">精神的亚当is a giant created by a man in瓦尔特's story, formed by weaving together all people's dreams. This entity becomes the pillar of the world's existence, but those who sleep within its dream lose their future.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee77b88c86c938c0967cd2eb1ef92ec0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
