    <node id="逐日者(伊卡洛斯)">
      <data key="d0">逐日者(伊卡洛斯)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">逐日者(伊卡洛斯) is a mythical figure referenced by瓦尔特, representing凯文. He flew towards the sun, melted, and fell, but in his fall, achieved ultimate victory by reaching a place no one had been before.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee77b88c86c938c0967cd2eb1ef92ec0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779005941</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="理想乡">
      <data key="d0">理想乡</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">理想乡is a concept described in瓦尔特's story, created by凯文. It is a place where people sleep without catastrophe or pain, living out their lives peacefully within the dream.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee77b88c86c938c0967cd2eb1ef92ec0</data>
