    <node id="年幼的孩子">
      <data key="d0">年幼的孩子</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The 年幼的孩子 is a young child of the埃维金 people, appearing in砂金's vision or memory, characterized by having彩色 eyes and interacting with an older female figure, to whom they offer a purple flower. This child expresses enthusiasm for playing hide-and-seek, often initiating the game, and calls out for their parents in a游乐园 setting. They also speak about the height of a place compared to the desert and encourage砂金 to try a game or experience. Additionally, in a迷宫, the child asks questions about leaves and flowers.&lt;SEP&gt;A young child from the Avgin people, enjoying the dream amusement park, who must return home as bad weather approaches.&lt;SEP&gt;年幼的孩子is a young child who expresses a desire to stay and not go home.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f34e8667489837059ab3bef5d5cb33a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8db95a87e9ec1f2386df8b2f27af208c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-415c7bdbfc0ac0348c2f17ccb1d95aa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e9683bae2c22cd52f4dabb5dac67998&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba17e1a90148b22dcf71f0d57c583881&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7778f84cd4b1b1ad3d8124b8a0c6a5f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e0963e43d1885db6bbb5b72dc56f869&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b98403c41e2e462a313eed651d8bbbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-192d4c65dacdd377abc5e38c2529132e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7246b78d1fb47de6cba879a74a4e96c1</data>
