    <node id="卡卡瓦">
      <data key="d0">卡卡瓦</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">卡卡瓦是一种极光现象，与某个特定事件或地点相关联。&lt;SEP&gt;卡卡瓦is a location associated with the Avgin people, where the aurora and final reunion is spoken of.&lt;SEP&gt;卡卡瓦是卡卡瓦夏提到的一个地点，以极光为特征。&lt;SEP&gt;卡卡瓦is the埃维金人的祭典and the birthday of卡卡瓦夏, symbolizing the cycle of the Mother Goddess.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b23d4778f839d2a1eac66e3c79c7e10e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b13f1d619b99829ec04b15c537d259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24c8b3733d7b211b7ce78db7de0a56d3</data>
