      <data key="d2">耶佩拉is a city, described as a "罪恶都市", whose name will disappear from galactic history.&lt;SEP&gt;耶佩拉是一个在银河历史中将消失的名称，可能是一个地点或实体。&lt;SEP&gt;Yepela is a place whose name will disappear from galactic history, where the Eternal Flame Mansion will be born.</data>
