      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">玩家角色(Player Character) is an "impossible thing" seen by Elio in the future, which changed the nature of Elio's scripts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cc45afcec4b5f6a1b7e1a966ff2b1588</data>
