    </node>
    <node id="逐梦时代">
      <data key="d0">逐梦时代</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">逐梦时代是三纪，被称为梦想之地的热潮，由钟表匠向全宇宙发出邀请而兴起。&lt;SEP&gt;逐梦时代refers to the three-decade period when钟表匠invited people to匹诺康尼, unaware of the星核activation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f53c7f48036990ccca5a5b48e0fe82a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ba3b6dae092d55950f9ddb961ea479</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779015615</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="家族话事人">
      <data key="d0">家族话事人</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">家族话事人is a representative of the family present at the gathering called by加拉赫.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f53c7f48036990ccca5a5b48e0fe82a3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779015618</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="哈伊尔">
      <data key="d0">哈伊尔</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">哈伊尔平息了匹诺康尼的内乱，并以同谐的名义参与了匹诺康尼的建设。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-58ba3b6dae092d55950f9ddb961ea479</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779015622</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="沉眠">
      <data key="d0">沉眠</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">沉眠是加拉赫在梦中虚构出的迷因的名字，常人无法在梦境中再度沉睡。&lt;SEP&gt;沉眠is the renamed concept for the event that米沙and流萤experienced, now called "Slumber."</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-58ba3b6dae092d55950f9ddb961ea479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74d9be5bb22932287cf5a631b7386195</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069333</data>
