      <data key="d2">智械宾客is an智械guest who witnessed事件from afar, feels安全感doubts, and threatens to leave匹诺康尼unless家族provides a合理解释.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f5fc4bdb0dd2b9ee973fa3d6b9e49199</data>
