    <node id="匹诺康尼(永恒欢乐的匹诺康尼/美梦之都/梦想之城/盛会之星)">
      <data key="d0">匹诺康尼(永恒欢乐的匹诺康尼/美梦之都/梦想之城/盛会之星)</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">匹诺康尼is a planet known as the "Land of Dreams," currently hosting many factions and the upcoming Harmony Grand Festival.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0cfbc268760ea4bc489027077a7b65a7</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
