    <node id="小谐乐鸽">
      <data key="d0">小谐乐鸽</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">小谐乐鸽is a small, helpless bird of a species known for being able to fly through the atmosphere.&lt;SEP&gt;小谐乐鸽是一只在庭院中被星期日和知更鸟发现的雏鸟，被父母遗弃，命运取决于抉择。&lt;SEP&gt;小谐乐鸽is a small harmonious music pigeon mentioned as the subject of the birdcage building choice.&lt;SEP&gt;小谐乐鸽是一种小型鸟类，被星期日和他人抚养长大，在多次尝试飞行后因坠落骨折而死亡。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c72500fd19b3d31361401b01307328e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1fecb95c7dca369bddda957ff6f5253&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebb112f018257ed68fe1d08bc61a6ab1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1853bbf4383b790ff8a8b2d27d966ca0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
