    </node>
    <node id="谐乐鸽">
      <data key="d0">谐乐鸽</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">谐乐鸽is a bird species capable of flying through the atmosphere, whose ancestors learned to fly to survive.&lt;SEP&gt;谐乐鸽是一只被星期日和知更鸟收养的鸟，后来被放归天空但坠落身亡，象征着被保护的生命在自由面前的脆弱。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c72500fd19b3d31361401b01307328e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c47098afdb2c1a8744e7c9c843360554</data>
