      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">Self-Annihilators are followers of the Nihility path who seek to annihilate everything, including themselves, and are not welcome in the Harmony.&lt;SEP&gt;自灭者是逐渐丧失自我存在的人，黄泉属于此类。</data>
