    <node id="严苛评委">
      <data key="d0">严苛评委</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">严苛评委is a judge overseeing the final stage of a talent competition, evaluating performances based on a movie scene.&lt;SEP&gt;严苛评委is a strict judge who evaluates performances and is not easily satisfied.&lt;SEP&gt;The Strict Judge is a character who evaluates performances, responding dramatically to the actors' interpretations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Strict Judge is a character who evaluates performances, responding dramatically to the actors' interpretations.</data>
