    <node id="逐梦往事">
      <data key="d0">逐梦往事</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">《逐梦往事》 is a movie that depicts the story of two companions pursuing dreams in the impoverished early days of Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;《逐梦往事》 is a movie featuring the villain characters that appear as enemies in the奇人擂台战challenge.&lt;SEP&gt;《逐梦往事》 is a narrative or performance that the challenge recreates, specifically its action sequences.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-499a6a3b676eaa4770c8084f55c078bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e96f4ec873a80f62d60ea20cc1bafda8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a615013e7ecef6026e27d87ed033cc3d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
