    <node id="奇人擂台战">
      <data key="d0">奇人擂台战</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">奇人擂台战is a competition hosted in the City of Dreams,匹诺康尼, inviting participants to showcase action star skills.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e96f4ec873a80f62d60ea20cc1bafda8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016053</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="引导员">
      <data key="d0">引导员</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity "引导员" (Guide) serves as a host, referee, or guide in multiple contexts. Primarily, the guide is a staff member or host of the Hot Sand Festival, responsible for welcoming participants, introducing the rules of challenges, explaining stage backgrounds, and guiding players. In the game "Little哈努 Action," the guide directs players on how to operate the character哈努 Brothers and introduces the storyline. Additionally, the guide is specifically associated with challenges related to the world of the钟表匠 (Clockmaker), where they welcome participants and provide information about the Clockmaker's world and the character Clockie. Across these instances, the guide's core function is to explain rules, provide context, and lead participants through activities.&lt;SEP&gt;引导员is a guide who comments on the actions of哈努兄弟and instructs others on how to proceed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e96f4ec873a80f62d60ea20cc1bafda8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56989daaebf06ae7dc0a54da8f088146&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e56d1c1fe03eb620f72d57e33feb68ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e91d85eb68de46387b3611dba693df1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-519002bb5791c29026085e92f1f99620&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3dac2b0b58dede9fc2d9238e6c559d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b926f3dee50d8c90e7dd10c60b966773&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a82402718fbbfa41c6e5bbfb21701215&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1010455801c113385227bc8c1f8a08c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2a617c09373b8228653ceb12250637b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779017081</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="电影《逐梦往事》中的反派角色">
      <data key="d0">电影《逐梦往事》中的反派角色</data>
      <data key="d1">creature</data>
      <data key="d2">These are the villain characters from the movie 《逐梦往事》 that serve as enemies in the challenge stages.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e96f4ec873a80f62d60ea20cc1bafda8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016056</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="红发选手">
      <data key="d0">红发选手</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">红发选手is a red-haired competitor who holds the record for the fastest clear time in the奇人擂台战.&lt;SEP&gt;红发选手是演技派舞台最高分记录的保持者，其精湛演技令最严苛的评委也泪洒赛场。&lt;SEP&gt;红发选手是一名未被明确指明的参赛者，其通关速度快于流萤和另一位选手。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e96f4ec873a80f62d60ea20cc1bafda8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56989daaebf06ae7dc0a54da8f088146&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1010455801c113385227bc8c1f8a08c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779017037</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="动作明星的秀场">
      <data key="d0">动作明星的秀场</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">动作明星的秀场is the theme of the奇人擂台战, where participants showcase flashy combat skills.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e96f4ec873a80f62d60ea20cc1bafda8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016061</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="三座舞台">
      <data key="d0">三座舞台</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">三座舞台are the three stages in the奇人擂台战, each containing a separate challenge against villain enemies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e96f4ec873a80f62d60ea20cc1bafda8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016062</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="5分钟">
      <data key="d0">5分钟</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">5分钟is the record time set by the红发选手for defeating all enemies across the three stages in the奇人擂台战.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e96f4ec873a80f62d60ea20cc1bafda8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016063</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="欢快的宾客">
      <data key="d0">欢快的宾客</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">一位参加谐乐大典的客人，喜欢在匹诺康尼的梦境中狂欢，逃避现实生活，享受梦泡带来的快乐。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-399e9f5b95e2162b7f5074dcec92103a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016096</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="台词评委">
      <data key="d0">台词评委</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">台词评委是负责评估演技的评委，为开拓者和流萤设置了双人对戏的场景考验。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-79dd695a476e6e11c893e09fcf2268ac</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016101</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="梦境的荒野">
      <data key="d0">梦境的荒野</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">梦境的荒野是双人戏中的场景之一，开拓者和流萤在此开着老爷车并遭遇忆域迷因。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-79dd695a476e6e11c893e09fcf2268ac</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016107</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="修铁路的工作">
      <data key="d0">修铁路的工作</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">修铁路的工作是故事中开拓者和流萤在沙漠深处找到的体力工作，导致他们疲劳倒下。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-79dd695a476e6e11c893e09fcf2268ac</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016108</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="房费">
      <data key="d0">房费</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">房费是宾客在匹诺康尼梦境中生活所需支付的费用，是梦境并非完全自由的关键因素，被知更鸟提及。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-399e9f5b95e2162b7f5074dcec92103a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016109</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="甘霖">
      <data key="d0">甘霖</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">甘霖是从天而降的雨水，滋润了开拓者和流萤的嘴唇并唤醒他们的奋斗精神。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-79dd695a476e6e11c893e09fcf2268ac</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016111</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="肢体考验">
      <data key="d0">肢体考验</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">肢体考验是第二个舞台的表演内容，继台词考验之后进行。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-79dd695a476e6e11c893e09fcf2268ac</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016112</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="老爷车">
      <data key="d0">老爷车</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">老爷车是开拓者和流萤在梦境荒野中驾驶的破旧车辆，用于穿越沙漠。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-79dd695a476e6e11c893e09fcf2268ac</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016112</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="双人对戏">
      <data key="d0">双人对戏</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">双人对戏是台词评委为开拓者和流萤准备的表演场景，考验他们的台词功底。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-79dd695a476e6e11c893e09fcf2268ac</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016113</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="台词功底">
      <data key="d0">台词功底</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">台词功底指演员在表演中表达台词的能力，包含情感、节奏和准确性，被评委评价为深厚。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-79dd695a476e6e11c893e09fcf2268ac</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016114</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="圆满的成绩">
      <data key="d0">圆满的成绩</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">圆满的成绩是评委预祝开拓者和流萤在考验中获得的好结果。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-79dd695a476e6e11c893e09fcf2268ac</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016116</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="第二个舞台">
      <data key="d0">第二个舞台</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">第二个舞台是继台词考验后的表演环节，要求演员通过肢体动作继续演绎故事。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-79dd695a476e6e11c893e09fcf2268ac</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016118</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="拓荒感召">
      <data key="d0">拓荒感召</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-79dd695a476e6e11c893e09fcf2268ac</data>
      <data key="d2">台词评委提及拓荒感召作为故事背景的一部分。</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016147</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="家庭">
      <data key="d0">家庭</data>
      <data key="d1">faction</data>
      <data key="d2">家庭(家族)是匹诺康尼的掌管者，包括五大家系，维护着美梦。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c9530d64790c372ec3c8746d7998106a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016161</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="礼物的用途">
      <data key="d0">礼物的用途</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">礼物的用途是花火留下的两份礼物，并指示在谐乐大典召开时使用。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c9530d64790c372ec3c8746d7998106a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016163</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="自然选择">
      <data key="d0">自然选择</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">自然选择是世间的一个法则，它注定会有一些人(如脆弱的雏鸟)会失败或坠落。&lt;SEP&gt;自然选择是星期日提及的法则，他认为这决定了世间强弱者的命运。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c47098afdb2c1a8744e7c9c843360554&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28f44dbc7147eb695d2a84423677906c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016182</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="天真的少年">
      <data key="d0">天真的少年</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">天真的少年是一个关心妹妹愿望的角色，他通过选择齐响诗班来表达包含妹妹和大家愿望的理想。&lt;SEP&gt;天真的少年(Naive Boy)是烂漫的少女的哥哥)，解释星星的光芒和永恒的幸福，并与妹妹约定理想。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28f44dbc7147eb695d2a84423677906c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a5c4612ea2ec33740c626cf9067e70</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779101180</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="烂漫的少女">
      <data key="d0">烂漫的少女</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">烂漫的少女是天真少年的妹妹，她热爱歌唱和绘画，梦想通过成为调弦师来召唤齐响诗班，让所有人感到幸福。&lt;SEP&gt;烂漫的少女(Vibrant Girl)是天真的少年的妹妹)，与哥哥讨论星星是否会死去，并对理想充满热情。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28f44dbc7147eb695d2a84423677906c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a5c4612ea2ec33740c626cf9067e70</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779101180</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="歌斐木先生">
      <data key="d0">歌斐木先生</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">歌斐木先生是一位给了烂漫少女一本关于谐乐众弦画册的人物。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28f44dbc7147eb695d2a84423677906c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016186</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="齐响诗班">
      <data key="d0">齐响诗班</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">齐响诗班是一个与谐乐相关的群体，被烂漫的少女和天真的少年视为实现愿望和传递爱的工具。&lt;SEP&gt;齐响诗班是同谐的化身，其降临与调弦师相关。&lt;SEP&gt;齐响诗班is a choir that collapsed, with黑天鹅helping the group escape before its collapse.&lt;SEP&gt;The Choir is a group associated with Order or the Family, defeated by General Jing Yuan to free the imprisoned crew members.&lt;SEP&gt;齐响诗班(Choir of Chords) is the Harmonious incarnation of "Harmony", whose authority was usurped by Sunday during the Harmony Grand Ceremony.&lt;SEP&gt;齐响诗班is described as the Harmonious incarnation of "Harmony".</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28f44dbc7147eb695d2a84423677906c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d11ce896bd7f1b7e87c79e1a7cf7dabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fecb71ee2401bfdf2be56be0fc3835d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bef71ea9725559b5e05574558cbcec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-950f3c9663f4eaa9cf5cef2539e2ff52</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779101366</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="谐乐众弦">
      <data key="d0">谐乐众弦</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">谐乐众弦是歌斐木先生画册中的故事主题，涉及音乐和调弦师的概念。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28f44dbc7147eb695d2a84423677906c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016188</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="调弦师">
      <data key="d0">调弦师</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">调弦师是与谐乐众弦相关的一个角色或身份，烂漫的少女梦想成为调弦师来召唤齐响诗班。&lt;SEP&gt;调弦师是与「齐响诗班」相关的角色，如果没有调弦师，谐乐大典将成为普通演出。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28f44dbc7147eb695d2a84423677906c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d11ce896bd7f1b7e87c79e1a7cf7dabd</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016423</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="雏鸟">
      <data key="d0">雏鸟</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">雏鸟是诗意的比喻，象征弱者和坠亡的生命。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28f44dbc7147eb695d2a84423677906c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016193</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="多米尼克斯">
      <data key="d0">多米尼克斯</data>
      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">多米尼克斯是齐响诗班中的存在，被烂漫的少女视为可以召唤来实现愿望的对象。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28f44dbc7147eb695d2a84423677906c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016195</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="星星">
      <data key="d0">星星</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">星星是星期日用来隐喻成为调弦师的条件，意味着只有变成星星才能做到。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-28f44dbc7147eb695d2a84423677906c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a5c4612ea2ec33740c626cf9067e70</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016197</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="肢体评委">
      <data key="d0">肢体评委</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">肢体评委是一名评委，负责评估演员的肢体语言演技，并描述故事情境来考验演员。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ee455e266c9bbd01db8a74a4c28bcc9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016226</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="第二道「演技派」考验">
      <data key="d0">第二道「演技派」考验</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">这是演员需要通过的第二个演技考试环节，由肢体评委主持，评估肢体语言表演能力。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ee455e266c9bbd01db8a74a4c28bcc9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016227</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="肢体语言">
      <data key="d0">肢体语言</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">肢体语言是一种表演技巧，演员需要用身体动作而非言语来诠释故事中的情境和情感。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ee455e266c9bbd01db8a74a4c28bcc9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016230</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="大雨">
      <data key="d0">大雨</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">大雨是故事中的一个自然事件，拯救了倒在沙漠中的人物，浇灭了愤怒，并促使同伴发现商机。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ee455e266c9bbd01db8a74a4c28bcc9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779016231</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="雨伞行业">
      <data key="d0">雨伞行业</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
