    <node id="苏乐达™盛会海选">
      <data key="d0">苏乐达™盛会海选</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">苏乐达™盛会海选is a talent competition held before the谐乐大典, allowing winners to enter the大剧院early. It was originally created by米哈伊尔as a promotional stunt and is held in热砂的时刻.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b893a9163e9decf898e6a47789d69c6d</data>
