    <node id="盛会巨星">
      <data key="d0">盛会巨星</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">盛会巨星is the title awarded to the winner of the苏乐达™盛会海选, granting early entry to the大剧院and a meeting with知更鸟.&lt;SEP&gt;盛会巨星是匹诺康尼的至高荣誉称号，由热砂盛典的最终胜者获得。&lt;SEP&gt;The Festival Mega-Star is a title or role for the champions of the Harmony Grand Ceremony.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b893a9163e9decf898e6a47789d69c6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e91d85eb68de46387b3611dba693df1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ab104d64e9eb410cea34464f76c33a5</data>
