      <data key="d2">「巡猎」的记者is a journalist with the theme of「巡猎」(the ideology-path of the仙舟联盟) who comments on the contestants' journey ahead.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b893a9163e9decf898e6a47789d69c6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db7acddc1a4e47a665ceece42a9f23e</data>
