    <node id="苏乐达™">
      <data key="d0">苏乐达™</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">苏乐达™是艾迪恩·列达旗下的一种饮品，被宣传为能带来快乐美梦。&lt;SEP&gt;苏乐达™是一种由苏萨先生饮料灵感创造的快乐美梦饮料品牌。&lt;SEP&gt;苏乐达™ is a brand of soda, passionately guarded by the monster characters and linked to their "dragon transformation" ability.&lt;SEP&gt;苏乐达™ is a brand's product that the气泡锂犬protects and claims ownership over.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7db7acddc1a4e47a665ceece42a9f23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3757b3a184b0e258bec874c72a3bf9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a615013e7ecef6026e27d87ed033cc3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e72a5d2f0e00a042025ce46633fcea9d</data>
