    <node id="拼图绅士">
      <data key="d0">拼图绅士</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">拼图绅士is a mysterious individual who offers guidance and requires completion of the "筑梦拼图" as a condition for passing.&lt;SEP&gt;拼图绅士是《小小哈努行动》中一个可以提供帮助的角色，哈努兄弟准备寻求其帮助。&lt;SEP&gt;拼图绅士is a character who is pleased with the completed puzzle and encourages Hanoo Brothers to touch the TV to transform and retrieve a weapon.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-03ebfa7ecf0c4900fef7960e9a636783&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-519002bb5791c29026085e92f1f99620&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1edc535953132e71c8ea06d16e282c1d</data>
