      <data key="d1">character</data>
      <data key="d2">坏家伙refers to two villains who are also targeting the puzzle fragments, posing a threat to the hero's progress.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-03ebfa7ecf0c4900fef7960e9a636783</data>
