    <node id="巨大迷钟">
      <data key="d0">巨大迷钟</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">巨大迷钟is a giant puzzle clock whose missing inner parts are the goal of the quest.&lt;SEP&gt;巨大迷钟是一个会说话的钟表雕像，自称是失败的废案，内心空虚，因知道自己是钟表小子的造型废案而陷入存在主义危机。&lt;SEP&gt;巨大迷钟is a character with a broken inner self ("内心") that is repaired by "钟表小子". Initially expressing feelings of inadequacy, it later expresses gratitude for the help it received.&lt;SEP&gt;The Giant Clock is a sentient entity that blocks the way and sees itself as a failed clock and toy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Giant Clock is a sentient entity that blocks the way and sees itself as a failed clock and toy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4fd6207caebf601e2aad532ccfd66dd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b45e0901f34f95111a2f25c844d60f7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2698cb34da87c071df26173119364599&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0120d6441f2644ee546f500398f26838</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069211</data>
