    </node>
    <node id="火箭筒">
      <data key="d0">火箭筒</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">火箭筒is a rocket launcher weapon that流萤uses in the game and finds enjoyable to handle.&lt;SEP&gt;火箭筒is a rocket launcher that is owned by哈努兄弟and is sought after.&lt;SEP&gt;The rocket launcher is a weapon discovered by流萤, used to defeat villains.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ea54d0393768a455e6b3a9e281d49198&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f1950b0d3b7a3068030a8b79637f2c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2a617c09373b8228653ceb12250637b</data>
