      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">罗盘号is a toy boat made by Misha that was placed in the fountain.&lt;SEP&gt;「罗盘号」是米沙担任船长的船。&lt;SEP&gt;罗盘号is a ship in Misha's story that sailed to a new continent, crewed by Clockie, Mirror Lady, and the paper birds.&lt;SEP&gt;罗盘号是沃克•夏尔•米哈伊尔和钟表小子在梦中一起登上的船。</data>
