    <node id="露莎卡星">
      <data key="d0">露莎卡星</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">露莎卡星位于普热斯米尔星系，是「钟表匠」米沙出生的地方。&lt;SEP&gt;Lushaka is an ocean planet entirely composed of liquid water, home to many aquatic races and the homeland of the former Nameless, Mikhail.&lt;SEP&gt;Lushaka is an ocean planet and the hometown of Misha and Mikhail, which was devastated by a Stellaron disaster, changing it completely.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3b2df6c7c464d907afd4da6f5f01960&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e038997304f6b48259a70927a3be53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d235d876b6479c8e730e06da624342e</data>
