    <node id="怀表">
      <data key="d0">怀表</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">怀表is a gift left by the Watchmaker for the Nameless, which guided him through his journey.&lt;SEP&gt;怀表is a heirloom given to Misha by Mikhail, which guides Misha's direction in difficult times.&lt;SEP&gt;怀表是沃克•夏尔•米哈伊尔小时候记忆中爷爷的物件，他后来才意识到这是一块罗盘。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-92b7f5f4dc623665b5e5c7330c0b5c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffa19e6c8f41788df56ba4b3dcb02a41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c86e4e8873e665dc85fecd7c393c16c6</data>
