    <node id="星核之灾">
      <data key="d0">星核之灾</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">星核之灾是星期日和知更鸟小时候经历的灾难，与秩序星神的抉择故事有关。&lt;SEP&gt;星核之灾是导致星期日和知更鸟成为受害者的灾难性事件。&lt;SEP&gt;The Stellaron Disaster is a catastrophic event, and Melusteyn is one of its original outbreak points.&lt;SEP&gt;The Stellaron disaster is an event that changed the planet Lushaka completely.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b1fecb95c7dca369bddda957ff6f5253&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d81d7afd4e410e297a5351eee7eb9d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9e038997304f6b48259a70927a3be53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d235d876b6479c8e730e06da624342e</data>
