    </node>
    <node id="「罗盘号」">
      <data key="d0">「罗盘号」</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">「罗盘号」是一艘冒险船只，「航海士」米哈伊尔鼓励拉格沃克驾驶它开始旅途。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a4bb44dd906f564ea60408699af064c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069800</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="君王">
      <data key="d0">君王</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">君王is a figure who speaks poetically about falling from a spiral staircase, leaving faint traces in a quiet night, being forgotten without eternal memory.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9d8d43bcd5da9f1a53fc3bdb43750929</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069801</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="「开拓」">
      <data key="d0">「开拓」</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">「开拓」是星穹列车的核心理念，拉格沃克认为离开列车后这一精神也不会结束。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a4bb44dd906f564ea60408699af064c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069806</data>
      <data key="d6" />
