      <data key="d0">列神之战</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">列神之战是一场在寰宇蝗灾后爆发的星神大战，导致「繁育」和「秩序」两道命途失去了星神。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ba76ab4009be3694fc20bec3980fef08</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779069919</data>
