      <data key="d2">太一之梦is a concept referencing a dream of the 「Order」, considered too cruel for some.&lt;SEP&gt;太一之梦is a concept mentioned as an alternative to facing reality.&lt;SEP&gt;太一之梦(Tayzzyronth's Dream) is the grand dream state created by the "Order", where everyone can live happily in their own perfect dreams.</data>
