    <edge source="银狼" target="星核">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">银狼成功取出了黑塔空间站内的星核，并将其装入载体。&lt;SEP&gt;银狼states that the Stellar Core is directly in front of them and urges to seize the moment.</data>
