    <edge source="银狼" target="黑塔">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">银狼认为在骇客领域，她比天才黑塔更具优势。&lt;SEP&gt;Silver Wolf has seen many portraits of Herta but has never met her in person.&lt;SEP&gt;银狼also provoked黑塔after螺丝咕姆.</data>
      <data key="d9">indirect knowledge,provocation,rivalry,visual acquaintance,天才挑战,技术对抗</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-4dbaabda37c8db9a4a137cc6aa064f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e35d358e818be02513731a4ae614a35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cfc8f55ca58a8b49ae984321424c78</data>
