    <edge source="卡芙卡" target="开拓者">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between Kafka and the Trailblazer is complex and deeply intertwined. Kafka implanted a Stellaron into the Trailblazer's body, a significant act that sets the course of their journey. She also provided the Trailblazer with guidance and encouragement for the future. The Trailblazer retains memory of Kafka after awakening and expresses a fondness for her. The Trailblazer demonstrates a unique connection to Kafka, being most familiar with her use of suggestion, and is able to deduce details from her intercepted communication, including weather and actions. Kafka has shared secrets with the Trailblazer, such as the truth about the fall of an Aeon, and has explained the true purpose of the Stellaron Hunters' actions. Despite this deep bond, Kafka currently ignores the Trailblazer, though she has indicated this will not last forever. The Trailblazer shows a level of trust in Kafka, stating that if she has not lied, there is nothing to explain, a sentiment that raises questions from March 7th.&lt;SEP&gt;卡芙卡向开拓者讲述陨落星神的故事和仙舟联盟的历史。&lt;SEP&gt;卡芙卡向开拓者发出邀请，扰乱了列车组原定前往匹诺康尼的计划。</data>
      <data key="d9">awareness,connection,conversation,deduction,disruption,future,investigation,invitation,manipulation,revelation,understanding,信任,信息分享,命运指引,对话,情感连接,植入载体,疑问,秘密,记忆关联,讲述</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-4dbaabda37c8db9a4a137cc6aa064f29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25bbc2acab19c28d156b60535056e250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43623aa0b2e27c60a1de27a0205f0f63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b69d30c7d3a7f454ed932719bcad47b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d1d3f2fdd68ace39bfead72d5c6de09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aec7e92881b8561c64f206d873044d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7226238e34da823949aab509aaac80e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee709ee6223dbebd15d8b80e4cdae7e</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1778834108</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
