      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">艾利欧预见了未来，并指定卡芙卡必须做出将星核给予开拓者的决定。&lt;SEP&gt;Kafka is a subordinate of Elio and follows his script.&lt;SEP&gt;卡芙卡follows艾利欧's scripts, which predicted they wouldn't meet黑塔.&lt;SEP&gt;Elio is the leader of the Stellaron Hunters, and Kafka is a member.&lt;SEP&gt;卡芙卡reveals the purpose of her visit to the Xianzhou Luofu is according to艾利欧's script.&lt;SEP&gt;卡芙卡从艾利欧的预言中得知对罗浮最有利的未来路径。</data>
