    <edge source="卡芙卡" target="太卜司">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Divination Commission intercepted a communication sent by Kafka, Blade's accomplice, and suspects the Astral Express crew are allies with the Stellaron Hunters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Divination Commission intercepted encrypted communications, leading to the detection of卡芙卡.&lt;SEP&gt;The Divination Commission found clues regarding Kafka's location based on her transmission data.&lt;SEP&gt;Kafka surrendered to the Divination Commission.</data>
