    <edge source="卡芙卡" target="景元">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">景元intends to use the crew to draw out and capture Kafka.&lt;SEP&gt;Jing Yuan requests the crew's help in searching for Kafka as part of Xianzhou internal affairs.&lt;SEP&gt;景元intends to use the穷观阵to interrogate卡芙卡to uncover her secrets.&lt;SEP&gt;景元根据穷观阵的结果，信任卡芙卡的逻辑，并指出星核猎手的目的并非制造混乱，而是促使仙舟与列车结盟。&lt;SEP&gt;景元作为将军，对通缉犯卡芙卡拥有处置权。&lt;SEP&gt;卡芙卡为迎接景元这位罗浮将军的到来做了准备工作。</data>
      <data key="d9">anticipation,capture,interrogation,investigation,preparation,request,target,信任,分析,管辖,通缉</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-c992f8ca9cbe3142dda05033f0b52e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43623aa0b2e27c60a1de27a0205f0f63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5341e4ccc7283969ac76c86061d28586&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df8b5bd13b0c402afd43298bddf26cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db1a6716eb95924fce53acec168f822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86afcf1d5b41644aabd32c7cbee164cc</data>
