    <edge source="卡芙卡" target="瓦尔特">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">瓦尔特认为自己一方是与卡芙卡产生联系的诱饵，用于引出星核猎手。&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特根据卡芙卡的出现推测通信故障与星核猎手有关。&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特confronts卡芙卡, demanding information and insisting on witnessing her interrogation.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特warns the group that卡芙卡may have anticipated their actions and set traps.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特doubts whether the collected clues were left by卡芙卡or are deliberate misdirection.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特states that the crew will handle the pursuit and battle against卡芙卡.</data>
