    <edge source="卡芙卡" target="三月七">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">March 7th and Kafka are connected through a narrative of pursuit and tension. Kafka is known to be a member of the Stellaron Hunters, and March 7th actively tracks her, trying to prevent her escape while searching for clues left behind, though she suspects these may be traps. March 7th humorously speculates that a device might track Kafka by biting her, and she imagines Kafka making mocking statements, indicating personal tension. March 7th also expresses dissatisfaction with Kafka's escape, worried about failing to report to the Divination Matrix authorities. Additionally, March 7th references how the Divination Matrix was used to analyze Kafka's past, leading her to consider using it on herself.</data>
      <data key="d9">chase,humor,membership,observation,past analysis,pursuer,pursuit,reference point,search,speculation,suspicion,target,tracking,不满,追捕</data>
