      <data key="d8">停云is involved in the effort to track卡芙卡.&lt;SEP&gt;Tingyun responds to the Trailblazer's questions about an intercepted communication related to Kafka.&lt;SEP&gt;停云is part of the group tracking卡芙卡and questions her actions.&lt;SEP&gt;停云is searching for clues left by卡芙卡in迴星港.&lt;SEP&gt;停云remarks that they might be the prey being observed by卡芙卡, highlighting a hunter-prey dynamic.&lt;SEP&gt;停云expresses that she cannot help in a fight against卡芙卡and will only cheer from the sidelines.</data>
