      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">符玄takes custody of卡芙ka for interrogation.&lt;SEP&gt;Fu Xuan is responsible for overseeing the interrogation of the prisoner Kafka.&lt;SEP&gt;符玄负责看管人犯卡芙卡，这是景元的命令。&lt;SEP&gt;符玄announces that卡芙卡's interrogation will begin after the formation bases are restarted.&lt;SEP&gt;符玄审问卡芙卡，并对穷观阵的结果感到震惊。&lt;SEP&gt;Fu Xuan investigated Kafka and confirmed her innocence through the Divination Array.&lt;SEP&gt;符玄foresaw that卡芙卡would attempt to escape.</data>
