    <edge source="艾利欧" target="星核猎手">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">艾利欧是星核猎手组织的领导者，身份为能看见命运的狂人。&lt;SEP&gt;Elio, who can foresee the future, is a key figure in the Stellaron Hunters' plans.&lt;SEP&gt;Elio is the leader of the Stellaron Hunters.&lt;SEP&gt;艾利欧is the leader of the星核猎手who creates the script.</data>
