    <edge source="艾利欧" target="萨姆">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Sam receives their "script" from Elio, the "Slave of Fate."&lt;SEP&gt;萨姆follows a "script" provided by艾利欧, which dictates the actions and goals of the Stellaron Hunters.&lt;SEP&gt;萨姆引用艾利欧的话，并提到自己受剧本约束。</data>
