    <edge source="艾利欧" target="流萤">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">流萤acknowledges that艾利欧sees a singular fate and knows their predetermined endings.&lt;SEP&gt;流萤followed艾利欧's "剧本" which predicted the conflict between萨姆and the星穹列车.&lt;SEP&gt;流萤(Firefly) explains that Elio's script would no longer be centered on a specific Stellaron because the player character appeared.</data>
      <data key="d9">follows,future,knows about,prediction,script,storytelling</data>
