    <edge source="开拓者" target="三月七">
      <data key="d7">102.0</data>
      <data key="d8">March 7th and the Trailblazer share a deeply connected, inseparable bond as fellow members of the Astral Express crew, consistently referred to as "best partners" and described by others as a key set of variables. Their relationship originated when the Trailblazer saved March 7th, prompting her to gift a baseball bat and warmly welcome them aboard, offering encouragement and guidance. They frequently travel together on missions, including journeys to the Xianzhou Luofu and Penacony, during which the Treasure Hunter from the Express promised to protect March 7th on behalf of Himeko. Their interactions span a wide range of activities, including planning, photography, gossip, mutual support, and cooperative problem-solving, such as using the Clockwork trick to resolve interruptions and working together to investigate a murder case for the Family. March 7th occasionally coaches the Trailblazer on teamwork, and they search for Tingyun together, track Kafka, share credit for successes, and stand united to prevent a prophesied destruction. She addresses the Trailblazer as a fellow team member, offers warnings about dangers, and reassures them of safety with capable companions like Mr. Yang. March 7th reacts playfully to the Trailblazer’s comments and expresses that the Trailblazer, like her, is a Nameless who does not back down from difficulties. Their dynamic also involves playful tension: March 7th has shown frustration at the Trailblazer for opening a closed furnace, challenged their reasoning when they justify actions solely for personal advantages or the greater good, and commented on their numerous encounters. She shares her excitement and packing dilemmas for trips, asks about readiness for battles, and discusses appropriate gifts for the Star Skiff and friends to visit. March 7th is noted as waiting for the Trailblazer, and both are told to return to their rooms for dream preparation prior to Penacony. The Trailblazer introduces themselves and March 7th to others, including her online nickname, and has attempted to find and meet with her. Overall, their bond is marked by adventure, concern, camaraderie, unwavering loyalty, and occasional moments of playful disagreement.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七encourages开拓者to be strong, citing their previous victory over a Lord Ravager.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者和三月七在关于是否「前进」的投票中辩论，三月七支持前进。&lt;SEP&gt;三月七唤醒开拓者并告知其当前处境。&lt;SEP&gt;三月七teases the Trailblazer, saying he/she has been telling all the jokes he/she could in his/her lifetime.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七is a friend and companion to the Trailblazer, showing concern for their health and memory.&lt;SEP&gt;March 7th expresses concern for the Trailblazer's well-being after a past event.</data>
