    <edge source="开拓者" target="丹恒">
      <data key="d7">49.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Dan Heng and the Trailblazer are close comrades and fellow crewmates aboard the Astral Express, sharing a deep bond built on trust, mutual reliance, and coordination. Upon the Trailblazer's arrival, Dan Heng actively introduced himself, explained ongoing rescue missions, and clarified the nature of the Star Rail. Since then, he has provided guidance on various topics, including neutralizing the Antimatter Legion, warp travel mechanics, and the nature of the Stellaron. He encourages the Trailblazer to make independent decisions, demonstrating respect for their autonomy, and has speculated that the Trailblazer may play a crucial role in key events. The two coordinate closely, such as when they flee from the Silver Mane Guards together or when Dan Heng assesses the Trailblazer's compatibility with the Astral Express. Dan Heng possesses sharp awareness, often noticing the Trailblazer's approach before they knock, and the Trailblazer has praised his vigilance. Their interactions include the Trailblazer assisting Dan Heng in fighting the Machine Squad, him asking for help fixing a device, inquiring if the Trailblazer is ready, and showing concern about the Trailblazer's recurring dreams, which he speculates might be linked to the Stellaron inside them. The Trailblazer asks Dan Heng questions about the underground situation and the "地火" organization, while another conversation hints that Dan Heng may be in danger due to Sampo. Discussions about Dan Heng's past occasionally arise, with the Trailblazer questioning if they are being shut out, yet the Trailblazer respects his privacy. As companions, they work together to find the Stellaron, with Dan Heng reminding the Trailblazer not to betray the trust of the Iron Cavalry. He often shares calm insights, such as on Stellaron resonance, and is known for his composed demeanor when asked to recount events. They plan to meet up with March 7th to return to the train, highlighting their ongoing partnership. Dan Heng is also concerned for the Trailblazer's safety on the Xianzhou Luofu and is unable to contact them, worrying about their situation, and he advises the Trailblazer to carefully pack luggage due to Penacony's complicated entry procedures. On one occasion, the Trailblazer jokes about reporting Dan Heng for being late, and elsewhere, their interaction with him shows hesitation and concern, with the Trailblazer responding with ellipses to hint at complex emotions. Overall, Dan Heng is a key ally and steadfast supporter of the Trailblazer on their journey.&lt;SEP&gt;The Trailblazer invites Dan Heng to join the trip, but Dan Heng declines, preferring to stay on the train.&lt;SEP&gt;The Trailblazer jokingly claims to be Mr. Dan Heng, confusing Welt.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者提到丹恒会一本正经地讲冷笑话。&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者指出丹恒会讲冷笑话，作为应对方式。&lt;SEP&gt;Dan Heng asks the Trailblazer how they feel after waking up.&lt;SEP&gt;The Trailblazer jokes with Dan Heng, who expresses that "the joy of reunion" is part of the Trailblaze.</data>
      <data key="d9">accusation,adaptation,advice,appreciation,camaraderie,collaboration,companionship,concern,confusion,conversation,crew interaction,crew member,curiosity,decision,detection,door lock,encouragement,helping,hesitation,identity,importance,information,inquiry,interaction,introduction,joking,mission arrangement,observation,perception,personal history,protection,question,questioning,reassurance,receiving information,remark,request for assistance,rescue,search,shared experience,silence,speculation,speech,target,team,teaming up,teammates,teamwork,travel,warning,交流,交谈,关心,列车组,合作,同伴,同伴关系,同行,同行关系,推测关系,提及,提议,搞笑,星核共鸣,行为,询问、准备</data>
