    <edge source="开拓者" target="黑塔">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between the Trailblazer (开拓者) and Herta (黑塔) is defined by a mix of interest, caution, and collaboration. Herta, a member of the Genius Society, is fascinated by the Trailblazer primarily because they contain a Stellaron stabilized inside their body, viewing them as a unique object for research. She initially deems them dangerous and strange but ultimately allows them to stay at the Space Station, deferring the final decision to Asta. 

Herta recruits the Trailblazer for a scientific project involving the study of Aeons through the Simulated Universe, guiding them through tests and later apologizing for interfering. She also shares information about the Stellaron, though the Trailblazer later finds that such explanations differ from personal experience. While Herta expresses trust in the Trailblazer, she advises them not to live permanently on the Space Station due to the risks posed by the Stellaron within them. The Trailblazer, in turn, questions Herta about the Space Station and the Stellaron, leading Herta to perceive them as having potential value.&lt;SEP&gt;Both the Trailblazer and Herta express distrust toward "interesting" things.</data>
      <data key="d9">agreement,authority,concern,curiosity,decision,distrust,guidance,information,inquiry,interaction,interest,mutual value,research interest,research subject,testing,信任与合作,兴趣,招募</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-8272ce558ae20153faafd6ffc5a4135d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3aa925e2cda548b4c1ed572e6b6fb31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c61378b1f48a3fccbe0fff17273a16f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54c578d96b848b155835e3ba7da7e5f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cbf01ed9ad87a70a79c843ac877485f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b90e0ee8e6c1bdf39a40aa9e79108543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bf663d6f3ed8f5070fc03ef10983000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f45211ad81e0b2b4ed34aeb081be541&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59b3336841877e8d6032aebe0661beab</data>
