      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="开拓者" target="帕姆">
      <data key="d7">17.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Pam (the train conductor) and the Trailblazer share a professional, authoritative, and nurturing relationship aboard the Astral Express. Pam establishes their authority by reminding the Trailblazer that they are not uniquely special and must obey the train's rules. Pam provides practical guidance, such as directing the Trailblazer to the rooms of other passengers like March 7th and Dan Heng, sharing information about their locations, and instructing the Trailblazer to pack, gather near the front of the train for meetings, or prepare for the next leg of the journey. Pam also expresses anticipation for upcoming planets and excitement about adventures, while showing frustration when the train does not depart. The Trailblazer, in turn, asks Pam about past adventures, including whether he has ever visited雅利洛-Ⅵ, and inquires about reaching Pegana. Pam demonstrates a forgiving and understanding nature, forgiving the Trailblazer for forgetting to bring a souvenir as a special exception for a first mission. Pam expresses gratitude to the Trailblazer for helping to stabilize a rift, acknowledging their successful efforts and valuable contribution. Ultimately, Pam bids farewell to the Trailblazer, with the relationship marked by authority, care, and mutual respect.&lt;SEP&gt;Pam initially addresses the Trailblazer with a question about admitting guilt before transitioning to Akivili's list of crimes.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者提到帕姆会用喷壶让人冷静。</data>
      <data key="d9">accusation,communication,conductor,conversation,destination,direction,farewell,gratitude,guidance,history,information,information exchange,instruction,interaction,interrogation,meeting coordination,mission briefing,passenger,questioning,reference,travel,travel guidance,warning,开拓任务,提及,行为</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-8272ce558ae20153faafd6ffc5a4135d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e78a4d47602d8436e5950b7c64fa6734&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bb530c0e05d34c67f0c09a0b64e8fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2ba7c588b6bb3764618714d5bb5c3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63dc2a8cef74048f287c7e0648930116&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3b928a611b55c5851f3bf1cdc2b0d93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef607cf0570a332c394810669c8b2ed4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d49ee9d93d2b9c97270455c78b3b83e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-488e16522a18a4f6bb0a292766e58c72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55386d63b94eb9742f952f3f22848dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-094804e240d67bb52bc7b0d5edc9d536&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f619797d531a760023734b0000857d9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff01e303ac33cbdc731672f2b8068156&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce6adaabd8f6d85314cbea559ce01a36</data>
