    <edge source="开拓者" target="星穹列车">
      <data key="d7">28.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Trailblazer is a member of the Astral Express crew, having been invited aboard by Himeko after a decision to join, with confirmation from March 7th and advice from Herta. As a passenger and crew member, the Trailblazer is also known as an "无名客" (Nameless), traveling on the Astral Express across the universe, which provides an alternative path to journey through the stars and seek answers about the Star Rail. After a period of consideration, including discussions about the train's accommodations, the Trailblazer ultimately joined the team and remains an active part of the crew, sharing goals with Dan Heng and March 7th. The Trailblazer once proposed returning to the Astral Express as a safe option and inquired about its status, receiving a report from Pom-Pom that all equipment is normal and space is stable. The Trailblazer's first Trailblaze expedition has been successfully completed. Additionally, the Trailblazer has experienced Sunday's "调律" (Tuning) while being a member of the Astral Express and, while in Luofu, felt discomfort and desired to leave.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者是星穹列车的成员之一。&lt;SEP&gt;The Trailblazer is a passenger on the Astral Express.&lt;SEP&gt;The Trailblazer is a member of the Astral Express crew.&lt;SEP&gt;The Trailblazer is a passenger on the Astral Express, traveling to new destinations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Trailblazer is a member of the Astral Express crew.</data>
      <data key="d9">advice,affiliation,allegiance,alternative,belonging,collaboration,consideration,crew,decision,departure,journey,member_of,membership,new passenger,offer of passage,passenger,plan,team,transportation,travel,乘客关系,加入与乘客关系,加入选择,成员,旅程,状态查询</data>
