    <edge source="开拓者" target="瓦尔特">
      <data key="d7">37.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between the Trailblazer and Welt is one of mutual trust, guidance, and care, as both travel together as crew members of the Star Rail Express. Welt proactively offers to check on the Trailblazer's health, concerned about potential side effects from the Stellaron within them and the intervention of the Stellaron Hunters. He warns the Trailblazer that the hunters' appearance might be an omen to change the future, and they discuss topics including the future, free will, and the Stellaron Hunters. The Trailblazer seeks Welt's insight on the backgrounds of companions like Dan Heng and March 7th, and discusses the nature of their role as a Nameless. In return, the Trailblazer shows interest in Welt's past, asking about why he left his original world and his previous work. The Trailblazer praises Welt's company, believing he makes the journey easier. Welt expresses a desire to join the Trailblazer on adventures, regrets not helping them earlier, leads investigations alongside them, and is entrusted to look after them. He comments that the Trailblazer looks well, shows patience, and supports their explorations. They also discuss suspicions, with Welt providing analytical support, including analyzing Aventurine's interest in Acheron and agreeing with the Trailblazer's views on their movements. After returning from the trip, Welt remarks that the journey's end is also a new beginning. The Trailblazer asks Welt questions about the Watchmaker, the Family, and the dream itinerary, and suggests that Sand Gold should talk to Welt instead. Additionally, Welt sends reliable information about Sam to the Trailblazer, asks them to accompany him to investigate the bellhop, confirms to the Trailblazer that "Mian Mian" is a Nameless and explains the situation, and requests to borrow a token given by the company envoy. Finally, Welt and the Trailblazer return to the Astral Express together to wait for Himeko and March.&lt;SEP&gt;Walter praises the Trailblazer's growth, comparing it to an S-rank warrior from his homeland.</data>
      <data key="d9">adventure,advice,analysis,check-up,commentary,companionship,consultation,conversation,crew member,discussion,encouragement,examination,explanation,group member,health concern,information exchange,information sharing,inquiry,interaction,investigation,involvement,learning,medical concern,mentorship,motivation,observation,passenger well-being,perspective,philosophy,praise,preparation,question,recognition,referral,return,shared action,suggestion,support,travel,warning,welcome,交谈,信任,共识,分析,同伴,团队协作,对话,对话与询问,支持,旅行,照顾,讨论,请求,陪同,领导</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-e78a4d47602d8436e5950b7c64fa6734&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789285bc757b7b48d94a58fb5071cb0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95f3cdca78469e141c72057fa03532b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bb530c0e05d34c67f0c09a0b64e8fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f363a6ba12d7e65941adba654ef6fb4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2decb49a546c2b4fde6ed99f9c7b7ad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9509992da819b3c05c5d00771b2ec521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c308352492cacde7b8e6f6802f949905&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c992f8ca9cbe3142dda05033f0b52e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e80256f6b29768c5cfabe6c8af4d081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63dc2a8cef74048f287c7e0648930116&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7304e1604bff47c393b7d5c5dec23a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25bbc2acab19c28d156b60535056e250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef607cf0570a332c394810669c8b2ed4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d49ee9d93d2b9c97270455c78b3b83e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43623aa0b2e27c60a1de27a0205f0f63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61516ad7fd396ad1a99e7af49440d26a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5c30624adbe5e5d9ad4c03419838c07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd64d36e6f165af69ecd014e8024b7c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db1a6716eb95924fce53acec168f822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7226238e34da823949aab509aaac80e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fc6126d0155a7c411f4068a66d7ddca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbaaefa57c77ce66db9f587ea1d3d757&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55386d63b94eb9742f952f3f22848dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee709ee6223dbebd15d8b80e4cdae7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0a70a6406ad3789553b939ba9a7d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-729906f69b0dc31b866284fec42bd817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c99e6308cd56f22b4ce44dda6f0ec62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0d9a1eb37814b69abf237639d5775c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8540d7e0e81fe2169489850051f5cdd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d404ca122e5e26803146d6835398291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a26e6722285ef522993b41004a8fb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ced452746c325133a3a01ca4ffe26f9</data>
