    <edge source="开拓者" target="星核猎手">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Trailblazer and the Stellaron Hunters share a deeply intertwined and often manipulative relationship. The Stellaron Hunters have meddled directly with the protagonist's body and fate, most notably by implanting a Stellaron into the Trailblazer for their own long-term objectives. Consequently, the Trailblazer has expressed a sense of being a puppet or tool of the Stellaron Hunters, with their actions frequently manipulated or redirected by the Hunters' schemes, such as when the Hunters disrupted the Trailblazer’s original plans to travel to Penacony.  

Despite this manipulation, the Stellaron Hunters also seek the Trailblazer’s assistance on specific matters. March 7 has observed that the Trailblazer was previously familiar with members of the group, and the Trailblazer has directly conversed with Kafka, a prominent member of the Stellaron Hunters. Their frequent proximity to the Trailblazer may imply a future course correction or reveal a deeper, long-term connection between them.</data>
      <data key="d9">alliance,body tampering,disruption,implantation,interference,involvement manipulation,manipulation,observation,past familiarity,plan,request for help,关系,对话,自我认知</data>
