    <edge source="开拓者" target="杰帕德">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">杰帕德注意到开拓者的穿着和装备，认为不能草率地下判断。&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者询问如何说服杰帕德，希露瓦建议在杰帕德留在城里时快速行动以避开他。&lt;SEP&gt;杰帕德addresses the main character as "Trailblazer," a title chosen by the Architects to show more respect.&lt;SEP&gt;杰帕德expresses gratitude for the Trailblazer's understanding and acknowledges their combat prowess.&lt;SEP&gt;杰帕德acknowledges the Trailblazer's strength and expresses a desire for them to assist in training the Iron Guard.</data>
