    <edge source="开拓者" target="希儿">
      <data key="d7">12.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between 希儿 (Seele) and 开拓者 (the Trailblazer) begins with initial tension, as 开拓者 introduces himself as a friend of 桑博 (Sampo), a connection that 希儿 views negatively. Despite this, 三月七 (March 7th) believes that gaining 希儿's help would make it easier for them to find the Stellaron. Over time, 开拓者 and 希儿 collaborate on several missions, including jointly traveling to the mines to rescue people. 开拓者 proactively seeks information from 希儿 about 史瓦罗 (Svarog) and the 地火 (Wildfire) organization, and also expresses concern for 希儿's situation while asking for her assistance. 希儿, in turn, informs 开拓者 about the worsening conditions in other towns compared to 贝洛伯格下层区 (Boulder Town's Underworld). The two also travel together to assist 娜塔莎 (Natasha) with her patients. In a separate interaction, 希儿 warns 开拓者 about a child thief, showing her growing willingness to protect and cooperate with him. Overall, their relationship evolves from suspicion to mutual cooperation and trust, with 希儿 becoming a key ally for 开拓者 in the underworld.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者's suggestion of persuasion contrasts with希儿's preference for direct violence.&lt;SEP&gt;希儿与开拓者一起出发，响应希露瓦的提议。&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者和希儿一起行动，讨论换位思考和结束一切。&lt;SEP&gt;希儿expresses concern about the difficulties the Trailblazer will face on their journey.</data>
      <data key="d9">approach,concern,cooperation,disagreement,guidance,interaction,introduction,journey,rescue,skepticism,互动,信息交换,关心与求助,合作,同行关系,告知,团队,对话,探索,潜在帮助,行动</data>
