    <edge source="开拓者" target="史瓦罗">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between Svarog and the Trailblazer is characterized by initial conflict that evolves into a cooperative partnership. The Trailblazer’s group seeks to meet Svarog, who is identified as a crucial figure for their mission to obtain information about the Stellaron. Svarog initially assesses the Trailblazer and their allies as a threat. Following a confrontation, Svarog ultimately evaluates the situation, decides to transfer decision-making authority to the Trailblazer, and opens access to the Stellaron's data. Upon request, Svarog presents audio recordings related to the Stellaron to the Trailblazer. Furthermore, the Trailblazer believes it is possible to convince Svarog to formally join their side, with the core objective being to persuade or defeat Svarog in order to change their predicament. The Trailblazer attempts to negotiate with Svarog to gain the needed information, and the two are soon established as partners, with Svarog becoming a cooperative ally.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者帮忙解决了史瓦罗带来的麻烦。&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者试图说服史瓦罗，但后来史瓦罗先动手导致失败。</data>
