    <edge source="开拓者" target="瓦尔特·杨">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Trailblazer refers to Welt Yang as "杨叔" (Uncle Yang) and asks about his decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者与瓦尔特讨论裂界、寒潮和希望。&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者asks瓦尔特·杨for his opinions on the仙舟联盟and other matters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Trailblazer listens to Welt Yang’s comments about the hotel and the Dreamscape.</data>
