    <edge source="开拓者" target="停云">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Trailblazer and 停云 (Tingyun) share a multifaceted relationship built on interaction, respect, and assistance. The Trailblazer first encounters 停云, a foxian girl, and interacts with her by questioning her about the artificial weather and the chaos caused by the Stellaron. When the Trailblazer presses her about Kafka's communication, 停云 politely deflects the inquiry. In a crucial moment, the Trailblazer rescues 停云 at the streamcross port. Following this, 停云 respectfully addresses the Trailblazer as "恩公" (benefactor), comparing them to a heroic imperial censor. She also offers to pilot the star-skiff for the Trailblazer. Their conversations deepen as the Trailblazer and 停云 discuss the nature of immortality and the rules of the Xianzhou Alliance, with 停云 defending the organization's stance. The Trailblazer, in turn, actively searches for her, indicating a close and ongoing bond.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者和三月七代停云小姐送上她的礼物。</data>
      <data key="d9">address,assistance,conversation,deflection,gratitude,interaction,observation,philosophy,praise,rescue,search,代送,委托</data>
