      <data key="d8">The Trailblazer expresses suspicion towards Jing Yuan's motives and behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;景元向开拓者解释秘而不宣使用穷观阵的原因。&lt;SEP&gt;景元请求开拓者帮助应对罗浮的灾变，并承诺事后回报。&lt;SEP&gt;Jing Yuan explains the history of the Xianzhou to the Trailblazer.&lt;SEP&gt;The Trailblazer expresses concern for Jing Yuan's safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Jing Yuan praises the Trailblazer by calling them the "Galaxy Ranger" and engages in banter.</data>
