    <edge source="开拓者" target="符玄">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Fu Xuan and the Trailblazer have a complex, multi-faceted relationship characterized by collaboration, inquiry, and command. Fu Xuan, as a leader and commander, gives direct instructions to the Trailblazer, ordering them to follow her to a star skiff dock and enlisting their help, along with the Astral Express crew, in addressing an internal crisis, such as dealing with the Den of Thieves. The Trailblazer, in turn, often questions Fu Xuan, asking about the Poor Observation Array’s operation, whether she would attack the Dan Ding Si, and if it is a "lucky hour" for action. This relationship also includes moments of personal interaction, where Fu Xuan performs divination for the Trailblazer to discuss the fortunes and misfortunes of their path ahead. The Trailblazer also provides medical treatment to Fu Xuan after a conversation. Furthermore, the Trailblazer reports to Fu Xuan and participates in interrogation processes, while Fu Xuan responds to the Trailblazer’s challenges or doubts, indicating a dynamic of both subordination and independent inquiry.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者offers to share Fu Xuan's burdens and observes her performance.&lt;SEP&gt;符玄算到开拓者会多次返回罗浮仙舟，因此简化道别，并祝福其旅途平安。</data>
      <data key="d9">cooperation,dialogue,guidance,interaction,leadership,negotiation,observation,offer,query,questioning,卜算,占卜,复命,对话,指挥,祝福</data>
