    <edge source="开拓者" target="米沙">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between the Trailblazer and Misha is multifaceted, encompassing interactions as a guest, a friend, and a guide. Misha frequently calls out to the Trailblazer, asking them to come closer, and has offered luggage services to both the Trailblazer and March 7th. The Trailblazer often seeks information from Misha, asking questions about the hotel and dreams, specifically regarding the "Reverie Hotel" dreamscape and "Golden Hour," with Misha providing explanations in return. In one instance, Misha apologized to the Trailblazer for a cleaning oversight. The Trailblazer found the name "Misha" intriguing and decided to investigate the situation further. Misha identified the Trailblazer as a friend and thanked them for resolving a crisis. Additionally, there is a notable event where Mika brought the unconscious Trailblazer into the dream, acting as their guide.&lt;SEP&gt;The Trailblazer first met米沙at a hotel.</data>
