    <edge source="开拓者" target="砂金">
      <data key="d7">23.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Aventurine (砂金) and the Trailblazer (开拓者) have a complex, multi-layered relationship defined by manipulation, mutual testing, threats, and tentative cooperation. Aventurine has actively sought to draw the Trailblazer into his schemes, attempting to manipulate them by alluding to their "Stellaron" power and inviting them to uncover hidden truths. He has directly proposed a partnership to investigate the truth behind Robin's death and later recounted events to seek the Trailblazer's cooperation in exploring the truth of Penacony. Aventurine has tested the Trailblazer's motives, expressed interest in seeing their value through either cooperation or betrayal, and has even apologized while gifting them 10,000 Credits. Crucially, he has threatened to detonate the Stellaron inside the Trailblazer's body to fabricate a death, using them as an instrument of destruction. He also gave the Trailblazer a gambling chip that functions as a tracking device. The Trailblazer, while initially skeptical of claims about Acheron being an Emanator, has shown trust by prioritizing the overall situation at Aventurine's behest. Previous combat between them ensures mutual recognition and reduces the need for lengthy explanations. Ultimately, Aventurine has left a means of contact, suggesting the Trailblazer keep funds available for investigation, and expressed a desire to uncover the truth of a "death" together. The Trailblazer decides to meet with him, and after negotiations, may potentially accept his cooperation proposal. Despite their conflicts, Aventurine has also congratulated the Trailblazer on a job well done and discussed the Interastral Peace Corporation's fundamental value of peace with them. The Trailblazer has also questioned the guarantee of Aventurine's survival.</data>
      <data key="d9">acceptance,apology,approach,conflict,congratulation,conversation,cooperation,deal,direct interaction,discovery,discussion,interaction,investigation,larger picture,manipulation,meeting,negotiation,past encounter,proposal,recognition,skepticism,social interaction,suspicion,transaction,trust,value,互道再见,信息提供,冲突,利用,利用计划,合作,合作邀请,威胁,对话,期待,目标,给予信物,联系方式,调查,谈判,质疑,追踪</data>
