    <edge source="开拓者" target="流萤">
      <data key="d7">41.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between the Trailblazer (开拓者) and Firefly (流萤) is a complex, multi-layered bond that develops through their shared experiences in Penacony. It is characterized by mutual assistance, protection, guidance, and a collective search for understanding amidst the mysteries and secrets of the dreamscape. Initially, Firefly guides the Trailblazer to explore the Golden Hour, introducing herself as a member of the Iris Family. She provides help, shows concern for the Trailblazer's well-being, warns of danger, and proposes playful activities. The Trailblazer seeks out Firefly to learn her secrets, engaging in moments of negotiation and trust-building, including discussions of a stalker and pocket watch. As their relationship deepens, it involves vulnerability and growing familiarity. Firefly leads the Trailblazer to a secret base and the Edge of Dreamscape for intimate conversations, where she eventually confesses her identity, though the Trailblazer initially expresses distrust toward those who withhold the truth. Despite this, lighthearted moments occur, such as the Trailblazer teasing Firefly about her fear of the camera, yet she remains prepared to take photos with them. Fuuka interprets riddles suggesting that only the protagonist can unite trash cans to defeat evil, and the pair reacts with shock together in empty spaces, highlighting their shared vulnerability and partnership. The Trailblazer also supports Firefly against Sampo, worries about her status and wants to know if she has returned to reality, and recognizes that hunting dog members were previously pursuing her. After expressing frustration at being deceived, the Trailblazer later accepts Firefly's apology, solidifying their partnership as they share findings and feel a need to give her a final explanation.

The duo also engages in several collaborative activities, including participating together in a "奇人擂台战" challenge and forming a pair to complete a dual-performance scene in a line test. They also jointly compete in an acting performance stage challenge. Himeko suggests that the Trailblazer team up with Firefly to act together, and Firefly agrees. The Trailblazer and Firefly participate together in an improvisational performance test, adjusting their moods and actions, and Firefly asks the Trailblazer to perform specific emotions like disappointment or surprise during an activity. Furthermore, the Trailblazer and Firefly agree on the need to seal the Stellaron in Penacony, and they are co-champions of the Hot Sand Ceremony.&lt;SEP&gt;流萤与开拓者一起游览匹诺康尼，察觉到真相后试图邀其入局，却意外导致了自己的“死亡”。</data>
