    <edge source="开拓者" target="匹诺康尼">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Trailblazer (开拓者) has a complex and evolving relationship with Penacony (匹诺康尼), a dream world that they visit for the first time. Upon their initial arrival, the Trailblazer sought a guide and experienced disappointment at the dream world's barren appearance, yet also expressed excitement and a desire for opportunities there. While in Penacony, the Trailblazer is described as being in a dream state and is treated as a guest by the local 猎犬家系 (Bloodhound Family) members, who offer welcome and directions. The character 砂金 (Aventurine) believes that the Trailblazer is necessary for reclaiming Penacony. Furthermore, the Trailblazer holds a specific philosophical view of the dream world, believing that the Penacony of 米哈伊尔's (Mikhail's) dreams does not belong to the path of Order (「秩序」) and thereby indirectly supports its nature as a land of Trailblaze (「开拓」).&lt;SEP&gt;The Trailblazer is recognized as the hero of Penacony for their contributions to resolving the disaster.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者参与了拯救匹诺康尼的行动，结束了梦幻之旅。</data>
