    <edge source="开拓者" target="钟表小子">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Trailblazer has a unique and direct relationship with Clockie. The Trailblazer is the only person who can see and interact with Clockie, noting that he is only visible to children. Clockie considers the Trailblazer a friend and asks for their help in dealing with the帮派老大. The Trailblazer can communicate with Clockie, who is the source of the "clockwork" ability, referred to as 钟表把戏. In one instance, the Trailblazer mentioned pulling out eyelashes from Clockie, and in another, the Trailblazer discussed with 流萤 whether Clockie's image is cute.&lt;SEP&gt;开拓者能够看见「钟表小子」。</data>
