    <edge source="开拓者" target="黑天鹅">
      <data key="d7">25.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Trailblazer and Black Swan share a multifaceted relationship characterized by guidance, cooperation, and mutual care within the dreamscape. Black Swan instructs the Trailblazer on sensing memories (忆质) and walking on walls, rescues them from danger to fulfill a promise, and brings them back to the Astral Express. She recommends that the Trailblazer keep their distance from Acheron and seeks their opinion on traveling alongside her, while also warning that trusting Aventurine may mean leaving the truth behind. Black Swan informs the Trailblazer about Firefly's safe awakening and notes March 7th's absence.

Black Swan also observes the Trailblazer's recovery, calls them a "little sleepyhead," and expresses concern for their safety in Penacony. She provides a flawed story to guide their awakening from the dream, examines their memories, and gifts a "空光锥" while intending to reveal a secret answer. Black Swan collects the Trailblazer's memories, citing deeper reasons for her favor, and senses their emotions. The Trailblazer, in turn, asks about shortcuts, speculates on Black Swan's thoughts and motivations, including potential discussions about Aventurine. Overall, Black Swan believes in the Trailblazer's potential, willingly helps them, and offers companionship due to their sensitivity to memories.</data>
      <data key="d9">accompany,being warned,care,character interaction,communication,concern,conversation,cooperation,counseling,curiosity,emotion sensing,gift,guidance,influence,information,interaction,interest,investigation,kidnapping,memory collection,mentorship,observation,presence,protect,protection,reassurance,receiving information,seeking help,teaching,therapy,trust,truth,warning,可能性,同行,咨询,带回,建议,引导觉醒,思考,拯救,揭示真相,疑问,警告,讲述故事,询问意见</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-6e324df5f5fbf95c7405c125ff8a660d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59980cf920354512f617e41b955d0a8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-704fd94705176c5d8b7902f98a6e3b69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24565d6d66fd343d204ca6ee232d3fb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a111bfaa2097692df9de2c4cee43b80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-decf73ec6ca6190de19732c8d1e452cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a85593df517a24f90624d6d6d8ce60fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b3042cb485fcff761368d2fa08b2f5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c011e090ca9129d5dd9e7a0c357dfcff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-083647d174927add1aefc63655ec615b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41a99864b87ae5c7c8eb089ea4a5b9d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d063d42a7d57ae6c56275f1aaaa1ec8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5954e37f4e86a5288abe3c27ceaf4ef9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a014c948b270f74369d5227c7fc80c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c99e6308cd56f22b4ce44dda6f0ec62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f273e249d48375fe4ce18df04b167906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fecb71ee2401bfdf2be56be0fc3835d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eafccb4855b4210dcf8ae59537a1eb77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea958dd07fcb944ce792ebb1149ed1b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b169536dd073e8b85cff97e7e4637fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d235d876b6479c8e730e06da624342e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ced452746c325133a3a01ca4ffe26f9</data>
