    <edge source="星核" target="黑塔">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">黑塔is interested in researching the Star Rail and the Trailblazer who contains it.&lt;SEP&gt;黑塔研究星核，认为它是生命体，机制与毁灭命途相关。&lt;SEP&gt;黑塔is a genius who cannot fully explain the Stellaron, indicating its profound mystery.</data>
      <data key="d9">containment,mystery,nature,research</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-1cbf01ed9ad87a70a79c843ac877485f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bf663d6f3ed8f5070fc03ef10983000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bb530c0e05d34c67f0c09a0b64e8fa6</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1778737020</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="星核" target="瓦尔特">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Walter (瓦尔特) has a deep understanding of the Stellaron (星核) as a dangerous and corruptive force. He describes it as a "Cancer of All Worlds," emphasizing its ability to spread destructively, and warns the Astral Express passenger about the risks of the Stellaron located inside their body. Walter believes the Stellaron is responsible for the severe environmental changes on 雅利洛-Ⅵ and has similarly linked it to major catastrophes on the Xianzhou Luofu, notably identifying it as the source of the abnormal energy that triggered the rebirth of the 建木. He explains that the Astral Express crew has a history of stopping Stellaron disasters, which is why they have come to help, and states their explicit purpose on the Xianzhou is to assist in sealing the Stellaron.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特suspects that the星核(Stellaron) is the cause of the药王秘传's emergence and the related Abundance anomalies.</data>
      <data key="d9">causation,cause,caution,crisis resolution,danger warning,describes,explains,explanation,influence,investigation,link,mention,mission objective,prior experience,判断,识别</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-8bf92db6fb06a4ce23bb9a1040ac0bf5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33140787e65f36d03a2cf1fe766a0e3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e80256f6b29768c5cfabe6c8af4d081&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd1ac3b2477b33ac600764c2339c9761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a08a4c1f5ae941cbe079fc5aaa48a0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df8b5bd13b0c402afd43298bddf26cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e67f27ee470faa07599b85ba409e78c8</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1778832142</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="星核" target="裂界">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation between the Stellaron (星核) and the Fragmentum (裂界) is one of causation and direct influence. The Stellaron is widely regarded as the fundamental origin or root cause of the Fragmentum phenomenon. It is believed that the Stellaron gives rise to the Fragmentum, and its presence in any world inevitably leads to the birth of the Fragmentum. The Stellaron's activity is directly linked to the expansion of the Fragmentum, and when a Stellaron is planted, it necessarily results in the creation of this spatial distortion. For instance, after a Stellaron was extracted, it was observed to have eroded a space station, forming the Fragmentum space. In summary, the Stellaron is the source of the Fragmentum's influence, causing the spatial distortion phenomenon that manifests as the Fragmentum.&lt;SEP&gt;星核唤来了墙外的风雪，并开启了裂界的大门。&lt;SEP&gt;The influence of the Fragmentum has taken root deeply due to the Stellaron, making it hard to reverse.</data>
      <data key="d9">causality,causation,cause,cause and effect,creation,deep influence,disaster,effect,spatial distortion,world influence,侵蚀与创造关系,创造,因果关系</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-b90e0ee8e6c1bdf39a40aa9e79108543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff4678a309428e5e405e8aab17b34d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e575eb06637f7ecf24d773fb6f0f798b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33a3b81a0e0d021e092a5a43b49f3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f358eb31ab41c53d64bb729897805779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-048b0dd3c3bc2cae0be82ff708452623&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4230a2ca41a3aa5b271c968b4567de1d</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1778809066</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
