    <edge source="星核" target="三月七">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">三月七在对话中提及星核存在于开拓者体内。&lt;SEP&gt;三月七表示星穹列车是专门向受星核困扰的世界伸出援手的热心人士。&lt;SEP&gt;March 7th and the crew are searching for the Stellaron, believed to be the cause of all disasters.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七stated that the task is progressing smoothly and they are going to find the星核next.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七notes that as the group gets closer, the voice of the Stellaron fragment becomes clearer, indicating proximity.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七mentioned that the group resolved the issue with the星核using the造物引擎.&lt;SEP&gt;March 7th struggles with how to tell people that sealing the Stellaron did not fix all their problems.</data>
      <data key="d9">approach,emotional impact,location,objective,observation,quest,reference,resolution,search,task,victory,援助目标</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-00732d55bdd6fa143033b2dd0669aaa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0f0f18d770fb010f9ef46a1a80d78c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-876cbdcb2b6b60cef20d49340ecee30f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eacd315ae5f95c55d189019b4d765b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-759b67ce2403d327c5bbf52c85062eaa</data>
