    <edge source="星核" target="丹恒">
      <data key="d7">19.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Dan Heng consistently identifies the Stellaron (星核) as a primary source of disaster and corruption across worlds. He explains that the Stellaron causes space blockage on planets like Yarilo-VI (雅利洛-Ⅵ), rendering critical infrastructure such as geothermal heaters ineffective and making it the mission's target for removal. He notes that the Stellaron brings disaster to worlds, serves as the root cause of the damage that Svarog's calculations are based on, and is the source of the 裂界 (Fragmentum) corruption. Dan Heng further observes that the Stellaron has an extraordinary influence on the world, and he explains to Cocolia (可可利亚) the dangers it poses, stating that the Astral Express (星穹列车) has the means to seal it. 

Dan Heng infers that the planet's leadership knew the Stellaron was the disaster's source but failed to destroy it. He also speculated that March 7th's (三月七) recurring dreams might be caused by the Stellaron inside her. Dan Heng focuses on the specific coordinates and location of the Stellaron, though he has not yet grasped them. He urges the group to find it quickly to prevent Cocolia from taking action. As part of the group actively seeking the Stellaron, he deduces its path, stating that the group is approaching the Stellaron, which is the source of the cold. Consequently, the Stellaron is the primary objective for both Dan Heng and the Trailblazer (开拓者), who seek clues about it in the underground.&lt;SEP&gt;丹恒分析了星核封印后的影响，认为寒潮和裂界的变化需要时间。&lt;SEP&gt;丹恒推测星核之间能通过某种方式传递讯息，开拓者体内的星核与世界星核共鸣。&lt;SEP&gt;丹恒recounted witnessing the battle against the星核.&lt;SEP&gt;Dan Heng explains the harsh reality of the Stellaron's effects on the planet.</data>
      <data key="d9">analysis,causation,cause of blockage,connection,disaster,explanation,hypothesis,investigation,investigation target,knowledge,location,mission,mission goal,objective,observation,primary objective,problem,pursuit,pursuit of goal,recount,solution,witness,world influence,共鸣理论,分析,后果,寻找,封印,推测分析,目标,解释与封印,调查目标</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-07c244e0b796cd21c35920e292f8b301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff4678a309428e5e405e8aab17b34d43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f6083a9f5af04acd1ef8a41e5bfdfda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8772d247819725686282b99e50b8064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15180a72eb9a3f1361af9608498c499b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1381bbbb71b642a091a6c3425722884b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0f0f18d770fb010f9ef46a1a80d78c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62249a61ab686e12d9f450bd5b82c692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a472ad06854cfbea32b100ad930934ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-876cbdcb2b6b60cef20d49340ecee30f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc91593211be73b8761c305cc9886950&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e5ba5f7b6b4c9a58f7986795cc260a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-597d9b4d5a0e43e3628da07ccc535c03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7761bbe49cdee3fe2ebc6f41bfed7bee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eacd315ae5f95c55d189019b4d765b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-759b67ce2403d327c5bbf52c85062eaa</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1778814420</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="星核" target="雅利洛-Ⅵ">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">A Stellaron is located on the planet雅利洛-Ⅵ and is causing issues.&lt;SEP&gt;The Stellaron is the root cause of Jarilo-VI's ecological transformation into an ice-covered world.&lt;SEP&gt;星核是雅利洛-Ⅵ危机的根源，封印后星球获得了恢复的可能性。&lt;SEP&gt;The Stellaron is a threat to Jarilo-VI and its inhabitants.</data>
