    <edge source="星核" target="反物质军团">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">丹恒mentions that after the Stellaron's arrival, the Antimatter Legion invaded, leading to the Eternal Freeze.&lt;SEP&gt;星核的出现与反物质军团的入侵有关联，后者在星核到来后不久发动侵袭。&lt;SEP&gt;The Stellaron is often accompanied by the Anti-Matter Legion during its spread.&lt;SEP&gt;星核曾经在七百年前驱逐了入侵的反物质军团。</data>
      <data key="d9">association,causation,correlation,disaster chain,入侵,因果关系,敌对关系,驱逐</data>
