    <edge source="星核" target="寒潮">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">星核的出现引发了寒潮，这是一种席卷全球的自然灾祸。&lt;SEP&gt;星核根据贝洛伯格星球的情况，创造了寒潮这一灾祸。&lt;SEP&gt;The Stellaron created the Eternal Freeze disaster specifically for Belobog based on the planet's conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;星核被认为是寒潮灾难的根本源头。&lt;SEP&gt;The Stellaron's fulfillment of the wish resulted in the Eternal Freeze.</data>
      <data key="d9">causality,causation,creation,wish fulfillment,创造,因果关系,灾祸</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33a3b81a0e0d021e092a5a43b49f3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f358eb31ab41c53d64bb729897805779&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3230677383d6c0041b3dbc113dd8b0ff</data>
