    <edge source="星核" target="可可利亚">
      <data key="d7">11.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Cocolia, the Supreme Guardian of Belobog, entered into a pact with the Stellaron, aligning with its power rather than resisting it. She believed in the Stellaron's promise of a new world and drew strength from it to realize her vision. While publicly she offered assistance to the Astral Express crew to help find and seal the Stellaron, she was simultaneously accused of hiding its true nature from the people. Ultimately, Cocolia sought to bring her daughter, Bronya, into the same alliance with the Stellaron. The power she drew from it led to her sacrifice.&lt;SEP&gt;星核与可可利亚有关，需要赶在她发觉之前拿到。&lt;SEP&gt;星核以某种方式向可可利亚发出讯息，是可可利亚拥有力量的可能关键。&lt;SEP&gt;可可利亚的力量来自星核，并受其精神侵蚀。</data>
      <data key="d9">alignment,alliance,belief,choice,control,corruption,pact,promise,secrecy,source of power,关联,力量,力量来源,控制关系,牺牲,盟友关系,目标,调查与合作</data>
