    <edge source="星核" target="大守护者">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The大守护er's aggressive reaction to discussions about the星核suggests she might be protecting a secret related to it.&lt;SEP&gt;The Guardian channeled energy from the Stellaron, leading to her defeat.</data>
