    <edge source="星核" target="布洛妮娅">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">布洛妮娅向开拓者询问，假设找到星核，有多大把握能阻止寒潮。&lt;SEP&gt;Bronya experienced the Stellaron's voice being implanted into her mind by her mother, causing her pain.&lt;SEP&gt;星核attempted to implant its voice into布洛妮娅's mind, causing her torment.</data>
      <data key="d9">mental influence,mind control,suffering,torment,猜测,询问</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-72d3e4bc634c012aad25dcf71e92b962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f363a6ba12d7e65941adba654ef6fb4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2decb49a546c2b4fde6ed99f9c7b7ad0</data>
