    <edge source="星核" target="匹诺康尼">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">After the Stellaron severed connections, Penacony changed ownership several times.&lt;SEP&gt;匹诺康尼is built upon a星核, making it the星核之灾.&lt;SEP&gt;星核是匹诺康尼的核心危机，从未被真正封印。&lt;SEP&gt;The星核is the root cause of匹诺康尼's current crisis as a星核之灾.&lt;SEP&gt;星核serves as the stable core of the美梦in匹诺康尼.&lt;SEP&gt;Penacony's beautiful dream is built upon the Stellaron, which now poses a danger to the location.</data>
