    <edge source="星穹列车" target="开拓">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Astral Express is powered by the power of the Trailblaze Path.&lt;SEP&gt;The Astral Express is associated with the Trailblaze Path, reflecting its purpose in its appearance.&lt;SEP&gt;星穹列车沿着开拓命途的旅线行驶，并从该命途搬运力量。&lt;SEP&gt;The星穹列车upholds the philosophy of开拓(Trailblaze).&lt;SEP&gt;星穹列车成员贯彻开拓之道，迎难而上。</data>
