    <edge source="星穹列车" target="三月七">
      <data key="d7">29.0</data>
      <data key="d8">March 7th (三月七) is a member and passenger of the Astral Express (星穹列车) crew, and she is one of the Nameless (无名客) who travels aboard the train. She was rescued by the Astral Express while drifting in space and subsequently joined the crew, remaining on the train in search of her lost past. As a crew member, her activities include traveling with fellow member Himeko (姬子), receiving juice from the conductor Pom-Pom (帕姆), and participating in investigations while expressing surprise. She has also been known to drive and damage the train’s snow vehicle, resulting in a lack of spare vehicles for the crew. March 7th has offered photos as a farewell gift to the crew, expressed readiness to take luggage and souvenirs and return home to the train, and engages in banter and escape with fellow crew members. She has also wanted to take photos before their departure. Overall, March 7th is consistently identified as a member of the Astral Express and the Star Rail Express team, serving as one of the Nameless.</data>
      <data key="d9">affiliation,allegiance,collaboration,crew,home,identity,journey,member,member_of,membership,passenger,rescue,team,travel,乘客,参与,成员,成员关系,成员身份,所属,财物损害,隶属,驾驶事故</data>
