    <edge source="星穹列车" target="丹恒">
      <data key="d7">24.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Dan Heng is a member of the Astral Express (星穹列车) crew. On the train, he serves as its guard and is responsible for recording observations and experiences into the train's database, known as the 智库 (Think Tank). The Astral Express is the place where Dan Heng has stayed the longest, and he has used the database to study the planet 雅利洛-Ⅵ (Yarilo-Ⅵ). He is characterized by a solitary personality but engages with other crew members like March 七 (三月七) and the Trailblazer. Dan Heng uses old train codes for escape plans and has been noted for being late for meetings or needing to return to the train; other crew members, including 姬子, seek him out for discussions. His friends, including the Trailblazer, have waited for him at 鳞渊境 (Scalegorge Waterscape). During the crew's visit to Penacony, Dan Heng chose to remain on the Astral Express to guard it while others disembarked. He has also represented the train in negotiations, such as discussing with 波提欧 (Boothill) about an imposter issue. Across various accounts, he is consistently referred to as a Nameless (无名客) and a crew member of the Astral Express.&lt;SEP&gt;丹恒是星穹列车的成员之一。&lt;SEP&gt;Dan Heng is a member of the Astral Express crew.</data>
      <data key="d9">affiliation,allegiance,association,crew,delay,duty,guard duty,information source,longest stay,member,membership,plan,research,role,stay behind,travel,乘客身份,伙伴,成员,职责</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-96858a626ba4813bcea021ec43244a7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b766f048e61cc6147f844ddae676af7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83567c2b7f3bbf3d89505fcae70b0ba1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68ca2f09bea0bd57ce26ea252d883318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-789285bc757b7b48d94a58fb5071cb0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-010cf81a86ef8e6d81978812db1537ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95f3cdca78469e141c72057fa03532b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0e0a01514bf55bdf01a37e57b42711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07ddaec7bfcdba9a4cc6197378b1a8df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cb8da041bb65dbc2bdac7765d979d3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-807438542660c564cc6c45c1235307a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af804fb1bf95b8cfffcbb33654822b1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3b928a611b55c5851f3bf1cdc2b0d93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86afcf1d5b41644aabd32c7cbee164cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbaaefa57c77ce66db9f587ea1d3d757&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55386d63b94eb9742f952f3f22848dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8665828cdd81643c13114451e6ade3fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19f5f030dc583660b802b079e3f709e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d31c548c51772ffa1288c6206b2ff0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bb475440db80c353fd6762c87c12548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76afa09c20cb3ce18cbeba034f2526a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b9e8302300ff54dabbffc9bcf5f0204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ced452746c325133a3a01ca4ffe26f9</data>
