    <edge source="星穹列车" target="姬子">
      <data key="d7">30.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Himeko (姬子) is a central and long-standing member of the Astral Express (星穹列车) crew, serving as its navigator and one of the Nameless (无名客). Her journey began years ago when, on her birthday, the Astral Express crashed near her; she discovered the train partially buried in a crater and successfully repaired it, thereby enabling it to once again navigate the galaxy and beginning her own adventure. In her role, Himeko was instrumental in inviting the Trailblazer (开拓者) to join the train, sharing her desire to follow in the footsteps of the Trailblazing Aeon, Akivili (阿基维利). She has explained that the Express travels along the Trailblaze Path (开拓命途) and discussed the train's power mechanisms. As a central figure on the Express, Himeko represents the crew in key dialogues and strategic discussions. She has engaged in dialogue with Kafka (卡芙卡), requested landing permission from the Xianzhou Luofu (仙舟「罗浮」), and announced the crew's departure for a new planet after finishing their exploration of Jarilo-Ⅵ (雅利洛-Ⅵ). She also analyzed the motives of the Family (家族) and proposed strategic plans to target the Stellaron (星核), stating that the Astral Express cannot ignore the Stellaron and must fulfill the wishes of earlier trailblazers like Mikhail. Furthermore, she represented the Astral Express in negotiations with Sunday (星期日), questioning his actions. Her presence on the train is consistently noted alongside fellow crew members like March 7th (三月七).</data>
      <data key="d9">affiliation,analysis,boarding,crew,discovery,encounter,leadership,member,membership,negotiation,repair,responsibility,role,strategy,travel planning,trust,代表,启程,成员,成员与归属关系,成员关系,成员身份,所属,所有权与探索,维护,通讯,隶属,领导,领航</data>
