    <edge source="星穹列车" target="阿基维利">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Astral Express and Akivili are intrinsically connected. The Astral Express, a train that travels the stars, was created and originally used by Akivili, the Aeon of Trailblaze. Akivili rode the Astral Express as part of their trailblazing journeys, and the memories depict Akivili as a member of the crew who committed various mischiefs. The core of the Astral Express is rumored to be Akivili's heart, though the character Himeko is skeptical of this, suggesting there may be other mechanisms. Today, the Astral Express continues to travel the Galaxy, following the path of Trailblaze pioneered by Akivili by tracing their footsteps.</data>
      <data key="d9">association,creation,legacy,membership,ownership,past actions,riding,开拓生涯,旅途,起源与核心,追随与传承关系</data>
