    <edge source="星穹列车" target="裴迦纳">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Astral Express travels along Akivili's route, with both its first and last stops being Pegana.&lt;SEP&gt;星穹列车的旅程以裴迦纳为首末站，阿基维利的故乡。</data>
