    <edge source="星穹列车" target="帕姆">
      <data key="d7">17.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Pam is the dedicated and long-serving conductor of the Astral Express (also known as the Star Express or 星穹列车). In this capacity, they are responsible for managing the train's operations, including overseeing its departure and travel into calm inter-domain spaces to prevent spatial anomalies, as well as reminding passengers of their duties. Pam takes their role very seriously; while generally helpful and approachable, they can be terrifying when angered. Beyond operational tasks, they also host crew meetings, make requests for the crew to fulfill, uphold the train's rules, and guide passengers by explaining itineraries and procedures. Pam has notably commented that while the Astral Express is fast, it cannot outpace change. They have also been observed expressing anxiety over the behavior of certain passengers, such as Boothill, reflecting a deep sense of responsibility for the train and its crew.&lt;SEP&gt;帕姆is the conductor of the Astral Express and manages its operations, including announcing warps.&lt;SEP&gt;Pam is the conductor of the Astral Express.</data>
      <data key="d9">authority,conductor,connection,crew,employment,leadership,manages,membership,operates,operation,role,service,travel dynamics,列车长,发车准备,管理角色,职责,领导</data>
