    <edge source="星穹列车" target="无名客">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Nameless (无名客) are the members and crew of the Astral Express (星穹列车), a train that serves as both their home and primary vehicle. They are typically passengers who travel aboard the Express, with some choosing to leave the train at various destinations, such as a group that decided to stay in Penacony. The Nameless are actively involved in investigations and other missions undertaken by the Astral Express. The relationship is reciprocal, as the Astral Express provides its home and transportation for the Nameless, while the Nameless contribute to the Express's journey and legacy, sometimes leaving behind gifts like dream bubbles for the train.</data>
      <data key="d9">affiliation,crew,faction,gift,identity,members,membership,ownership,travel,vehicle,成员,成员关系,派系,身份,隶属</data>
