    <edge source="星穹列车" target="景元">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">General Jing Yuan of the Xianzhou Luofu maintains a cooperative and mutually beneficial relationship with the Astral Express crew. He offers the crew full authority and support to operate on the Luofu, and has personally invited them to help resolve incidents, such as one at the Artisanship Commission. Jing Yuan expresses admiration for the Astral Express and requests their assistance not only with the Stellaron but also with other tasks, viewing them as a valuable force worthy of alliance. In return, he promises full assistance and even intends to give them a gift before departing from the Luofu. Notably, out of consideration for Jing Yuan, Fu Xuan omitted the names of the Astral Express crew from her report to avoid implicating them in internal Xianzhou matters.&lt;SEP&gt;景元asks the Astral Express to represent them in the negotiation and invites them to a discussion.&lt;SEP&gt;Jing Yuan takes his leave of the Astral Express crew, offering to handle remaining affairs.</data>
      <data key="d9">&gt;request,admiration,alliance,clearance,closing dialogue,cooperation,delegation,farewell,invitation,mediation,request for assistance,request for help,信任,内务,合作,告别,影响,送礼</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-33140787e65f36d03a2cf1fe766a0e3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c992f8ca9cbe3142dda05033f0b52e1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8dd3179cc07be6652a8a064b6cefde1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df8b5bd13b0c402afd43298bddf26cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e9b4a06f02fe7c6cb62ff7b9a3d56cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95189fee74f326831efd9da16d00b815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e47a0efebc7ceac09127ceb2083c2301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bef71ea9725559b5e05574558cbcec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9a26e6722285ef522993b41004a8fb2</data>
