    <edge source="星穹列车" target="匹诺康尼">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between 匹诺康尼 (Penacony) and the 星穹列车 (Astral Express) is defined by the Express's journey to, and involvement with, the planet. Initially planned as a holiday visit for the crew, the Express travels to Penacony as its next destination. Upon arrival, the crew checks into a hotel. The Astral Express is formally invited, and its promotional posters are widely displayed throughout Penacony. Beyond a simple visit, the Astral Express crew becomes deeply involved in a critical mission to save Penacony by addressing a Stellaron threat.&lt;SEP&gt;The Astral Express has a mission to pioneer the future of Penacony.</data>
      <data key="d9">destination,destiny,journey,mission,passenger,pioneering,responsibility,travel,visit,关联,受邀访问</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-8a9abe8221b156371ccb92c8c70ff3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbaaefa57c77ce66db9f587ea1d3d757&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c55386d63b94eb9742f952f3f22848dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66cf67fcb2b367fc8c70e85c70acc6e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20dddf19eb9d23402675b17b25d6b7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db7acddc1a4e47a665ceece42a9f23e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76f30cea7751c5e1cdb8b78f14fea91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cca95c43061171ec0f9a64327c928c33</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1779070016</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="星穹列车" target="星核猎手">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The星核猎手manipulated events to bring the星穹列车to the Xianzhou Luofu to help resolve the Stellaron crisis.&lt;SEP&gt;星核猎手与星穹列车存在对立和互动关系，双方在匹诺康尼事件中博弈。&lt;SEP&gt;The星核猎手is predicted to be in unavoidable conflict with the星穹列车.</data>
      <data key="d9">alliance building,conflict,interaction,manipulation,prediction,rivalry</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-5aec7e92881b8561c64f206d873044d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-729906f69b0dc31b866284fec42bd817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54</data>
