      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The星穹列车needs to establish a connection with the仙舟联盟.&lt;SEP&gt;The Xianzhou Alliance proposes that the Astral Express represent them in the mediation efforts.</data>
      <data key="d9">alliance,alliance development,representation</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-5aec7e92881b8561c64f206d873044d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bef71ea9725559b5e05574558cbcec4</data>
