      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">砂金cites星穹列车as an example of entities that understand being a chip.&lt;SEP&gt;Aventurine proposes a cooperation with the Astral Express to uncover the truth of Robin's death, which he calls a win-win situation.&lt;SEP&gt;砂金suspects and closely observes the星穹列车group.&lt;SEP&gt;砂金的计划中，星穹列车处于关键位置，他可能试图利用他们。&lt;SEP&gt;砂金与星穹列车成员对峙，并邀请他们参加秀场。</data>
