    <edge source="星穹列车" target="流萤">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Firefly asks about the Trailblazer's friends on the Astral Express.&lt;SEP&gt;流萤表示星穹列车会和她一起行动，解释必要的事情。&lt;SEP&gt;流萤是星穹列车的无名客之一。&lt;SEP&gt;The Astral Express agrees with and supports the viewpoint expressed by Firefly.&lt;SEP&gt;流萤states she must go to another battlefield to support the Astral Express.</data>
