    <edge source="星穹列车" target="家族">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">星穹列车接受了家族的委托调查案件。&lt;SEP&gt;星穹列车受橡木家系授权协助调查，但家族处处隐瞒。&lt;SEP&gt;星穹列车决定协助家族调查命案真相。&lt;SEP&gt;波提欧criticizes the Family as part of the hotel's hospitality service on behalf of the Astral Express crew.&lt;SEP&gt;星穹列车成员认为因家族对列车熟悉而不敢轻举妄动。&lt;SEP&gt;星穹列车回复了家族的邀请函。&lt;SEP&gt;The Astral Express crew, via the Xianzhou Alliance, is involved in mediating the conflict between the Family and the IPC in Penacony.</data>
