    <edge source="星核猎手" target="瓦尔特">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">瓦尔特notes that the Stellaron Hunters tampered with the protagonist's body, causing potential aftereffects.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特一方与星核猎手成员卡芙卡有联系，被景元视为可利用的诱饵。&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特推测星核猎手的小骇客对通信设备动了手脚。&lt;SEP&gt;Welt analyzes the Stellaron Hunters' actions and motivations.</data>
