    <edge source="星核猎手" target="景元">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">景元accuses the Stellaron Hunters of framing the Astral Express and devises a plan to capture their member.&lt;SEP&gt;General Jing Yuan mentions that the Divination Commission suspects the Astral Express of being allies with the Stellaron Hunters, but he himself does not believe so.&lt;SEP&gt;景元试图利用瓦尔特等人作为诱饵来引出星核猎手。&lt;SEP&gt;景元asks the Astral Express Crew to help capture the Stellaron Hunters to learn about their Stellaron-related goals.&lt;SEP&gt;Jing Yuan is using the Stellaron Hunters as "bait" to lure out another unknown factor, implying a strategic pursuit rather than a simple capture.&lt;SEP&gt;Jing Yuan assigns the task of handling the Stellaron Hunters to the Divination Commission.&lt;SEP&gt;景元initially suspected the星核猎手of further plots.</data>
