    <edge source="三月七" target="丹恒">
      <data key="d7">55.0</data>
      <data key="d8">March 7th and Dan Heng are both crewmates aboard the Astral Express, bound by a strong sense of camaraderie and cooperation through shared missions and daily life. Their dynamic is marked by March 7th’s lively and teasing nature: she often notes Dan Heng’s usefulness for tasks like repairs, directs the Trailblazer to seek his help, asks about human lifespan, expresses concern about his whereabouts, and teases him for oversleeping. She once considered using the Xianzhou trip to inquire about his past and planned to take photos to make him envious for not joining. She also references his appearance to explain why she does not look like a Xianzhou native.

Dan Heng, typically reserved, shows care through cautious advice—warning March 7th to be wary of untrustworthy people, to conserve energy, and about the dangers of the Fragmentum. When he is unable to contact her, he worries about her situation. They have cooperated on numerous missions, such as escaping danger, fighting enemies, and reporting progress. They shared suspicions about Cocolia and discussed strange dreams that only March 7th experiences. Light-hearted banter includes playfully disagreeing on how to rate the Trailblazer’s first journey or differing accommodation preferences—March 7th wants to stay at the Goethe Hotel while Dan Heng suggests returning to the train. March 7th expresses sadness about parting, whereas Dan Heng offers a pragmatic perspective. In more serious moments, Dan Heng pushes for decisive action, rejecting delays for the organization “地火” due to time constraints and explaining that an extreme risk is the only viable path to the Stellaron’s center. March 7th speculates Dan Heng has a dramatic past and is wanted by the Garden of Recollection, while she also expresses surprise and welcome at his arrival. Their relationship balances her energy with his reliability, forming a cohesive partnership.&lt;SEP&gt;丹恒引导三月七进入持明废墟，并计划通过"叩祝三爪"仪式开启通往玄根的道路。&lt;SEP&gt;三月七对丹恒和景元提到的"叩祝三爪"术语表示困惑，并跟随丹恒前行。&lt;SEP&gt;March 7th does not directly interact with Dan Heng in this conversation but discusses his choice not to join the trip.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七suggests they find Dan Heng in the VIP lounge.&lt;SEP&gt;March 7th asks Dan Heng to introduce the cowboy to the Trailblazer.</data>
      <data key="d9">admonition,advice,analysis,banter,caution,collaboration,combat partner,communication,companion,companions,companionship,comparison,concern,consultation,conversation,crew,crew dynamics,crew member,curiosity,dialogue,direction,disagreement,discussion,explanation,farewell,following advice,friendship,guidance,habit,helping,interaction,mention,missions,mystery,observation,passenger behavior,persuasion,photography,planning,questioning,reference,refusal,relationship,reminder,report,request,request for assistance,rescue,reunion,scoring,searching,shared experience,silence,speculation,summon,supervision,task,team,team members,team membership,teaming up,teammates,teamwork,teasing,tolerance,下落不明,同伴关系,否定,团队互动,好奇,对话交流,寻找目标,意见分歧,打听,提及过去,时间</data>
