    <edge source="三月七" target="姬子">
      <data key="d7">20.0</data>
      <data key="d8">March 7th (三月七) and Himeko (姬子) are both members of the Astral Express, a faction of space travelers, and share a close, mentor-like relationship. Himeko often takes a guiding and supervisory role toward March 7th, greeting her, asking if she has caused trouble for others, and instructing her to follow directions or return to her room to prepare for missions and dreams. March 7th looks up to Himeko, wishing to learn skills like negotiation from her, and considers Himeko, alongside Mr. Yang, to be a patient, mature adult. The two are part of a core group along with the Trailblazer and Dan Heng, often working together on missions such as searching for information or for the character Gallagher. They share living quarters on the train, and Himeko welcomes March 7th back aboard, confirming the latter enjoys the Trailblazer lifestyle. Their relationship is defined by mutual respect and camaraderie within the context of their shared journey.&lt;SEP&gt;姬子决定与三月七组队行动，并建议开拓者与流萤组队。&lt;SEP&gt;姬子向三月七解释「钟表小子」和米沙的本质。&lt;SEP&gt;姬子推测可能需要亲手完成剧本，三月七据此建议开拓者检查人偶情绪。&lt;SEP&gt;三月七和姬子就场景变化和剧目内容进行了交流。&lt;SEP&gt;三月七states that Ji Zi is busy and suggests they find Dan Heng first.</data>
      <data key="d9">acquaintance,advice,appreciation,assignment,assumption,command,communication,companionship,cooperation,crew member,departure,dialogue,direction,explanation,instruction,interaction,mention,relationship,relationship advice,room location,searching,travel,understanding,welcome,列车成员关系,剧本互动,同伴关系,团队合作,建议与推理,引导,搭档,组队,解释</data>
