    <edge source="三月七" target="杨叔">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">三月七refers to the older male figure as "杨叔" (Uncle Yang). (Note: This relationship was already correctly extracted, but the entity杨叔needed a more precise definition in the entity list.)&lt;SEP&gt;三月七refers to瓦尔特as杨叔.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七uses the nickname "杨叔" to refer to瓦尔特.&lt;SEP&gt;March 7th affectionately calls Welt Yang "Uncle Yang" and expresses confidence that he will handle any problems.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七states that Uncle Yang is busy and they should find Dan Heng first.</data>
