      <data key="d8">The relationship between March 7th and Bronya is multifaceted, encompassing suspicion, concern, curiosity, and admiration. Initially, Bronya pursues March 7th with the intent to arrest her for alleged crimes, causing March 7th to notice Bronya and suggest she might be in trouble. March 7th observes that Bronya is good-looking but not arrogant, though she now seems preoccupied with something on her mind. March 7th also expresses concern for Bronya's safety, specifically as a Silvermane Guard officer operating in the dangerous underground. Conversely, Bronya is curious and puzzled by the "Open Sesame" password used by March 7th. March 7th notes Bronya's shared blonde hair genetic traits with Gepard, characterizing them humorously as a golden-haired beauty and a golden-haired handsome man. At one point, March 7th sees a residual image of Bronya, indicating she passed through the area. Despite earlier tensions, March 7th praises Bronya for being efficient and decisive, highlighting a dynamic that transitions from initial antagonism to recognition of her capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七expresses surprise and concern about Bronya's health condition for the upcoming speech.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七returned to Belobog and spoke to Bronya about her speech.&lt;SEP&gt;March 7th delivers a message from Bronya about the end of the lockdown.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七recalls布洛妮娅's statement about being willing to wait for七百years.</data>
      <data key="d9">#|praise,capture,concern,decisiveness,delivering a message,dialogue,health inquiry,identification,interaction,knowledge,location,observation,pursuit,questioning,return,skepticism,关注,印象,变化,观察</data>
