      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">March 7th and Serval Landau share a relationship characterized by collaboration, mutual aid, and a degree of familiarity. March 7th finds the mechanism's design similar to one at Serval's workshop, indicating she has visited Serval's space. March 7th asks Serval if she worries about her brother, Gepard, showing concern for family. Serval introduces March 7th as her assistant, highlighting their cooperative dynamic. March 7th acknowledges the difficulty of a plan to pass a blockade and asks Serval to use her wits; Serval agrees to lead the infiltration. March 7th also references Serval as "Gepard's sister" and questions her about their plan to bypass the blockade guarded by the Silvermane Guards. March 7th comments on a pattern of negotiations leading to fighting. Finally, March 7th promises Serval she will take a photo of the Stellaron as part of their joint mission.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七suggests visiting希露瓦at机械屋since they haven't seen her since returning.&lt;SEP&gt;希露瓦称赞三月七的摄影技术，并收到了三月七赠送的照片作为临别礼物。</data>
