    <edge source="三月七" target="停云">
      <data key="d7">12.0</data>
      <data key="d8">March 7th and Tingyun share a complex and multifaceted relationship characterized by both collaboration and tension. March 7th often expresses distrust, frustration, and worry towards Tingyun, particularly due to her confident demeanor and past actions that have led to misunderstandings. She actively seeks out Tingyun, a Foxian girl, and comments critically on her tendency to delegate tasks and her calm, unruffled attitude, even questioning why she shows no concern for the fate of the Xianzhou. Despite these moments of friction, their interactions also demonstrate a capacity for teamwork, as Tingyun once offered March 7th a strategy to bypass an obstacle. Additionally, Tingyun has taken the time to explain to March 7th the historical reasons for Yukong's vigilance and the background of the Sky-Faring Commission leader, highlighting a dynamic where Tingyun provides context to alleviate March 7th's concerns. Overall, their relationship oscillates between wariness and cooperative problem-solving, rooted in differing perspectives and past events.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七expresses concern for停云's safety and questions why she is not returning.&lt;SEP&gt;March 7th is reassured by Tingyun.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七is worried about the fate of the real停云.&lt;SEP&gt;三月七believes that停云is a refined beauty usually surrounded by jewelry, making the weapons found seem out of place.</data>
      <data key="d9">Inquiry,Searching,assumption,concern,distrust,doubt,explanation,frustration,guidance,impression,observation,order,reassurance,search,social interaction,strategy</data>
