    <edge source="丹恒" target="姬子">
      <data key="d7">11.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Dan Heng and Himeko share a relationship built on mutual respect, guidance, and concern within the Astral Express crew. Himeko frequently assigns tasks to Dan Heng as a key team member, including missions alongside the Trailblazer and March 7th, and expresses gratitude for his diligent work. She also shows personal care, often inquiring after his well-being, such as asking about his condition in messages and comforting him by advising him not to worry and to follow his own judgment. Dan Heng, in turn, keeps Himeko informed, seeking her guidance and planning to report his safety to her after returning to the train. The dynamic reflects a supportive and professional bond, where Himeko fosters teamwork and encourages the Trailblazer to build a good rapport with Dan Heng.&lt;SEP&gt;姬子向丹恒询问了他的个人经历。&lt;SEP&gt;姬子revealed the secret of the invitation to丹恒before the crew departed.</data>
