    <edge source="丹恒" target="瓦尔特">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">丹恒 and 瓦尔特 maintain a cooperative and analytical relationship aboard the Astral Express. Dan Heng notes that Walter is likely on his way, as alerted by the recording system. In turn, Walter explains Dan Heng’s past as a lonely child shaped by a long life of fleeing, a history the crew protects. Dan Heng acknowledges Walter’s hypothesis about the Stellaron causing changes as highly probable and suggests they discuss the Trailblazer’s mysterious power together for better understanding. Walter informs Dan Heng that the crew must decide on their next destination, and he also understands Dan Heng’s sadness regarding the Xianzhou, encouraging him to resolve the issue. The two plan to return to the Astral Express together ahead of the others. Additionally, Walter asks Dan Heng, who stays behind on the train, to verify the news of the Antimatter Legion’s loss of contact. Their interactions reflect mutual respect, shared decision-making, and a focus on protecting the crew and solving problems.</data>
      <data key="d9">agreement,awareness,care,communication,coordination,discussion,encouragement,hypothesis,next destination,planning,speculation,travel companion,understanding,verification</data>
