    <edge source="丹恒" target="丹枫">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">丹恒是丹枫的转世，但坚持自己是独立个体，不愿被视作丹枫的影子。&lt;SEP&gt;丹恒is the reincarnation of丹枫.&lt;SEP&gt;Dan Heng is the reincarnation of Dan Feng and is bound to the karma of his past life.&lt;SEP&gt;Dan Heng is linked to Dan Feng's past sins, which continue to affect his situation.</data>
