    <edge source="姬子" target="钟表匠">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The hidden message in the invitation speaks of finding the legacy of钟表匠, the Father of Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;Himeko talks about the Watchmaker as a famous tycoon of Penacony and expresses doubt about the invitation's connection to him.&lt;SEP&gt;姬子identifies the animated character钟表小子as corresponding to the real historical figure钟表匠.&lt;SEP&gt;姬子asserts trust in the Watchmaker's legacy for the future Nameless.&lt;SEP&gt;姬子leads the group in deciding to accept the Watchmaker's legacy and go to the end of the dream.</data>
