    <edge source="姬子" target="砂金">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Himeko and Sand Gold (Aventurine) share a relationship defined by mutual wariness and strategic interaction. Himeko describes Sand Gold as a cunning and flamboyant company envoy, a smooth-talking merchant with ulterior motives, and a natural gambler willing to stake everything for victory. She analyzes his goals, concluding he is a shrewd agent of the Interstellar Peace Corporation targeting the Family (the "家族"), and views him as an ill-intentioned guest that must be guarded against. Despite this, Himeko negotiates with him to use his status as a guarantor for the Trailblazer, and she acknowledges that his elaborate schemes require the participation of the Astral Express, noting that his arrangements would be wasted if the audience and actors were not present. Ultimately, Himeko agrees to meet Sand Gold as per his invitation and directly questions him about a murder case, indicating a tense yet cooperative engagement between the two.</data>
      <data key="d9">acknowledgment,analysis,caution,description,faction,negotiation,observation,opinion,partnership,speculation,strategy,suspicion,对峙,约定</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0a70a6406ad3789553b939ba9a7d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4006787ff76d5227d6ce51fce241de65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f273e249d48375fe4ce18df04b167906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ebbbf7bf5819ee830ffd02c3c6f9d34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24216adb3550f4039e3373041f9f3067</data>
