    <edge source="裂界" target="银鬃铁卫">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Silver Mane Guards (银鬃铁卫) are actively engaged in opposing the Fragmentum (裂界), which poses a constant threat through its expansion and the monsters it spawns. The Guards fight on the front lines, including the Iron Guard's Restricted Zone, to defend against this encroachment, often suffering casualties as soldiers lose their lives in battle. Despite their efforts, the Fragmentum's expansion does not slow. The Guards employ extreme measures in their defense and do not pursue enemies into the Fragmentum due to its dangerous nature, allowing others to escape. Additionally, the Fragmentum causes the bodies of dead Guards to linger and wander, further complicating the conflict.&lt;SEP&gt;银鬃铁卫在裂界前线拖住敌人，为开拓者争取时间。&lt;SEP&gt;银鬃铁卫负责通过军事攻势抑制裂界的扩张。</data>
      <data key="d9">blockade,combat,conflict,containment,defense,destruction,military opposition,mutation,tactical boundary,人员损失,威胁,对抗,战斗,防御</data>
