      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">希儿向开拓者解释裂界正在侵蚀地底，导致矿场废弃。&lt;SEP&gt;希儿计划独自前往裂界冒险并处理畸形怪物。&lt;SEP&gt;希儿is accustomed to entering the裂界alone, as she states she has done so many times.&lt;SEP&gt;希儿认为如果能对抗裂界，人们可能不需要抛弃家园。&lt;SEP&gt;Hil observes and reacts to the severe Fragnmium pollution at the location.&lt;SEP&gt;希儿concludes that Bronya and Cocolia went in a certain direction within the Fragmentum and decides to follow.</data>
