    <edge source="瓦尔特" target="停云">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Tingyun asks Welt to clarify why the Astral Express crew is on the locked-down Xianzhou.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特analyzes停云's behavior as self-interested and cautious, suggesting she wants to pass responsibility to higher authorities.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特suggests that停云is using the environment to hide her traces and recommends investigating further.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特agrees not to force停云into combat and asks her to continue guiding them.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特urges停云to return, citing the importance of human life.</data>
