    <edge source="瓦尔特" target="匹诺康尼">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Welt is part of the crew traveling to Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特arrived in匹诺康尼with the Star Rail crew.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特comments on黄泉's metaphor regarding匹诺康尼's dream, noting the dream's survival mechanism and later questioning the nature of freedom within the dream.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特is investigating the disappearance cases occurring in匹诺康尼.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特作为访客来到匹诺康尼，并计划与梦主会晤。&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特observes that a dissonant note for freedom is awakening in匹诺康尼.&lt;SEP&gt;Welt compares the dreamscape of Penacony to the "Agate World" to reason about visiting the latter.</data>
      <data key="d9">analysis,comparison,discussion,event location,insight,investigation location,location,observation,travel,访问</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-c55386d63b94eb9742f952f3f22848dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0a3dbfcfd8b95ff234089961fba702&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee77b88c86c938c0967cd2eb1ef92ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2f9568f3044cc0b8024fbb468793c90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d11ce896bd7f1b7e87c79e1a7cf7dabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5554caf63113cf1aae9ee5c4485624e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d235d876b6479c8e730e06da624342e</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1779101336</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="瓦尔特" target="不夜侯">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">瓦尔特记得在一个写着「不夜侯」的盒子里发现了一把植物种子。</data>
      <data key="d9">关联,提及</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-3a72aac5822e0c6707a88eed4d7298c5</data>
