    </edge>
    <edge source="瓦尔特" target="星期日">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">瓦尔特感谢星期日从中斡旋，并询问单独升级房型是否不妥。&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特和星期日就调查行动进行交涉，星期日对瓦尔特擅闯禁地表示不满，但仍接受其善意。&lt;SEP&gt;Welt representatives the Astral Express to ally with Sunday and Robin.&lt;SEP&gt;星期日与瓦尔特讨论谐乐大典及星核问题，并承诺梦主将参与磋商。&lt;SEP&gt;星期日囚禁瓦尔特，使用「调律」让其在内心世界沉思。&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特的consciousness was imprisoned by星期日using the "Tuning" ability.</data>
      <data key="d9">alliance,captivity,collaboration,conflict,confrontation,cooperation,imprisonment,交谈,接待,讨论,询问</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-20dddf19eb9d23402675b17b25d6b7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcc40b65a49e0c9b6e746474d3eeb7b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae9b4cc1fecad7f9f71968041c2edbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d11ce896bd7f1b7e87c79e1a7cf7dabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d81d7afd4e410e297a5351eee7eb9d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bef71ea9725559b5e05574558cbcec4</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1779100933</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="瓦尔特" target="家族">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">瓦尔特suspects that The Family is not the original sender of the invitation and is hiding information.&lt;SEP&gt;Welt talks about the Family's faith in Harmony and the scrutiny they face from other factions.&lt;SEP&gt;Welt will stay in reality to ensure safety and may need to negotiate or liaise with the Family.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特建议谨慎处理与家族的距离，并与公司合作以制衡家族。&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特评论家族维系大型美梦建筑的能力。&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特质疑家族的信仰，并指出其教导的神祇可能并非真正的希佩。</data>
      <data key="d9">analysis,faction,negotiation,potential interaction,secrecy,suspicion,制衡,合作,探寻真相,认知,评论,质疑</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-c1a1c7c7cdd2117231c2128f98f9f367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a07d8ef325346821827a8cabce8be9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c99e6308cd56f22b4ce44dda6f0ec62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18bb9d37a8fed7eab8d5cba8f123f61d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54eac7c3e839691c079d25a3b921a4d7</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1779069481</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
