      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">瓦尔特noticed a strange quality in知更鸟's voice before her performance.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特discusses with知更鸟whether external forces are influencing the family.</data>
      <data key="d9">conversation,investigation,observation,suspicion</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-c1a1c7c7cdd2117231c2128f98f9f367&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54</data>
