    <edge source="瓦尔特" target="黄泉">
      <data key="d7">13.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Welt and Acheron have a complex and evolving relationship characterized by cooperation, suspicion, and deep discussion. Initially, Welt proposes that they share their findings privately to avoid disturbing others, indicating a cautious approach. Acheron suggests that their upcoming conversation will be lengthy, implying a need for deep discourse. She also proposes cooperation with Welt to build trust and jointly seek evidence. However, there is tension as Welt confronts Acheron, demanding she reveal her identity and intentions, and he evaluates her as fitting the stereotype of a Galaxy Ranger. Despite these tensions, the two collaborate on an investigation at the Dawn Mansion, and later travel together, with Acheron noting the unusual lack of resistance they encounter. Their discussions delve into the nature of "Death" and the possibility of a traitor within the Family, highlighting their shared focus on uncovering deeper truths while navigating a relationship marked by mutual wariness and strategic partnership.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特和黄泉合作调查匹诺康尼案件。&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特and黄泉engage in a deep philosophical dialogue about the nature of dreams, human will, and the inevitable pursuit of the future, even when dreams offer escape.&lt;SEP&gt;Huang Quan acknowledges Walt's words and shares her own story, showing an effort to relieve his concerns.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特connects the bellhop's appearance to黄泉's action of severing the beautiful dream.&lt;SEP&gt;瓦尔特notes that黄泉's power is immense and could affect the dreamscape.</data>
      <data key="d9">collaboration,confrontation,conversation,dialogue,discussion,empathy,evaluation,event linkage,exchange,impression,information sharing,investigation,knowledge,long duration,observation,reference,teamwork,trust,合作,调查</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-d68ceba3f304fb715c34b69def89e801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37acbcddb2ef4b1470aa3a1b1cd86de2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89c9a7f59707875421c63842c0c2864&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c77346cce3c3448fb8ecdb4640cd7f32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6189fd71f5b5b0638759e8acd76bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0a3dbfcfd8b95ff234089961fba702&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcc40b65a49e0c9b6e746474d3eeb7b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56bf05d342e60a2ae1c0004ed755f892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee77b88c86c938c0967cd2eb1ef92ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0d9a1eb37814b69abf237639d5775c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54</data>
