    <edge source="公司" target="砂金">
      <data key="d7">17.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Interastral Peace Corporation (IPC), referred to as 公司, maintains a significant and multi-faceted relationship with the character 砂金, also known as Aventurine. 砂金 acts as an agent, representative, employee, and official envoy of the company, executing tasks assigned by the IPC. He is specifically a member of the company's Strategic Investment Department and primarily works on corporate business, such as recovering corporate assets in Penacony. This includes a specific mission to reclaim the planet as part of the IPC's interests. In this capacity, 砂金 works to leverage events, such as a murder case, to justify the company's direct intervention in Penacony's affairs, suggesting a strategic, business-oriented approach to his role. Furthermore, he has access to the company's extensive intelligence network and has hinted at the IPC's capability to investigate individuals, underscoring the power of the organization behind him. 

砂金 chose to work for the 公司 instead of accepting an invitation from the 酒馆 (Tavern). Despite his loyalty and service, 砂金's extreme risk-taking approach has led others to question his true allegiance to the company. His actions have also put him at risk of punishment from the 公司, particularly for destroying an artifact known as the "Cornerstone."&lt;SEP&gt;砂金is a member of the Interstellar Peace Corporation and acts in its interest, ensuring it is the ultimate winner in his schemes.</data>
      <data key="d9">accountability,affiliation,allegiance,benefit,choice,employment,intelligence,loyalty,representation,risk,suspicion,task,任务,使用,信息,所属,背景,计划</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-057807b41b216391fb3264dc438854b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b412da8b0cc0052c5e91a978c9d4f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b0a70a6406ad3789553b939ba9a7d8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee043452b079db75e92301d147036f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41a99864b87ae5c7c8eb089ea4a5b9d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d063d42a7d57ae6c56275f1aaaa1ec8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03be2219947057675dc5055c09116ccc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff5381ef14c0174d6621bf098b92d840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19fa917549ed487883ffc4d2270cc5d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcc40b65a49e0c9b6e746474d3eeb7b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98bd728493101041950cb3bbec840969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-415c7bdbfc0ac0348c2f17ccb1d95aa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d49da9008828c6200d6d99602c0309a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8453ce4da49768db75c2cf6376b2913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405</data>
