    <edge source="可可利亚" target="希露瓦">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between Cocolia and Serval is a complex and tragic one, marked by a deep, pre-existing friendship that was shattered by Cocolia's political actions and the hidden truths of Belobog. Serval and Cocolia were once close friends and colleagues, but everything changed after Cocolia assumed the role of Supreme Guardian. Cocolia subsequently expelled Serval from the Architects after Serval attempted to uncover the truth about the Stellaron and its threat to Belobog. This act of expulsion led Serval to develop a profound distrust of Cocolia, whom she now accuses of hiding the truth and covering up the danger. Serval, in direct opposition, calls Cocolia a mad guardian, and her opposition is so strong that she fears Cocolia might even harm Bronya. Despite this, Serval still holds a faint hope that once the Stellaron crisis is resolved, Cocolia can return to her former self. Cocolia, in turn, has declared Serval's research illegal and ordered her lab sealed, while a loose-lipped guard revealed to Serval that "Outsiders" had met with Cocolia, further fueling Serval's suspicions.&lt;SEP&gt;希露瓦了解可可利亚，认为她不是那种会突然转变心意的家伙，怀疑布洛妮娅有所隐瞒。</data>
      <data key="d9">accusation,belief,change,conflict,friendship,information source,knowledge,meeting,opposition,skepticism,suppression,trust,个人行为,同事关系,宿怨,担忧,提及,政治驱逐,驱逐</data>
