      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">桑博在贝洛伯格附近寻找古代遗物以谋取利益。&lt;SEP&gt;Sampo Koski is an associate from Belobog.&lt;SEP&gt;桑博曾在贝洛伯格帮助过开拓者。&lt;SEP&gt;Sambo reveals that his dream is set in Belobog, indicating the location is a construct of his mind.</data>
      <data key="d9">affiliation,crime,dream setting,memory,origin,past association,relic hunting</data>
