      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">银鬃铁卫是贝洛伯格的官方执法力量。&lt;SEP&gt;银鬃铁卫是贝洛伯格的城市防卫力量，负责维护城市安全。&lt;SEP&gt;The Silver Mane Guards serve as the military force protecting the city of Belobog.&lt;SEP&gt;The "银鬃铁卫" is the official law enforcement of Belobog but does not operate in the underground.&lt;SEP&gt;The银鬃铁卫protect贝洛伯格and its people.&lt;SEP&gt;银鬃铁卫fights to protect贝洛伯格from threats.</data>
