    <edge source="桑博" target="娜塔莎">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">桑博委托娜塔莎代为照料开拓者。&lt;SEP&gt;娜塔莎描述了她与桑博的初次相遇是一次精心设计的偶遇，并提及桑博行踪不定。&lt;SEP&gt;娜塔莎relies on桑博to procure medical supplies, and she exaggerated the Trailblazer's condition to make him owe her a favor, indicating a transactional relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;娜塔莎感谢桑博提供的情报，使团队能及时赶到。</data>
