    <edge source="桑博" target="地火">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">地火 (Wildfire) is an underground organization in Belobog, and 桑博 (Sampo) maintains a complex and multifaceted association with them. He is familiar with the group's operations and leadership, and has been known to assist them with various tasks, as confirmed by 娜塔莎 (Natasha). Consequently, 桑博 claims to have some influence through his connections to Wildfire. His role often involves acting as a liaison; he was responsible for introducing "outsiders" (the protagonists) to the underground and to Wildfire, and was assigned by 奥列格 (Oleg), a member of Wildfire, to serve as the group's guide. Despite this cooperative relationship, 桑博 is wary of being targeted by them, and acknowledges that his own actions risk attracting their unwanted attention.</data>
      <data key="d9">assignment,assistance,avoidance,collaboration,connection,guidance,introduction,membership,potential entanglement</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-99b307cf496fce182708882c7b313806&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a90b802948644335ecefb11f9f552b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576240ab20bd81b46c419628067e2caf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9be9e73fc5517e5bedc65669d89d77cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46382422446ab0cbb34790317e9aab79</data>
