      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="银鬃铁卫" target="杰帕德">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation "杰帕德, 银鬃铁卫" describes a hierarchical and military association between the individual Gepard and the faction known as the Silvermane Guards (银鬃铁卫). Gepard serves as a high-ranking officer and specifically holds the title of "戍卫官" (Guardian Officer or Captain of the Guard) within the Silvermane Guards. He is a prominent member from the Landau family and is respected by the citizens of Belobog. In this capacity, he commands the Guards in the restricted zone (禁区), leading them in formation and battle to defend against enemies. Initially, he was loyal to the orders of Cocolia, but he later demonstrated his independent judgment by ordering the Guards to open the gates to support the Trailblazer's actions.</data>
      <data key="d9">command,high status,leadership,membership,military service,rank,service,指挥,指挥关系,职责,隶属,领导</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-5ccd5b35cd1293bdaf94fdad4255f9a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44ecf03d0149dc26b66d743b79debb39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa1dd4d736f14bea85815b72b0449b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da4724fc5e3317bb631f842e18bf511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1cedbf6b0cc229e63cd33aa3825db5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a472ad06854cfbea32b100ad930934ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62781f29bdc9b0fad8b67a1741741b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f0fb910ea43e4acb7d09e5d8281a94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f2ef2960da6e6a6c3a214f45255a64</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1778808709</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
