    <edge source="银鬃铁卫" target="布洛妮娅·兰德">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Silvermane Guards are subordinate to布洛妮娅·兰德and deliver her message.&lt;SEP&gt;Bronya Rand acts as the acting commander of the Silver Mane Guards, leading the pursuit of the infiltrators.&lt;SEP&gt;布洛妮娅作为银鬃铁卫，认为自己有责任当面谏言。</data>
