    <edge source="银鬃铁卫" target="地火">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">娜塔莎用银鬃铁卫来类比描述地火的性质。&lt;SEP&gt;娜塔莎将地火比作银鬃铁卫，指出地火在下层区履行银鬃铁卫曾经的职责。&lt;SEP&gt;After the银鬃铁卫withdrew, the地火organization was formed by the underground residents to take over the duties of maintaining order.&lt;SEP&gt;The地火organization replaced the银鬃铁卫in maintaining order in the underground.</data>
