    <edge source="大守护者" target="布洛妮娅">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">布洛妮娅initially obeys the大守护者but later questions her motives.&lt;SEP&gt;Bronya defends the Guardian's decisions regarding the sealing of the Underworld.&lt;SEP&gt;布洛妮娅忠于守护者，不容他人在自己面前侮辱守护者。&lt;SEP&gt;布洛妮娅被建议担任大守护者，但她认为这个念头可怕并拒绝。&lt;SEP&gt;布洛妮娅被指定为下一任大守护者，感到无法胜任。&lt;SEP&gt;Bronya is expected to take over the position of Guardian after Cocolia's sacrifice.</data>
