    <edge source="下层区" target="上层区">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">上层区和下层区通过输运管线进行物资交换，上层区送去支援物资，下层区送來能源。&lt;SEP&gt;The connection between the Underworld and the surface is now almost completely severed, except for Geomarrow transport lines.&lt;SEP&gt;丹恒提到下层区原本与上层区往来频繁，但如今完全封锁。&lt;SEP&gt;The lower and upper districts of Belobog were separated by the Stellaron crisis but are being reconnected by Supreme Guardian Broya Rand.</data>
