    <edge source="娜塔莎" target="地火">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Natasha is a key member and the leader of the "地火" (Wildfire) organization. She is both the founder and the current head of the group, which is dedicated to protecting the citizens of the Underworld. Natasha recommends that the Trailblazer seek help from the "地火" organization if they encounter difficulties, indicating a collaborative relationship between them. She also states that remaining notifications will be handled by the "地火," highlighting her authority and the organization's operational role.&lt;SEP&gt;娜塔莎is a member of the Wildfire organization in Belobog's Underworld.&lt;SEP&gt;娜塔莎是地火组织的领导者。</data>
