    <edge source="地火" target="史瓦罗">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Wildfire is engaged in an ongoing conflict with Svarog and his robot underlings.&lt;SEP&gt;Svarog's forces and Wildfire are in a state of conflict. Svarog has concluded that forcing Wildfire to comply is the most efficient plan.&lt;SEP&gt;Svarro distrusts Wildfire and opposes their goal of bringing people to the surface, as he believes the surface is unsafe.&lt;SEP&gt;史瓦罗评估地火武装成员为高危个体，并启动剿灭协议要求剿灭他们。&lt;SEP&gt;地火知道史瓦罗的根据地在何处，但从未成功进入过。&lt;SEP&gt;地火遇到了由史瓦罗带来的麻烦。</data>
      <data key="d9">conflict,distrust,knowledge,location,opposition,trouble,冲突,敌对</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-d8e1dc6f9e5af6812e9d18dc7b0b4ae8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a0e40e757b3f57f8f40aff9acd3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c33c1e9e634113885abc239bd6e869e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8aea3ce7e067d8f4062dc3a1d66bc67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9be9e73fc5517e5bedc65669d89d77cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f76d31020f2b23cdf05dbb6c335fe625</data>
