    <edge source="地火" target="希儿">
      <data key="d7">12.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation between 地火 (Wildfire) and 希儿 (Seele) is that of affiliation and membership. 希儿 is a member of the 地火 organization, which operates in the underworld. She is recognized by miners for her skills and is often seen patrolling the area and dealing with troublemakers. In addition to being a regular member, 希儿 also holds a leadership role within the organization. She operates under the leadership of 奥列格 (Oleg). Her affiliation with 地火 is evident in her confrontations with 史瓦罗 (Svarog), as she is aware of the organization's knowledge of Svarog's lair. 希儿 is particularly skilled in reconnaissance and action, making her a valuable asset to 地火.&lt;SEP&gt;希儿is a member of the organization "地火".&lt;SEP&gt;希儿是地火组织的成员。&lt;SEP&gt;希儿是地火组织的成员，为自由抗争。&lt;SEP&gt;希儿is a member of the地火organization, which supports布洛妮娅.</data>
      <data key="d9">affiliation,alliance,capability,influence,knowledge,leadership,membership,patrol,representation,成员关系,所属,抗争</data>
