    <edge source="史瓦罗" target="希儿">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">希儿suspects that史瓦罗's minions damaged the mining cart.&lt;SEP&gt;希儿identifies Svarog's robots as the core problem and explains Svarog's influence over the underground.&lt;SEP&gt;希儿suspects that the mastermind behind the robots is '史瓦罗大佬'.&lt;SEP&gt;希儿has a previous unresolved conflict with Svarog and confronts him.&lt;SEP&gt;希儿warns that史瓦罗is not a normal robot and is special.&lt;SEP&gt;希儿expresses a desire to physically attack and destroy史瓦罗.&lt;SEP&gt;希儿recalls the group's victory over史瓦罗to encourage them to face the current enemy.</data>
