    <edge source="希儿" target="奥列格">
      <data key="d7">11.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between Oleg and Seele is a complex one, blending a past of rescue and care with a present of trusted collaboration. Before the events of the main story, Oleg found a young Seele and subsequently sent her to an orphanage. Later on, Seele became a trusted core member working for Oleg, who is the chief of the underground organization, Wildfire (Groundfire). Oleg, a veteran, has stated that he would not threaten Seele and has noted that she has received training. Seele has also mentioned that Oleg is waiting for them to discuss matters concerning the robot Svarog, indicating she acts as a key liaison for him. Furthermore, Seele has relayed that Oleg wants to meet and question Bronya. When the situation is serious, Seele plans to join Oleg as reinforcement, and she once took the protagonists to meet him because they had a request. On another occasion, Hime infers that Oleg is ahead in a conflict zone, showing Seele's awareness of his movements.&lt;SEP&gt;奥列格agrees with希儿's view on being prepared to use force if necessary.&lt;SEP&gt;希儿接受奥列格的指令，继续带领开拓者等人前进。&lt;SEP&gt;奥列格将希儿从街头救出并送入孤儿院，后带领她巡查矿区。</data>
      <data key="d9">affiliation,backup plan,leadership,location,meeting,mentorship,military readiness,reporting,rescue,subordination,support,trust,商议事务,执行,收养关系,退伍老兵与铁卫丫头,领导</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-7e6c641bf64196f3c447229ccda14715&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-404cf71a3e6219ba8a0e5449b0ac3648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14ff2981a079af20ab48290ab8fef705&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd6c2f54014a4719c504a96be8e20cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d50dd0c4a864aad264fdad2c99753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e28fada03ee0258d0ac9090608ef7ef0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8010590ea9229f0d14cbda63a8ffc533&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c8165dc1c4464351a5fdc5fe0b4bff2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e377a0f376efa576e9326882d3e9d187&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d074295b463d948dc288523dc7361759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16db8c2d24c790ba6ab06adc96caa029</data>
