    <edge source="停云" target="驭空">
      <data key="d7">11.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Tingyun (停云) is a subordinate of Yukong (驭空), the leader of the Tianshi Caucus (天舶司). In this hierarchical relationship, Tingyun reports on situations, such as the activities of the Astral Express crew, to Yukong, and acknowledges that only Yukong possesses the authority to authorize specific missions. Tingyun often defends Yukong’s cautious reputation and humorously complains about her workload, even joking that the crew could put in a good word for her. Tingyun’s subordination is further confirmed by her being ordered by Yukong to carry out tasks, and she mentions that her behavior could be reported to Yukong. On a personal and emotional note, Yukong grieves the loss of Tingyun, her long-time colleague, indicating a significant and somber turn in their relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;驭空vows to remember停云and avenge them if they have perished.&lt;SEP&gt;驭空deeply trusted停云as a subordinate and friend, and grieves her death.&lt;SEP&gt;驭空计划沿着停云进入仙舟前的航路追溯她遭遇的细节。</data>
      <data key="d9">authority,camaraderie,colleagueship,defense,deference,grief,information relay,loss,memory,recommendation,reporting,serving,subordinate,subordination,trust,vengeance,work request,调查,追溯</data>
