    <edge source="停云" target="天舶司">
      <data key="d7">12.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation describes the involvement of Tingyun (停云) with the Sky-Faring Commission (天舶司). Tingyun is a member of the Sky-Faring Commission, specifically serving as a reception envoy (接渡使). In this role, she is tasked by her superior, Yukong, with handling guest reception and greeting visitors. Additionally, the Sky-Faring Commission dispatched Tingyun on a mission that involved the Trailblazer and the capture of Kafka, and the Commission may have investigated her whereabouts following this assignment.&lt;SEP&gt;The original停云was a member of the天舶司.&lt;SEP&gt;停云可能是天舶司的成员，她的发言中提到了给天舶司留点颜面。&lt;SEP&gt;停云worked under驭空in the Sky-Faring Commission as a merchant and advisor.&lt;SEP&gt;停云领了天舶司的使命，要出使其他世界。</data>
