      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">General Jing Yuan reveals that the Xianzhou has captured Blade, a Stellaron Hunter, and is interrogating him.&lt;SEP&gt;景元可能为了隐瞒刃逃脱的事实，而采取迂回策略请瓦尔特等人帮忙。&lt;SEP&gt;景元states that Blade is a wanted criminal by both the IPC and the Xianzhou Alliance, and refuses to share further information.&lt;SEP&gt;景元表示刃是仙舟要犯，必须由仙舟处置。&lt;SEP&gt;景元与刃是故人，但刃对景元表现出冷淡态度，声称完成的事无关。</data>
