    <edge source="景元" target="符玄">
      <data key="d7">19.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Jing Yuan and Fu Xuan share a complex hierarchical and collaborative relationship within the Xianzhou Luofu. As the Divine Foresight (神策将军), Jing Yuan is Fu Xuan's superior, and she serves under his command, regularly reporting to him. Despite this official chain of command, Fu Xuan openly critiques Jing Yuan's reluctance to relinquish power and actively offers her own strategic proposals. Jing Yuan relies heavily on Fu Xuan's intelligence and divination skills, frequently coordinating with her and delegating critical tasks—such as operating the 穷观阵 (Qionguan Array) and assessing their proximity to the 丹鼎司 (Alchemy Commission) to efficiently task the Nameless with investigations.

In a significant display of confidence during the crisis of the 建木's resurgence, Jing Yuan formally delegated full military authority over the 云骑军 (Cloud Knights) to Fu Xuan by giving her the military command tally (兵符). Both agreed to seek outside help, and Jing Yuan trusted Fu Xuan to act based on her divination results. She then implemented his plan, using the main Cloud Knight forces to attract enemy attention while deploying the group as surprise forces. At one point, after communicating via the 穷观阵, Jing Yuan lost contact, leaving Fu Xuan to manage the situation. The pair were also mutually aware of the hiding place of the Yaoqing Medicine Sect's remnants.&lt;SEP&gt;景元orders符玄to stay and guard the passage, and to report to other Xianzhou if he fails to return.&lt;SEP&gt;景元thanks符玄for her support.&lt;SEP&gt;符玄代景元处理其在事件中的违规之举，并向联盟提交报告。&lt;SEP&gt;景元无法视事后，符玄暂代将军一职，处理战后事务。</data>
      <data key="d9">&gt;gratitude,advice,alliance,assignment of duty,collaboration,command,cooperation,coordination,critique,delegation,guidance,instruction,leadership,motion,mutual reliance,strategy,subordination,trust,上下级,合作,处理,奇兵策略,权力代管,汇报,禀报,策略,职务交接,违规,通讯</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-a8dd3179cc07be6652a8a064b6cefde1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80deed5fb02763ec38f8b148679259b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b761f7975a148b7f60b9118ff40d2789&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5341e4ccc7283969ac76c86061d28586&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df8b5bd13b0c402afd43298bddf26cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89401ac7b3d1c2b401bcf8e7944f69bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d71f2f56e13337663cff785e79fbb43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2db1a6716eb95924fce53acec168f822&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1f262b5a3808ba99b93f0ef466c358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1172e16aec5fcaed74cebbab925fca42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42cb7b6c602a4d11cb2e76505dd012c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fc6126d0155a7c411f4068a66d7ddca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2101b673e76c054dc78ff26e503442a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44856396e630f7b48e968e5becd820f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c96d885f6a65cadc94f79df95313f0ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95189fee74f326831efd9da16d00b815&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7518279c2f3fe4c184db489acb2bf761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-329c1b97983307d60a3541156156882f</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
