      <data key="d8">Jing Yuan is Yanqing's mentor and general. He advises Yanqing to be patient and tempers his eagerness for battle. Yanqing loyally seeks to serve Jing Yu.&lt;SEP&gt;彦卿是景元的部下，称呼其为将军，并对其决定表示质疑。&lt;SEP&gt;Yanqing is a loyal lieutenant under General Jing Yuan of the Xianzhou Luofu.&lt;SEP&gt;彦卿建议景元在奠仪后休息，但景元坚持先与列车团交谈。</data>
