    <edge source="太卜司" target="青雀">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The entity relation "太卜司, 青雀" describes the connection between the character Qingque and the Divination Commission (太卜司). Qingque is a member and staff member of the Divination Commission, also referred to as the Taibu Department or the headquarters for divination in the Xianzhou Luofu. She is a disciple (门人) of this organization and works there, demonstrating familiarity with its shortcuts. In one instance, she humorously transfers the title of "逍遥门掌门" (Master of the Carefree Sect) of the Divination Commission to a person named Mr. Yang. Qingque expresses fear of being expelled from the Divination Commission if she fails a given task, indicating that her position is contingent on performance. She is also noted for guiding a group to the Divination Commission as their destination.</data>
