    <edge source="匹诺康尼" target="谐乐大典">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation between Penacony (匹诺康尼) and the Charmony Festival (谐乐大典) is that Penacony, known as the "Festival Star" or "盛会之星", serves as the host location for this grand celebration. The Charmony Festival is a significant and important event that takes place in Penacony, including within its dreamscape, attracting guests from across the universe. It is described as the Harmony Grand Ceremony, which brings blessings of everlasting peace to Penacony, and is also referred to as the Harmonic Grand Ceremony or Harmony Grand Festival. The event is portrayed as both an ongoing occurrence and an upcoming gathering, emphasizing its role as a major festive occasion in Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;谐乐大典将在匹诺康尼大剧院举办，事关匹诺康尼的未来。</data>
      <data key="d9">event,event location,hosting,location,occasion,举办地点,事件、地点,传统盛典</data>
