    <edge source="匹诺康尼" target="砂金">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between Penacony and Aventurine (砂金) is defined by a strategic and high-stakes corporate mission. Aventurine is tasked by the Interastral Peace Corporation (IPC) with reclaiming Penacony, which serves as the primary target location for his operation. To accomplish this, he has formulated a plan that involves orchestrating events and ultimately sacrificing himself to help the Company gain entry into Penacony. While Topaz awaits the results of this mission, Aventurine has noted that his time in Penacony was not entirely negative. However, during his stay, he has felt isolated and has been actively scheming against the Family, intending to have the Company surround Penacony upon completing his assignment.&lt;SEP&gt;砂金在匹诺康尼布局，试图揭开其秘密。&lt;SEP&gt;砂金的计划围绕匹诺康尼梦境展开。</data>
      <data key="d9">experience,investigation,involvement,isolation,location,memory,mission,objective,operation,planning,reclamation,recovery,sacrifice,target,任务地点,关联,地点,计划</data>
