    <edge source="匹诺康尼" target="米沙">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">米沙祝愿开拓者在匹诺康尼享受一段难忘的美梦。&lt;SEP&gt;米沙is considered the most knowledgeable person about Penacony among the Astral Express's friends.&lt;SEP&gt;米沙's memories and stories are related to the animation of匹诺康尼, where Clockie and friends live in Dream Town.&lt;SEP&gt;米沙embarked on a great adventure in匹诺康尼.</data>
