    <edge source="匹诺康尼" target="钟表匠">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">钟表匠是匹诺康尼的传奇大亨和梦境世界的奠基人。&lt;SEP&gt;The钟表匠extended an olive branch to the Family, helping to turn the prison into匹诺康尼, earning him the title "Father of Penacony."&lt;SEP&gt;钟表匠led the construction of匹诺康尼after liberation.&lt;SEP&gt;The钟表匠was the first and last Nameless of匹诺康尼.&lt;SEP&gt;The Watchmaker and his friends built the original Penacony and fought for its future.&lt;SEP&gt;The Watchmaker hopes that someone will help Penacony return to the right track.</data>
