    <edge source="匹诺康尼" target="美梦">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">匹诺康尼is a dreamscape defined by the "美梦" (sweet dreams) it provides.&lt;SEP&gt;The美梦is a central feature of匹诺康尼, which黄泉claims is collapsing due to human nature-people indulging in easy, painless dreams become closer to "necrosis."&lt;SEP&gt;美梦是匹诺康尼构筑的富丽堂皇的梦境。</data>
