    <edge source="匹诺康尼" target="黄泉">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">黄泉拜访匹诺康尼以寻求钟表匠的遗产。&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉traverses both the reality and dream of匹诺康尼, observing the stagnation of time and spiritual wealth. She asserts that the collapse of the美梦is inevitable.&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉is in Penacony but is told she does not belong and must leave, as she sees its future as Nihility.&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉is connected to events in匹诺康尼.&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉遭到匹诺康尼的放逐。&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉intends to awaken匹诺康尼from its dream state.</data>
