      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">丹鼎司is located close to the sealed location of建木.&lt;SEP&gt;丹鼎司从「建木」中研究出将仙舟人转变为长生种和其他不可思议的技术。&lt;SEP&gt;The丹鼎司is located next to the Ambrosial Arbor, making it a hazardous area.</data>
