    <edge source="钟表小子" target="美梦小镇">
      <data key="d7">12.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The entity "美梦小镇" (Dreamtown) and the entity "钟表小子" (Pocketwatch) have a defined relationship:钟表小子 is the central character and guardian of the fictional world of美梦小镇.钟表小子, also known as Pocketwatch, is portrayed as a big star and the protector of Dreamtown in the Penacony region. He describes himself as the town's guardian, responsible for maintaining its peace. He is claimed to be omnipresent and omnipotent within美梦小镇, engaging in adventures with the protagonist. The character is part of an animation series where the stories unfold in美梦小镇, and he is depicted as emotionally responsive, such as crying in reaction to a帮派老大's (gang leader's) sadness.&lt;SEP&gt;钟表小子在美梦小镇无处不在、无所不能。&lt;SEP&gt;钟表小子identifies itself as the guardian of美梦小镇.&lt;SEP&gt;钟表小子guards Dream Town and is part of the animation's setting in Penacony.</data>
      <data key="d9">affiliation,capability,expression,guardianship,location,omnipresence,presence,protection,story,创作设定,守护,守护者,居民关系,拯救,故事地点,故事背景,背景,角色</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-825953bbddc81f456bf53ec3b5e18e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fa14e2cd405ae0ca7c60547e2d8750c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-984f2b2c81711f4d1b45fc906d20a6b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfa9fb5844d8ca25fdcdcdb908866300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce6adaabd8f6d85314cbea559ce01a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14ef88ed231842823bf1bb0651d40e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1e9cf811c7d40de98dc1e000a4c7c90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05884a17d8c8c5a8133a0c2b263b2ba7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b45e0901f34f95111a2f25c844d60f7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2698cb34da87c071df26173119364599&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edd454eefe538364064b11caeeed6aad</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1779069720</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="钟表小子" target="钟表匠">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">钟表小子的原型是匹诺康尼的传奇人物钟表匠。&lt;SEP&gt;钟表小子的原型是钟表匠。&lt;SEP&gt;「钟表小子」被认为是「钟表匠」的化身或另一身份。&lt;SEP&gt;The giant钟表小子is implied to be a creation or symbol of the "Clockmaker".&lt;SEP&gt;钟表匠conceived the prototype of钟表小子in his childhood, after dreaming of broken clocks growing limbs.</data>
      <data key="d9">association,creation,creator,inspiration,原型关系,名号继承,身份关联</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-825953bbddc81f456bf53ec3b5e18e71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21d69e5d473598eccb1e77a81726c583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2eae7f1df6bd3eadca41c1db5167225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b926f3dee50d8c90e7dd10c60b966773</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1779016918</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
