    <edge source="钟表小子" target="米沙">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">米沙和钟表小子之间的关系被描述为亲密的伙伴和共同成长的同伴，他们都生活在梦境世界中。钟表小子曾声称米沙遇到危险，并寻求外界帮助，同时也向米沙告别。米沙将钟表小子视为自己的好伙伴，两人曾一起在壁炉旁坐着，显示出过去的深厚友情。根据回忆，米沙和钟表小子首次相遇是在米哈伊尔的书房，他们曾一起追随火车的汽笛声，并共同长大。米沙还将钟表小子与“指南针”船员联系在一起，视其为朋友。</data>
      <data key="d9">acquaintance,companionship,danger,farewell,friendship,gratitude,shared memory,story,伙伴,保护关系,同行</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-2fa14e2cd405ae0ca7c60547e2d8750c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-984f2b2c81711f4d1b45fc906d20a6b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1e23bfd4bf1c77fb266c1fdef2619ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2f9568f3044cc0b8024fbb468793c90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fade5ce5717b1083491143af20df52aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3b2df6c7c464d907afd4da6f5f01960&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffa19e6c8f41788df56ba4b3dcb02a41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edd454eefe538364064b11caeeed6aad</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1779069714</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="钟表小子" target="哈努兄弟">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">哈努兄弟(Brother Hanu) is one of Pocketwatch's friends who helps protect Dreamtown Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;钟表小子asks哈努兄弟where he is going.&lt;SEP&gt;钟表小子acts as the translator for哈努兄弟, interpreting their snorts as spoken words about battle and strategy.</data>
      <data key="d9">alliance,destination,friendship,narration,question,translation</data>
