    <edge source="家族" target="知更鸟">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between 知更鸟 (Robin) and 家族 (The Family) is complex and multifaceted. Robin is a singer explicitly connected to the Family, and she once sang hymns for the Aeon of Harmony in the Family's name. Her brother Sunday is also a member, further cementing her ties to the organization. However, this relationship is marked by conflict and tragedy. Robin was murdered within the Family’s dreamscape, and it is claimed that the Family would attempt to cover up her death to protect their interests, having previously concealed the existence of "Death." This suggests the Family was willing to suppress the truth. Robin eventually discovered that the Family was hiding a conspiracy, which prompted her to investigate. This investigation led her to uncover an ideological change within the Family, ultimately causing her to break away from them.&lt;SEP&gt;Robin was brought up by the Family as an orphan.&lt;SEP&gt;知更鸟是家族成员，但被家族和星期日隐瞒真相。</data>
      <data key="d9">affiliation,association,conflict,control,cover-up,death,event location,investigation,membership,opposition,origin,possible membership,名义代表,庆典仪式,成员,死亡</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-0d200c73d981b852fa64a6901ad64129&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d7a59509484cbe6f53205988ca34274&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff5381ef14c0174d6621bf098b92d840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f273e249d48375fe4ce18df04b167906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c77346cce3c3448fb8ecdb4640cd7f32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-745ef3f5cddfa7a86e439825e5de4a96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae9b4cc1fecad7f9f71968041c2edbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d81d7afd4e410e297a5351eee7eb9d8</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1779069501</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="家族" target="星期日">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">星期日是匹诺康尼家族（The Family in Penacony）的重要话事人之一，也是该组织的正式成员。他经常代表家族发声，并宣称拥有家族的权威，在处理案件时代表家族行事。星期日利用自己作为家族成员的认知来指认加拉赫，并曾计划自内向外肃清家族中的邪恶。此外，他还声称家族的渗透计划以他本人为目标，这表明他在组织中具有关键地位。在与真理医生的交涉中，星期日代表家族提供星核研究知识。&lt;SEP&gt;星期日属于家族，但利用家族名义囚禁他人，违背家族承诺。&lt;SEP&gt;The Family previously led by Sunday has now labeled him and other Order remnants as enemies.</data>
      <data key="d9">affiliation,aid=Relation|affiliation,authority,conflict,disavowal,interrogation,knowledge,membership,representation,内部肃清,成员,成员关系,成员身份,指控</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-20dddf19eb9d23402675b17b25d6b7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e2f5d140594a40dea9db0736e490217&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282520995832324abf63454ecad3f3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aea80432a137f815124bb7fadd3b0383&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-009c79711483e2ca1c076c720ae3e662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcc40b65a49e0c9b6e746474d3eeb7b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f1e25533bb02e085267257087f8cfab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d81d7afd4e410e297a5351eee7eb9d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bef71ea9725559b5e05574558cbcec4</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1779100921</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="家族" target="砂金">
      <data key="d7">19.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between the Family (家族) and Aventurine (砂金) in Penacony is characterized by active opposition, strategic conflict, and mutual suspicion. Aventurine views the Family as a primary obstacle and is on a mission to target them, aiming to overthrow their influence by creating a significant breach in their defenses for the Corporation to act. He claims to have already outmaneuvered the Family to secure the protagonist's room and suspects internal problems within the Family, later specifically accusing them of harboring evil and dereliction of duty. He negotiates with the Family through Sunday for the return of his confiscated items and analyzes that their only weakness appears to be "death," which he seeks to exploit.

Aventurine suspects that the Family hides information about death in the dream and believes there is a traitor within their ranks, linking the Robin murder case to internal Family issues. He prepares to intervene and leverage this, using the opportunity to deploy "Cornerstones" as bait. His entire plan is designed to deceive the Family through multiple cornerstones and deception as a strategy, accepting that it will require paying a price. He is also looking for partners to investigate matters unfavorable to the Family and ultimately plans to perform a "grand unveiling" that will cause their downfall in Penacony.&lt;SEP&gt;??? suggests砂金could have used members of the家族as disposable assets.&lt;SEP&gt;砂金considers that to the Family, the life of an envoy is expensive, meaning his death or sacrifice would be costly for them.&lt;SEP&gt;砂金计划在家族做出反应前行动，制造混乱。</data>
      <data key="d9">accusation,analysis,collaboration,confiscation,conflict,deception,downfall,faction,hostility,hostlie,investigation,manipulation,negotiation,opposition,plan,potential,strategy,suspicion,target,value,介入,叛徒,对抗,怀疑,指控,计划</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-057807b41b216391fb3264dc438854b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38b44970aed0e94097fc3f8033b5e3eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee043452b079db75e92301d147036f9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4006787ff76d5227d6ce51fce241de65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03be2219947057675dc5055c09116ccc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff5381ef14c0174d6621bf098b92d840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9de4b10f842bc7af36c30316a0a72a84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aea80432a137f815124bb7fadd3b0383&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aef888c83a56efa55bc6bdac956ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d4f76837602b150702d42db6ea60525&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19fa917549ed487883ffc4d2270cc5d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2d249f7bcbd0b19ddb847f1301c1021&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98bd728493101041950cb3bbec840969&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d49da9008828c6200d6d99602c0309a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8453ce4da49768db75c2cf6376b2913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fc27eb1f7547ffdcf4c47fa1e6ca44c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24216adb3550f4039e3373041f9f3067</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1779015281</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="家族" target="同谐">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">同谐is the power or path that the家族uses to manage the dreamscape.&lt;SEP&gt;The Family's rule and their guarantee of safety in the dreamscape are backed by the protection of the Path of Harmony.&lt;SEP&gt;The家族's power in匹诺康尼is derived from the path of同谐.&lt;SEP&gt;家族围绕「同谐」命途建立，并以此维系美梦世界。&lt;SEP&gt;The Family is aligned with the Harmony, but黄泉asserts they have deviated from its true path.&lt;SEP&gt;家族信仰「同谐」命途，但黄泉认为其信仰中混入了杂质，可能被无主命途的残党利用。</data>
