    <edge source="家族" target="黄泉">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">黄泉怀疑匹诺康尼一切悲剧的源头潜伏在家族中。&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉将家族比作一尊活着的神像。&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉describes the家族as a perfect building like a living god statue, where members are puzzle pieces serving a central core. She critiques the家族for refusing to acknowledge the collapse of the dream, which unwittingly accelerates it.&lt;SEP&gt;Yomi provides commentary on the societal structures and labor within the dreamscape governed by the Family.&lt;SEP&gt;家族is not expected to open the door for Huangquan due to her path.&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉perceives the Family as having deviated from the Harmony and is in opposition to their authority.&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉摆脱了家族的控制。</data>
