    <edge source="加拉赫" target="钟表匠">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The entity 加拉赫 is connected to the 钟表匠 (the Watchmaker) as a subordinate and agent. 加拉赫 has stated that he is a "child" of the Watchmaker, rather than a companion, and has served as the Watchmaker's deputy. He is responsible for managing the Watchmaker's legacy and carrying out his will. 加拉赫 acted as an agent for the Watchmaker, sending out invitations in the Watchmaker's name to attract factions to uncover the truth, and he also brought people to meet the Watchmaker, fulfilling a promise to his old friend. Additionally, 星期日 identified the Watchmaker as 加拉赫's true master. 加拉赫 has provided information about the Watchmaker and shared stories about his past.</data>
      <data key="d9">affiliation,association,deputy,information,mystery,old friends,promise,relationship,以…名义,归属,真正主人,邀请函</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-981eb877163a6b386e5d40eb1f7edddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7b13f1d619b99829ec04b15c537d259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53c7f48036990ccca5a5b48e0fe82a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ba3b6dae092d55950f9ddb961ea479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a53c00b399a52fdff3f15122ca9284aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c72500fd19b3d31361401b01307328e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76f30cea7751c5e1cdb8b78f14fea91</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d12">1779016644</data>
      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="加拉赫" target="米哈伊尔">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">加拉赫considers it his greatest betrayal to have done nothing when米哈伊尔was old and could no longer protect his children.&lt;SEP&gt;加拉赫considers himself a traitor to米哈伊尔(the original Clockmaker) for his inaction.&lt;SEP&gt;加拉赫曾与米哈伊尔在梦境荒野中同行，并在米哈伊尔临别时送他离开。&lt;SEP&gt;加拉赫提到米哈伊尔犯过的错误，并决心不再重蹈覆辙。&lt;SEP&gt;加拉赫has completed his final task, which was to convey米哈伊尔's will to the星穹列车.&lt;SEP&gt;加拉赫怀念已故的米哈伊尔，称其计划成功，并准备下地狱与其共进晚餐。</data>
      <data key="d9">betrayal,inaction,legacy,mission,personal history,人物关系,同伴,学习,往事与回忆,怀念,避免错误</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-981eb877163a6b386e5d40eb1f7edddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3428cb608b39b27cf65390b499a0173e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d404ca122e5e26803146d6835398291&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b893a9163e9decf898e6a47789d69c6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a52baa9f6e0386aac3ddefb6f99df9</data>
