      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="知更鸟" target="星期日">
      <data key="d7">37.0</data>
      <data key="d8">星期日 (Sunday) and 知更鸟 (Robin) are siblings, with Sunday being the older brother and Robin the younger sister. Both are key figures of the Family in Penacony, having been adopted by Gopher Wood after surviving the Stellaron disaster. Their relationship is deeply personal and collaborative, encompassing shared history such as performing home concerts in their youth. Sunday entrusts Robin with assisting the Trailblazer in adapting to the dreamscape and shows immediate concern for her safety; he expressly asks to see her as proof of trust. The tragedy of Robin’s silencing is a core factual basis for Aventurine’s plan, and due to his high station, Sunday cannot personally avenge her. They share the common goal of exposing a traitor in the Family, whom Sunday suspects is Robin’s murderer. Despite their mutual vision for a paradise in Penacony and a shared wish for universal happiness, profound ideological differences emerge in discussions about life, happiness, dreams, and human nature. Sunday argues that human weakness and natural selection prevent the weak from achieving equality, whereas Robin insists the weak deserve care and opportunity. These differing perspectives on humanity, survival, hope, and equality form a central ideological conflict in their otherwise loving bond. Additionally, Sunday has hidden truths that lead to Robin being unable to sing, and he expresses concern and anger when she ventures into warzones. The day Robin left Penacony coincided with the release of small harmonious doves. Sunday also questions whether others would support Robin embarking on the journey of “Harmony.”&lt;SEP&gt;星期日是知更鸟的兄长，他决定代替知更鸟执行在谐乐大典上的计划。&lt;SEP&gt;星期日and知更鸟are siblings, both implicated in the Harmony Grand Ceremony incident.&lt;SEP&gt;星期日和知更鸟曾与开拓者一起，决定分头去寻找封印星核的方法。&lt;SEP&gt;知更鸟is the sister of星期日and opposes his vision of a paradise built solely on秩序.&lt;SEP&gt;知更鸟是星期日的妹妹，两人就梦、幸福和虚无进行对话。&lt;SEP&gt;知更鸟identifies the journal's handwriting as that of her brother, 星期日, and expresses grief over their diverging paths.</data>
      <data key="d9">agreement,association,concern,conflict,conversation,cooperation,discussion,familial relationship,family,grief,implication,instruction,interaction,investigation,opposition,proposal,question,search,shared goal,sibling,sibling relationship,siblings,support,suspected perpetrator,tragedy,|collaboration,事件,会面,保护,兄妹,兄妹关系,兄妹关系、共同愿景,共同愿望,关联,分头行动,合作,呼唤,哲学对话,家庭关系,对话,对话交流,寻找,思想冲突,担忧,替代,期待,死亡,观点碰撞,讨论</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-20dddf19eb9d23402675b17b25d6b7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aefc0cff9a04d631273e4f0927557c5d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70d2b43f7c6354bc0d0b43505f6ba515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e50467af689c6df6aabbc4058a5858c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03be2219947057675dc5055c09116ccc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aea80432a137f815124bb7fadd3b0383&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d4f76837602b150702d42db6ea60525&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0a3dbfcfd8b95ff234089961fba702&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcc40b65a49e0c9b6e746474d3eeb7b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae9b4cc1fecad7f9f71968041c2edbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-943144073634dd9204a02a1a6cd56046&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c72500fd19b3d31361401b01307328e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-399e9f5b95e2162b7f5074dcec92103a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9530d64790c372ec3c8746d7998106a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c47098afdb2c1a8744e7c9c843360554&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28f44dbc7147eb695d2a84423677906c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d11ce896bd7f1b7e87c79e1a7cf7dabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-157465497ea64ffb70d63727d9cd7189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32d2a4d85dd65814c67bee4806ee1d60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1fecb95c7dca369bddda957ff6f5253&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d81d7afd4e410e297a5351eee7eb9d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9be26a61f86441c64a06812e2316ff8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1853bbf4383b790ff8a8b2d27d966ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa4f6559bb8c6fdf7a61d696bb98ea71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcadf281cd20b82436458f643f5099be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c75592f96a4b5f7fcffc49d7d471d7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bef71ea9725559b5e05574558cbcec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea958dd07fcb944ce792ebb1149ed1b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5554caf63113cf1aae9ee5c4485624e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05a5c4612ea2ec33740c626cf9067e70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-620e245cd9df09d58b2231e7fff3bf19</data>
      <data key="d11">unknown_source</data>
