      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">真理医生为星期日传话，并带砂金前往朝露公馆与其会面。&lt;SEP&gt;真理医生explains that星期日has set a test for them to prove their value before the formal conversation.&lt;SEP&gt;真理医生negotiates with星期日, ultimately agreeing to assist in exchange for星核research, while revealing the truth about the false基石.&lt;SEP&gt;星期日agrees to share星核research with真理医生in exchange for真理医生's assistance in revealing砂金's plan.&lt;SEP&gt;真理医生认为星期日是难对付的人，提醒砂金做好准备。</data>
