    <edge source="黑天鹅" target="记忆">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">黑天鹅作为忆者与「记忆」领域紧密相关。&lt;SEP&gt;Black Swan confirms the memory presented by Aventurine is true and unaltered.&lt;SEP&gt;黑天鹅asserts that记忆does not lie, confirming the reality of the events.&lt;SEP&gt;黑天鹅states that memory is the only thing we possess, highlighting its importance.&lt;SEP&gt;黑天鹅believes that memory is a powerful force that can reshape the world and prevent one from being forgotten.&lt;SEP&gt;黑天鹅holds memories about the interlocutor, which are insufficient for detailed future divination.&lt;SEP&gt;黑天鹅used the protagonist's "memory" to find a chance to survive and escape the Order's dream.</data>
