    <edge source="建木" target="罗浮仙舟">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">建木is a treasure and remnant of the罗浮仙舟.&lt;SEP&gt;建木是由药师留在罗浮仙舟的古物。&lt;SEP&gt;The Arbor is an ancient divine tree located on the Luofu Xianzhou.&lt;SEP&gt;The罗浮仙舟was granted the Ambrosial Arbor in the past.</data>
