    <edge source="流萤" target="黄泉">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Huang Quan and Firefly (流萤) share a complex relationship involving conversations, shared information, and a pivotal, tragic event. Huang Quan has spoken with Firefly, exchanging stories and speculating about dream entities, and has closely observed Firefly's nervousness and emotions, including dialogues about starting over. A critical moment occurred when Huang Quan kicked Firefly into a deep pit. Huang Quan later expressed concern upon realizing that Firefly was unaware of the danger she faced, and also mentioned that Firefly had discovered the truth about the “other side” of death. Furthermore, Huang Quan feels she hesitated and failed, leading to Firefly's death in the dream, and has apologized for it. In the context of an ongoing investigation, Huang Quan has noted that Firefly's situation needs to be verified in relation to a murder case, and she suspects that a traitor from within the Family (家族) was responsible for Firefly's death.</data>
      <data key="d9">analysis,companionship,concern,conversation,discovery,foreshadowing,information,investigation,knocks down,observation,protection,regret,victim</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-b1e23bfd4bf1c77fb266c1fdef2619ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24565d6d66fd343d204ca6ee232d3fb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2539c79e7b103e6c4fb2a5bb7901dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f230a74b3af82c685045831898f3ea6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d68ceba3f304fb715c34b69def89e801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcc40b65a49e0c9b6e746474d3eeb7b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-591f11cf1ef3be84f3f140ad6ced600a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-620e245cd9df09d58b2231e7fff3bf19</data>
