    <edge source="同谐" target="砂金">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Aventurine suspects that Penacony is a conspiracy of Harmony.&lt;SEP&gt;砂金被「同谐」的力量所禁锢，这影响他的任务执行。&lt;SEP&gt;砂金feels the influence of the Collective, experiencing a sound in his head that intensifies over time.&lt;SEP&gt;砂金initially mistakes the mysterious voice as a "newborn of the Harmony," but the voice denies this association.</data>
