    <edge source="同谐" target="黄泉">
      <data key="d7">6.0</data>
      <data key="d8">黄泉analyzes how few things can interfere with the power of paths like "Harmony."&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉通过拔刀斩断了砂金身上的同谐烙印。&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉cut the "Harmony" brand from the protagonist.&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉行走的道路不为同谐所容，因为她属于虚无命途。&lt;SEP&gt;Huangquan's way of walking is not accommodated by the path of "Harmony".&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉's power level suggests that only a being of "令使" or higher could influence "同谐"'s domain.</data>
      <data key="d9">concept analysis,cut,exclusion,intervention,path conflict,path power,power,sever,不被容纳,对立,斩断,道路冲突</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-7c0a3dbfcfd8b95ff234089961fba702&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23d4778f839d2a1eac66e3c79c7e10e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef3b6681f2925e2c81851592c3ba8372&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24216adb3550f4039e3373041f9f3067&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b69d8ced9e31f9cd219995b3c96a9c54</data>
