    <edge source="虚无" target="黄泉">
      <data key="d7">11.0</data>
      <data key="d8">黄泉与「虚无」命途（Path of Nihility）存在深刻且复杂的关联。根据多方描述，黄泉明确行走在虚无命途之上，并曾自述在虚无的阴影中走得更远。她被视为「虚无」星神IX的令使（Emanator），其存在与力量被评断为具有危险性。黄泉的力量被认为是来自星神IX的馈赠，她也是虚无命途上的「自灭者」。由于深受虚无命途的影响，黄泉极难受到其他命途力量的干扰，甚至能无意识地侵染它们。此外，黄泉追求且将虚无的意义视为自身的最终所求，并试图探寻虚无命途的终结。波提欧亦曾猜测黄泉可能是虚无令使，并对其真实身份表现出警惕和在意。&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉is progressing on the path of Nihility, driven by her unique belief.&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉discusses how human resistance and faith stand in contrast to the concept of 「Nihility」.&lt;SEP&gt;黄泉's connection to the "Nihility" path made her resistant to the "Order"'s dream.</data>
      <data key="d9">allegiance,association,belief,human resistance and faith,journey,path,philosophical alignment,power source,purpose,pursuit,related to,resistant to,seeking,suspicion,令使,关联,力量,命途,命途关联,影响</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-b23d4778f839d2a1eac66e3c79c7e10e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef3b6681f2925e2c81851592c3ba8372&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11db0eebf350de4c9c9bbf8188cadf5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19f5f030dc583660b802b079e3f709e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-603ef2226ecb6b7032da6f1dbc06644f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59017ceba7321c9197dc124a2391ce84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba76ab4009be3694fc20bec3980fef08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1f7faf4930e00b263ca759277579820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5952867e688ef54311e49d8a4f3f4ad2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-950f3c9663f4eaa9cf5cef2539e2ff52</data>
