    <edge source="黄泉" target="砂金">
      <data key="d7">15.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between 砂金 and 黄泉 is complex and multifaceted, characterized primarily by suspicion, strategic opposition, and direct confrontation. 砂金 holds a deeply skeptical and hostile view of 黄泉, suspecting that she is not a simple cosmic drifter but a disguised and highly dangerous entity. He theorizes she could be an Emanator of the "Destruction," "Hunt," or "Finality" paths, or even a herald of death and doom. Most crucially, 砂金 has explicitly accused 黄泉 of disguising herself as an ordinary person and murdering Robin, a claim that has since been proven groundless. As an envoy of the Interastral Peace Corporation, 砂金 made these public accusations, though his reasoning appeared flimsy to onlookers like March 7th. According to Himeko, 砂金 also showed an intense interest in and kept a close watch on 黄泉. Himeko and Welt both suspected 砂金's goal was to sow distrust towards 黄泉 among others.

Beyond accusations and surveillance, their relationship involved direct, strategic engagement. They engaged in a deep conversation concerning death, dreams, and secrets. 砂金 once confronted 黄泉, questioning her abilities and proposing a gamble. This confrontation escalated into a battle of strategy and force, where 砂金's cunning allowed him to gain an advantage, as acknowledged by 黄泉 herself. Ultimately, 黄泉's attack struck 砂金 down and, in doing so, tore open a fissure to the primordial Memory Zone, demonstrating the destructive power underlying their antagonistic relationship.</data>
      <data key="d9">accusation,claim,confrontation,danger,distrust,gamble,identity,manipulation,mutual strategy,observation,reveal,suspicion,wariness,互动,关注,击败,对峙,对话,指控与澄清,提防,撕开通道,质疑</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-057807b41b216391fb3264dc438854b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-083647d174927add1aefc63655ec615b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2539c79e7b103e6c4fb2a5bb7901dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff5381ef14c0174d6621bf098b92d840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7213cad09005f82a03399c704c05da25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c99e6308cd56f22b4ce44dda6f0ec62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f273e249d48375fe4ce18df04b167906&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2d5f5276bd322a80a7f8a45c5c6b7d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89c9a7f59707875421c63842c0c2864&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21d69e5d473598eccb1e77a81726c583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ebbbf7bf5819ee830ffd02c3c6f9d34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23d4778f839d2a1eac66e3c79c7e10e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5979a047bbe07055ca7d07c41c07f405&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24216adb3550f4039e3373041f9f3067&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea958dd07fcb944ce792ebb1149ed1b7</data>
