    <edge source="砂金" target="真理医生">
      <data key="d7">23.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between Dr. Ratio (also known as Truth-Doctor) and Aventurine (砂金) is a complex partnership marked by mutual assistance, significant conflict, and deep-seated rivalry, primarily within the context of missions for the Interastral Peace Corporation (IPC). They collaborate on investigations, working together to solve puzzles and search for clues, including examining a treasure room, a pinball machine, and sandbox leads. Their dynamic is characterized by frequent verbal exchanges involving sarcasm, warnings, and criticism; Dr. Ratio often takes the lead in discussions, providing counterpoints, warning Aventurine not to needlessly find fault with the Family, and exposing his gambler tactics by analyzing his strategy and revealing a false cornerstone. Aventurine, in turn, invites Dr. Ratio to see results but also curses him for helping Sunday set a trap. Despite this, Aventurine later seeks Dr. Ratio's help to testify on his behalf. Their interactions involve mutual, if contentious, professional respect. Dr. Ratio is assigned by the Strategic Investment Department to monitor Aventurine, and while Aventurine accuses Dr. Ratio of betraying him, they continue to cooperate on tasks. Dr. Ratio also expresses concern over Aventurine's readiness to face Sunday and questions the lack of sincerity in his plans.</data>
      <data key="d9">admonishment,aid=Relation|interaction,analysis,argument,collaboration,comment,communication,companionship,conflict,conversation,dialogue,disagreement,dispute,expose,interaction,investigation,invitation,mutual agreement,observation,problem-solving,questioning,reliance on knowledge,reminder,sarcasm,seeking help,shared goal,互动、求助,任务,伙伴关系,协作,合作,对抗,对话,揭发,敌对,监视,背叛,警告,质询</data>
